window.AKK_AFTER_REBIRTH_I_WAS_FORCED_TO_BECOME_THE_MAFIA_PRINCESS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AFTER_REBIRTH_I_WAS_FORCED_TO_BECOME_THE_MAFIA_PRINCESS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":401,"title":"Chapter 401: 401, How Disgusting","paragraphs":["Li Xiaohui had never felt such satisfaction from gaming in a rival internet cafe's establishment.","In fact, it was the most enjoyable time she'd ever had in any internet cafe.","Of course, a big part of that was because she hadn't been to one in quite a while.","Back when her father strictly controlled her living expenses, she had to scrape together a little from her pitifully small allowance just to afford some internet time.","Later, after joining the Wanlong Society and having her own income, she had more than enough money for the cafe, but strangely, her enthusiasm for going had waned.","After all, all the brothers and sisters in the Wanlong Society were so driven and hardworking; it felt a bit wrong if she just slacked off all the time.","She wanted to work hard too! She wanted to strive!","This time, being able to play games to her heart's content was entirely because her Phoenix Power Esports was organizing the first University Esports Championship.","Liu Yutong had suggested to her that since they were going the esports internet cafe route, why not hold a tournament to attract attention.","Li Xiaohui loved playing games herself, whether it was dance games or FPS games, she had tried them all.","Hearing Liu Yutong's suggestion, she got incredibly excited.","Wasn't this exactly what she most wanted to do and loved doing?","Li Xiaohui was extremely proactive in preparing for this event.","She even roped in a few classmates like Lin Tao to form a tournament team with her as the captain.","For this first Esports Championship, the final game chosen was CF, a popular FPS competitive game in internet cafes at the time.","She had considered other games too, like the dance game AU, kart racing games, and so on.","But after a comprehensive evaluation, in terms of watchability, FPS games came out on top, which is why they chose CF.","As for whether to consider holding esports tournaments for other games later, that would depend on how this first one turned out.","After a period of intense preparation, the event plan was basically finalized. All that was left was to do the promotional warm-up, and the championship could officially launch.","Apart from the event preparations, Li Xiaohui hadn't been idle in her daily life either.","She had also taken people to select sites for chain internet cafes at various branches of the Wanlong Supermarket in Bright Pearl City and in other counties. The construction teams had already started work.","As long as they defeated Yanwang Internet Cafe this time, Qixing Capital would have to invest the money into their internet cafe chain according to the bet. Then they could pay off the remaining balance in one go and get all the chain cafes up and running.","As for cafe staff, that was the easiest position to fill within the Wanlong Society. Once internal recruitment opened, they'd probably be fully staffed in no time.","After everything was arranged, Li Xiaohui took advantage of Yanwang Internet Cafe's free promotion period to bring her team members over to practice their coordination and, incidentally, annoy the cafe owner a bit.","\"We lost that one. The opponents were pros!\"","In this best-of-nine demolition match, Li Xiaohui's team actually lost.","Her classmates, Lin Tao and the others, naturally didn't dare to say that the captain dragged them down. In fact, Li Xiaohui's skills weren't bad at all. Her gaming talent was definitely top-notch among girls her age, and she was not weaker than most boys in the class.","Li Xiaohui wasn't very satisfied with the result because her goal was to win the championship, and it had to be a proper, fair-and-square victory.","Currently, her team only had four members and was missing one main player.","Among the five people teamed up today, one was a Wanlong Society member temporarily recruited.","According to the championship rules, a team must be composed of students from the same university, forming the \"XX University XX Team.\" That meant their squad was still short one official teammate from their own school.","Of course, a single university wasn't restricted to just one team.","\"Boss Hui, what about trying to get Fang Haoran?\" Lin Tao suddenly thought of something and said.","Li Xiaohui took a lollipop and gave it a suck. \"But I heard he never plays games. What's the point of asking him?\"","Lin Tao: \"He's my roommate. It's not that he doesn't play; he can't play.\"","Hearing this, Li Xiaohui was instantly curious. \"Why? Afraid his parents would come to the university to give him a beating?\"","Lin Tao shook his head. \"I don't know why either. But Fang Haoran's gaming skills are absolutely undeniable, especially his sniping. He's incredibly skilled, like a god.\"","Li Xiaohui: \"Really? 'Like a god'? Isn't that a bit exaggerated?\"","Lin Tao scratched his head. \"How to put it... I only had a one-on-one with him in the dorm once, and I barely lost.\"","Li Xiaohui looked at him suspiciously, her eyes seeming to say, if that's all the skill level we're talking about, it's not worth your hype, is it?","Lin Tao's face reddened. \"Alright, I admit it. I got slaughtered!\"","Li Xiaohui: \"........\"","She was just about to say she'd go get Fang Haoran to test him out later when a familiar voice sounded right by her ear.","\"Li Xiaohui, what are you doing in my internet cafe?!\"","Suddenly interrupted, Li Xiaohui turned her head impatiently, the lollipop still in her mouth. \"What? Can't you see I'm in the middle of a game? It's very rude to disturb your own customers like this!\"","Deng Zheyan pointed at her screen. \"What kind of customer are you? Did you top up your card?\"","Li Xiaohui rolled her eyes and said righteously, \"Top up what? Deng Zheyan, it's written right outside your own cafe: 'Bring a team, get ten free hours per person, valid permanently!'\"","Then she pointed at all the people playing games in the main hall. \"See? I brought you all these people directly! Ten hours each, the internet fees are free. Why would I top up? Am I stupid?\"","Lin Tao, sitting beside her, immediately chimed in, \"Exactly, boss! We came as a team. Why should we top up? Ten hours is enough for us to play!\"","Deng Zheyan was furious. \"Who told you it was ten hours? It's one hour! Someone altered it! And that 'permanently valid' is fake too!\"","\"Pfft!\"","Li Xiaohui curled her lip disdainfully, pointing outside the main door. \"It's written in black and white outside your cafe, on the notice you posted yourself. Trying to welch on the deal? Or do you think we're easy to bully?!\"","As soon as she finished speaking.","The Wanlong Society members in plain clothes scattered throughout the internet cafe stood up one after another, all looking unfavorably at Deng Zheyan.","Deng Zheyan: \"........\"","Damn, that's shameless! Bullying with numbers!","Even though the pressure from being stared down by so many people was immense, he still firmly refused to admit it. \"That notice outside was maliciously vandalized! It doesn't count!\"","\"If you don't believe me, I can check the surveillance. My cafe has cameras inside and out. They definitely caught who did it! If you know what's good for you, leave now. Otherwise, I'm calling the police!\"","Li Xiaohui looked completely unfazed. \"You don't think we did it, do you? Then go ahead, check the cameras, call the police. We'll keep you company!\"","Right at that moment.","A student from the Law School of the University of Finance and Economics, wearing black-framed glasses, stepped forward.","\"Boss, don't say I didn't warn you. According to the Consumer Rights Protection Law, this promotional notice posted outside your shop constitutes a public commercial advertisement and an invitation to offer. We registered as members and came here to use the internet based on our trust in this notice. Now, you are unilaterally declaring it invalid, which constitutes a breach of contract. We have the right to report this to the relevant authorities. In serious cases, it might even lead to your internet cafe being suspended for rectification for a period of time.\"","Upon hearing this, Li Xiaohui's eyes lit up, and she gave the student a thumbs-up. \"Wow, Qiao Qiao, well said! That was so professional! I think you have real potential to join our Wanlong Hui Law Firm.\"","\"Hear that, Boss Deng? This is a top student from the Finance and Economics University's Law School giving a professional interpretation! This is a breach of contract, consumer fraud!\"","\"Of course, if you insist on breaking the contract, then let's see if you can handle the consequences!\"","\"...\"","Deng Zheyan was practically fuming with rage. \"Cut the crap with all that legal talk! I'm going to find the evidence right now! Just you all wait!\"","Then, like a madman, he rushed into the nearby surveillance room and began operating the main console roughly.","After reviewing all the surveillance footage from yesterday to today with bloodshot eyes, he found nothing.","Only a brief blackout in the surveillance feed around ten o'clock last night.","\"What's going on? Where's the footage?!\"","Soon, Deng Zheyan remembered something.","\"Yellow Light, Green Light! Where are those three bastards? Tell them to get their asses over here and see me NOW!!!\""]},{"number":402,"title":"Chapter 402: 402, Can't Afford It","paragraphs":["Just as Deng Zheyan was having someone contact the three men—Huang, Lu, and Deng—a sudden clamor of noisy commotion erupted outside, sounding as if a large crowd had arrived.","Deng Zheyan instinctively looked through the glass doors and indeed saw a dense, dark mass of university students gathered outside.","At the front of the crowd, a chubby young man was holding a loudspeaker, shouting:","\"Come on, come on! Free internet access! Ten free hours per person, fair deal for all!\"","\"But I gotta remind you all, Brother Ma Da is treating you to internet today. If anyone dares to secretly top up their account, that means you're disrespecting me, Ma Da, and disrespecting our Wanlong Society!\"","Upon hearing the words \"Wanlong Society,\" the students immediately understood and assured him.","\"Don't worry, Brother Ma! We absolutely won't top up. We're here for the free ride, all the way!\"","\"Yeah! Whoever tops up is a grandson!\"","\"Wanlong Society is mighty! Brother Ma is mighty!\"","\"Brother Ma, we promise not to top up!\"","\"...\"","Ma Da nodded with satisfaction, picked up the loudspeaker again, and added, \"Oh, right, almost forgot to tell you brothers. If you guys want instant noodles or milk tea while surfing the net, just have the attendant go buy them from the Huangquan E-sports across the street. Their noodles are tasty and cheap, especially the newly launched 'Bo Ya Breaks the Strings' milk tea—it's incredibly good. Mention my name for a 20% discount.\"","\"Don't feel bad about asking! The attendants are paid a salary; what's wrong with them running a little errand?!\"","The crowd of students responded enthusiastically again.","\"No problem, Brother Ma!\"","\".........\"","Seeing this scene outside his internet cafe, Deng Zheyan's face turned green with rage. He rushed to the entrance to block them.","\"Ma Da, what exactly do you mean by this? What are you doing bringing so many people here?!\"","Ma Da unhurriedly handed the loudspeaker to a subordinate beside him and said with a grin, \"To use the internet, of course. Boss Deng, why are you so angry? You're open for business; customers are at your door. Aren't you going to welcome them?\"","\"I welcome normal paying customers, not you lot who are here for a free ride and to cause trouble!\" Deng Zheyan retorted, pointing at them.","\"Calling us freeloaders?\"","Ma Da feigned surprise and pointed at the promotional notice posted outside the door. \"Boss Deng, it's written clearly right here on your cafe's notice: 'Bring one person to form a team for internet access, and each person gets an extra ten hours of free time, permanently valid.' I brought you so many people. How can that be called freeloading? We're strictly following your promotional rules! Right, everyone?\"","\"Right!\" the students shouted in unison.","\"You... you're twisting words!\"","Deng Zheyan was so angry he saw stars. \"That notice was maliciously altered last night! I have surveillance footage to prove it!\"","\"Is that so?\"","Ma Da crossed his arms, looking amused. \"Then show us the surveillance footage right now. If you produce it, we won't say another word and will top up properly to use the internet. But if you can't produce it...\"","\"That proves you're lying! Going back on your word!\"","Seeing that the internet cafe owner might try to weasel out of the deal, potentially costing them their free internet time, the students immediately became unhappy. The crowd grew agitated.","\"Boss, you're not actually trying to back out, are you?!\"","\"Exactly! Your door clearly says 'free ten hours, permanently valid.' It's posted in black and white, and all of us saw it! Now that we're here, you're saying it doesn't count? Are you messing with us?\"","\"Yeah, boss! You think you can just change it whenever you want? Think we're fools? Brother Ma explained it clearly just now; the notice is right there! Where's the surveillance footage? Show it to us!\"","\"If you can't produce it, you've got something to hide!\"","\"You set up this promotion yourself, and now that you see so many people, you're having second thoughts about the cost and want to back out! Shady business!\"","\"Shady business! Liar! Going back on your word!\"","\"We're going to file a collective complaint against your internet cafe! We'll also expose this shady shop on the university forum and the local online boards!\"","\"Yeah! Expose him!\"","\"...\"","Seeing the students' emotions running higher, with some even pulling out their phones ready to call in complaints, Deng Zheyan panicked instantly.","He couldn't produce the evidence right now. If he didn't handle this well, his internet cafe might really be ordered to suspend operations for a few days.","Left with no other choice, he could only grit his teeth and let the crowd in to use the internet, thinking he'd stabilize the situation first and figure something out later.","As soon as Deng Zheyan relented, the students surged into the internet cafe, perfectly timing their arrival to seamlessly replace the customers who were just preparing to log off.","The worst off were the attendants, ordered around by the students like spinning tops.","One moment they had to go across the street to buy the discounted \"Bo Ya Breaks the Strings\" milk tea, the next moment they had to buy instant noodles, and so on.","They ran back and forth countless times, nearly exhausted to the point of stupor.","Three out of the five daytime staff members quit on the spot, worn out.","For a monthly salary of just eight hundred, why kill yourself working like that?","Deng Zheyan finally understood why, when he entered the cafe earlier, he saw the attendants looking listless and drained.","Turns out they had all been run ragged.","Ma Da and his group weren't deliberately trying to torment these innocent attendants either.","Seeing three of them quit, Ma Da immediately stepped forward and offered that if they were willing, they could go work at their Huangquan Internet Cafe right away, with priority for future branch openings.","If they weren't willing, he would compensate them five hundred yuan on the spot for emotional distress.","Hearing such a good deal, the three attendants were immediately grateful and ran straight over to the internet cafe across the street to report for duty.","They figured that an internet cafe backed by an organization like the Wanlong Society at least wouldn't treat them like grandsons to be ordered around constantly.","With three people gone all at once, the shop became even busier.","Deng Zheyan finally couldn't take it anymore and approached Ma Da, who was leisurely smoking a cigarette at the entrance.","\"Ma Da, don't go too far!\"","\"Me, go too far?\"","Ma Da viciously crushed his cigarette butt underfoot and shot Deng Zheyan a sidelong glance. \"Then what about you sending people to plant a virus in our Huangquan Internet Cafe, causing dozens of our machines to blue screen and crash? Didn't you think that was going too far? Huh?\"","Deng Zheyan's heart skipped a beat. He evaded, \"Nonsense! When did I ever do such a thing? You're slandering me!\"","Ma Da gave a cold laugh. \"Looks like you won't admit it until you're faced with the coffin. Fine then, when you get those people here, I'll question them face-to-face!\"","Deng Zheyan: \"You...\"","After what Ma Da said, he really didn't dare to call over those three troublemakers, Huang, Lu, and Deng, anymore.","Frustrated and with nowhere to vent his anger, he turned directly to the promotional notice board by the door and unleashed a torrent of abuse on it.","Then, he went back to the internet cafe's workroom and called his investor, hoping to ask them to help mediate.","He truly regretted it now, regretted provoking the other side first.","The investor on the other end of the line, however, showed him no courtesy at all.","\"Business competition is inherently brutal. Since you chose Ms. Liu Yutong as your opponent, then show your capabilities. Remember, the means aren't important; the result is!\"","With that, the other party hung up directly.","Of course, the investor spoke to Deng Zheyan this way entirely because his weight in the investor's eyes was too low.","If it were a top-tier, highly regarded entrepreneur, the investor's attitude would undoubtedly be more amiable than anyone's.","However, the investor's words weren't wrong. Business warfare is inherently brutal. The difficulties Deng Zheyan was facing were completely insignificant compared to the business wars they had witnessed.","If he couldn't withstand such minor hardships, then he should be prepared to be trampled underfoot.","Deng Zheyan was so furious he nearly smashed his phone to pieces.","Just then, he turned his head and saw a black Maybach parking across the street in front of the Huangquan Internet Cafe.","The door opened, and a familiar figure stepped out — Liu Yutong.","Deng Zheyan's first reaction upon seeing Liu Yutong was fear. The reputation of the Wanlong Society's young mistress was no joke around the university district.","Yet, as he thought of his current predicament, the fear in his heart was gradually replaced by a surge of intense hatred.","This woman seemed born to be his nemesis. First, she snatched his secret recipe for small fish pot stickers back in Wushui County, and now she had deliberately opened an internet cafe right opposite his, aiming to pull the rug out from under him completely.","\"If this woman doesn't die, I'll never be able to turn my life around. I'll forever be crushed under her heel, targeted until the day I die!\"","\"In that case... then you should just die!\"","With this thought, he picked up his phone again and dialed a mysterious number he had once obtained by chance.","This number was for people who handled dirty work, the kind that couldn't see the light of day.","The call rang several times before someone answered, and the person on the other end was extremely cautious.","\"Who are you looking for?\"","\"I'm looking for Boss Zhu. I'd like to buy some bones to make soup!\"","Only after hearing the code phrase did the person on the other end continue.","\"Is the target tough?\"","\"Well... just a little bit tough, I suppose.\"","\"Two million!\"","\"Can't afford it. Goodbye!\"","Deng Zheyan hung up immediately after saying that.","What a joke!","Two million just to get rid of one person? I don't have that kind of money!"]},{"number":403,"title":"Chapter 403: 403, Zhao Junjie Has Arrived.","paragraphs":["The moment Deng Zheyan hung up the phone, the woman across from him seemed to sense it, suddenly glancing in his direction and making his heart skip a beat.","Truth be told, two million was already a bargain to settle things with Liu Yutong. If the person on the other end of the call knew her identity as the young mistress of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, demanding ten million would’ve been reasonable.","But the problem was, he didn’t have that kind of money.","Because of past incidents, his family had already cleaned up enough of his messes and refused to support him further. On top of that, he was in the middle of launching his business—the funds raised for his internet café and its revenue were all being funneled into opening new branches, leaving no extra cash to spare.","Unless he sold all his shares, which was obviously out of the question.","For now, he had no choice but to let Liu Yutong off the hook, suppressing his desire for revenge until he had the means to act.","The pressing issue now was how to deal with his current predicament.","He had already figured out that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was deliberately using these \"legal and compliant\" underhanded tactics to cripple his internet café’s profits.","What made it even more frustrating was that he didn’t dare report it to the police—he didn’t even dare call over Huang Lüdeng and his two lackeys.","After all, he had previously paid them to plant viruses in the rival café, which was outright illegal. If the other side had solid evidence, he could end up behind bars.","So, he had no choice but to swallow this bitter pill.","Just as Deng Zheyan was at his wit’s end, another large group of people—dozens of them, all looking like street thugs—poured into the café.","Deng Zheyan assumed they were more reinforcements called by Ma Da, and his frustration grew.","Enough was enough! Were they really going to keep this up?","Before he could even vent his anger, the leader of the group, a young man, walked straight up to Ma Da and greeted him.","\"I remember you—Ma Da from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, right?\"","Ma Da, a cigarette dangling from his lips, eyed the dozens of men behind the young man with disdain. \"Tsk tsk tsk, Zhao Junjie, just out of prison and already making such a grand entrance? Looking for a fight?\"","Zhao Junjie smirked insincerely and waved his hand. \"No, no, it’s a misunderstanding. My boys and I are just here to get online. What, Brother Ma, you’re not gonna stop us from using the internet, are you?\"","Ma Da scoffed. \"Wouldn’t dream of it. But, bad luck—the café’s full right now. How about you wait outside?\"","\"Sure thing!\" Zhao Junjie turned to his men without a care. \"You heard him, boys. Wait till there’s space, then we’ll log on. In the meantime, go ahead and sign up for memberships, top up your accounts.\"","Seeing Zhao Junjie’s attitude, Ma Da instantly understood—he was stepping in to back up Yanwang Internet Café.","This was Deng Zheyan’s first time meeting Zhao Junjie, but the hostility in their exchange made it clear they were on opposing sides. A surge of relief washed over him.","Talk about perfect timing! He had been racking his brain over how to deal with Ma Da and his annoying crew, and now, out of nowhere, reinforcements had arrived!","And judging by the scene, this guy was definitely a major player in the underworld.","Deng Zheyan immediately put on a smile and approached Zhao Junjie, striking up a conversation.","When he learned that the man was none other than the young master of the East Sea Alliance—a notorious name in Bright Pearl City’s underworld—his excitement grew, and he unconsciously straightened his posture.","He had heard of the East Sea Alliance before—one of Bright Pearl City’s most prominent gangs, second only to the Yilien Society in its prime.","With the backing of a heavyweight like this, why would he still fear that wretched Liu Yutong?","In his eyes, an established force like the East Sea Alliance had to be stronger than the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","After exchanging a few words, Deng Zheyan eagerly ushered Zhao Junjie inside, followed by his dozens of underlings.","Ma Da didn’t stop them. He flicked away his cigarette and strode across the street toward Phoenix Reign Internet Café.","The young mistress was here for an inspection—perfect timing to report Zhao Junjie’s release and his interference in the café business.","The fact that he had come out swinging so soon meant he must’ve caught wind of something.","Not long after Ma Da left, two young men in baseball caps exchanged a discreet glance outside Yanwang Internet Café before slipping inside.","Shortly after, a woman bundled up in a black down jacket, also wearing a hat, entered the café.","......","Phoenix Reign Internet Café.","Ma Da found Liu Yutong in the lounge area and quickly approached her. \"Young Mistress, Zhao Junjie’s out. He brought over thirty men to Yanwang Internet Café.\"","Liu Yutong’s red lips curled slightly. \"Oh? Released so soon? His father must’ve pulled quite a few strings behind bars.\"","Ma Da’s tone turned grave. \"Not just that. Zhao Junjie clearly came looking for trouble—he started provoking me the moment we met. Now Deng Zheyan’s treating him like royalty. Looks like he’s stepping in to take sides.\"","\"Young Mistress, what if Zhao Junjie keeps bringing his men to hog our machines and seats? Should I gather some brothers and—\"","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"No need. We’ve had our fun messing with Deng Zheyan. No point dragging it out—we’ll beat them fair and square.\"","\"If we want investors, we’ll make them willingly open their wallets.\"","\"If Zhao Junjie wants to back Deng Zheyan, let him. Just focus on running our promotions.\"","Seeing the young mistress so calm and confident, Ma Da had no choice but to drop the matter.","He had absolute faith in her.","Then his gaze drifted to the massive high-end projector screen newly installed in the lounge.","The young mistress had said it was for broadcasting esports tournaments—likely one of her trump cards.","......"]},{"number":404,"title":"Chapter 404: 404, Zhao Junjie Falls from a Building","paragraphs":["Ma Da walked to the entrance of the internet café.","Just then, a voice suddenly rang out beside his ear.","\"Oh wow, is this the famous Phoenix Reign Internet Café of Bright Pearl City?\"","\"Look at this decor—did they learn their aesthetic from some back-alley hair salon? All purple and tacky, anyone would think it’s some shady establishment!\"","\"And with this level of ‘style,’ they still charge outrageous prices. Everyone, keep your eyes open! If you want to surf the web, come to Yan Net instead—half-price right now, plus free drinks!\"","\"............\"","As soon as Ma Da stepped out, he saw Deng Zheyan standing at the entrance of Phoenix Reign, waving a megaphone and hurling insults like crazy.","Not only was he trashing the café, calling it worthless, but he was also deliberately twisting his hips and striking disgusting poses to provoke them, fully embodying the smug arrogance of a petty man who’d finally gotten his moment.","Of course, he dared to act this way for two reasons.","First, Zhao Junjie and his crew had each topped up 500 yuan in credit at Yan Net, instantly boosting the café’s revenue.","Second, Zhao Junjie had promised to back him up, telling him to go all out.","With Zhao Junjie—the young master of the East Sea Alliance—as his patron, Deng Zheyan naturally stopped caring about the Dragon Society’s reputation.","He’d always believed that an old-school syndicate like the East Sea Alliance was far more powerful than some upstart group like the Dragon Society.","So, with Zhao Junjie’s encouragement, he couldn’t resist rushing over to start trash-talking.","Ma Da clenched his fists in fury. \"Deng Zheyan, are you fucking asking for death? Who gave you the guts to come here and run your mouth?!\"","Deng Zheyan sneered. \"Who gave me the guts? That’d be Young Master Zhao! What, you still think your Dragon Society can rule Bright Pearl City with an iron fist?\"","\"You’re not even qualified to talk to me. Where’s Liu Yutong? Tell her to come out!\"","Liu Yutong, hearing the commotion, stepped out. Her cold, beautiful eyes locked onto him. \"Deng Zheyan, has your arm healed already?\"","For some reason, the moment Liu Yutong appeared, Deng Zheyan instinctively took a few steps back. Seeing her again sent a chill down his spine.","But then he glanced behind him—at the dozens of East Sea Alliance members inside the café—and his courage instantly surged back.","With Young Master Zhao backing him, what was there to fear?","Zhao Junjie had outright said he didn’t give a damn about Liu Yutong or the Dragon Society.","Given the East Sea Alliance’s power, that couldn’t just be empty talk, right?","Deng Zheyan smirked. \"Oh, Miss Liu, your words scare me so much~ But hey, times have changed.\"","\"See that? Standing behind me is Young Master Zhao of the East Sea Alliance!\"","\"Ever heard of the East Sea Alliance? Probably not, huh? Wouldn’t expect a woman with long hair and short vision to know anything about them.\"","\"But no worries, I’ll educate you. The East Sea Alliance is one of Bright Pearl City’s top syndicates. And Young Master Zhao? Just a stomp of his foot makes the whole city tremble! He’s got connections everywhere—black, white, you name it!\"","\"Today, with him covering me, I’d like to see who dares lay a finger on me!\"","The more he spoke, the more inflated his ego became. With Zhao Junjie as his shield, he no longer had to live like a coward. Now, he could even trample over them.","Nearby onlookers, hearing his words, began murmuring among themselves.","\"Holy... the East Sea Alliance? That old-school syndicate from East Sea Road?\"","\"Zhao Junjie... I’ve heard of him. He’s pretty notorious, and his family’s got serious influence...\"","\"The Dragon Society’s in trouble now. The East Sea Alliance isn’t someone you mess with.\"","\"Who knew the owner of Yan Net had connections like this...\"","\"..........\"","Ma Da, watching Deng Zheyan’s shameless, bootlicking display, couldn’t hold back. \"What the hell are you, you piece of trash? Barking like a rabid dog—you actually think you’re somebody now?\"","\"‘Young Master Zhao’ this, ‘Young Master Zhao’ that—is he your damn daddy? The way you suck up to him makes me sick!\"","Deng Zheyan, surprisingly, fired right back.","\"Ma Da! You’re nothing but the Dragon Society’s guard dog! All you can do is yap! Look at yourself—following some woman around for scraps, and you’re proud of it?\"","\"So what if Young Master Zhao’s my daddy?! I’m happy about it! Proud, even!\"","\"Being his lackey is a million times better than being your pretentious boss’s lapdog!\"","\".........\"","Ma Da was momentarily stunned. He genuinely wanted to crack open Deng Zheyan’s skull to see what kind of brain—or lack thereof—was inside.","Even the most hardened gangsters in Bright Pearl City wouldn’t dare speak to him like that to his face.","Yet this nobody, just because he’d latched onto Zhao Junjie, had suddenly turned into an insufferable loudmouth.","What kind of idiot was this?","Liu Yutong, however, wasn’t surprised by Deng Zheyan’s behavior. She’d known him in her past life—this was just his nature.","If you kept him under your thumb, he’d behave like a docile mutt. But the second he sniffed even the slightest chance to turn the tables—even if it was just an illusion—he’d immediately jump at the opportunity to humiliate you.","Zero patience, zero restraint.","Like today. Zhao Junjie must’ve promised him something, which was why he dared to openly provoke them.","The sad part? This idiot didn’t even realize he was being used as a pawn—or why.","Liu Yutong didn’t need to think hard to figure out Zhao Junjie’s motives.","First, he wanted to mess with her.","Second, the two investors who’d originally planned to fund his project with General Manager Sun had, after his stint in jail, switched sides and invested in the Dragon Society’s ventures instead.","Having lost face, Zhao Junjie was now using Deng Zheyan to get back at her.","But Deng Zheyan? He was too stupid to see it. He actually believed he’d scored a powerful ally, gleefully playing the role of expendable cannon fodder.","\"Liu Yutong! Who the hell do you think you are? I’ll settle every last debt with you—with interest!\"","Liu Yutong finally spoke. \"Deng Zheyan, do you really think Zhao Junjie can protect you?\"","\"Still trying to scare me?\" Deng Zheyan scoffed. \"Young Master Zhao is the heir of the East Sea Alliance. His influence is massive. What, you gonna kill him or someth—\"","Before he could finish—","BOOM!!!","CRASH—!!!","A deafening impact, followed by the sound of shattering glass, erupted without warning right behind him!","The second-floor windows of Yan Net exploded, shards raining down like lethal confetti.","Then, a figure in a blue suit plummeted from above—landing with a sickening THUD on the concrete barely a meter behind Deng Zheyan.","The ground trembled from the force.","Deng Zheyan's expression froze instantly, his neck stiff as he turned to look at the figure lying in a pool of blood on the ground.","It was none other than the young master of the East Sea Alliance—Zhao Junjie—whom he had just been boasting about as all-powerful."]},{"number":405,"title":"Chapter 405: 405, Internet Cafe Brawl","paragraphs":["Dead silence!","An absolute, suffocating silence engulfed the entire street!","The onlookers who had been chattering moments ago now stood frozen as if under a spell, mouths agape, too terrified to make a sound. Their faces were twisted in horror.","Even Ma Da was startled. He hadn’t expected such a bloody scene to unfold.","A thought flashed through his mind: Did the young mistress arrange this? But why wasn’t I informed?","Dirty work like this should have been left to them—people who could take the fall if things went south!","The young mistress has lost her mind!","Deng Zheyan’s brain completely short-circuited, leaving only a blank void.","Stiffly, he stared at Zhao Junjie’s motionless body on the ground, then mechanically turned his head toward the woman standing at the entrance of Phoenix Reign Internet Cafe.","Liu Yutong remained still, her icy gaze fixed on him. There wasn’t a ripple of emotion in those beautiful yet terrifyingly calm eyes.","Then, a bone-chilling dread surged from the soles of Deng Zheyan’s feet straight to the crown of his head.","This woman... is this ruthless?!","In broad daylight, in front of a crowd, she had just killed the young master of the East Sea Syndicate.","How dare she?!","Is this still Earth? Still the Dragon Nation?!","This was sheer lawlessness!","Suddenly, Deng Zheyan remembered what had happened back at that restaurant in Wushui County. Rumor had it that Liu Yutong had butchered and cooked members of the Righteous Brotherhood.","At the time, he hadn’t witnessed it himself and assumed it was just Er Kun trying to scare people.","Later, at the hospital, he’d scoffed—What era is this? Who would actually do something like that? Chopping people up and eating them? That’s inhuman!","Gradually, he’d dismissed it as exaggeration.","But now, the gruesome scene before him was undeniable.","Broad daylight. Dozens—no, hundreds—of witnesses. Even Zhao Junjie’s dozens of underlings were still inside the internet cafe behind him.","Yet Liu Yutong had dared to strike.","Just how cruel, how vicious, must this woman be?!","His reaction was understandable. After all, his internet cafe wasn’t just filled with Zhao Junjie’s men and college students—most of the patrons were from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","With so many of her people inside, it made perfect sense that Liu Yutong could order someone to be thrown from the upstairs window.","And let’s be real—who else here would dare lay a finger on the East Sea Syndicate’s young master?","But that didn’t matter now.","The real question was: He’d been running his mouth earlier. Would he be next?","The thought sent a jolt of terror through him.","With a thud, Deng Zheyan dropped to his knees, arms outstretched, pressing his forehead to the ground in the most abject, groveling surrender.","“Miss Liu! I was wrong! I deserve death! My mouth is trash!”","“Please, spare my worthless life! Have mercy!”","Liu Yutong ignored him. Her sharp eyes darted back to the second-floor window of the opposing internet cafe.","Out of the corner of her eye, she’d spotted two shadowy figures in hats—the moment Zhao Junjie was thrown, they’d instantly retreated.","Did Zhao Junjie have other enemies?","No... no. This was deliberate. Someone’s trying to frame me.","In seconds, Liu Yutong pieced it together: this was a premeditated murder.","The killer had used the feud between the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, Deng Zheyan, and Zhao Junjie’s faction as cover.","The goal? To pin Zhao Junjie’s death on her and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","Zhao Tianxing had only one son. The old fox had been lying low lately, avoiding direct conflict.","But if he learned his heir had been killed by her hands? He’d stop at nothing—mobilizing the entire East Sea Syndicate for vengeance.","So who benefits most from an all-out war between the East Sea Syndicate and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society?","There was only one answer: Zhao Weixiang, the puppet master who loved pulling strings from the shadows.","Just as Liu Yutong was about to order Ma Da to seal off the opposing internet cafe, the eerie silence shattered.","A bystander’s scream pierced the air.","“AHHH!!!”","“M-murder!! Someone’s been killed!!”","“A body—someone was thrown from the building!”","“Oh my god! Call the police! NOW!”","“This is insane! In broad daylight!”","“Run! Don’t get caught up with these gangsters!”","The crowd, once buzzing with morbid curiosity, now scattered like startled birds.","An ordinary homicide? Maybe they’d linger for the spectacle.","But this involved organized crime. Who’d risk sticking around? One wrong look, and they might end up “disappeared” too.","Better to mind their own business. Survival first!","Meanwhile—","Zhao Junjie’s dozens of East Sea Syndicate enforcers, after the initial shock, erupted into fury.","“YOUNG MASTER!!!”","“Who the hell did this?!”","“It’s the Ten Thousand Dragons Society! It’s gotta be them! Brothers, AVENGE HIM!”","“Grab your weapons! KILL THEM ALL!”","The most enraged among them snatched chairs, keyboards, and hidden blades from their belts, charging out of the internet cafe.","Blinded by rage and fear—knowing their boss, Zhao Tianxing, would skin them alive if they didn’t retaliate—they zeroed in on Liu Yutong, Ma Da, and their crew across the street.","“Protect the young mistress!” Ma Da bellowed, leaping in front of Liu Yutong.","In seconds, a dozen Ten Thousand Dragons Society members surged from Phoenix Reign Internet Cafe, forming a defensive ring around her.","None drew weapons. They knew the rules: strike second, leave no legal openings. Let the enemy throw the first punch.","“PAY WITH YOUR BLOOD!”","“DIE, TEN THOUSAND DRAGONS SCUM!”","The East Sea thugs, consumed by bloodlust, barely registered when the front line of “defenders” suddenly collapsed—howling, clutching fake wounds, flying backward with Oscar-worthy theatrics.","The attackers hesitated.","...Are Ten Thousand Dragons fighters really this weak?","If so, capturing their young mistress would be easy.","The thought spurred them into a frenzy.","If they dragged Liu Yutong back to their boss, maybe—just maybe—they’d escape punishment.","As they lunged forward—","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society’s real counterattack began.","\"Move out!\" Ma Da barked the order.","In an instant, the members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, who had been on the defensive moments ago, sharpened their gazes and drew their collapsible batons, launching a fierce counterattack.","The two sides clashed violently, and chaos erupted immediately.","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society members, all well-trained in combat and physically conditioned, far outmatched the ragtag thugs of the East Sea Alliance.","Soon, the enemy was overpowered.","Under the precise and efficient strikes of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, the East Sea Alliance members quickly collapsed, howling in pain as they fell to the ground.","Of course, the attackers exercised restraint—incapacitating their opponents without inflicting fatal damage, carefully staying within the bounds of self-defense.","When Li Xiaohui led another twenty or so Ten Thousand Dragons Society members, who had been at the internet café across the street, to join the fray and flank the enemy, the East Sea Alliance thugs were swiftly overwhelmed.","One by one, they writhed on the ground, moaning, most of them rendered combat-ineffective.","Even after their victory, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members remained vigilant, their eyes locked on the fallen thugs to prevent any sudden ambush against their young mistress.","Ma Da, who had just fought alongside them, returned panting and reported, \"Young Mistress, it's done! Damn it, these bastards must be out of their minds to dare attack us.\"","Liu Yutong had no time to dwell on that. She immediately commanded, \"Surround Yan Net Internet Café now and search for two suspicious individuals wearing baseball caps!\"","She wasn’t afraid of Zhao Tianxing or the East Sea Alliance, but she refused to take the blame for this mess without clarity.","Capturing those two men might just expose the mastermind behind this.","\"Yes, Young Mistress!\" Ma Da acknowledged and swiftly led a team into Yan Net Internet Café.","As Ma Da turned away, Liu Yutong’s cool, composed eyes fell once more on Zhao Junjie, lying in a pool of blood.","Just moments ago, she had noticed his bloodied hand twitch faintly.","\"Heh... Not quite dead yet.\"","\"Seems... whoever did this had reservations.\""]},{"number":406,"title":"Chapter 406: 406, Should We Just Cut It Off","paragraphs":["A few minutes later.","Ma Da returned to Liu Yutong's side with a look of frustration and reported, \"Miss, we've searched the internet cafe inside and out. They're gone. Those two guys in baseball caps most likely slipped away in the chaos earlier.\"","The scene had indeed been extremely chaotic. They had to protect the young lady, quickly subdue the rampaging thugs from the East Sea Alliance, and also guard against any stragglers who might launch a surprise attack.","By the time they finally had a free moment to charge into the Yan Wang Internet Cafe to seal it off and search, several minutes had already been lost.","Those few minutes were more than enough for those two to vanish without a trace.","Liu Yutong's brows furrowed slightly, though she wasn't entirely surprised by this outcome.","Their timing had been impeccable, their actions clean and efficient. They were clearly well-trained professionals who had planned this in advance.","It seemed this particular black mark wasn't going to be cleared away anytime soon.","\"Forget it. Let's call the police first and deal with the aftermath here.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\"","Just then, a heart-wrenching, pig-slaughter-like wail erupted from not far away.","\"Ah! My hand! My arm is broken!\"","\"Help! It hurts so much!\"","Liu Yutong and Ma Da looked in the direction of the sound.","It was Deng Zheyan, who had been prostrating himself on the ground earlier. He was now clutching his arm, howling in agony. His right arm hung limply, clearly broken.","\"How many times is this now?\" Liu Yutong felt a slight urge to laugh.","She instantly guessed how this unlucky fellow had broken his arm. Earlier, while he was crawling on the ground begging for mercy, the East Sea Alliance thugs had charged out of the internet cafe.","With their young master having just been thrown down, how could they possibly notice Deng Zheyan lying on the ground? In the chaos, who knows how many feet trampled over his arm.","And so, he had broken his bone yet again.","Liu Yutong walked over to Deng Zheyan and looked down at the man who had caused her immense suffering in her past life. A flicker of something absurd, and even a trace of pity, passed through her originally icy eyes.","Seeing Liu Yutong approach, Deng Zheyan gritted his teeth and stifled his cries of pain, his body trembling with fear.","He was afraid of becoming the second Zhao Junjie.","Strangely enough, this wasn't the first time he had suffered at Liu Yutong's hands, yet for some reason, he never seemed to learn his lesson.","Or perhaps, every time he saw this woman, that inexplicable hatred in his heart would instinctively flare up. Even now, terrified as he was, that hatred remained, impossible to shake off.","\"Miss... Miss Liu, I won't dare anymore, I really won't! Please, just think of me as a fart and let me go!\"","\"Look, I'm already injured. Of course, I deserve it!\"","\"I beg you, spare me!\"","Liu Yutong glanced at his arm, her red lips parting slightly as she uttered a few words: \"It seems this arm of yours is destined to be at odds with your fate.\"","Just as Deng Zheyan's face turned deathly pale, ready to beg for mercy again, the familiar sound of police sirens filled the air.","Several police cars with flashing lights screeched to a halt on the street between the Huang Quan Internet Cafe and the Yan Wang Internet Cafe.","The doors opened, and a group of uniformed officers quickly got out. They immediately began setting up a cordon, dispersing the last few bold onlookers, and securing the scene.","The moment Deng Zheyan saw the officers, his eyes welled up with tears of relief.","Saviors! Upright officials!","You've finally arrived!","He no longer had to worry about being finished off!","Right now, Deng Zheyan felt like the Monkey King trapped under the Five Elements Mountain for five hundred years finally seeing the Tang Monk.","Arrest her!","Quickly arrest this lawless she-devil!","And arrest all these thugs from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society too! Punish the perpetrators severely, better yet, shoot them on the spot!","However, reality was destined to disappoint him.","After securing the scene, the officer in charge, Sheriff Wang, went straight to Liu Yutong, his attitude exceedingly warm.","\"Miss Liu, the commotion today was... a bit big!\"","Liu Yutong replied with a hint of helplessness, \"Sheriff Wang, what choice did we have? There are always these lawless elements who ignore the law, love to cause trouble armed, and attack me and my employees for no reason. We were forced into a corner and had no choice but to exercise our right to self-defense.\"","Sheriff Wang nodded in deep agreement. \"Yes, Miss Liu is absolutely right! These lawbreakers nowadays are truly outrageous! Too brazen! Daring to commit armed assault in broad daylight! Utterly lawless!\"","\"Fortunately, you and your people stopped them in time, otherwise the consequences would have been unthinkable!\"","Liu Yutong said modestly, \"I wouldn't go that far. It's what we should do. To maintain a good public security environment in Bright Pearl City, every one of our employees will step forward when they see criminals, because that's also the duty of every citizen!\"","Hearing this, Sheriff Wang sighed with emotion again. \"Well said. If only everyone could be as righteous and law-abiding as Miss Liu and the employees of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, then Bright Pearl City would definitely become a national model city for safety!\"","Deng Zheyan, lying on the ground: \"???\"","He wondered if his ears had also been trampled, causing him to hear something utterly filthy.","Her, Liu Yutong, law-abiding?","What an international joke?!","Just moments ago, this she-devil ordered someone to throw the young master of the East Sea Alliance from the second floor. He's still lying over there, probably not even cold yet.","And those thugs crying for their mothers, were they injured by their own falls?","Given the scene here, how can you utter such shameless, black-and-white-reversing words with such righteous indignation?!","You're an officer! Doesn't your conscience hurt?!","This world is just too dark!","The more Deng Zheyan thought about it, the colder his heart grew. Overwhelmed by grief and indignation, he couldn't help but start moaning and groaning again.","Hearing the whimpering from the ground, Sheriff Wang finally noticed Deng Zheyan lying there with a look of utter misery. He frowned slightly. \"Brother, aren't you cold lying on the ground like that?\"","Deng Zheyan thought to himself, \"My body doesn't feel cold anymore, but my heart... it's freezing cold!\"","As he spoke, Sheriff Wang also noticed him clutching his arm and asked with concern, \"Broken arm?\"","Deng Zheyan nodded.","Who knew Sheriff Wang's next question would be: \"So your legs aren't broken?\"","Deng Zheyan nodded again, thinking the officer would help him up.","Sheriff Wang said, \"The ambulance just left. Take a taxi to the hospital yourself. Remember to come to the station to give your statement after you're bandaged up.\"","Deng Zheyan's heart grew even colder. Shouldn't an officer warmly escort him to the hospital?","And in his current condition, regular taxis probably wouldn't even dare take him!","Ma Da seemed to sense his predicament, walked over, and handed him an empty glass liquor bottle. \"Brother Deng, having trouble hailing a cab? Here, take this. As long as you're holding this, a car will definitely stop for you.\"","Deng Zheyan: \"...\"","In the end, after much tribulation, Deng Zheyan finally made it to the hospital.","After carefully examining his arm, which had endured repeated trauma, the doctor's first words were, \"Perhaps... it would be better to amputate? You'd suffer less in the long run.\"","Deng Zheyan: \"...\""]},{"number":407,"title":"Chapter 407: 407, Group Buying Gains Momentum","paragraphs":["Zhao Junjie was indeed not dead, but with multiple fractures and severe brain trauma, he was highly likely to become a vegetable. Even if he miraculously regained consciousness, his intellect would regress to that of a young child, essentially rendering him completely incapacitated.","After learning this definitive news,","the retaliation Liu Yutong had anticipated did not materialize. Instead, the underworld of Bright Pearl City took on an atmosphere of unusual peace and calm.","Zhao Tianxing seemed to have vanished into thin air. He made no public statements, gathered no forces, and even all the establishments under the Donghai Alliance became more low-key.","Liu Yutong had a premonition that the old fox was likely gathering his strength, preparing for a major move, possibly targeting her as the primary objective, and was merely waiting for the right opportunity.","She was not idle either, immediately instructing Hua Muying to investigate all information regarding Zhao Tianxing and his gang.","Simultaneously, Yun Cheng reinforced the security detail around her.","In truth, she didn't have to remain so passive, merely waiting for the other side to strike before counterattacking.","This was because she already held substantial evidence of their criminal activities.","The reason she hadn't acted was that she still lacked a proper, legitimate opportunity to move against Zhao Tianxing and wipe out his entire operation in one fell swoop.","And she believed this opportunity would not be long in coming.","In any case, before the storm arrives, life goes on as usual.","Time passed bit by bit.","The businesses under the Wanlong Society, especially the Wanlong Group-Buy project managed by Yu Xin, were currently developing at a startlingly rapid pace.","Driven by this wave of enthusiasm, even Bright Pearl City, which was already relatively developed, could distinctly feel the buzz.","Bright Pearl City University District, outside a male student dormitory building.","\"Hey, classmates! New user registration for Wanlong Group-Buy gets you three instant coupons for '20 off with a 10 minimum spend'! Drinks and daily necessities from Wanlong Supermarket are all eligible, plus fried chicken, fries, hand-shredded roast duck, and more—all covered! Order online, and it can be delivered right to your dorm building in as fast as half an hour. It's convenient and quick!\"","Some Wanlong Society members, along with temporarily hired work-study students, were diligently handing out flyers to passing students.","The tempting food pictures, combined with the lure of delivery to the dorm, quickly captured the attention of many students.","\"Is it for real? '20 off with a 10 minimum'? So, you could get a portion of fried chicken and a cup of milk tea for just 10 bucks?\"","\"Looking at the advertised prices on the flyer, a lot of the food ends up cheaper than the cafeteria after the discount. But is this platform reliable?\"","\"Give it a try! Our platform is part of the same group as Wanlong Supermarket, the most famous chain in Bright Pearl City. And the backing is from the most well-known... ahem, company in our university district, the Wanlong Society.\"","\"What's the Wanlong Society's reputation in our university district? You all know, right?\"","The students exchanged glances upon hearing this. What reputation did the Wanlong Society have in the university district?","Probably... they fight fiercely? Play a bit dirty, dress in black? And are ruthless?","Besides that, anything else?","However, they were ultimately won over by the incredibly good deals and the half-hour delivery promise.","Some students returned to their dorms and immediately opened their computers, downloading and registering via the website on the flyer.","Not far away, in the female dormitory area.","Several eloquent female members of the Wanlong Society were also enthusiastically promoting Wanlong Group-Buy to fellow students.","Though their pitch differed slightly from the one used for the male students.","\"Wanlong Group-Buy new user benefits! Register now and get a free delivery voucher for desserts! That super-popular taro ball and herbal jelly place on the university district snack street, tiramisu—order now, and our delivery runners will bring it free to your dorm building, no queues!\"","\"And if you ever find yourself in an inconvenient situation, like forgetting to buy some essential daily items, you can also order. Just add a note, and we'll expedite the delivery, with the dorm auntie bringing it right to your room.\"","\"Really? That tiramisu place is seriously delicious, but the lines are always insane. Let me see!\"","\"And that new healthy salad place is on here too, perfect for my diet...\"","\"What if I forget to buy sanitary pads during my period? Can you deliver at night too?\"","\"Of course! We'll even arrange a relay delivery within the school.\"","\"Wow! That's so convenient!\"","\"I want to register! Show me how!\"","\"...\"","Similar scenes played out repeatedly at major universities, outside office buildings, and at the entrances of residential communities throughout Bright Pearl City.","Likewise, they were happening simultaneously in over a dozen cities in A Province and major cities like Nan City in the neighboring province.","Thus, in just over ten days, Wanlong Group-Buy's registered user count broke through the 500,000 mark.","In an era where smartphones weren't even widely popular yet, this registration number was undoubtedly an inspiring achievement in the local life services sector at the time.","Perhaps due to inherent advantages—the founding team itself consisted of university students who understood their peers better—and because university students are young and quick to adopt new things, the student demographic accounted for the highest proportion of registered users, ranking first.","Next were urban white-collar workers, a group with busy schedules, spending power, and a willingness to try this new, highly convenient service, ranking second in proportion.","Other demographics accounted for relatively smaller shares.","The average daily order volume also began to grow rapidly alongside the expanding user base, reaching around 8,000 to 10,000 orders.","This order volume was actually still limited by current conditions; if smartphones were more widespread, this number could easily multiply several times over.","In terms of delivery rider scale, Bright Pearl City had the most, being the Wanlong Society's headquarters and the only city operating completely independently, with over 500 riders.","Other cities combined had only around 3,000 riders, mostly part-timers.","The delivery rider profession was still a novelty at this time, requiring time for public acceptance. Transitioning to full-time would take a while, and Wanlong Group-Buy also needed time to screen riders based on delivery frequency and reliability, eventually converting those willing to work long-term into full-time employees.","Full-time status would necessitate social security contributions, the standard five insurances and one housing fund.","This would be implemented immediately once conditions were ripe in the future, and it was temporarily not disclosed to investors. Liu Yutong knew their nature; if they found out about providing riders with social security and housing fund, they would undoubtedly object.","After all, the larger the rider workforce, the higher the labor costs. Not paying social security could save hundreds of millions per year, and potentially tens of billions in the future.","However, Liu Yutong had no intention of saving that money.","She had already informed Yu Xin in advance: once the business was stable and mature, implement it directly, giving the investors no chance to kick up a fuss.","If anyone had objections then, they could come to Bright Pearl City and voice them to her face. Otherwise, they should keep quiet.","With such results achieved by Wanlong Group-Buy in roughly half a month,","Yu Xin, following Liu Yutong's instructions, sent the relevant data to Ji Zhe of Qixing Capital and Chu Hai of AEG Capital.","They needed to proceed with their Series A funding round for a simple reason: the money was almost burned through.","Those two guys, who had originally sworn they'd rather die than come to Bright Pearl City, were thrilled when they saw the data. They immediately said they'd book return flights to China and fly back tomorrow.","After a brief period to settle their affairs, they would arrive in Bright Pearl City within three days at the latest.","Of course, they could actually arrive sooner. However, as the angel investment stakeholders, it was standard industry practice for them to typically lead in organizing other capital to participate in the Series A investment and subsequent funding rounds—sharing the profits and spreading the risk.","Besides, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai secretly wanted to see the reactions of their peers after being 'specially received' by that young lady from the Wanlong Society.","Such an embarrassing experience shouldn't be something only the two of them had gone through; everyone should get a taste of it.","A few days later, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai indeed got their wish. It was even ten times, maybe a hundred times, more intense than what they had experienced before!"]},{"number":408,"title":"Chapter 408: 408, Let's Compete Together.","paragraphs":["The promotional campaign for Wanlong Group Buying was in full swing, with everything looking promising.","At the same time.","Huangquan E-sports officially launched the first-ever \"Huangquan Cup\" E-sports Tournament.","Li Xiaohui immediately arranged for Wanlong Hui personnel to distribute flyers at various universities, and the news quickly spread among the student population.","The rewards for this tournament were quite substantial.","Participants could not only receive internet credit from Huangquan E-sports but also high-end peripherals and a total prize pool of approximately fifty thousand yuan.","This amount might not seem huge, but considering it was just a tournament hosted by an internet cafe, offering such rewards was already very attractive.","One must remember that many university students at the time only had a few hundred yuan for monthly living expenses.","Furthermore, there was a major additional prize: the champion team and the individual champion would qualify to become short-term brand ambassadors for Huangquan E-sports!","At that time, your names would be known throughout the university district, and even in many parts of Bright Pearl City, wherever there was a Huangquan E-sports branch.","The impact of this announcement instantly overshadowed the tangible rewards like internet credit, peripherals, and cash prizes.","Especially for those university students who loved gaming, harbored e-sports dreams, and also wanted to show off, the appeal was simply off the charts!","\"Holy crap! The Huangquan Cup? The prize money is that high?\"","\"Brand ambassadors? What is Huangquan E-sports, some internet cafe? Whatever, if they can put up this much prize money, they're showing real sincerity.\"","\"The champion team gets to be ambassadors? They might even make the local news. That would be a huge chance to show off!\"","\"Yeah, that's way cooler than just getting prize money. Never thought playing games could make you famous.\"","\"Brothers, let's form a team! We gotta form a team!\"","\"........\"","In the various universities, many boys, and even some girls, who enjoyed FPS games, were fired up and eager to give it a try after seeing the flyers.","With the registration period being very short, they quickly sprang into action, looking for teammates on campus or posting far and wide on gaming forums and university message boards, seeking like-minded skilled players to form teams and go for the championship.","This fervor even spread to student groups who usually weren't very interested in gaming or e-sports.","Their first reaction upon hearing about the tournament was, what is e-sports?","In those days, many people didn't understand e-sports, even simplistically thinking it was just playing games.","Even the national professional league for CF wasn't officially organized and launched until the second half of the year.","It was precisely because e-sports was not yet mature and lacked exposure that public understanding of electronic sports remained rather vague.","Therefore, the emergence of the Huangquan Cup, especially with its total prize pool of fifty thousand and other rewards, caused quite a stir in the university district.","\"Did you hear? You can win fifty thousand by playing in a game tournament!\"","\"Really? Is it some kind of scam?\"","\"Here, look, the flyer. Huangquan E-sports!\"","\"Wow, there really are people throwing money around to sponsor gamers, even offering some ambassador thing.\"","\"So you're saying you can get famous from playing games?\"","\"Right. If someone from a university wins the championship, they could totally brag about it in front of students from other schools.\"","\"No need to even think about who'll win. Our Finance University has to take the championship!\"","\"You're way too confident. Our school would be lucky not to come in last.\"","\"..........\"","For a time, \"Huangquan Cup,\" \"fifty thousand prize money,\" and \"Huangquan E-sports ambassador\" became the hottest topics on campus.","At the back door of the Finance University library.","On a quiet campus path, two students sat on a somewhat aged wooden bench.","Fang Haoran sat at one end of the bench, head bowed, not daring to look at the girl beside him, Lin Yu, who had occupied his entire youth.","Lin Yu sat sideways, a faint, almost imperceptible flicker of disappointment in her clear eyes.","\"Haoran, have you really decided? To give up the study abroad exchange opportunity you prepared for so long?\"","\"And, our university's computer science program isn't a flagship major; it's not even as good as the Science and Technology College's. Are you really sure about this?\"","Fang Haoran swallowed with difficulty. \"But I... I really don't like my current major.\"","\"Maybe your father is right. I'm just the kind of hopeless loser he says I am, only thinking about how to play games, how to design games.\"","Since their university didn't offer any game-related majors, he could only settle for the next best thing, initially studying computer science alongside his current major. He planned to apply for a major change in his sophomore year, build a foundation, and then teach himself game design.","A long time ago, he had accidentally seen a broadcast of a fellow countryman winning an international e-sports tournament for the first time.","The moment the bright national flag was draped over that person's shoulders, it was like a bolt of lightning, opening a new world for him.","That was when he learned that playing games could also bring glory to the country.","It was that very scene that quietly planted a seed of e-sports in the heart of this \"good child\" in his parents' eyes.","However, due to various reasons, he ultimately became a member of Finance University's Industrial Management Class 2.","After getting familiar with university life in the first half of the semester, he realized he truly had no interest in his current major and preferred something more connected to games or e-sports.","But if he were to actually make that choice, the pressure would be immense.","Both his parents and Lin Yu's father strongly opposed him going down this path. Playing casually for leisure was fine, but pursuing an uncertain future in this field was absolutely unacceptable.","Lin Yu's father had some influence within the system and had even mapped out a future path for them.","The study abroad exchange was one part of that plan.","\"Xiao Yu, sometimes I really don't know how to choose... If I give up the exchange opportunity, you... what will you do?\"","Lin Yu shook her head. \"I don't know either. My path was arranged by my father long ago. He said which university and major to choose, and I went there. He said to go abroad for exchange and further study, and I went.\"","\"My choices... have never really been in my own hands.\"","\"Haoran, you're different. At least you know what you truly like, even if others don't think much of it. As for me, I don't even dare to think about it.\"","These words were like a needle, piercing through a long-suppressed emotion in Fang Haoran's heart.","He abruptly looked up at Lin Yu and, for the first time, saw something called confusion on her always gentle face.","The more Fang Haoran looked, the more his heart ached for her situation, and the more he feared that if he gave up the exchange opportunity, he might never see her again.","Amidst these particularly tangled emotions, the two of them fell into silence once more.","After an unknown length of time.","Lin Yu took a soft breath. She turned her head to look at Fang Haoran's lowered face, etched with struggle.","After a few seconds, she stood up, walked in front of Fang Haoran, and said softly,","\"Haoran, don't overthink it. Whatever path you choose, I'll support you!\"","\"Don't worry about what others say, and don't worry about... what might happen later. Go and do what you want to do. Just like that e-sports player you once told me about, the one you saw on TV draped in the national flag.\"","After saying this, Lin Yu turned and left without waiting for Fang Haoran's response.","By the time Fang Haoran looked up, all he saw was her raising one hand high, clenched into a fist: \"Good luck, Fang Haoran!\"","And another phrase, spoken so softly it was completely inaudible: \"In three years, I'll come back for you...\"","Fang Haoran stood up stiffly, simply staring dumbly as Lin Yu disappeared at the end of the road.","He didn't know how long he stood there.","Suddenly.","A small, ice-cold hand slapped heavily onto his shoulder: \"Hey! Fang Haoran, I've been looking for you forever. How about teaming up for the Phoenix Crown Cup esports tournament?\""]},{"number":409,"title":"Chapter 409: 409, Competition","paragraphs":["The sudden announcement of an esports tournament by Phoenix Authority Esports genuinely caught many by surprise.","Especially Deng Zheyan, the boss of Yan Internet Cafe.","As the saying goes, a broken bone takes a hundred days to heal. Deng Zheyan's arm had been fractured several times already, and according to the doctor, it would take at least half a year to properly recover.","Just a few days after getting his arm bandaged up, this guy learned about Phoenix Authority's move and couldn't stay put in the hospital any longer. He sneaked out, determined to see with his own eyes what they were up to.","Deng Zheyan was the type who forgot the pain once the wound healed, quickly brushing off how Zhao Junjie had fallen down the stairs and how his own arm had gotten broken in the first place.","Sure enough.","When he arrived at his own internet cafe, he saw the Phoenix Authority Esports place across the street packed with people, even spilling out the door. It was a sea of humanity, with bursts of cheers erupting from inside every now and then.","A perfectly good internet cafe had been transformed into something resembling an esports arena.","Hardly anyone was playing games on the first-floor hall anymore; they were all intently watching some kind of match.","The spectators were clearly divided into different groups, mostly students from Finance University and Vocational College, as it was currently a showdown between teams from these two schools.","They had all come to cheer for their own school's team.","With the crowd far exceeding the available seats, they had divided into seated tickets and standing tickets.","The original gaming area in the hall had long been occupied by early arrivals who had logged onto the machines, turning it into a VIP viewing section.","Those without a machine had to make do with the complimentary standing-room-only treatment.","A projector was set up in the central area, broadcasting the live match onto a large white screen.","Two rows of computers on either side of the screen had been deliberately cleared to serve as temporary player stations.","Whenever a thrilling kill appeared on the screen, the audience below would immediately erupt into roaring cheers.","\"Holy shit! That snipe! A-site, one through two! That's insane!\"","\"See that, see that? I told you this sniper was solid, A-site is completely locked down! They still dare to push? Really thick-headed!\"","\"Never expected Finance University's team to have such a skilled player. I originally thought they'd definitely lose to Vocational College.\"","\"Tell me about it. I thought Vocational College had it in the bag too, especially since Finance University's 'Lady Purple Team' even has a girl on it.\"","\"What, looking down on us Finance University girls?\"","Someone instantly remembered Liu Yutong, the daughter of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, and quickly waved their hands: \"Wouldn't dare! Wouldn't dare!\"","\".........\"","At that moment.","In front of a row of computers to the right of the projection screen, a girl wearing a purple wig was staring intently at her monitor, wearing headphones and shouting.","\"Oh no, oh no! The mid smoke is a fake! Watch A-short, go there now!\"","\"B-site, B-site! Three entering! Can't hold it!\"","\"Ugh, what's the shot-caller thinking? Why did they send people to A?\"","\"Aren't you the shot-caller?\"","\"...Am I? Hehehe... my mistake.\"","Her four teammates: \".......\"","Soon, this round put Lady Purple Team on the back foot. A poor decision nearly led to a team wipe.","In the end, only a sniper and a little Samoyed, hiding behind a crate waiting for a chance to knife someone, were left.","To make matters worse, both were low on health.","The spectators in the cafe, especially the Finance University supporters, had their hearts in their throats.","\"It's over, it's over! Only two left! And both are low health! The rotation routes are blocked now, mid is smoked, and there's probably someone holding A-short too. This round's gonna be tough.\"","\"Sigh, it's all the shot-caller's fault... that last call was terrible, basically gave away three players. This clutch situation is impossible even for a god!\"","\".......\"","The Vocational College students couldn't help but burst into laughter seeing this.","\"Hahaha, see that? That's the skill gap! The girl calling shots for Finance University is still a bit lacking, boys. Get ready to celebrate the win! Five versus two, it's in the bag!\"","\"See that little Samoyed? Cowering behind the crate, trembling, hahaha.........\"","\"This round is ours! Boys, get ready to shout 'Vocational College rules!'\"","\"........\"","Li Xiaohui was indeed getting nervous. The Vocational College team was genuinely strong, managing to fight her team to a standstill.","After all, the teammates she had gathered were basically the top players from Finance University. And yet, facing their first Vocational College team, they were already on the verge of an upset.","The tournament format was single elimination, one match decides it all. Losing meant immediate elimination.","Right at that moment.","Fang Haoran's voice came through the headset: \"Don't panic, I'm still here, Hui-jie. Try to draw their fire in a bit, leave the rest to me.\"","Hearing him, Li Xiaohui gave an affirmative hum. She switched her weapon a few times before finally pulling out her knife.","This way she could run faster, maybe buying Fang Haoran a little more time and creating a sniping opportunity.","Two players on the opposing team, perhaps having heard the shouts from the audience—after all, the environment here was no match for a professional soundproofed venue, so sound leakage was normal—vaguely caught that someone on the other side wanted to knife them. They, too, wordlessly switched to their knives, planning to strike first and knife that little Samoyed!","How dare you be so cocky, trying to knife them when you're at a disadvantage.","Just as they were about to rush over and raise their knives,","A sudden change!","The little Samoyed, who had been crouching behind the crate as if frozen in fear, suddenly flashed out, raising her combat knife for a wild slash.","Perhaps by sheer luck, those two just happened to run right into the blade's path.","The in-game voice announcement instantly played.","Double kill!","The entire internet cafe fell silent for a moment, everyone stunned.","Vocational College spectators: \"???\"","Finance University spectators: \"!!!\"","You've gotta be kidding me? That actually worked?","But soon, someone shouted excitedly.","\"Holy crap! She actually knifed them?! Lady Purple Team got the knife kills, and two headshots at once! Lady Purple rules!!!\"","\"See that? See that? Who said our little Samoyed was a coward? That knife play is insane!\"","\"More like two idiots ran headfirst into Lady Purple's blade.\"","\"Hahaha.......\"","The remaining three Vocational College players were also startled by the sudden kill feed, then quickly pushed forward, spraying bullets all over the little Samoyed's last known position.","Just as they exposed themselves...","\"Bang!\"","A crisp sniper rifle shot rang out!","One of the three instantly dropped.","Similarly, the little Samoyed was also gunned down in the hail of bullets.","The situation instantly shifted from an initial two-versus-five to a one-versus-two.","The two remaining Vocational College players also pinpointed the sniper's location. One provided covering fire while the other seized the chance to rush out!","Another burst of intense gunfire sounded.","But the one who dropped wasn't the sniper!","The atmosphere in the venue was completely ignited!","\"It's a 1v1! A 1v1!!\"","\"That sniper still got hit, he's down to one HP, one touch and he's dead. This is too intense!\"","\"Vocational School team, hold the line! He's one shot! A single bullet graze and he's done!\"","\".........\"","The last player from the Vocational School team, even though he knew his opponent had barely any health left, was still tense. After all, the other guy's aim was too precise.","Then he switched weapons and realized he still had a flashbang left. A plan instantly formed: flash out first, then rush him hard. The moment they faced each other, victory was guaranteed!","However, he still underestimated the skill and mental fortitude of the sniper from Team Purple Lord.","Just as he threw the flashbang, exposing only a sliver of his body for a split-second before ducking back behind cover, the sniper rifle roared again.","Bang!","A near-impossible reaction in a fraction of a second. The sniper seemed to have predicted it, swinging out and firing a quick-scope shot.","The screen immediately washed out into blinding white.","As the white faded, the victory screen for the Counter-Terrorists appeared on the monitor.","The entire venue fell silent for a few seconds before erupting completely.","\"AAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!\"","\"We won!! An epic comeback!!\"","\"The God of Snipers! Xiao Samoyed! You're insane!!\"","\"Team Purple Lord is fucking awesome!!!\"","............."]},{"number":410,"title":"Chapter 410: 410. One Hundred Cups of Milk Tea.","paragraphs":["\"Congratulations to Team Purple Lady on their victory and advancing to the next round!\"","\"Let's all congratulate them!\"","As an unprofessional commentator shouted these words, the already bustling internet cafe erupted once more.","This was the first time Li Xiaohui and her team had participated in an esports competition. When the word 'Victory' appeared prominently on the big screen, coupled with the unprofessional commentator calling out their team name, an unprecedented sense of exhilaration instantly surged within them.","Li Xiaohui ripped off her headset, stood up from her seat, and in her excitement, almost threw herself at Fang Haoran beside her.","\"Ahhh! Fang Haoran! We won! You were absolutely amazing! That final shot was just too cool!!\"","Although she initially intended to give him a hug, she restrained herself at the last moment, opting instead to pat his shoulder with her small hand, saying, \"Not bad, not bad, keep it up, let's win the championship together! Woohoo...\"","Fang Haoran was also extremely excited at this moment, nodding vigorously before turning to tightly embrace his other three teammates.","\"We won! We really won!\"","\"Well done, brothers!\"","\"...\"","Then, they all looked towards the cheering crowd around them.","Especially Fang Haoran. Looking at those familiar yet unfamiliar faces and hearing them shout his team's name and \"Sniper God,\" an intense wave of emotion rushed to the bridge of his nose, and his vision gradually blurred.","Was this the feeling of winning a match?","The confusion he had felt before was now completely dispelled by this small internet cafe tournament, solidifying his conviction.","Esports had a future, and that future would surely be bright!","On the outskirts of the crowd.","Deng Zheyan, who had disguised himself simply with a hat, was also startled by the sudden outburst of cheers.","Then he muttered sourly, \"What's so great about it? It's just hosting a competition, is it worth getting this excited?\"","\"Even with this many people now, I don't see the revenue increasing much. It's purely a waste of money!\"","When he first arrived at the internet cafe, he too had been shocked by the electric atmosphere at Huangquan Esports.","He never expected that a mere internet cafe tournament could possess such magic, attracting so many students to come and watch.","Even he, a spy, couldn't help but become completely absorbed in watching the final clutch round moments ago, his heart tightening along with the action.","Of course, he quickly snapped out of it, remembering his true purpose for being here: to estimate their revenue.","There was no direct way to see the revenue figures.","He could only use the simplest method of counting heads and observing the number of paying customers to estimate a rough revenue number.","The internet fees were mostly transparent and didn't need much calculation; the main focus was on additional spending.","After counting for a while, he had a rough estimate in mind.","The consumption on drinks and snacks had indeed increased somewhat, but not by much.","Most people were just there for the spectacle, watching without spending. Overall, it was still within an acceptable range for him.","Moreover, judging by the current trend, no matter how successful this tournament became, the other side couldn't possibly beat him unless Wanlong Hui acted dishonorably and forced those students to spend.","Why was Deng Zheyan so confident of his victory?","Because he knew that for the other side to surpass him, they would have to achieve double his internet cafe's revenue without cheating.","That was almost impossible.","Time was also running out. His victory over Huangquan Esports was practically set in stone.","Thinking of this, Deng Zheyan became smug again.","\"Liu Yutong, oh Liu Yutong, did you think you could turn things around with some small-time tournament?\"","\"I've got this in the bag...\"","Before he could finish his mental mockery of Liu Yutong, suddenly, a voice rang out in the internet cafe.","\"Host, host, don't rush to start the next match yet!\"","A young man wearing a Huangquan Esports uniform squeezed his way to the front from the crowd.","The host, also the not-so-professional commentator, looked somewhat confused as he picked up the microphone. \"Huh? Is there something else to announce?\"","The staff member quickly walked up to the host, handed him a small note, and whispered a few words rapidly into his ear.","A flicker of surprise first crossed the host's face, then his eyes suddenly lit up, and his whole demeanor became more spirited.","He nodded, vigorously tapping the microphone, producing a series of thump thump thump sounds.","\"Quiet! Everyone, quiet! Listen to me!\"","The internet cafe instantly fell silent.","The host straightened his posture, a smile on his face, and announced loudly:","\"I've just received a major piece of news!\"","\"Just now, right after Team Purple Lady created that clutch miracle and won this match, we received a special gift from a mysterious Miss Liu!\"","The entire venue fell silent again, even Li Xiaohui and her team looked curiously at the host.","A gift? What kind of gift?","Could there be additional rewards for this tournament that she didn't know about?","The host deliberately paused, building up the suspense, before revealing the answer.","\"To celebrate the thrilling match brought to us by Team Purple Lady and their successful advancement, Miss Liu has specially gifted one hundred cups of our internet cafe's signature milk tea, 'Boyajuexian,' to them!\"","\"Wow!\"","\"One hundred cups of Boyajuexian milk tea?\"","\"Is that milk tea good? Giving away so many at once?\"","\"I've had it, it's delicious, just tastes a bit like Wangzai milk...\"","\"Miss Liu is so generous!\"","\"How much would that cost?!\"","\"...\"","After the initial astonishment, the audience began discussing the impractical side.","\"Gifting so much milk tea at once, Team Purple Lady only has five members. Can they possibly finish it all?\"","\"Exactly! That much milk tea, even one cup a day would take forever. They'd probably get sick of it!\"","\"I think it's probably being stored at the internet cafe for now, and they can drink it for free when they come to game later.\"","\"Hmm, that makes sense!\"","\"...\"","Li Xiaohui and her teammates were stunned, looking at each other in disbelief.","One hundred cups of Boyajuexian gifted to them? They'd be drinking that until the cows come home.","Especially Li Xiaohui, who didn't even want to drink it anymore at this point.","Ever since learning that simple recipe, she had been mixing herself a cup whenever she felt like it and was utterly sick of it.","Hearing that someone had gifted her and her teammates so much milk tea left her momentarily bewildered.","Did this person have too much money and nowhere to spend it?","She didn't think of Liu Yutong, because she hadn't seen her and assumed this 'Miss Liu' was someone else.","The host, clearly anticipating everyone's confusion, smiled and waved his hands, explaining:","\"Everyone, calm down! I know what you're thinking. One hundred cups of milk tea... even if the members of Team Purple Lady drank three cups a day, it would take them over a month. That's indeed a sweet dilemma, hahaha...\"","The audience in the venue erupted in laughter once more.","\"But, our mysterious Miss Liu has considered everything very thoroughly. The 'Boya Breaks His Zither' she sent out isn't just about the literal one hundred cups of milk tea. Behind this lies a special sponsorship gift mechanism launched by our Huangquan E-sports to support and encourage outstanding players!\"","\"???\"","\"Sponsorship gift? What's that?\"","This term was completely unfamiliar to everyone present, even Li Xiaohui perked up her ears curiously."]},{"number":411,"title":"Chapter 411: 411. The Witch is Too Vicious.","paragraphs":["\"Sponsorship gifts?\"","\"Exactly!\"","The host went on to explain, \"Simply put, Miss Liu thought Team Lady Zi played too brilliantly, so she paid for these one hundred cups of 'Bo Ya Jue Xian' tea to our Huangquan E-sports!\"","\"So, how should this money be distributed fairly? Our internet cafe has proposed two options!\"","\"The first method is physical redemption. The members of Team Lady Zi can exchange these milk teas for physical items, storing them at the internet cafe. They can drink them whenever they want, treat friends if they wish, valid for one year!\"","\"The second method is cash conversion. If they don't want to drink that much milk tea or store them, they can convert the gifts into cash, although the internet cafe's costs will be deducted.\"","In reality, there were no costs at all. This was essentially borrowing the revenue-sharing model from live-streaming donations in a past life; actual costs only occurred when redeeming physical items.","After the host's explanation, the students all understood what it meant.","\"Wow, this gift is so special, it can even be exchanged for cash!\"","\"This is my first time seeing something like this, quite novel.\"","\"I think it's great too. Players who perform well deserve this kind of reward.\"","\"........\"","This sponsorship gift model was still very novel for university students of this era. It meant the 'Bo Ya Jue Xian' could be either milk tea or a virtual gift for tipping, with the proceeds ultimately going to the players or team they supported.","Li Xiaohui and her teammates also understood, their faces breaking into surprised and delighted smiles.","Especially Fang Haoran, who vaguely sensed something—it seemed the earnings from this competition were far more than just the fixed prize money.","For an esports player, besides passion, the biggest pain point was the lack of sustainable income, which was also the main reason many couldn't persevere.","If you can't even support yourself, how can you expect family support, how can you continue to love esports?","Whoever came up with this tipping method is a real genius!","The host then began to ask.","\"So, the five players of Team Lady Zi, do you choose to store them for later or turn Miss Liu's kindness into cash?\"","After a brief discussion with Fang Haoran and the others, Li Xiaohui said, \"We've decided to exchange all the 'Bo Ya Jue Xian' milk tea we received for physical items. We won't store them; we'll treat everyone present right now, everyone gets a share!\"","Whoa!","The entire internet cafe instantly erupted!","\"No way, treating all of us?!\"","\"Holy crap! That's so awesome!\"","\"Long live Boss Liu!\"","\"Long live Team Lady Zi!!\"","\"Team Lady Zi is so generous!!!\"","\"............\"","As if prepared in advance, shortly after Li Xiaohui's announcement, the staff immediately brought out large quantities of prepared milk tea and began handing them out one by one.","The atmosphere in the internet cafe grew even more enthusiastic. Even students from opposing camps were all beaming with joy.","Even Deng Zheyan, who was still in a daze, received a cup of milk tea.","This... this actually works?","When he came to his senses and figured out this model, his expression changed immediately, thinking, this is bad!","Sure enough.","After the milk tea was distributed, some university students who wanted to show off or came from wealthier families began to get eager.","Every era has its wealthy people, let alone a university town with so many students; it's normal for some to come from well-off backgrounds.","Then, those students who genuinely wanted to support Team Lady Zi started to follow suit.","\"Student Li from the University of Finance and Economics sends Team Lady Zi twenty cups of milk tea. Student Li is awesome!\"","As the host's voice fell, a prominent line of text appeared on the big screen.","[Student Li from the University of Finance and Economics gifts Team Lady Zi 'Bo Ya Jue Xian' X20 cups! Student Li is awesome!]","Student Li himself was a bespectacled boy who looked well-off. When he was recognized by his friends in the crowd, they all started cheering.","\"Not bad, Lao Li, hiding your skills!\"","\"Brother Li is so generous, this move is too cool!\"","\"This is what prestige looks like!\"","\".........\"","Student Li felt a bit embarrassed by the praise, but a proud and excited smile also appeared on his face as he waved towards the stage.","Li Xiaohui and the others also saw the screen, smiling and waving in Student Li's direction to express their thanks.","The feeling of being thanked by name directly made Student Li's heart soar with delight.","It was as if a Pandora's box had been opened.","\"Host! Host! I want to send some too! Ten cups to that female captain, Lady Zi! I like her!\"","\"I... I... I'll send five cups to Sniper God Fang Haoran, that last shot was divine!\"","\"Our University of Finance and Economics boys from dorm 303 jointly send fifteen cups to the entire Team Lady Zi. Brothers, go for it, win the championship!\"","\"........\"","As voices rose one after another from the audience, the sponsorship messages on the big screen also began to scroll continuously.","In just ten minutes, Team Lady Zi, including individual gifts, received nearly a thousand yuan worth of gifts.","Of course, they couldn't let the audience keep sending gifts indefinitely; there was a time limit because the next matches still needed to proceed.","So, after about ten minutes, it was promptly called to a stop.","The players from other teams who were about to take the stage saw this scene, their eyes turning red with envy.","Good performance can also earn gifts? Then what's there to say? Fight like hell to crush the opponents!","An unprecedented fighting spirit ignited fiercely within their chests!","Host: \"So, are the teams taking the stage next ready?\"","\"Ready!!\" The members of both teams roared.","The atmosphere was completely ignited!","The internet cafe became fervent once again, everyone eagerly anticipating the next exciting match.","Deng Zheyan, as if having lost his soul, slowly walked out of Huangquan E-sports.","When he reached the outside of the internet cafe, he couldn't help but turn his head to look once more at the lively crowd inside.","This is terrible now!","Just as he was in a daze...","A voice suddenly came from his right.","\"Move! Get out of the way!!\"","A motorcycle, skidding and out of control on the slippery road, was wobbling straight towards him.","By the time Deng Zheyan noticed, it was too late to dodge. All he could do was let out a mournful cry, \"No way! Again?\"","Crash—!","A scream rang out!","Not far away.","Liu Yutong, wearing a black baseball cap and a black mask, happened to be walking out of the internet cafe with Yun Cheng. She saw Deng Zheyan being carried onto an ambulance, clutching his right arm, and couldn't help shaking her head.","\"Not staying put in the hospital, daring to run around outside.\"","She didn't linger, directly getting into the car Yun Cheng drove over, leaving the scene and heading to the Wanlong Shopping Center construction site to inspect the overall renovation progress.","Lying on the stretcher, Deng Zheyan squinted in pain just in time to see Liu Yutong getting into the car and driving away. With great effort, he raised his less-injured left hand, pointing in the direction the vehicle had disappeared. \"That witch... that witch... she's utterly vicious!\"","He was clearly convinced that the motorcycle had been arranged by Liu Yutong, all part of a scheme to ensure he'd never leave the hospital."]},{"number":412,"title":"Chapter 412: 412. The Sudden Crisis","paragraphs":["Wanlong Shopping Center, this colossal structure with over a hundred thousand square meters of usable space, was currently undergoing extensive renovations in full swing.","The construction site was bustling with activity, filled with the roar of machinery and the sounds of workers laboring away.","Liu Yutong, Yun Cheng, and others, wearing white hard hats, weaved through the site accompanied by the project manager in charge of construction and several technical staff.","The project manager pointed at various areas while giving his report.","\"Miss Liu, look over here. The partitioning for the anchor stores in Zone A is basically complete, and the progress for pre-buried water and electrical pipelines has reached 65%...\"","\"The steel structure for the atrium's skylight has been successfully joined, and the installation of the glass curtain wall will officially commence next week...\"","\"The laying of fire sprinkler and ventilation ducts is proceeding simultaneously. We will absolutely ensure it passes inspection on the first try...\"","\"Miss Liu, rest assured, all the materials we are using are procured strictly according to your requirements...\"","Liu Yutong gave a slight nod. Yet, despite the project manager's various assurances, she still decided to personally inspect some details.","When she encountered something she didn't understand, she would ask the professional borrowed from Yu Mo's company who was by her side.","Only after confirming there were no major issues would she proceed to the next area.","The group arrived at the core of the under-construction Zone C, where enormous intersecting steel beams and the yet-to-be-capped dome loomed overhead.","This was also the final area of their inspection.","Just as Liu Yutong was about to ask approximately how long it would take to complete construction and handover,","figures suddenly moved at the edge of the high steel framework above.","Immediately after, a low utterance of \"Now!\" faintly drifted down from above.","Before Liu Yutong and the others could react, several stone slabs plummeted down from the height without warning, aimed directly at Liu Yutong's position.","Yun Cheng, who had been maintaining high alert, looked up and spotted the anomaly instantly, his expression changing drastically!","\"Miss, look out!\"","Acting on instinct, Yun Cheng lunged forward with great force, shoving Liu Yutong away from the spot, while using the momentum to roll forward himself.","Thud!","They both landed heavily, one after the other, on a neatly stacked pile of relatively soft fireproof acoustic insulation material nearby.","Liu Yutong grunted, her vision swimming for a moment, her white hard hat knocked off. Mainly because Yun Cheng had pushed her with such immense strength.","Almost at the exact same moment they hit the ground!","Bang! Crash!","Deafening crashes rang out consecutively as those stone slabs smashed onto the concrete floor where Liu Yutong had just been standing, instantly shattering into pieces!","Dust billowed, and shattered fragments of stone flew everywhere!","\"Miss!\"","Yun Cheng didn't hesitate. He scrambled up and used his body to shield Liu Yutong's position.","Several Wanlong Hui members around them also snapped into action, rushing forward without a second thought, instantly forming a human wall that tightly protected Liu Yutong at its center!","These Wanlong Hui members, regardless of their usual personalities, at this life-and-death moment, didn't even think—they simply acted.","\"We must protect the Miss!\"","\"The Miss's life is more important than all of ours combined!\"","Falling rubble pelted their backs, arms, legs, and bodies like hail, yet they stood firm, gritting their teeth and bearing it without a single sound.","As the dust settled slightly, it revealed Liu Yutong, shielded at the center.","She pushed herself up from the insulation material, her black long hair slightly disheveled, with some minor scrapes on her forehead and wrist, but fortunately, she was otherwise unharmed.","Seeing the Wanlong Hui members forming the human wall before her, ignoring their own pain, Liu Yutong had no time for pity or to look up and see what the assassins looked like.","But no matter who they were or how many there were, they absolutely could not be allowed to escape!","The immediate priority was to evacuate to the open, safe area outside, to prevent the assassins from launching a second attack.","From such a height, anything falling and hitting a person could be fatal.","\"Everyone, run outside now!\"","Yun Cheng and the Wanlong Hui members, ignoring the pain in their bodies, immediately tightened the protective circle, firmly shielding Liu Yutong at its core as they covered her rapid retreat.","Above, several assassins watched as the dust cleared and saw that their target was unharmed, their faces turning ashen.","\"Damn it, she's still alive! Quick! Again!\"","\"Throw whatever you can! We must crush that woman to death!\"","Just as Liu Yutong and her group were sprinting downstairs, the assassins hurled more objects down. This time, it wasn't just stone slabs, but also steel rebars, metal angle irons, and other lethally heavy items.","Coupled with the inherent clutter of the construction site, even while running, the group's speed was limited. Someone even tripped over something.","When those objects rained down from above, some people found it impossible to dodge.","\"Protect the Miss!\"","A member of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, positioned somewhat farther from Liu Yutong, was Zhang Tao, the one who had recently returned from the southern district. Out of the corner of his eye, he saw several steel rebars with sharp ends hurtling toward Liu Yutong's back. Without a moment's hesitation, he made a decision that bordered on suicidal.","Zhang Tao immediately snatched up a roughly half-meter-long, arm-thick square wooden plank from the ground and swung it fiercely upward at an angle!","He actually intended to try and knock those rebars away.","Although he knew the odds of failure were high, and that a single misstep could cost him his life, he charged forward regardless.","Thwack!","Crack!","The wooden plank whistled through the air and actually struck the sides of two of the rebars, deflecting their trajectory. They shot past Liu Yutong's side with a shriek and plunged deep into the concrete floor nearby.","However!","The third rebar, carrying terrifying penetrating force, slammed straight through the left arm he had just raised!","\"Ahhh—!!!\"","Zhang Tao let out a blood-curdling scream, clutching his agonizing arm as he collapsed to the ground. Blood instantly stained the black uniform he wore.","His body even convulsed violently, beyond his control, but his fading consciousness remained fixed on the Young Lady's direction, desperate to confirm her safety.","Seeing that the Young Lady was unharmed, a faint, relieved smile touched his trembling lips.","It was good that the Young Lady was safe!","\"Zhang Tao!\"","Liu Yutong, still running, whipped her head around just in time to witness the gruesome scene.","An unprecedented surge of fury, heartache, and icy killing intent instantly flooded her heart.","Yun Cheng also saw it happen, his eyes nearly bursting from their sockets.","He shoved Liu Yutong toward the entrance of the emergency exit, then turned back without a second thought, along with two other Ten Thousand Dragons Society members. Braving the still-falling, potentially lethal debris, they desperately dragged the fallen Zhang Tao to his feet and quickly pulled him toward safety.","Fortunately, they managed to avoid further injury on their way back.","However, several ordinary construction workers in their forties who had been working on the first floor, along with two of the technicians accompanying Liu Yutong's inspection, were not so lucky.","One was struck on the head by a brick. Thankfully, his safety helmet was of good quality and held, so he survived, though he was knocked unconscious.","The others sustained injuries of varying severity: fractures, legs gashed by shattered concrete, broken ribs—all serious wounds.","Finally, the group scrambled out to the safety of the open area outside.","Liu Yutong didn't even have time to compose herself, her eyes locked on the exit.","Only when she saw Yun Cheng and the others emerge safely, bringing the severely injured Zhang Tao with them, did she allow herself to breathe a slight sigh of relief."]},{"number":413,"title":"Chapter 413: 413, Comprehensive Inspection","paragraphs":["At that moment.","The project manager scrambled over, his voice trembling with fear. \"M-Miss Liu! Are you alright? Wh-what on earth happened? This is terrible! It's all our fault for failing with safety management! I... I...\"","\"Shut up!\"","Liu Yutong whirled around, her icy glare instantly freezing the project manager in his tracks, forcing him to swallow his next words.","Immediately, she strode over to Yun Cheng and the others, gritted her teeth, and swiftly began issuing orders.","\"Yun Cheng, relay my commands!\"","\"First, spare no expense. Get Zhang Tao and the other injured to the hospital immediately. I want them all alive and well, and they must recover completely!\"","\"Second, notify all available Wanlong Hui members in the surrounding area. Seal off every entrance and exit of this construction site immediately! Not even a fly is to get out!\"","\"This time, no matter what, we must dig out those rats. I want them alive! If they dare resist, as long as they don't die, you have free rein to deal with them!\"","\"Third, immediately account for every single person on site—workers, technicians, security, management. No one is to be missed. Verify everyone's identity. Anyone suspicious is to be detained immediately! Also, lock down all information. Until this matter is fully investigated, not a single detail about today's attack is to leak out!\"","\"Fourth, reassure all the frightened and injured workers. Provide compensation where it's due, all according to the highest standards! The Wanlong Hui will cover all costs!\"","\"...\"","One command after another flowed from her lips, quickly received and executed.","The originally chaotic scene rapidly became orderly under her formidable presence and efficient command.","Uninjured Wanlong Hui members sprang into action, driving the wounded to the hospital at top speed.","Within mere minutes, a flood of reinforced Wanlong Hui members poured into the area around the site, swiftly completing the lockdown.","Once there were enough personnel, they directly began checking personnel information.","For those assassins to have infiltrated the site, even climbed to the top floor to ambush her, and known her schedule for today, there had to be negligence within the site itself, or possibly even an inside job.","Liu Yutong stood her ground. Though she had several abrasions on her hands and forehead, she only had someone bring iodine to clean them briefly, not even bothering with bandages.","After tending to her wounds, she went nowhere.","A Wanlong Hui member brought a chair from the site office, and she sat down right there in an open area, personally overseeing her subordinates as they screened for suspicious individuals.","No matter who was behind this, Zhao Tianxing or anyone else—anyone who dared target her people, who dared try to take her life!","She, Liu Yutong, would see it through to the end!","To the death!","Liu Yutong had temporarily chosen not to call the police. Although this was a major incident, because she had locked things down promptly enough, the outside world remained unaware of what had happened here for now.","Even if some uninformed workers on site knew something had happened and had seen the wounded with their own eyes, when they saw the dense crowd of men in black surrounding the place, none dared to call the police.","Especially after learning someone had dared to attack the boss of these men in black, they were utterly terrified, fearing these men might vent their anger on them, the innocent bystanders.","Time passed minute by minute, and the atmosphere on site grew increasingly oppressive.","Yun Cheng, along with Ma Da and Zhao Tianyi who had arrived later, were all meticulously supervising the verification of the workers' information.","It had to be said, the pressure from the dense crowd of black-clad figures surrounding them, like something out of a movie, was immense for the workers present.","It was only now that they truly realized the background of the boss behind the project they were working on was actually this... dark.","Liu Yutong sat on the brought-in chair, her eyes slightly lowered, her right hand unconsciously wiping at a remaining smudge of blood on the back of her left hand.","She was thinking about the condition of those in the hospital, especially Zhang Tao. His father had just been discharged, and now he was in the hospital... she didn't even know if his arm could be saved...","Yun Cheng and the others worked with great efficiency. Through the information check, they quickly identified five suspicious individuals among the workers who had no registered information.","After confirming their identities, they subdued them instantly, giving them no chance to resist.","The five were roughly dragged and thrown onto the open ground not far from Liu Yutong, forced to kneel.","Their faces showed a mix of terror, resentment and despair, and one was expressionless, as if already resigned to life or death.","Liu Yutong finally stopped wiping the bloodstain and slowly raised her head.","A breeze blew past, stirring her disheveled hair and revealing the abrasion on her temple.","She didn't speak, only calmly scrutinized the five kneeling men with her ice-cold, beautiful eyes.","Under the pressure of her gaze, the five kneeling assassins felt their breathing grow increasingly difficult, as if someone were choking them.","At that moment.","Ma Da stepped forward and reported in a deep voice, \"Young Miss, we've caught them. How shall we proceed?\"","Liu Yutong finally spoke, her voice carrying a calmness that chilled to the bone.","\"Take them all away. Find a quiet place.\"","\"Yun Cheng, Ma Da, you two interrogate them separately.\"","\"I want their names, origins, who's behind them, and how they got in here. Every step, every detail, I want it all laid out.\"","\"As for methods... as long as they don't die, do as you please.\"","\"Zhao Tianyi, you handle the cleanup. Don't leave any traces!\"","In the past, the Wanlong Hui's methods were mostly about intimidation, rarely resorting to truly harsh measures, as that could lead to disputes and legal risks.","But today was different. The nature of this was too vile. This wasn't an ordinary conflict or business competition; it was premeditated murder! And it had caused serious injuries to multiple innocent people, including Zhang Tao!","No matter what methods were used, there was no need to hold back, especially with Zhao Tianyi covering any potential loose ends to prevent problems.","\"Understood!\" The three immediately accepted their orders.","Subsequently, the five assassins were dragged away from the scene amidst their terror and despair.","Witnessing this, the workers were even more terrified, not daring to breathe loudly, and already imagining the fate of those men.","The more they thought about it, the more frightened they became; some even felt the urge to urinate.","The interrogation results came back quickly.","Among the five assassins, two had very tough bones. Even after suffering considerably, they still clenched their teeth, refusing to reveal who hired them.","The other three weren't as tough; they confessed everything after just a bit of persuasion.","\"Zhao Tianxing. As expected, it's him.\"","Liu Yutong stood up. Before she could even give the order to apprehend the individuals named by the assassins, a foreman among the workers suddenly fell to his knees with a thud, scrambling and crawling to get in front of Liu Yutong.","\"Miss Liu, spare me! Miss Liu!\"","\"Miss Liu, I didn't know, I truly didn't know they were here to harm you!\"","\"I... I just got a little greedy for some petty cash. That Old Chen, he's a fellow villager of mine. He came to me, said he had a few relatives who just came to the city and wanted to find some work for a few days... and he slipped me two thousand bucks.... I... I lost my head for a moment and agreed.\"","\"If I had known they were here to harm you, I wouldn't have dared to let them in even if you gave me a hundred, a thousand times the courage!\"","\"Miss Liu, I beg you! Please forgive me this one time! I have a wife and kids at home, my old mother is bedridden! I'm begging you!\"","The foreman spoke while kowtowing frantically.","However, Liu Yutong felt not a single ripple of pity in her heart. Especially when she thought of the Wanlonghui brothers and those innocent injured workers lying in the hospital at this very moment, her expression grew even colder.","\"You claim ignorance, yet you nearly cost me and my employees our lives. Isn't the price for that a bit too light?\"","\"Take him away. Give special attention to the hand he used to take that money. Make sure he remembers forever what money he can take, and what money, once taken... will cost him his life.\""]},{"number":414,"title":"Chapter 414: 414. The Evidence Has Been Fully Supplemented","paragraphs":["After the foreman was dragged away, the atmosphere at the site grew even more oppressive.","Especially for the workers laboring on the construction site. Having witnessed the foreman, who usually barked orders, being dragged off like a dead dog, and now seeing the girl with an imposing aura, surrounded by a group of men in black, walking towards them, they couldn't help but tremble.","The workers on the site were generally older, with those around forty being the main workforce. It was no exaggeration to say that some of them, who had married early, might have children older than this young girl before them.","Yet, it was this seemingly adolescent girl who made them too afraid to even look her in the eye, instinctively lowering their heads and silently praying in their hearts.","\"She... she's coming over...\"","\"Don't... don't look at me.\"","\"It's not my business, I really don't know anything.\"","\"Please... please don't drag us into this...\"","\"...\"","Liu Yutong looked at these usually simple and honest workers, now frightened and uneasy. The frost on her face gradually melted, and her expression softened.","She tilted her head slightly, looking at Yun Cheng beside her. \"Yun Cheng, bring the money over.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\" Yun Cheng replied.","He immediately waved over a subordinate in black carrying a briefcase and took out a thick stack of cash from it.","Liu Yutong looked again at the nearly hundred migrant workers before her, who were like startled birds, and comforted them, \"Uncles and aunties, there's no need to be nervous. We are not bad people.\"","The workers: \"...\"","Then, they nodded frantically.","If you say you're not, then you're not. We certainly wouldn't dare to shake our heads.","Liu Yutong continued, \"Now that the murderer and the bad apple among you have been caught, today's incident has given you all a scare, and even caused injuries to a few innocent uncles. I promise, we will take full responsibility!\"","\"This money is compensation for each of you, five hundred yuan per person. It's not much, but it represents a token of sincerity from me, Liu Yutong, and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, and also an apology for the fright caused today.\"","As soon as the words fell, a stir immediately rippled through the crowd.","Compensation?","And an apology to them?","Many widened their eyes, doubting if they had heard correctly.","But looking at the serious expression on the young girl's face, it didn't seem like a joke.","Liu Yutong said no more and simply gestured to Yun Cheng beside her.","Understanding her meaning, Yun Cheng immediately called over several Ten Thousand Dragons Society members to begin distributing the money one by one.","When the money was pressed into their hands, the workers flinched as if burned, instinctively pulling back before hurriedly accepting it, perfectly enacting the extreme wariness common among ordinary people at the bottom rungs of society.","A moment later.","When the workers finally believed it was all real, their awe for the young girl deepened, now mixed with genuine gratitude from the heart.","\"Th... thank you, boss.\"","\"Thank you, Miss Liu.\"","\"Thank you...\"","\"...\"","Afterwards, Liu Yutong reminded them not to speak about today's events. Once she received their assurances, she let them leave to go about their business.","She didn't stay at the construction site either, but got into a car with the five assassins and the foreman, heading towards the police station where Qi Wei was located.","The main reason she personally escorted these criminals was to take the opportunity to sound out Qi Wei, to find out how things were progressing on his end.","When exactly would the special investigation team be stationed in Bright Pearl City, or had they already sneaked in?","And had Qi Wei and Gao Min joined this investigation team?","Once it was confirmed they were part of the team, she could, according to her prior agreement with Qi Wei, automatically become an informant for the special investigation team.","At that time, she would be able to completely destroy Zhao Tianxing and his faction!","Since the end of last year, when Liu Yutong schemed to swindle sixty million from Zhao Tianxing, she had already possessed some evidence of money laundering by Zhao Tianxing and his East Sea Alliance.","Coupled with the information unexpectedly obtained from Great South City last year about Zhao Tianxing colluding with Master Jiu of South City in some illegal trades, although the chain of evidence in this area wasn't yet complete.","Of course, even with the existing evidence, it was enough for the police to arrest and sentence Zhao Tianxing.","However, that guy would most likely still manage to get bail through some connections, which didn't align with her original intention.","So she had been biding her time, firstly to continue gathering evidence, and secondly to wait for an opportunity.","But now, she didn't want to wait any longer.","Zhao Tianxing and the people around him had to be taken down!","Thinking of this, Liu Yutong prepared to call Hua Muying to ask about the progress of his investigation.","Ever since bringing back the girl named Lan Die from Great South City, Hua Muying had been secretly investigating various illegal businesses under Zhao Tianxing's banner.","However, after all this time, there hadn't been any major breakthrough progress.","Before Liu Yutong could make the call, her own phone rang first.","She looked at the number and couldn't help but smile. \"Speak of the devil, and he calls.\"","As soon as she answered, Hua Muying's excited, hushed voice came through.","\"Miss Liu, we did it! We caught them all! Ironclad evidence!\"","\"Speak!\" Liu Yutong uttered only one word, very succinct.","\"I had my people take shifts staking out those peripheral dens and secret transfer points Lan Die provided for almost two months! Finally, we caught the important targets at an abandoned warehouse in the western suburbs!\"","\"Then I used some methods to record their entire transaction process, including them forcing and transporting the girls, and all the details of them drugging the girls and loading them onto trucks—everything was recorded by us!\"","\"Also, through my efforts to turn people and the cooperation of personnel we planted, we successfully recorded their conversations, including the next delivery location and some client information. Some are indeed people from overseas...\"","\"Besides that, I followed the clues and discovered that Zhao Tianxing actually has a hidden private clinic underneath him, equipped with a full set of illegal medical testing equipment. Later, I found a few professional pickpockets... ahem... people with professional skills, to steal some documents from the safe inside. They contain detailed records of the girls controlled by Zhao Tianxing's subordinates, as well as blood types and matching information for some of his employees, and so on...\"","Hua Muying grew more and more excited as he spoke, even blurting out curses uncontrollably: \"These beasts, these damn bastards, actually selling our fellow countrymen like livestock! They deserve to be cut into a thousand pieces, minced, and fed to dogs!\"","The main reason he lost control of his emotions was Lan Die—she had almost become one of those 'livestock' to be sold overseas back then.","Thinking of this, Hua Muying's voice suddenly turned low, carrying a plea. \"Miss Liu, can I ask you for a favor?\"","\"Considering you've done well with this matter, I'll try to agree,\" Liu Yutong said, now in a better mood herself, and agreed.","With this ironclad evidence Hua Muying had added, Zhao Tianxing wouldn't be able to escape even if he grew wings now."]},{"number":415,"title":"Chapter 415: 415, Assemble All Members, Eradicate the Enemy","paragraphs":["\"Miss Liu, I beg you to help Lan Die. I know you have immense influence. Although Lan Die was involved in those illegal businesses, she was truly a victim!\"","\"Could you please ask someone to put in a good word? Considering Lan Die can atone for her crimes by helping the authorities, could you give her a chance? Don't let her go to prison; she has suffered so much these years!\"","\"If nothing else works, let me take the blame instead. Lan Die's situation today is my fault!\"","\"Miss Liu, please!\"","The voice on the phone, Hua Muying's, was exceptionally humble. This was only the second time Liu Yutong had known him to be so subservient.","The first time was because of Xiao Hu and the others.","Hua Muying knew very well that Liu Yutong had the ability to help Lan Die escape punishment, because he knew Li Xiaohui's identity, and he also knew about Liu Yutong's connections with Gao Min and Qi Wei.","Any one of these people, except perhaps Gao Min, had the power to get Lan Die out of this mess.","But Liu Yutong would never do such a thing.","\"Hua Muying, I am fully aware of Lan Die's contributions and her hardships.\"","\"I will not directly ask someone to get her out. However, as long as she fully cooperates with the police's subsequent investigation and testimonies, I will do my best to secure every possible legal leniency for her.\"","\"For instance, having Zhao Tianyi personally act as her defense lawyer, striving to minimize her sentence and reduce her time behind bars.\"","Hua Muying on the other end wasn't entirely satisfied. What he truly hoped for was for Lan Die to avoid prison altogether, so he tried to plead further.","\"But, Miss Liu...\"","Liu Yutong cut him off: \"Hua Muying, this matter ends here!\"","The line immediately fell silent!","\"I... understand, Miss Liu.\" Hua Muying's voice carried a sense of helplessness and a faint disappointment.","\"I... I'll make sure she cooperates fully. Please trouble yourself to inform Lawyer Zhao then.\"","Liu Yutong gave a quiet 'Mm': \"I will.\"","With that, she hung up.","She pondered for a moment, then called Zhao Tianyi, who was in a car behind hers, explained Lan Die's situation, and asked him to try his best to secure a suspended sentence for her.","As long as they could get a suspended sentence, she wouldn't have to go to prison. Apart from needing to report regularly, her life would be almost like a normal person's.","After these two calls,","Liu Yutong's motorcade arrived at the entrance of the Lijin District Police Station.","Just as she was about to get out, she saw a black official car driving into the station from outside. The driver was a man who looked somewhat familiar to her.","The man also noticed Liu Yutong's conspicuously luxurious motorcade, clearly pausing for a moment and turning his head to give them a few extra glances.","After all, such an eye-catching convoy was very rare in Bright Pearl City, even exceedingly rare in the provincial capital.","The man seemed to have urgent business. Although curious about the owner of the convoy, he didn't dwell on it. After parking, he quickly walked into the police station building.","Liu Yutong rolled down the window, watching the man disappear through the doors, lost in thought.","\"Miss, shall we go in now?\" Yun Cheng had already seen several very familiar-looking police officers walking towards them.","Clearly, they recognized this as the Wanlong Association's motorcade, knowing that some more 'credit' might be delivered to their doorstep, so they were all very enthusiastic.","Liu Yutong shook her head: \"Not for now. Let's go to the hospital to see Zhang Tao and the others. Have Ma Da and Zhao Tianyi stay, take those guys in to give their statements.\"","She had suddenly changed her plans.","Yun Cheng didn't ask further, nodded, first got out and went to the back seat of a Mercedes behind them to brief Ma Da and Zhao Tianyi, then returned to the driver's seat of the Maybach and drove away.","Several other cars followed as escorts, primarily to ensure the young lady's safety.","At the hospital,","Liu Yutong inquired with the doctor. Learning that except for one worker still unconscious in the ICU, everyone else was out of life-threatening danger, and Zhang Tao's arm could be saved, she felt somewhat relieved.","In the hospital room, she saw Zhang Tao after his surgery. Seeing he was in good spirits, she was completely put at ease.","After chatting briefly for over ten minutes, just as Liu Yutong was preparing to leave with Yun Cheng, a crisp, bird-like voice came from outside the door.","\"Brother Tao, I found a place that makes super delicious pork liver and greens congee! I heard it's the best for replenishing blood!\"","Immediately after, a petite girl carrying a thermal lunchbox walked in. Her cheeks were rosy, like ripe apples, and she looked utterly adorable.","\"Your arm is injured, it's not convenient. Let me feed you...\"","Before the girl could finish her second sentence, the next moment, she saw the exceptionally poised Liu Yutong standing by the bed, and her eyes instantly went wide.","It... it's the big boss!","The girl immediately became extremely nervous, flustered as she greeted: \"B... Boss, hello!\"","By now, almost everyone in the company knew that this young big boss was actually the daughter of a mafia boss.","Liu Yutong's gaze swept over the thermal lunchbox in Zhou Juan'er's hands, then shifted to Zhang Tao, who was clearly avoiding eye contact and looked somewhat embarrassed. She immediately understood.","There's something going on between these two.","Liu Yutong first responded to the girl with a faint acknowledgment, then said to Zhang Tao: \"With someone looking after you, it seems we don't need to worry.\"","Zhang Tao's face instantly flushed red. He coughed awkwardly: \"Miss, this is Zhou Juan'er from the logistics department of our Wanlong Supermarket. She... she's just being kind, came to check on me...\"","Liu Yutong immediately put on an expression that said 'I understand perfectly'.","Zhou Juan'er kept her head down, wishing she could bury her face in the lunchbox, not daring to say a word.","She had liked Zhang Tao for a long time, and quite a few people at the supermarket could tell.","Zhang Tao also had feelings for her, but with his father seriously ill at home and the heavy burden he carried, he never dared to take that step, afraid of dragging down this lovely girl.","However, the moment Zhou Juan'er heard about Zhang Tao's accident, she didn't think twice. She rushed to the hospital immediately, staying by his side without leaving, and had just gone to buy congee from the most highly-recommended porridge place near the hospital.","Liu Yutong nodded, then instructed Zhang Tao: \"Eat well, rest well. I've hired professional caregivers and a cook for your family, so don't worry.\"","\"Thank you, Miss!\" Zhang Tao said gratefully.","Liu Yutong looked over the flustered Zhou Juan'er once more: \"Zhou Juan'er, right? Thank you for your trouble. You are allowed paid leave for this period, just focus on taking good care of Zhang Tao. If the two of you can make it work in the future, I'll gift you a wedding apartment and a car.\"","\"Thank you, boss... It's no trouble, I... I'll take good care of Brother Tao...\"","Zhou Juan'er stammered halfway through before suddenly processing the meaning of Liu Yutong's last sentence. Her mind buzzed and short-circuited completely.","\"Huh?!\"","Zhang Tao's face turned even redder, overwhelmed, not knowing what to say.","A slight smile tugged at the corner of Liu Yutong's mouth. She left with the words: \"Focus on recovering.\" and turned to leave the room.","Before leaving, Yun Cheng also playfully punched Zhang Tao's chest (the uninjured side), making him grimace, and said with a laugh: \"You sly dog, keeping secrets, huh!\"","With that, he also quickened his pace to follow Liu Yutong and left.","Only the two flustered and bewildered young people remained.","After leaving the hospital, Liu Yutong, Yun Cheng, and the others headed directly towards the company.","On the way, she finally received the phone call she had been waiting for most eagerly.","After hanging up,","her eyes turned cold once more as she issued a command.","\"Assemble all members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!\"","\"This time, we will wipe out all enemies standing in our way in one fell swoop!\"","Yun Cheng, usually cold, steady, and rarely showing emotion, now had a fighting spirit ignited in his eyes, becoming excited.","\"Yes, Miss!\""]},{"number":416,"title":"Chapter 416: 416, The Shocking Gathering of Men in Black","paragraphs":["At Liu Yutong's command, the long-placid surface of Bright Pearl City's lake finally began to ripple.","Yun Cheng immediately relayed the order to the high-level core member group chat of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, which was then passed down layer by layer through the management hierarchy.","In an instant, all core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, whether idling at school, working at a supermarket, delivering goods by car, or laboring in a restaurant, dropped whatever they were doing upon receiving the message and hurried towards the Shunchang Building, the society's current headquarters.","Initially.","The streets around Shunchang International remained calm and uneventful.","However, within the next twenty short minutes, the expressions of almost everyone passing by turned to one of shock and awe.","The square in front of the building and the lanes flanking the surrounding streets were now densely packed, as far as the eye could see, with a uniform line of sleek black luxury sedans!","Even the nearby bicycle lanes were filled with a multitude of electric scooters, and taxis kept pulling over, discharging young men and women dressed in black.","This spectacle left onlookers utterly stunned.","Some bold and curious individuals even secretly called their friends to come witness the commotion.","\"Hey, Brother Wang, holy shit! Holy shit, holy shit! I'm... I'm near the Shunchang Building, something huge is happening! The whole street is full of black cars, they're practically overflowing! And there are so many people in black suits, it's like a movie set, they must be filming... anyway, there are so many people, you can't see the end of them! Hurry over, maybe some big celebrity has come to our Bright Pearl City.\"","\".........\"","Of course, sharp-eyed individuals noticed the dragon patterns embroidered on the chests of those in black. Their faces paled, and they hurriedly stopped their companions from taking photos with their low-pixel phones.","\"Are you insane! Don't take pictures! Do you have a death wish?!\"","\"Huh? Why? So many black suits, it's so cool! Just like a movie. I can brag to my friends later about seeing something this grand.\"","\"Cool my ass! Open your damn eyes and look closely! Look at their chests, that's a dragon embroidered there! These are Ten Thousand Dragons Society people!\"","\"Ten Thousand Dragons Society? What's that?\"","\"It's the biggest society around the university district. These are serious, proper gangsters. You dare take their picture? Aren't you afraid they'll drag you off, beat you to a pulp, and throw you in the river to feed the fish?!\"","\"I've heard these guys in black have actually done people in before, you better watch it?!\"","Hearing how terrifying the origins of these black-clad figures were, the person was frightened into quickly putting away his Nokia phone.","\"No pictures, no pictures. Did they see me?\"","\"Probably not. Let's go, let's go. This is no place to linger. Something big is about to happen.\"","\"........\"","For a time, the area around the Shunchang Building became tense and uneasy due to the sudden influx of black-clad figures, with many pedestrians scared into taking detours.","At this moment.","The square in front of the Shunchang Building acted like a giant magnet, continuously drawing streams of black-clad figures converging towards it.","The number of people grew at a visibly frantic rate.","Fifty, eighty, one hundred, two hundred, three hundred...","In the end, nearly five hundred core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society began to line up in sections according to their affiliated halls... departments, each wearing a solemn expression.","Although the notification from above didn't specify the purpose, the young mistress summoning them so urgently surely meant something major was afoot.","Of course, some had guessed from today's events what they might be about to do.","The newer members were fine, but especially the old-timers who had followed since the Misty Waters days felt particularly stirred.","After so long, the young mistress was finally going to lead them in a big move!","Indeed, although the young mistress talked about the Ten Thousand Dragons Society being a legitimate company and obeying the law, deep down she still very much wanted to lead everyone to expand, strengthen, and undertake a major venture.","She hadn't gathered so many people for action before because the timing wasn't ripe.","Now, the moment must have arrived, ripe for sweeping up all the other forces in Bright Pearl City in one fell swoop!","And then... the Ten Thousand Dragons Society would reign supreme!","This gathering of five hundred core members represented an expansion of over two hundred people compared to the annual meeting last year.","Estimating at a ten-to-one ratio, the society's affiliated ordinary employees likely numbered around five thousand.","As this black-clad mass gathered, the entire block seemed enveloped in an intangible, suffocating pressure. Even the originally bright sky appeared tainted by this austere blackness, the light dimming noticeably.","The onlookers who had dared to sneak glances earlier now hardly dared to breathe. Some hadn't gone far, watching from what they deemed safe distances.","A powerful intuition told them that something earth-shattering would happen today!","For now, curiosity had temporarily overcome fear.","Just then, from the lobby of the Shunchang Building's first floor, a girl of stunning beauty emerged.","Her face was youthfully exquisite, bearing the delicate features of a girl. She wore a pure black wool sweater dress, over which was draped an equally black long trench coat, exuding an aura of chilling intensity.","Her pitch-black eyes, especially, were indifferent as ice; no one dared meet her gaze wherever it swept.","As she walked step by step towards the dense crowd of black-clad figures, many witnessed a scene they would never forget.","Swish!","Five hundred figures in the square bowed their heads in perfect unison.","\"Young Mistress!!!\" x500+","Five hundred voices merged into one, like the roar of a colossal dragon—a roar filled with fanaticism, loyalty, absolute obedience, and a resolve to go through fire and water!","The wave of sound rolled out, causing the distant onlookers' legs to go weak, nearly buckling beneath them.","Now, even those who hadn't known what the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was finally understood. This wasn't a movie scene they were watching, but a massive, genuinely terrifying gang... organization!","What shocked them most of all was that all these black-clad gangsters obeyed the commands of that young girl.","It was surreal!","Liu Yutong's gaze swept over the five hundred core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society before her. Her cold, stunning face showed not a ripple of emotion.","A moment later.","She slightly lifted her fair chin, her gaze seeming to pierce through the crowd before her and the layers of buildings behind them, fixing on a certain place in the city.","There lay the enemies she was determined to eliminate.","As Liu Yutong took a few more steps forward.","The evening wind seemed to die completely at that moment.","The operation would begin immediately.","Liu Yutong didn't mince words, uttering only two clear, icy syllables.","\"Move out!\""]},{"number":417,"title":"Chapter 417: 417. Has This Person Been Scared Out of Their Mind","paragraphs":["The commotion caused by the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was so significant that well-informed individuals quickly got wind of it.","This was especially true for Zhao Weixiang, who had been paying close attention to the Ten Thousand Dragons Society and manipulating events from behind the scenes all along.","When Zhao Weixiang heard that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society headquarters had actually gathered countless men in black, he immediately jumped up from his boss chair.","\"Are you sure?\"","\"Boss, it's absolutely true. Many people saw it. The number of people the Ten Thousand Dragons Society gathered is probably no less than five hundred,\" his subordinate confirmed with a nod.","Even though Zhao Weixiang was well aware of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's background, he was still startled by such a large number.","In less than a year, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had built such formidable strength, fully proving that its young mistress, Liu Yutong, was no simple character.","One could say she was the most formidable woman he had ever met, bar none.","It was just a pity that the two of them were destined not to become partners... because there could only be one person truly in control of the underground forces in Bright Pearl City.","And that person was him, Zhao Weixiang!","After repeatedly confirming that Liu Yutong was indeed leading no fewer than five hundred people to raid Zhao Tianxing's turf, Zhao Weixiang couldn't help but burst into hearty laughter.","\"Liu Yutong, oh Liu Yutong, you just couldn't hold back after all.\"","\"With just a minor scheme of mine, I've made you and that old turtle Zhao Tianxing fight each other. Now, let's see how you're going to handle this!\"","Although he was somewhat resentful that Zhao Tianxing's two attempts had failed to eliminate Liu Yutong—he had even cursed Zhao Tianxing as a useless old turtle—the current outcome still served his purpose. Liu Yutong had finally lost her patience and launched a counterattack.","Moreover, this girl had even made such a grand spectacle of it, as if afraid no one would know.","She had clearly forgotten that in this day and age, daring to act so brazenly was practically no different from seeking death.","Hong Jiao, who had been silent, finally spoke.","\"The boss's methods are still superior. Although Zhao Tianxing failed to directly eliminate Liu Yutong, his two failed assassination attempts successfully provoked her. Now, we don't even need to lift a finger to deal with that woman.\"","Zhao Weixiang nodded, a look of smug satisfaction on his face.","\"Liu Yutong is, after all, still young. But I like this kind of young person—full of spirit and prone to impulsiveness.\"","\"What a shame, though. She doesn't understand one principle!\"","\"The underworld nowadays is no longer about having more men and sharper blades to dominate. The current underworld is about connections, relationships, having someone powerful backing you from above! And you have to know when to advance and when to retreat!\"","\"With the commotion she's making, if she actually finishes off Zhao Tianxing, she'll be completely cutting off her own retreat.\"","Hong Jiao deeply agreed: \"The boss is absolutely right. So, do we just watch from the sidelines next?\"","Zhao Weixiang shook his head: \"No, that would mean missing out on a spectacular show!\"","He then picked up his phone, walked to the window, and dialed a number. His tone was extremely polite, lowering his own posture considerably.","After hanging up, he directly instructed Hong Jiao: \"Arrange a few cars immediately. Keep it low-key, but they must be comfortable. We're going to pick up a few distinguished guests to watch the show together.\"","Although Hong Jiao wasn't sure which distinguished guests Zhao Weixiang meant, she immediately turned to make the arrangements.",".......","Meanwhile, at the Tianxing Hotel.","This was one of Zhao Tianxing's core properties. The hotel not only offered regular services, but its upper floors also housed luxurious entertainment clubs, and there was even a relatively discreet casino.","Overall, it was a comprehensive hotel with entertainment services.","In the most luxurious Emperor's Suite on the top floor.","Zhao Tianxing was enjoying a massage from several curvaceous beauties along with a few gang bosses like Liu Songxia.","Of course, while the others were quite engrossed, Zhao Tianxing's face remained gloomy.","That's because the news he received from the hospital was that while his son had regained consciousness, his mind was damaged. Not only did he drool uncontrollably, but he also spent his days giggling foolishly—essentially, he was completely ruined.","Besides that, the assassins he had arranged still hadn't sent back any information. He had no idea what the outcome was.","He could only curse that bitch Liu Yutong to hell in his heart!","Just as Liu Songxia and the other bosses were enjoying their massages while discussing some shady business, the door to the suite was suddenly slammed open with a bang.","A hotel security guard ran in, his face full of panic, shouting as soon as he entered.","\"B-boss! It's bad! Something terrible has happened!\"","The music in the suite came to an abrupt stop.","Everyone's eyes turned in unison to the panicked guard at the door.","Zhao Tianxing was already irritated and angrily scolded, \"What's all the panic?! Has the sky fallen? You ill-mannered dog! Speak, what is it?!\"","The guard, frightened by Zhao Tianxing's roar, stammered:","\"It's... it's the Ten Thousand Dragons Society! People from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society are heading towards our hotel! They'll be at our doorstep any moment!\"","Zhao Tianxing jolted in shock: \"What? The Ten Thousand Dragons Society is here? How many people did you see?!\"","\"I... I don't know how many. There's a dark mass of cars, we couldn't see the end of them. They've probably come out in full force!\"","\"Bang!\"","Upon hearing that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society might have mobilized their entire force, Zhao Tianxing's heart instantly sank. Subconsciously, he slammed his fist hard onto the glass coffee table in front of him.","\"How dare they?! How dare they bring so many people to our door in broad daylight! Have they no regard for the law?!\"","He knew that even at his most ruthless in the past, he wouldn't have dared to seek revenge so openly.","Generally, you'd launch a surprise attack on an enemy in the dead of night with your men.","Because there were fewer people at night, it was easier to escape, and even if caught, you could find a few loyal brothers to take the fall.","Daring to come knocking in broad daylight—if the cops got wind of it, it would be sheer suicide, the impact would be far too severe!","Although it was already evening, it still counted as daytime.","The other gang bosses, hearing this news, couldn't stay seated either, panicking uncontrollably.","\"Brother Zhao, what do we do now? The Ten Thousand Dragons Society has brought so many people. Can we hold them off?\"","\"Hold them off? With what? I only brought four guys with me today! Where are your men, Lao Zhao?!\"","\"I didn't bring many brothers either. We need to call for reinforcements now!\"","\"Call for reinforcements? They're almost at the door, is there even time?\"","\"Boss Zhao, does this hotel have a back door? Or maybe a secret tunnel?\"","\"We're done for, we're done for... we're probably going to get wiped out here this time...\"","\"Damn it, has that little bitch Liu Yutong gone mad? Doesn't she see what place this is, what era this is? Still playing those gangster games!\"","\"............\"","Liu Songxia was relatively calm because he had already secretly pledged allegiance to the Righteous Union Society, but he still had to put on an act.","\"Brother Zhao, can you have all your security guards and the brothers watching the place grab their weapons and block the elevator and stairwell entrances? Buy us some time, even if it's just a little. We'll retreat first. As long as we're safe, we can rebuild. Once we gather our brothers, we'll wipe out the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!\"","\"Right! If all else fails, we can even call the police!\"","\"This will work, this will work! That Liu Yutong woman will be in way over her head!\"","Just as everyone was chattering about how to make their escape.","Suddenly.","\"Ha ha ha ha...\"","A burst of abrupt laughter rang out, and the crowd quieted down once more.","Then, they looked with stunned expressions at Zhao Tianxing, who had been furious just moments before. How could this guy still be in the mood to laugh at a time like this?","\"Brother Zhao? Are you alright?\" someone asked with concern.","\"Ha ha ha... I'm fine, I'm fine! I'm perfectly fine!\"","Zhao Tianxing laughed until tears nearly streamed from his eyes. \"I understand now! I finally understand!\"","\"Understand what?!\" The others were still completely baffled.","Zhao Tianxing declared with absolute certainty, \"I know that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society is nothing but a clown now, a grasshopper after autumn—they won't be able to hop around for much longer!\"","Everyone: \"???\"","This guy must have been scared out of his mind, talking such nonsense."]},{"number":418,"title":"Chapter 418: 418. Zhao Tianxing's Trump Card.","paragraphs":["\"The Ten Thousand Dragons Society dares to gather so many people in broad daylight on my turf; they must be desperate!\"","\"To be frank with you all, I sent assassins to kill Liu Yutong today. They should have succeeded in taking her out. That's why her underlings are all charging over here like rabid dogs!\"","Zhao Tianxing hadn't told them about arranging the assassins this time; he had done it secretly.","After the last information leak, he weeded out some of the fence-sitters, and those fence-sitters had been quietly dealt with by his men on the road.","Although the few gang bosses present now were relatively reliable, he still didn't fully trust them and had kept them in the dark about this.","So, he told no one about today's assassination attempt.","He was afraid of another leak, a repeat of the first time when they fell into Liu Yutong's trap and she caught them red-handed.","When Liu Songxia suddenly heard Zhao Tianxing say Liu Yutong might already be gone, he jolted with shock.","\"Brother Zhao, are you serious? Is Liu Yutong really dead?\"","Zhao Tianxing nodded with absolute certainty.","\"Think about it. If she were safe and sound, would someone of her temperament impulsively bring everyone here to attack us? Obviously not!\"","\"If that were the case, she would have brought people to fight last time, not waited until now.\"","\"So, there's only one possibility: she herself is really in trouble, either critically injured and dying, or... already taken out by the men I arranged! The one leading the charge now is probably that guy named Yun Cheng. He's avenging his boss, which is why he's throwing everything he has into this reckless assault!\"","\"Regardless, I'm now almost certain that woman is finished! Hahaha...\"","The other bosses in the private room were momentarily stunned by Zhao Tianxing's sudden good news, then overjoyed.","\"Really? Liu Yutong was really taken out?!\"","\"Brother Zhao, you're amazing! I was wondering why the Ten Thousand Dragons Society suddenly went crazy.\"","\"Haha, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society is digging its own grave! Perfect, let's wipe them all out in one go this time!\"","\"..........\"","Seeing everyone so excited, Liu Songxia offered a hollow, congratulatory smile, but his heart sank.","Liu Yutong... dead?","Then what should he do?","Should he fully oppose the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, or play the fence-sitter again?","Just then, Zhao Tianxing, seeming to notice his preoccupation, walked over to him.","\"Brother Liu, what's wrong? What are you thinking about? You seem uneasy.\"","Zhao Tianxing still had some goodwill towards Liu Songxia. After all, this guy was the first to stand by his side back then. Compared to the other bosses, he trusted him more.","Liu Songxia's mind raced, and he quickly found an excuse: \"Brother Zhao, I'm worried about the Ten Thousand Dragons Society crowd. Even if Liu Yutong is dead, they're bloodlust-crazed and will definitely fight us to the death. What if we can't hold off those maniacs? Wouldn't we be doomed?\"","\"Is that what you're worried about? Don't be.\"","Zhao Tianxing patted his shoulder. \"Brother Liu, you were the first to stand up and support me back then. I've always remembered that. I promise you, we definitely won't come to harm. None of you need to worry.\"","\"They're just relying on numbers, right? I have a way to handle it.\"","Hearing this, although Liu Songxia was curious about what trump card Zhao Tianxing had to stop the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, he held back from asking more.","Loose lips sink ships.","He then pretended to relax. \"With your word, Brother Zhao, I feel much more at ease!\"","The others also flattered Zhao Tianxing a bit.","Perhaps because he felt 'vengeance was served,' Zhao Tianxing was in an excellent mood and greatly enjoyed the flattery from Liu Songxia and the others.","He then became even more brazen.","\"Gentlemen! Liu Yutong is dead! The Ten Thousand Dragons Society is just a tiger with its teeth pulled! If they dare come, they're walking into a trap! Perfect. Today, we'll use their blood to completely wash away the disgrace they brought upon us! And show everyone else in Bright Pearl City what happens to those who oppose Zhao Tianxing!\"","He turned and shouted to his subordinate, \"Pass the order! Tell all our brothers to hold the line! Tell them the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's young mistress is dead! The ones coming now are just a bunch of mindless mad dogs! Fight them hard! I'll reward a thousand for every one taken down!\"","\"Yes, boss!\" The subordinate immediately went to relay the order.","Watching Zhao Tianxing happily clink glasses with the other bosses and discuss how to divide the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's assets after their defeat, Liu Songxia's heart remained unsettled.","Liu Yutong... are you really dead or not?","If you're not dead... this old fool Zhao Tianxing is going to die very ugly today!","But what if... she really is gone?","Just then, another subordinate rushed in, flustered, to report.","\"Boss! There are too many Ten Thousand Dragons Society people! They've broken right in! Their young mistress... has already led her people in and is fighting her way up!\"","\"Hahaha... hic!\"","Zhao Tianxing's laughter cut off abruptly. \"What did you say?!\"","\"Liu Yutong isn't dead? And she's leading them personally?!\"","The triumphant smiles on the faces of the bosses who were just toasting instantly froze, as if they'd been doused with ice water.","\"What? Liu Yutong isn't dead?!\"","\"How is that possible! Brother Zhao, didn't you say she was definitely gone?!\"","\"We're done for, done for, done for! She's here personally, leading the charge herself! We're dead! Zhao Tianxing! Didn't you fucking say she was dead? You lied to us?!\"","\"My men also said they just saw downstairs... it's full of their people... we're surrounded... we're trapped!\"","\"Brother Zhao, what do we do?!\"","Although Zhao Tianxing was furious at these guys' cowardice—they were supposed to be bosses themselves, how could they all turn so spineless at the critical moment? Where was the guts they had when they were mixing in the underworld? Where did it all go?!","\"Stop panicking! I'm here!\"","\"So what if Liu Yutong isn't dead? So what if she's here? If she dares step through that door, I'll make sure she stays here for good today!\"","After saying that, he walked straight to the sofa on the south side.","Liu Songxia, who had been pondering what confidence Zhao Tianxing had to block the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, seemed to guess something from his actions.","Sure enough.","Zhao Tianxing actually pulled out two handguns from a hidden compartment under the sofa.","And while Liu Songxia was still stunned, he directly tossed one of the guns to him.","\"Brother Liu, take this gun. If they dare barge in, don't be polite, just shoot them. There aren't many bullets in the magazine, but it should be enough.\"","He said this entirely out of confidence in firearms. No matter how many people come, as long as one side has guns, the other side normally wouldn't dare act recklessly.","Liu Songxia: \"...\"","\"Damn it, are you sure you're not setting me up?\" he cursed inwardly.","If guns are used, the nature of this escalates again.","Dragon Country has extremely strict gun control. Any case involving firearms is a major crime that the police take very seriously and will investigate thoroughly to the end.","Most crucially, now that Liu Yutong isn't dead and has personally led the charge to their doorstep, he didn't need to follow Zhao Tianxing down this dark path anymore.","Soon, Liu Songxia made his choice!","He secretly unloaded the bullets from his pistol's magazine, tucked them into his pocket, and then seized an opportunity to approach, offering to swap guns.","His reason was that he had heard revolvers never jam, and he really wanted to try one. He added that as soon as Zhao Tianxing gave the signal, he would be the first to fire.","Little did he know, this was exactly what Zhao Tianxing most wanted to hear. Zhao Tianxing had already intended for Liu Songxia to shoot first; that way, if Liu Yutong and the others were really killed, he could pin the blame on this guy.","Although among the bosses in the private room, he trusted Liu Songxia the most, it was precisely because of that trust that he chose to give him one of the guns.","In the end, Zhao Tianxing traded his revolver for Liu Songxia's pistol.","Just as Zhao Tianxing was about to eject the magazine to check it, another underling rushed in, flustered, to report.","\"Boss, our guys couldn't hold them off. They were taken out the moment they reached the downstairs!\"","Distracted by the underling's report, Zhao Tianxing seemed to forget something. He casually stuffed the pistol into his jacket and immediately ordered a full-force, last-ditch defense, retreating to the top floor if they couldn't hold.","Liu Songxia's heart had nearly leaped out of his throat. Thankfully, Zhao Tianxing ultimately didn't open the magazine to check, or he would have been in trouble.","Listening to the constant stream of bad news over the walkie-talkie, he suddenly remembered the message of allegiance he had sent out earlier.","My name is Liu Songxia. I have heard of the young lady's magnanimity. Seeking a position, I wish to abandon the light for the dark!"]},{"number":419,"title":"Chapter 419: 419, Counter-Terrorism Exercise","paragraphs":["Outside the Tianxing Hotel.","A dense swarm of black cars, like a dark tide, completely surrounded the hotel entrance, leaving no room to pass.","The guests who had originally come to spend money were all terrified by this spectacle.","\"Holy crap! What's going on here?\"","\"No idea. Look at these guys in black, they look murderous. Probably here for revenge?\"","\"Who are these people?\"","\"It's the Ten Thousand Dragons Society! I heard they have a grudge against the East Sea Alliance behind this hotel. Coming straight to the East Sea Alliance's headquarters like this, they probably want to wipe them out in one go.\"","\"Damn... That ruthless?\"","\".........\"","Otherwise, there was simply no explanation for why this group of men in black would go to such lengths to press down on this place.","As soon as the hotel manager saw the dark mass of figures outside, he rushed to the lobby in a frantic hurry.","At that moment, Ma Da was directing his men to block all exits to prevent Zhao Tianxing and his crew from escaping in the chaos.","\"Team One, guard the back door. Teams Two and Three, secure the elevators, stairs, and fire escapes. Team Four, go guard the electrical room. Don't let anyone cut the power and escape in the darkness. The rest of you, search floor by floor! Move it, be quick!\"","\".........\"","As soon as Ma Da and his men finished their arrangements, the men in black immediately sprang into action according to instructions.","Seeing this, the manager couldn't stand by any longer. If he let them continue causing trouble, there'd be no business left to do, and the boss would surely skin him alive.","Although the manager was very afraid of these aggressive men in black, the thought that his boss was, after all, the head of the East Sea Alliance, and this was their turf, gave him some courage.","A powerful dragon shouldn't crush a local snake; a real fight would be bad for everyone.","With this confidence and what he believed to be the imposing aura of the local snake, the manager hurried over to Ma Da and the others.","\"Gentlemen, welcome to the Tianxing Hotel! I'm not sure what has prompted such a grand mobilization. Was there some aspect of our service that was lacking? We can talk things over. With this kind of display, you'll scare the guests, and even if you don't scare the guests, scaring the flowers and grass isn't good either...\"","Before he could finish, Ma Da, without even looking at him, delivered a clean, sharp, and powerful backhand slap!","Slap!","The manager was sent spinning ninety degrees to look at the ceiling, stunned.","\"All that yapping, like a damn fly. Take him away and deal with him on the spot!\"","\"Yes, Brother Ma!\" Immediately, two younger men in black walked over with wicked smiles.","When the manager snapped out of his daze, he quickly backed away a few steps, spouting threats.","\"Hey! You dare touch me? Let go! Do you know who I am? I'm the manager of Tianxing Hotel, I'm with Boss Zhao, Zhao Tianxing of the East Sea Alliance!\"","\"Don't get too cocky! This is East Sea Alliance territory! Boss Zhao is upstairs, he... he won't let you get away with this!\"","Hmm? An unexpected bonus?","Ma Da immediately raised his hand to stop them. \"Wait, you said Zhao Tianxing is upstairs? Which floor?\"","The manager threatened again, \"Let me go now, kneel and apologize, and there might still be time. I might even put in a good word for you with Boss Zhao! Otherwise, when Boss Zhao comes down, you... none of you will get away...\"","\"Ow... ow! Easy, big brother! Dear brother! I was wrong, I was wrong! I was a bit too loud just now, I'm really sorry! Ow, ow...\"","Two Ten Thousand Dragons Society underlings expertly slipped an 'Anti-Beatup Non-Injury Vest' on him. After just one punch, the previously tough-talking manager instantly turned cowardly as a dog, crying and begging for mercy.","\"Talk. Where is Zhao Tianxing?\"","\"The top floor. The Imperial Suite on the top floor.\"","Just as Ma Da was about to order an assault on the top floor, a ding sounded.","The elevator doors on the first floor opened simultaneously, and dozens of thugs wielding clubs and machetes poured out—East Sea Alliance members stationed at the hotel for security.","\"Damn, which blind fool dares to cause trouble on East Sea Alliance turf... Holy shit?! So many people?!\"","When those thugs saw the lobby nearly filled with a dark mass of... not clouds, but men in black, their eyes nearly popped out.","Immediately after, some of their walkie-talkies crackled to life.","\"The boss says, take down one troublemaker, get a thousand! No upper limit!\"","\"If you get hurt by accident, he'll take care of your wife and family.\"","The thugs thought to themselves: Such a good deal? So no worries then?","The thugs glanced at each other, thinking that with the boss backing them, they let out a roar and charged.","\"Kill them!\"","Unfortunately, their bravado seemed utterly laughable in the face of the silent black tide opposite them.","Ma Da couldn't even be bothered to move, taking only a half-step back. Li Xiaohui, who had been waiting eagerly at his side, immediately pulled out a megaphone and shouted.","\"Beat them to death for your grandma!\"","At the command, the dozen or so elite Ten Thousand Dragons Society members at the front moved simultaneously.","Swish!","Over a dozen reinforced telescopic batons snapped out in unison.","In the next second, these men in black, as if by tacit understanding, quickly formed into attack formations and met the charging thugs head-on.","Then, screams began to ring out continuously.","The fighting style of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society guys completely overturned the East Sea Alliance thugs' understanding. If they had time, they'd probably want to give a thumbs up and shout: \"Bro, professional!\"","The men in black operated in groups of three: one blocking, one on main attack, one finishing the job. Their movements were fluid, without a single wasted motion.","The thugs' street-style wild swinging was utterly no match against this efficient attack formation.","Almost immediately upon contact, the first dozen or so thugs were all rolling on the ground, howling in pain.","Those behind hadn't even grasped the situation before they were tripped by their fallen comrades, then precisely targeted by batons, instantly losing their ability to fight.","One minute? Maybe less.","Only groaning thugs, unable to even crawl, and weapons scattered all over the floor remained in the center of the lobby.","The vast majority of the men in black hadn't even moved. With just over a dozen men deployed, those several dozen East Sea Alliance thugs were all down.","A complete crushing defeat!","On the Ten Thousand Dragons Society side, those who had acted silently returned to their ranks as if nothing had happened.","Only a few had some blood on their batons. They casually wiped them on the clothes of the thugs on the ground before returning to formation, their practiced movements sending chills down the spine.","The entire lobby fell into an eerie silence once more.","The hotel staff and guests who hadn't managed to escape, cowering in the corners, saw this scene and were scared to tears.","This is just too damn terrifying!","Since when did such a terrifying force appear in Bright Pearl City?","Ma Da stepped expressionlessly over a twitching thug on the ground as if stepping over a bag of trash, then said to the men behind him, \"Go inform the young lady. First-floor obstacles cleared. Target is the Imperial Suite on the top floor.\"","\"Understood!\" A man in black immediately went outside to deliver the message.","Liu Yutong was sitting in the car parked right outside the hotel's main entrance, talking on the phone, a faint smile still on her face, as if completely unaware of the commotion inside the lobby.","\"President Ji, you said someone has already arranged things for you? Alright then, we'll talk more later. I happen to have a small matter to attend to myself.\"","After hanging up the phone, she finally got out of the car.","At the same time.","In another luxurious private room on the top floor of the Tianxing Hotel.","The investors Ji Zhe and Chu Hai, along with three other investors they had invited to participate in the Series A financing talks for Wanlong Group Purchase, were dining and chatting with a local boss surnamed Zhao in a white suit, Deputy Commissioner Liu of the Bright Pearl City General Police Headquarters, and a leader from the investment promotion department.","With so many well-known investors arriving, it was normal for the investment promotion official to come and receive them. If any investment could be secured, it would be solid political achievement.","Overall, the conversation between the investors, the two officials, and the host, Boss Zhao, was quite pleasant.","To boost the investors' confidence, the official in charge of investment promotion specifically pointed to Deputy Commissioner Liu beside him and said, \"Rest assured, gentlemen. Public security in our Bright Pearl City is under Commissioner Liu's direct supervision, and it is managed extremely well. Your funds invested here will be as safe as in a vault, absolutely no problem...\"","Before he could finish his sentence.","Suddenly!","Crash! Bang! Clatter!","Heart-wrenching screams and cries for help erupted from the corridor outside.","\"Ah—!\"","\"Stop hitting! Oww!\"","\"......\"","The several investors: \".......\"","The two officials: \".......\"","After a long pause.","The investment promotion official looked at Deputy Commissioner Liu in confusion: \"Commissioner Liu, is this... an anti-terror drill organized by the police department? I must say, it sounds quite realistic.\"","..........."]},{"number":420,"title":"Chapter 420: 420. The sky over Mingzhu City is finally about to brighten.","paragraphs":["Suddenly hearing the inquiry from the leadership of the investment promotion department, Deputy Chief Liu was momentarily at a loss for words, unsure how to respond.","He very much wanted to say he didn't know either, but he didn't know how to put it.","\"Uh... well... maybe... let me make a call...\"","Before he could even call to ask if some anti-terror drill was happening here, an investor spoke up with a laugh.","\"Leaders, I must say, I didn't expect the drills in Bright Pearl City to be so realistic. Even though we haven't stepped outside, just hearing those sounds tells us the extras are incredibly dedicated, screaming as if it were real. I'm now completely convinced that Bright Pearl City is putting in real effort to maintain public order!\"","Upon hearing this, the others all wore expressions of sudden understanding and immediately began exchanging compliments.","\"Yes, yes, Deputy Chief Liu has really gone to great pains. The effect of this drill is simply too authentic.\"","\"Just listening to those agonized cries makes one feel immersed, full of that artistic tension. The actors' emotions are also very intense, definitely following the method acting approach.\"","\"With this level of actor dedication, you probably couldn't hire actors like this for less than two hundred a day, right?\"","\"Honestly, I'm getting curious. I'd like to go take a look outside.\"","\"I'd like to see too.\"","\"Let's go, together.\"","As they spoke, the three investors who were visiting Bright Pearl City for the first time stood up, all wanting to see with their own eyes what kind of drill could be this realistic.","Zhao Weixiang, who was in the know, watched all this but did not stop them, thinking to himself that his plan was succeeding.","His reason for choosing the Tianxing Hotel as the meeting place today was precisely to \"kill with a borrowed knife\"—to let the leaders and these investors personally witness just how arrogant the Ten Thousand Dragons Society truly was.","When those investors saw that what was outside wasn't a drill but a real gang fight, they would surely be scared into immediately packing up and leaving. The leaders would definitely be furious.","By then, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society would be in serious trouble.","Even if that police chief of the Lijin District, Qi Wei, had a close relationship with Liu Yutong, he might not be able to protect her, right?","It was precisely because Zhao Weixiang knew that Liu Yutong's biggest backer was Qi Wei, the police chief of Lijin District, that he had used his connections with the investment promotion department leadership. Seizing the opportunity of having well-known investors visit Bright Pearl City, he had also invited Deputy Chief Liu.","Matters concerning investment promotion were significant, so the investment promotion leader had no reason to refuse and readily agreed.","Moreover, these investors were indeed prominent figures, with capital behind them ranging from tens of billions to even hundreds of billions, making them worthy of attention.","The investment promotion leader even felt quite grateful to Zhao Weixiang, this small business owner he had only met a few times at investment conferences, never suspecting he was being used as a pawn.","Those investors weren't very familiar with Zhao Weixiang either.","Originally, upon arriving in Bright Pearl City, they had planned to stay at the Lakeside Hotel. However, they were intercepted en route by people sent by Zhao Weixiang. Using the pretext that local leaders wanted to personally host them, they were invited here instead.","Hearing it was an invitation from local leaders, the investors naturally did not decline.","And so, Zhao Weixiang set the stage, waiting for Liu Yutong to come knocking, provoke the leaders, hand over leverage, and then be rounded up in one fell swoop.","This also showed how cunning Zhao Weixiang's methods were—using others' strength to fight his battles, hiding himself behind the scenes, needing only a gentle push to make the big shots follow his script.","\"You flatter us, gentlemen. Our public security work in Bright Pearl City has indeed always been solid,\" Deputy Chief Liu said, forcing himself to respond, while inwardly praying that what was outside was really just a drill and would end quickly.","Hearing Deputy Chief Liu say this, the investment promotion leader laughed heartily: \"This is a rare opportunity. Let's all go outside together and see Deputy Chief Liu's public security achievements... hahaha...\"","Deputy Chief Liu: \"...\"","He really wanted to say to his colleague: Please, I beg you, stop talking!","The three investors, not overthinking it, walked towards the door with smiles on their faces.","Only Ji Zhe and Chu Hai remained seated. They exchanged a glance, both seeing doubt and surprise on each other's faces.","Was this really a drill?","Was public security in Bright Pearl City really that good? Then what was it they witnessed last time?","The figure of a girl involuntarily surfaced in their minds; they couldn't shake the feeling that the commotion outside was connected to her.","Especially when they suddenly remembered that Zhao Junjie, who had hosted them last time, seemed to have this hotel as one of his family's businesses?","And Zhao Junjie had a grudge with that girl.","Just as the investors reached the door and were about to open it...","Suddenly!","With a loud BANG!","The wooden door of the private room swung violently inward. A thug flew in backwards, knocking down an investor who failed to dodge in time.","Immediately after, a very arrogant female voice came from outside the door.","\"This lady will kill anyone who stands in her way, even Buddha if he blocks me, hoo-hoo-hoo...\"","\"Huh? Seems like some fool just flew into someone else's private room. Drag him out for me and execute him on the spot ten times over!\"","As soon as the words fell,","Two black-clad Ten Thousand Dragons Society members appeared expressionlessly at the private room entrance. Each grabbing a foot, they swiftly dragged away the 'extra' on the floor, even politely closing the door on their way out.","Everyone in the private room: \"...\"","They had also caught a glimpse of the scene outside during that brief moment the door was open. The corridor was littered with groaning thugs, and a group of fierce-looking men in black passed by the door, dragging people away from the floor...","What the hell, this was no drill anymore! This was clearly a gang fight!","And it was happening right in front of the Deputy Chief in charge of public security!","A long, dead silence fell over the private room.","Apart from the unlucky fellow who got knocked down, everyone else's eyes were wide open, wondering if they were hallucinating.","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai looked at each other, thinking: Seriously, Miss Liu, can't you just keep it down for once?","If they hadn't been treated leniently during their last visit to Bright Pearl City, they'd probably want to pack up and run too by now.","The investment promotion leader looked at Deputy Chief Liu, whose face had turned ashen, and asked with a last shred of hope: \"Deputy Chief Liu, is... is this also part of the drill? Quite realistic, the actors are really going all out, huh? Especially the flying entrance pose, really impactful... ha... haha...\"","Deputy Chief Liu: \"...\"","\"Please, stop talking!\"","He wished he could find a hole to crawl into right now. This was a blatant slap in the face.","Then he took a deep breath, apologized to the investors, and promised he would give them an explanation.","He immediately followed up by calling to dispatch police forces.","Right after Deputy Chief Liu hung up, Zhao Weixiang, who had been keeping a low profile pouring drinks and speaking little, felt the timing was perfect and began his final, finishing blow.","\"Deputy Chief Liu, Leader, and all you distinguished guests, you've all seen it with your own eyes now, haven't you?\"","\"This Ten Thousand Dragons Society, and that society's young mistress, Liu Yutong—these people are simply a tumor, a scourge on our Bright Pearl City!\"","\".......\"","\"Ruthless plundering, lawless tyranny... they'd even force a boar to climb a tree...\"","\"..........\"","With his masterful acting skills, Zhao Weixiang painted Liu Yutong and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society as utterly wicked, heinous bandits despised by both man and god.","Hearing this, everyone in the private room wore expressions of righteous indignation, unanimously voicing the need for severe punishment.","The investment official finally lost his composure, his face turning ashen. He looked at Deputy Chief Liu and said, \"Chief Liu, public order falls under your primary jurisdiction. I'd like to hear your opinion.\"","Deputy Chief Liu promptly declared, \"This time, I will definitely round up this Ten Thousand Dragons Society in one sweep and give everyone a proper account!\"","Upon hearing Deputy Chief Liu's words, Zhao Weixiang immediately put on a profoundly grateful expression, as if moved to tears: \"With your assurance, Chief Liu, law-abiding businessmen like us can finally rest easy. The skies over Bright Pearl City are about to clear at last!\""]},{"number":421,"title":"Chapter 421: 421. Disclaimer Agreement","paragraphs":["The events unfolding at Tianxing Hotel quickly reached the ears of higher-level officials.","Even Teacher Gao, who was both Qi Wei's mentor and the number one leader of Bright Pearl City, learned of the news.","\"This is outrageous, absolutely outrageous!\"","\"Do they have any respect for the law? For discipline at all?\"","Upon hearing his secretary's report that the Wanlong Society had now gathered hundreds of people to surround a hotel in the city, and especially knowing that girl Li Xiaohui was mixed up in it, Teacher Gao flew into a rage.","He had always turned a blind eye to their previous minor scuffles.","Of course, his student Qi Wei had explained to him that while Li Xiaohui might stir up trouble, she hadn't broken any laws and had actually accomplished quite a few meritorious deeds.","Coupled with his knowledge that the Wanlong Society's background was relatively clean, not involved in any illegal businesses, he had allowed Li Xiaohui to operate within the society.","But such a huge commotion today? How could this possibly end well?","If Li Xiaohui's father found out, not only would Li Xiaohui face criticism, but he himself would probably get an earful in private.","Teacher Gao initially wanted to have his secretary call Qi Wei to ask him just what the hell was going on with maintaining order, and if he didn't want his job anymore.","But just as the secretary finished dialing, he reached out and took the phone himself.","The phone rang several times, but no one answered.","The second call, still no answer.","The third...","...","On the other side.","In Qi Wei's office.","\"Team Leader Zheng, Director Qi, Ms. Liu Yutong has made significant progress and now hopes to immediately confirm the specific terms of the informant agreement with both of you.\"","\"Ms. Liu Yutong has already signed the agreement. All that's missing are your signatures.\"","Both Qi Wei and Team Leader Zheng were stunned. It was the first time they'd heard of an informant needing to sign an agreement, their brains nearly short-circuiting.","\"An informant agreement? Wait, what does Liu Yutong mean by this? Does she not trust us?\"","Zhao Tianyi hurriedly explained, \"It's absolutely not a matter of distrust. It's just that my client, Ms. Liu Yutong, has a special status and is undertaking significant risks by assisting the police this time. Therefore, signing an agreement that grants her immunity for any 'necessary measures' she might take during the operation is a form of protection—for her, and for your subsequent handling of the case. It avoids unnecessary... well, disputes.\"","As he spoke, he subtly pushed the thick agreement in his hand forward a bit more and placed a pen right beside Qi Wei's hand.","Qi Wei and Zheng Yi, who had just arrived, looked at the incredibly detailed informant cooperation agreement before them, the corners of their mouths twitching slightly.","This was no ordinary agreement; it was clearly a preemptive liability waiver. It even listed up to nearly a hundred possible contingencies and their corresponding liability divisions, drafted with such meticulousness it was almost terrifying, leaving hardly any loopholes.","This wasn't Qi Wei's first time working with Liu Yutong, so he was somewhat accustomed to her way of doing things and could grudgingly accept it.","Zheng Yi, however, was completely different. He felt as if he were being held hostage.","After all his years as head of the prosecution department, this was the first time he'd encountered someone who operated like this... so... indescribable.","If it weren't for Qi Wei insisting on recommending her as the informant, he probably would have wanted to tear the agreement up.","Just as Zheng Yi was about to ask something...","Ring ring ring.......","The office landline suddenly rang.","Qi Wei instinctively reached to answer it.","While saying, \"Let me get that, you two review the agreement first,\" Zhao Tianyi reached out, picked up the phone, and handed it to Qi Wei. At the same time, his other hand found the phone cord and gave it a gentle pull.","He clearly remembered his boss's instructions: before the agreement is signed, anything could happen. Stall for time if possible.","He guessed this call was likely related to what his boss was doing, hence this rather drastic measure.","Qi Wei took the receiver, only to hear a dial tone.","\"Strange, no sound? Wrong number?\" He didn't think much of it and casually placed the receiver back.","Seizing the opportunity, Zhao Tianyi continued, \"Director Qi, Team Leader Zheng, I completely understand your concerns. This agreement does indeed seem somewhat... unique. But that precisely reflects Ms. Liu Yutong's sincerity regarding this cooperation and her trust in you both as leaders.\"","\"And this is called trust?\" Zheng Yi pointed at the densely packed liability waiver clauses on the agreement, clearly displeased.","\"Precisely because of trust, the details need to be clarified upfront. After all, Ms. Liu Yutong could have chosen not to participate at all. What benefit does she get from being involved? None, right?\"","\"Even ordinary people write I.O.U.s when borrowing money, let alone Ms. Liu, who is now staking her entire fortune and life, mobilizing all her resources to assist you two in solving this case. What's the ultimate goal? Isn't it to root out the malignant elements in Bright Pearl City and restore peace and order to the city!\"","\"Ms. Liu Yutong is giving so much without asking for anything in return. What a noble character she has. She merely wants a guarantee. Is that really too much to ask?\"","\"Is it?\"","Both Zheng Yi and Qi Wei felt somewhat ashamed by Zhao Tianyi's words. After all, hearing him put it that way, it did make sense.","This Liu Yutong not only wasn't asking for a single cent of funding from them but was also digging into her own pockets, providing manpower at her own expense to help them investigate and solve the case. After contributing so much, what's wrong with wanting a guarantee?","If they didn't agree, wouldn't they be breaking her heart?","In the end, both men signed their names on the liability waiver agreement.","The pens had just been set down.","Ring ring ring, the phone rang again.","This time, Zhao Tianyi didn't reach for it. Instead, he proactively bid them farewell and took his leave.","Qi Wei nodded. After Zhao Tianyi left, he grabbed the receiver. \"Hello? Who is this?\"","\"Qi Wei!!!\"","\"T-teacher?\"","\"So you still remember I'm your teacher? How many calls have I made? Your wings have grown strong, Qi Wei, you dare not answer my calls now? Do you think the sky over the Lijin District is too small to contain a big Buddha like you?!\"","\"No, Teacher, please let me explain, just now I was...\"","\"Explain? What is there to explain! I'm asking you, what are you doing right now? What's going on at Tianxing Hotel? I heard the Wanlong Society has hundreds of people surrounding the hotel, they've even stormed inside. I also heard that girl Xiaohui is leading the charge inside! The scene is practically like something out of a gangster movie!\"","\"Ah? Re... really?\"","\"What do you think! And what did you tell me before? You said that kid Li Xiaohui knew her limits, that the Wanlong Society operated with principles. Is this what you call limits and principles? To actually cause such a huge mess? You go now! Immediately! Go and fix this! Or I'll hold you personally responsible!\"","\"Yes... yes... Teacher, I... I'll go right away!\"","After hanging up, Qi Wei's face turned ashen.","Then he thought of something, quickly turned, and leaned out the window to look down. He happened to see that 'sanctimonious' fellow Zhao Tianyi also looking up at him.","Before Qi Wei could even shout for him, the guy turned and bolted.","His speed would have earned a thumbs-up from an Olympic sprint champion.","Qi Wei: \"...\"","\"Liu Yutong... you've really set me up this time!\""]},{"number":422,"title":"Chapter 422: 422, The Great Mop-up","paragraphs":["Outside.","\"Damn, how long has it been? Why haven't the police shown up yet?\"","\"Are the cops all on holiday today or something?\"","\"No way, the boys in blue are basically working year-round, holidays? I bet those guys in black suits called ahead and sorted it out.\"","\"Yeah, otherwise with a commotion this big, how could the police just ignore it? They must have been paid off.\"","\"Tsk tsk... the East Sea Alliance is in for a rough time.\"","\"Honestly, in all my years, this is the first time I've seen a brawl with so many people. There must be at least several hundred, right?\"","\"Same here. I doubt you could find another group in all of Bright Pearl City that could muster this many people.\"","\"I heard these guys in black are from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. They basically run the show in the university district and even Brocade District, with connections on both sides of the law!\"","\"That's true. My cousin goes to university over there. He says anyone who doesn't listen to the Ten Thousand Dragons Society gets thrown off a building. Didn't someone from the Yanwang Internet Cafe cross them recently, and then they just... vanished? Too brutal.\"","A guy on the sidewalk, sipping bubble tea, slurped up a pearl and chimed in with great seriousness.","\"I know about that too. It's not just throwing people off buildings. My second uncle's neighbor's brother-in-law's sister-in-law's cousin's classmate works over there. He says the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members don't even walk normally.\"","\"They don't walk? How do they get around then? Fly?\"","\"Tsk, pretty much. They move around on patches of black clouds, like right now. Wherever they go, nothing's left standing. It's savage!\"","\"Holy crap! They really are... gangsters. Too ruthless. With these guys around, will there be any light left in our Bright Pearl City?\"","A bespectacled student girl timidly interjected.","\"What you're saying isn't right, I think... I saw some Ten Thousand Dragons Society people eating skewers at the backstreet of the university district last week. They seemed pretty friendly, even asked the vendor for extra chili powder...\"","\"Young lady, you don't get it, do you? Bad guys don't wear a sign saying 'bad'. They act nice on the surface to lull you into a false sense of security. The moment you let your guard down, bang—you're dangling off the rooftop!\"","The student girl: \"...\"","\"That's... that's too scary!\"","Then, someone suddenly lowered their voice. \"I heard their boss, Liu Yutong... isn't actually human!\"","Everyone: \"???\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"I think that woman is the reincarnation of an ancient evil dragon. Human by day, her eyes glow at night, and she can eat three cows in one meal. That's how she can lead the Ten Thousand Dragons Society—that's where the name 'Ten Thousand Dragons' comes from!\"","Just as the talk was getting more and more outrageous, the black-suited men parked at the hotel entrance suddenly moved.","One of them, a coldly handsome man, stepped forward and respectfully opened the door of a Maybach.","Immediately after, a tall, stunning figure bent down and stepped out of the car.","When her form was fully revealed to the onlookers, all the rubberneckers watching from a distance and the small-time hoodlums closely following the situation collectively gasped. Only one thought remained in their minds.","Could a human being really look like this?","She was even more dazzlingly beautiful than a movie star, her aura utterly overwhelming.","She wore a long black coat over a matching high-neck sweater, with black high-heeled boots completing the look, the outfit accentuating her extremely slender figure.","Her jet-black, smooth hair cascaded freely down her back, the color pure as ink. Her face, in particular, was breathtakingly beautiful with an aggressive edge—sharp eyebrows, deep-set eyes, a high-bridged nose, and full red lips pressed into a faint, cold line.","Her expression was neutral, her gaze utterly calm. After getting out of the car, she merely swept her eyes casually around before looking away.","But that one glance made everyone who met it instinctively hold their breath.","Powerful, beautiful, dangerous, and carrying an air of aloof indifference towards all living things.","This! Was the young mistress of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society—Liu Yutong!","As soon as Liu Yutong approached, all the men in black immediately bowed their heads in greeting.","\"Young Mistress!\"","\"Young Mistress!\"","\".......\"","Liu Yutong gave a slight nod. She raised a hand to casually tuck a strand of hair blown by the wind behind her ear, revealing a small black gemstone earring.","Under the lights, the cold glint reflected by the earring mirrored the impression she gave at this moment.","—Cold and proud!","Liu Yutong walked in her high-heeled boots down the path formed by two rows of bowing men in black, heading into the hotel lobby.","Only after her figure disappeared into the hotel did the onlookers, who had fallen silent, feel the suffocating pressure gradually lift.","The same thought surfaced in everyone's mind simultaneously.","This was no cow-eating female dragon!","This was clearly a gangland queen who could make the masses kneel with just a single glance!","Finally, it was the bubble tea guy, the one best at spinning yarns, who broke the silence first, stating with absolute certainty:","\"Whether the sky over Bright Pearl City stays dark from now on... really might depend on the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!\"","...","Inside the Tianxing Hotel, chaos reigned.","After obtaining crucial intelligence, Ma Da and his men, having swiftly dealt with the East Sea Alliance thugs in the lobby, immediately dispatched a team of their most elite members straight to the top floor.","Apart from one team led by Yun Cheng responsible for the Young Mistress's security, and those guarding the front/back doors and basement passages, the remaining forces split up. Following the acquired intel, they began a floor-by-floor purge.","While this was a mission of revenge, it wasn't limited to that. Per the Young Mistress's instructions, they also had to gather evidence of illegal activities caught on-site to justify the necessity of their operation.","That way, even if Qi Wei and his men showed up later, they'd have nothing to say.","The Tianxing Hotel, as Zhao Tianxing's primary business and gang headquarters, was rife with illegal dealings, everything from drugs to gambling and prostitution.","But catching them red-handed wasn't easy.","The building had fifteen floors, and the fire exits were usually deliberately locked. If reported, they'd pretend to open them, only to lock them again after the inspectors left.","The elevators required special key cards, and there was even a hidden elevator.","Whenever the police came to investigate, they always struggled to catch anyone in the act. By the time they fought their way upstairs, the evidence was long gone.","But with the Ten Thousand Dragons Society here, it was different. The Ten Thousand Dragons Society didn't play by those rules.","What the police couldn't easily do, they did. What the police couldn't easily ask, they asked.","As long as the 'outcome was legal'—after scrubbing away some inconvenient evidence—they could easily make the East Sea Alliance members talk.","Upon receiving the report that the East Sea Alliance lackeys on the top floor were basically dealt with, Liu Yutong took Yun Cheng and others up in the elevator directly to the penthouse.","Meanwhile, urgent reports kept crackling over the walkie-talkies from various floors of the Tianxing Hotel.","\"Second floor! They're fighting their way up! We can't hold them! Send backup!\"","\"Second floor, shut up! We're worse off on the third! This guy's actually using nunchucks! And there's freaking background music! He's beating our brothers with rhythm!\"","\"Fifth floor... fifth floor... Damn, my teeth... Wait! Don't hit the face... Aah!\"","\"Basement calling, basement calling... Holy crap, they're not even sparing the old man from the boiler room!\"","\"............\"","Over on the Wanlong Hui side, the walkie-talkies were equally non-stop.","\"Team A reporting, third floor cleared. Successfully apprehended three couples engaged in illicit transactions!\"","\"Team B has secured the fourth-floor finance office. They voluntarily opened the safe; discovered a large amount of cash and several account books.\"","\"Team C calling. Found a large collection of... photo books in Zhao Tianxing's office, ugh... Request permission for on-site incineration to avoid offending the young lady's eyes.\"","\"Permission denied, those are important evidence... Wait, there's a photo of him in a maid outfit on the last page? That absolutely must be published in the newspaper!\"","\"Team E apprehended a sleazy foreigner selling drugs. He tried to resist. How to proceed?\"","\"Tell him the Wanlong Hui only respects Dragon Country martial arts. If he doesn't know any, teach him!\"","\"Evidence secured on the 7th floor as well. Someone got high on illicit substances and is starting to trip...\"","\"...\""]},{"number":423,"title":"Chapter 423: 423. A Little Impairment May Spoil a Grand Scheme","paragraphs":["In the Emperor's private room on the top floor.","Several gang bosses were gathered in the room, each one visibly panicked, muttering non-stop under their breath.","Every minute, someone would rush in to deliver a report, all bad news, not a single piece of good news.","Some were already filled with regret, thinking they shouldn't have waited here; they should have taken the hidden elevator and slipped away earlier.","Sure, Zhao Tianxing had a gun, but they didn't!","Besides, what if the Ten Thousand Dragons Society guys really weren't afraid to die?","With just two guns and a dozen or so bullets between them, could they really take down that many people?","Obviously not!","Soon, a few more underlings with some status scrambled in on their hands and knees, their faces etched with anxiety and panic.","\"Boss, we can't hold them off, we really can't! The Ten Thousand Dragons Society guys are insanely fierce. Our guys are getting knocked out the moment they show their faces, sleeping like babies, snoring louder than me, even drooling.\"","\"Yeah boss, we should really retreat now. As long as the green hills remain, burning them is pointless... I mean, there'll be no lack of firewood!\"","\"Boss, no offense, but you have a gun, we don't. And besides... your bullets... they aren't exactly plentiful.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"They... they don't know how to multiply! There are hundreds of them, and you only have a dozen bullets. That's less than half a bullet per person on average. What's that good for? Not even enough to clean their ears.\"","Zhao Tianxing: \"........\"","Can you all just shut the hell up?","At that moment, a bespectacled man who looked like a strategist pushed up his crooked glasses and began analyzing the current situation.","\"Boss, according to Murphy's Law, the Law of Conservation of Energy, and the probability I just calculated on my computer, the likelihood of us staying here and getting out unscathed is lower than the probability of me getting up on time for breakfast tomorrow morning. And I usually sleep until the afternoon.\"","\"Boss, we can't hesitate any longer! If we don't leave now, we might really be trapped!\"","Zhao Tianxing's head was throbbing from the noise of his subordinates. He couldn't help but roar, \"Shut up, all of you!\"","\"Useless! Useless! You're all goddamn useless!\"","\"Can't even hold off a small-time group like the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. What's the point of keeping you all around?!\"","Zhao Tianxing wished he could smash something over the heads of these whining underlings.","The underlings lowered their heads, not daring to speak, but internally they couldn't help but retort, \"If you're so good, you do it!\"","Of course, they only dared to think it, not say it out loud.","Zhao Tianxing irritably tugged at his tie, nearly shouting hoarsely, \"Leaving is out of the question! I'm going to kill that Liu Yutong! I swear I'll make her die!\"","Right at that moment—","With a deafening boom, the thick, luxurious solid wood door of the private room shattered into pieces.","This sudden event left the gang bosses in the room utterly dumbfounded, their jaws hanging open.","What just happened?","To showcase the grandeur of the Emperor's room, Zhao Tianxing had used custom-made, extra-thick solid wood doors with gold trim. In theory, they should have been extremely difficult to break, even with tools.","But now, this door had been smashed apart as if it were made of paper, shattered by a terrifying, inhuman force from the outside!","Yes, shattered!","Amidst the swirling dust, a massive, suffocating figure blocked the doorway, almost blotting out all the light from the corridor.","It was a giant of a man, definitely over two meters tall, his bulging muscles straining against his black suit, looking ready to burst at any moment.","His bald head gleamed, and his ferocious face was the stuff of nightmares, enough to silence a crying child at night.","The giant merely stood there, but the almost tangible pressure he exuded made all the gang bosses in the room gasp for air, their calves beginning to tremble involuntarily.","\"You... who are you?\" Zhao Tianxing couldn't help but ask.","\"Me?\"","The giant tilted his neck, which was thicker than an average man's thigh, producing cracking sounds from his joints, as if pondering the question very seriously.","A few seconds later, he finally spoke.","\"I'm the Young Lady's pathfinder. The Young Lady said, if a door blocks the way, tear it down. If people block the way, squeeze 'em into balls for the Young Lady's new pet koi's midnight snack. She says the fish have been getting picky lately.\"","Everyone in the room: \"........\"","Before they could say anything else.","A Ten Thousand Dragons Society member with a slicked-back hairstyle walked in from behind the giant, carrying a megaphone.","\"Hello, friends inside!\"","\"We are the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's Special Action Group for Harmoniously Building a Civilized Pearl City. Please place your hands on your heads and squat down in an orderly manner to cooperate with our work. I repeat, hands on heads, squat down orderly. Thank you for your cooperation!\"","Zhao Tianxing and his underlings: \".......\"","Isn't the style a bit off here?","Aren't you supposed to be a gang? What the hell is this 'Harmoniously Building a Civilized Special Action Group'?","The next second, a dark tide of Ten Thousand Dragons Society members flooded into the room, completely surrounding the Emperor's private room.","Then they saw a purple-haired delinquent girl swagger in, also carrying a megaphone.","\"Who's Zhao Tianxing? Get the hell out here!\"","\"Stop hiding. Weren't you going to kill my Sister Yutong today? Chickening out now?\"","\"With your pathetic skills, you dare challenge our Ten Thousand Dragons Society? Are you in the underworld or the 'Farewell My Love' internet subculture? And you in the corner wearing the fur coat, yeah, I'm talking to you, girlie. You really think you're some Northeast tiger? With that tiger tattoo? Let me tell you, in my book, you're just a Hello Kitty!\"","\"Zhao Tianxing, I'm giving you three seconds. Get out here, kowtow and apologize, then smash up this dump of yours to set off fireworks for my Sister Yutong. Otherwise, I'll have Ji Yu squeeze you into a human mochi, dip you in Lao Gan Ma chili sauce, and feed you to the stray dogs downstairs!\"","\"......\"","The purple-haired delinquent girl's tirade was so fierce it immediately made everyone in the room break out in a cold sweat.","They once again revised their understanding of the women in the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. That Young Lady of theirs was already plenty ruthless, but who knew this little delinquent was also outrageously fierce.","Seeing Li Xiaohui come on so aggressively, Ma Da whispered a reminder, \"Xiaohui, let's be a bit more ladylike, mind our language...\"","Li Xiaohui cut him off directly. \"Why bother being civilized with this trash? Does he deserve it? How much does he deserve?\"","\"Zhao Tianxing, get out here now, kowtow and apologize! You dare bully my Sister Yutong? I promise to beat you so badly even your own mother won't recognize you!\"","Zhao Tianxing's face turned livid with rage. Being cursed at and pointed at by a girl at least twenty years his junior was the greatest humiliation he had suffered since entering this line of work.","He sprang to his feet, pointing a finger at her. \"You little bitch, if you want to die, I'll grant your wish!\"","Then he tilted his head slightly towards Liu Songxia on his left, signaling for him to pull out his gun and take her down.","Liu Songxia deliberately pretended not to see, remaining unmoved.","Zhao Tianxing turned his head again to hint.","Liu Songxia still didn't see it.","Zhao Tianxing jerked his head sharply to the right again, this time with a bit too much force, a faint crick sound even coming from his neck.","His head... got stuck.","He had wrenched his neck.","A subordinate nearby, seeing the boss's awkward posture, said curiously, \"Boss, that's quite a distinctive angle your head's at, kinda like... uh... an angry bird with a stiff neck.\"","\"Shut the hell up, I've wrenched my neck....\"","Zhao Tianxing was about to curse, but the slightest movement sent a tearing, 'refreshing' pain that made his vision go dark, nearly causing him to pass out on the spot.","He could only maintain this extremely awkward, humiliating pose, glaring at Li Xiaohui at the door.","Liu Songxia finally 'caught on' now, asking with a face full of 'concern': \"Brother Zhao, what's wrong? A stiff neck? Let me fix it for you.\"","Then, without waiting for Zhao Tianxing's agreement, he grabbed the sides of his head with both hands and gave a forceful twist.","\"OW—!\"","A pig-slaughtering howl echoed through the private room.","Zhao Tianxing's tears were almost spurting out: \"Liu Songxia, damn you! You did that on purpose!\"","Right after cursing, he realized his neck was fine: \"Huh? It really doesn't hurt anymore?\"","He didn't have time to dwell on it, and whispered to Liu Songxia again, \"Liu Songxia, were you fucking blind just now? I kept hinting for you to pull your gun and waste that purple-haired brat. Why didn't you move? Or was it on purpose, thinking of betraying us?\"","Liu Songxia looked utterly sincere: \"Brother Zhao, you've got me all wrong. I was thinking of the bigger picture.\"","Zhao Tianxing: \"Explain!\"","Liu Songxia explained: \"Brother Zhao, think about it. We only have two guns, a dozen or so bullets. If we'd listened to you just now and shot that little punk girl, it would've felt great in the moment, but then what?\"","\"Then we'd immediately get shot dead by these Wan Long Hui guys, thrown off the building and smashed to death, kneaded to death like putty by that bald muscleman, drowned in a toilet, hanged from the private room's crystal chandelier...\"","Liu Songxia rattled off dozens of horrifying ways to die in one breath before asking in return, \"Brother Zhao, which one of these lovely deaths do you prefer?\"","Zhao Tianxing: \"........\"","He didn't want any of them.","\"Alright, I've calmed down. You were right. We'll make our move when Liu Yutong gets here.\"","Liu Songxia nodded: \"Wise decision, Brother Zhao. So, let's strategically swallow our pride for now. When Liu Yutong arrives, we strike with one lethal blow.\"","Then his tone shifted: \"However, Brother Zhao, you might have to endure a little something first.\"","Zhao Tianxing: \"???\"","\"What do you mean?\"","Before Liu Songxia could explain.","Li Xiaohui stuck the loudspeaker behind her waist, waved her small hand, pointed at Zhao Tianxing, and issued another fierce order: \"This old geezer keeps yapping non-stop. Get him for me, girls!\"","At the command, the Wan Long Hui members blocking the door immediately swarmed toward Zhao Tianxing with nasty grins.","Zhao Tianxing's face turned pale instantly. He backed away repeatedly, his hand twitching several times toward his gun but he held back.","\"You dare touch me? Do you know who I am?!\"","\"Let go, you hear me! You'll regret this!\"","\"Stop it, all of you, damn it... I'm the boss of the Dong Hai Alliance!\"","\"Fuck, not the face... Big brother... pah, I'm sorry, miss, please go easy...\"","\"Let's talk this out, we're all in the same line of... OW!\"","\"Help me........\""]},{"number":424,"title":"Chapter 424: 424. The Miserable Zhao Tianxing.","paragraphs":["Just as Zhao Tianxing was being \"professionally\" dealt with by a group of Wanlong Hui members, clear footsteps suddenly sounded from outside the door.","The private room instantly fell silent.","Everyone stopped what they were doing in unison, their gazes swiveling towards the entrance.","Immediately after, a tall figure appeared at the edge of the shattered door frame.","It was Liu Yutong.","She didn't even glance at the chaotic scene inside the room, nor at Zhao Tianxing lying on the floor like a dead dog. She merely tilted her head slightly and spoke to someone behind her.","\"It's getting a bit noisy.\"","\"Understood, Miss.\" Yun Cheng immediately stepped up to the several gangster bosses who were trembling like leaves. He first pointed at their feet, then pointed at Zhao Tianxing.","The bosses looked utterly bewildered, not yet grasping what this meant.","Li Xiaohui giggled and hopped forward to explain. \"You're so dense! Take off your socks! Use your stinky socks to gag Boss Zhao, and gag each other too, so you won't make a racket when you start screaming later!\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the faces of the bosses turned green, including Zhao Tianxing who was playing dead on the floor.","One boss stammered, \"This... this... Miss Liu, isn't this a bit too...\"","Liu Yutong didn't even lift her eyelids, merely uttering a soft, questioning \"Hmm?\"","Yun Cheng immediately took a step forward, his eyes narrowing dangerously.","The boss instantly changed his tune. \"Too appropriate! I'll take them off right now. I haven't washed my feet for days.\"","Another boss hurriedly chimed in, \"Use mine, mine! Mine are more authentic, I haven't changed my socks since playing ball yesterday!\"","Zhao Tianxing, terrified, tried to scramble up. \"No! Don't you dare! Liu Yutong, you bitch, a warrior can be killed but not humiliated! If you have any guts, just finish me off!\"","He once again frantically shot meaningful looks at Liu Songxia.","The message was clear: Liu Yutong is here now, quick, seize the moment, take her out!","Even at this point, he still didn't want to make the first move himself; he still wanted someone else to take the fall for him. He truly wasn't planning to pull out the hidden gun unless absolutely forced to.","Liu Yutong also noticed his hints, turning her head slightly to look at Liu Songxia, who appeared tense and restrained.","\"Liu Songxia.\"","Suddenly called by name, Liu Songxia gave a start. He immediately stepped out from the crowd, his face instantly switching to an obsequious, bootlicking expression as he bowed respectfully to Liu Yutong.","\"Miss, your orders.\"","This move left not just Zhao Tianxing, but also the other gangster bosses, dumbfounded.","No one had expected that this guy, who seemed to be Zhao Tianxing's staunchest supporter, was actually the deepest undercover traitor.","Zhao Tianxing whipped his head around, eyes blazing with fury. \"Liu Songxia! You bastard, you actually dared to betray us! Don't even think about surviving in Bright Pearl City from now on!\"","Liu Songxia looked somewhat resigned. \"Brother Zhao, I told you long ago to recognize the situation. Following the Miss offers much better prospects than following you.\"","\"And besides, you should worry about whether you can get out of this unscathed yourself first, before threatening others.\"","\"You...\"","Liu Songxia turned, pulled out his revolver, and presented it with both hands. \"Miss, this is the gun Zhao Tianxing gave me. He told me to shoot and kill you when you weren't paying attention.\"","Seeing Liu Songxia actually hand over the gun, Zhao Tianxing's face changed dramatically. \"Liu Songxia, damn your ancestors! After all the trust I placed in you!\"","Liu Yutong took the gun, handling it with keen interest.","Truth be told, whether in her past life or this one, this was the first time she had laid hands on the great equalizer.","She toyed with it for a bit, then suddenly raised her arm, aiming the muzzle at Zhao Tianxing, her index finger resting on the trigger.","Zhao Tianxing was scared out of his wits. \"No, don't shoot! Miss Liu, let's talk this over, let's talk! I was wrong, I was wrong! I shouldn't have provoked you. The East Sea Alliance, everything I have, I can give it all to you. Just spare my wretched life!\"","Earlier, worried that Liu Yutong might not show up and to prevent being searched, he had secretly transferred the pistol behind a cushion on the sofa. He planned to retrieve it once Liu Yutong arrived, catching her off guard.","Of course, his main hope back then was for Liu Songxia to make the first move. If Liu Songxia acted first, perhaps he wouldn't have to take the risk himself.","What he never anticipated was that Liu Songxia, with his honest-looking face, turned out to be the real traitor.","No doubt, it was this dog who leaked the information during the first assassination attempt on Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong suddenly shifted the muzzle, aiming it at a gangster boss nearby who was trying to quietly shrink back.","Pointed at by the gun, the boss felt all his hairs stand on end. He raised his hands and shrieked, \"No, no, no! It's nothing to do with me, Miss Liu! I'll take them off! I'll take my socks off right now!\"","He frantically yanked off his socks. The smell instantly permeated the air, making even his companions nearby gag.","Liu Yutong's gun muzzle moved to another bald boss.","The bald boss gave a jolt, moving faster than anyone else, practically tearing the socks off his feet. \"Mine, mine are off too, absolutely fresh and warm!\"","\"What are you waiting for then?\" Yun Cheng said coldly.","The bosses didn't dare hesitate any longer. Grabbing their socks, they pounced on Zhao Tianxing.","\"Brother Zhao, sorry about this.\"","\"Try my family's heritage salted fish flavor.\"","\"Have a taste of my aged pickled cabbage flavor too.\"","\"Damn it, you animals!\"","\"Mmph! Mmph mmph—!\"","Zhao Tianxing had several stinky socks stuffed into his mouth. The stench made him roll his eyes, tears and snot streaming down his face as he retched violently, but he couldn't spit them out.","Yun Cheng, who had been holding back for a long time, no longer held back. He stepped forward, grabbed Zhao Tianxing by the collar, hoisted him up, and delivered several punches to the specially-made chest pad he was wearing.","\"The first punch is for daring to lay a hand on the Miss.\"","\"The second punch is to tell you that you don't even have the right to look up to the Miss.\"","\"The third punch is to make you remember that even thinking about harming the Miss is the biggest mistake of your life.\"","\"........\"","With each sentence, Yun Cheng delivered a punch straight to Zhao Tianxing.","After a few punches, Zhao Tianxing's face turned purple, his whole body trembling violently. He wanted to howl but couldn't make a sound.","With the final punch, Zhao Tianxing simply rolled his eyes back and passed out completely.","The gangster bosses watching nearby felt their scalps go numb, thinking inwardly, damn, this is too brutal!","Actually, Yun Cheng had wanted to do this for a long time.","Zhao Tianxing had repeatedly provoked and even attempted to assassinate the Miss. Yun Cheng had held this grudge for too long, and today he could finally vent.","Liu Yutong finally raised her hand slightly. \"That's enough, Yun Cheng.\"","Yun Cheng's fist froze mid-air. He took a deep breath, suppressing all the killing intent in his chest, and stepped back.","\"Miss, I lost my composure a bit.\"","Only then did he notice that Zhao Tianxing was almost done for, his face purple, his breathing faint. A few more punches, even though he had deliberately avoided vital spots and the special chest pad provided some cushioning, and the guy would probably have kicked the bucket right then and there.","Immediately after, the Wanlong Hui members also \"dealt with\" the gangster bosses who had participated in the trouble, then quickly began cleaning up the scene.","Zhao Tianxing and his companions could only watch helplessly as the men in black meticulously cleaned the private room. They even wiped the fingerprints off the revolver and placed it in the hand of one of the gang leaders.","Naturally, the bullets were also unloaded and separately tucked into the pockets of several other leaders. Furthermore, they posted guards to keep them under strict surveillance, preventing anyone from passing a bullet to the leader holding the gun.","Just as these gang bosses were utterly bewildered by the situation,","Suddenly!","A booming voice rang out from outside the door.","\"Everyone, stop right there!\""]},{"number":425,"title":"Chapter 425: 425. The Darkness of the World.","paragraphs":["\"Listen up, everyone inside! This is Liu Li from the Bright Pearl City Headquarters. I'm warning you, cease all illegal activities immediately, put your hands on your heads, and stand against the wall!\"","As soon as the words fell, a middle-aged man with a resolute face appeared at the doorway.","\"It's Deputy Commissioner Liu! Deputy Commissioner Liu is actually here!\"","\"We're saved!\"","\"..........\"","Zhao Tianxing, who had been lying by the sofa and was splashed with cold water to wake him up, struggled to lift his head at the sound.","When he saw that it was indeed Liu Li, the Deputy Commissioner of the Bright Pearl City Police, he burst into laughter.","\"Hahaha... Liu Yutong, you're done for!\"","At the same time, he abandoned the thought of reaching for another pistol hidden behind the sofa cushion.","\"Deputy Commissioner Liu, you must uphold justice for me! Look, just look at what they're doing!\"","\"They forced their way into my hotel, smashed everything, assaulted my staff and guests. They are utterly lawless!\"","\"Commissioner Liu, quick, order your men to arrest them all! Don't let a single one get away. Arrest them and have them executed!\"","Liu Li looked at the Wanlong Society members, all uniformly dressed in black suits and radiating a fierce aura, then at the sorry state of Zhao Tianxing and the other gang bosses—some even holding smelly socks in their hands—and his frown deepened.","\"What on earth is going on here? Who are you people? Give me an explanation immediately, or don't blame me for acting according to the law and taking you all back for processing!\"","He had been waiting in the neighboring private room for a long time and only came out after hearing police sirens downstairs.","Calculating the time, his own men should have almost reached the top floor by now, which was why he felt emboldened.","Liu Yutong, shielded by the men in black, stepped forward and extended a hand. \"Hello, Deputy Commissioner Liu. My name is Liu Yutong...\"","Then, she recounted the course of events to Liu Li \"in full detail.\"","After all, the other party was a leader from headquarters; an explanation was necessary.","She also explained why Zhao Tianxing and the others ended up in their current state.","However, her words sounded like a complete distortion of the truth to Zhao Tianxing and his crew.","\"As for why the scene is so chaotic, it's entirely the result of Zhao Tianxing and those gang bosses fighting amongst themselves. They even tried to use violence against us when we came to intervene. We had no choice but to exercise limited restraint in self-defense. Some items might have been accidentally damaged during the process, for which we certainly will not offer compensation...\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Li's frown tightened even more.","With years of experience handling cases, how could he not see the trickery here?","Zhao Tianxing and his men were indeed no saints, but this girl's account was far too full of holes.","He decided not to dwell on it further. Just as a large number of officers arrived,","Liu Li immediately ordered, \"On suspicion of affray, organized crime, and gang-related offenses, everyone must come with me to the police station for investigation. Save your statements for the interrogation room!\"","To his surprise, however, the newly arrived officers did not follow his command.","This group was entirely from the Lijin District Sub-bureau, operating under the direct orders of the special investigation team leader, Zheng Yi, and possessing special investigative authority.","Zheng Yi's mission here was precisely to investigate several connected homicide cases from last year and the serious organized crime incidents related to the major fire in Bright Pearl City at the beginning of the year.","\"What are you doing? Why aren't you moving!\" Liu Li, seeing the officers stand still, felt his authority undermined and rebuked them.","He didn't know that the personnel he had tried to mobilize earlier had already been intercepted by higher-level leadership.","\"Deputy Commissioner Liu, these Wanlong Society members cannot be arrested.\"","At that moment, Qi Wei arrived belatedly.","Beside him was a young man in a suit with a special badge pinned to his chest—Zheng Yi, the special investigation team leader dispatched from above.","\"Qi Wei?\"","\"What... what do you mean? Why can't they be taken away? Also, isn't this area outside your jurisdiction?\"","Qi Wei walked up to Liu Li, first saluting him. \"Deputy Commissioner Liu, please don't be angry. It's not that we're disobeying your order, it's just that... the situation is somewhat special.\"","Then he pointed to Zheng Yi and introduced, \"This is Comrade Zheng Yi, the leader of the special investigation team sent down from above. Perhaps he can explain it to you.\"","Zheng Yi stepped forward and extended a hand to Liu Li. \"Hello, Deputy Commissioner Liu.\"","Liu Li shook his hand, finding him increasingly familiar. \"Team Leader Zheng, have we met before?\"","Zheng Yi nodded. \"Yes, we crossed paths once at a provincial police work conference.\"","Liu Li suddenly remembered the other's background, especially the high-ranking leader behind him, and his attitude instantly softened.","He also realized that the higher-ups were dissatisfied with their work here, or suspected protective umbrellas, hence the special dispatch.","It was just that Zheng Yi hadn't had time to report to him before this incident suddenly occurred.","\"Based on the clues we currently have, much of the evidence in these cases points to Zhao Tianxing of the East Sea Alliance.\"","\"Miss Liu is actually an informant assisting us. Today's events were rather sudden...\"","After listening, Liu Li's attitude toward Liu Yutong changed as well.","\"Oh, I see! Team Leader Zheng, why didn't you say so earlier? Look at this mess, a misunderstanding! A complete misunderstanding!\"","\"No wonder Miss Liu's demeanor is so extraordinary, and these Wanlong Society employees look so... uh... familiar. So they are all civilian heroes acting bravely for justice!\"","\"Everything you've done are necessary extraordinary measures taken to assist the police in combating crime, fully demonstrating the importance of police-civilian cooperation. It deserves praise! Must be commended!\"","Liu Yutong replied modestly, \"Thank you for the praise, Deputy Commissioner Liu. Cooperating with the police, maintaining public security in Bright Pearl City, and cracking down on criminal gangs are the duties of every member of the Wanlong Society!\"","Liu Li listened, nodding repeatedly, his face showing even greater admiration. \"Look at Miss Liu's awareness, her vision! It truly puts us to shame! If all entrepreneurs in Bright Pearl City had such awareness and sense of responsibility, how could we worry about social instability!\"","\"..........\"","The gang bosses nearby had initially been hoping the police would quickly arrest all the Wanlong Society members, preferably execute them.","But gradually, the joy faded from their faces.","The headquarters leader was actually engaging in mutual admiration with that woman, Liu Yutong?","What exactly was going on?","Especially Zhao Tianxing, hearing Liu Li's words, almost choked on his breath again.","He really wanted to curse: Liu Li, are your eyes on your ass?","The Wanlong Society people nearly beat me to death, trashed my place, stuffed smelly socks in my mouth... and you call her a praiseworthy entrepreneur?","Their Wanlong Society is the biggest gang of all!!!","Finally grasping the situation, the gang bosses' minds short-circuited, each one utterly dumbfounded.","\"No... it can't be. Has the world really sunk this low? They're pulling this right in front of everyone?\"","\"It's over, completely over. These cops aren't here to save us at all. Damn it, they're here to congratulate the other side...\"","\"No wonder Liu Yutong dared to so brazenly bring hundreds of men to wipe us out. No wonder she's so fearless. Her connections must reach the heavens.\"","\"Collusion... playing both sides of the law... I've truly witnessed it with my own eyes today...\"","The men closed their eyes in despair. Today, they had finally felt the true darkness of this world."]},{"number":426,"title":"Chapter 426: 426. Want to Pick the Peaches","paragraphs":["At that moment.","In another private room.","After the investment promotion officials left to check on the situation in the Emperor's private room, the others gradually became more animated.","With the police here, no matter how fiercely those people outside were fighting, they'd have to behave themselves in front of the officers. Their personal safety was more or less guaranteed.","Although they were also curious about what exactly was happening over there, none of them followed the officials out.","After all, that was police work, none of their business, and it really wasn't appropriate to go gawk.","Even though no one went over, they instinctively started talking about the incident.","\"Who would have thought Bright Pearl City could be this chaotic.\"","\"You can say that again. It really scared me just now.\"","\"What do you think will happen to those men in black?\"","\"At the very least, they'll get time behind bars. Storming in with so many people in broad daylight, fighting and smashing things—do they think there's no law in Bright Pearl City? Especially with Chief Liu himself handling it, none of them will get away.\"","\"That 'Big Miss' Liu Yutong you mentioned earlier, no matter how tough she acts, is just a gangster at the end of the day. She was too impulsive. Causing such a scene is like cutting off her own escape route.\"","\"More than that, it's downright foolish. Didn't you see how grim the officials' faces were? The Wanlong Society wasn't just slapping those local thugs in the face; they were slapping the officials' faces too.\"","\"These gangsters nowadays really think that with sheer ruthlessness and numbers they can run wild like they did in Hong Kong over a decade ago. Too bad for them they miscalculated this time. This is the mainland.\"","\"Exactly. The Wanlong Society is finished. I reckon before tonight's over, all their establishments will be raided. That 'Big Miss' Liu Yutong is probably done for.\"","\".........\"","The first-time investors in Bright Pearl City chatted back and forth about the Wanlong Society's impending doom, completely missing the increasingly strange expressions on Ji Zhe and Chu Hai's faces.","Could the police really take down the Wanlong Society?","Hard to believe.","Right then, one of the investors, Zhang Zhaoyuan, suddenly remembered something and turned to ask, \"By the way, Mr. Chu, Mr. Ji, what's the relationship between that Wanlong Group-Buy project you're leading the investment in and this Wanlong Society?\"","The other two, Li Hanming from Zhaosheng Capital and Chen Baiyuan from Changxing United Holdings, were startled upon hearing this.","\"It couldn't really be...\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai nodded helplessly. \"It is.\"","They had originally intended to give these three a little shock, but they never expected it to come so suddenly and so violently.","Have you ever seen a brawl involving over five hundred people?","Haven't, right?","They were seeing it for the first time too.","Zhang Zhaoyuan frowned. \"Mr. Chu, Mr. Ji, this is no small matter. If the internet project you're promoting is connected to such gangsters, it will be very difficult for our risk control and investment committee to approve.\"","\"The Wanlong Group-Buy project is indeed a good one, but investing ultimately means investing in people. Getting involved with them is too risky.\"","The other two also nodded in agreement. \"Right, who would dare follow an investment when they resort to this kind of gangster violence and large-scale brawls?\"","\"Mr. Chu, Mr. Ji, to be honest, were you threatened into this initially?\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai: \"....\"","\"Well... not exactly threatened.\"","\"We fully understand your concerns. Risk control is indeed a consideration, but often, what the eyes see isn't necessarily the whole truth.\"","\"You're essentially worried that the Wanlong Society is shady. And are they shady? Absolutely!\"","\"But that doesn't stop us from making money. As long as there's profit to be made, who cares if they're shady or not? We're not the ones running this project.\"","\"We're financial investors, not responsible for operations. The project is managed by their team. We only need to care about how much money we can make. As long as we can hold out until the next round of financing or a successful IPO, or at the very least, arrange for a major company to acquire the project, there will be plenty of opportunities to cash out and exit.\"","\"By that time, even if the Wanlong Society gets into trouble for its underworld connections, it won't implicate us.\"","\"We can't just stop making money because we're afraid of gangsters, can we?\"","\"Don't you agree, gentlemen?\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai never imagined they would one day be speaking in defense of an organization with underworld ties.","Businessmen are profit-driven by nature, especially venture capitalists like them. As long as there's sufficient profit, what does it matter if it's shady or not?","They just need to isolate the risks in advance and have an exit strategy ready.","Moreover, the Wanlong Group-Buy project itself is a legitimate venture, not some gray-area business.","Hearing Ji Zhe and Chu Hai's words, the three investors lowered their heads in thought, clearly somewhat persuaded.","As long as they could make money, and do so legally, whether the founding team was black or white didn't matter much to them.","They were investors, not legal representatives. Investors don't need to be responsible for them.","They had all conducted due diligence on the Wanlong Group-Buy project recently. It had a novel model, good data, and rapid growth—truly a rare, excellent project.","Missing out would indeed be a loss.","Just then, Zhao Weixiang, who had been mostly silent in the room, suddenly chuckled and stood up.","Even at this point, these people still held illusions about the Wanlong Society?","Then he would be the one to shatter those illusions.","\"Gentlemen, since you all have reservations about the Wanlong Society's background, I have a proposal that satisfies both sides.\"","As soon as he spoke, everyone looked at this young boss in the white suit.","Zhao Weixiang straightened his suit and tie, continuing, \"The Wanlong Society caused such a huge scene today—illegal assembly, vandalizing the hotel, assault... the evidence is solid. Plus, with Chief Liu handling it personally, there's absolutely no way they can recover.\"","\"I know you all came to Bright Pearl City for Wanlong Group-Buy. It is a good project. Your only hang-up is whether a project run by such a shady organization as the Wanlong Society can survive.\"","\"In my opinion, if the butcher is gone, we don't have to eat hairy pork. Why not let me, Zhao Weixiang, take over the Wanlong Group-Buy project? I've been operating in Bright Pearl City for many years, familiar with all the connections up and down, and I have people who can put in a word with those above.\"","\"I guarantee I can get the project running smoothly and ensure all your investments yield substantial profits. What do you say?\"","Everyone seemed tempted upon hearing this. If they could switch to someone less shady, that seemed like a good thing too.","Just as they were about to ask him how he could take over the project, the door to the private room was suddenly pushed open from the outside.","Two young men wearing the Wanlong Society's signature black suits appeared at the doorway, their eyes sweeping across the room.","\"Gentlemen, our Big Miss has specifically instructed us to invite you over for a chat.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the entire room fell deathly silent.","Liu Yutong was inviting them?","Shouldn't she have been arrested by now?","This...","Zhao Weixiang, who just moments ago had been holding forth about taking over the project and declaring the Wanlong Society's certain doom, now looked as if an invisible hand had grabbed his throat, his smile instantly frozen on his face."]},{"number":427,"title":"Chapter 427: 427, The Gunshot","paragraphs":["\"Invite me over? Are you joking! Isn't Chief Liu and the others still outside? How... how can you people still...\"","Zhao Weixiang couldn't understand it at all. Logically, the police should be making arrests, so how could they be letting the members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society move about freely?","This doesn't make sense!","Could something unexpected have happened?","\"Impossible! Absolutely impossible!\"","\"You assaulted people, smashed up the place, involved in organized crime and violence... how could you possibly be completely unscathed? Chief Liu saw your Ten Thousand Dragons Society with his own eyes...\"","A man in black immediately cut him off: \"Mr. Zhao, please watch your words. Our Ten Thousand Dragons Society is a legitimate company; we would never engage in such unlawful activities!\"","Everyone in the private room: \"???\"","Wait, how can you say that with a straight face?","We all saw clearly what you just did.","And now you're telling us you're the good guys?","Zhao Weixiang opened his mouth, wanting to argue further, but found his throat blocked as if by something, unable to utter a single word.","He had put so much thought into setting up this scheme to bring down Liu Yutong and crush the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, and now the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was completely unharmed?","This is just too ridiculous!","If there were no officials present, if it weren't for this occasion, if these investors weren't here, then perhaps Liu Yutong might have been able to pull some strings and escape unscathed.","But with officials being embarrassed in front of so many investors, coupled with the authorities' zero-tolerance policy towards organized crime, once labeled as such, the consequences are almost always devastating.","That's why many underworld figures generally avoid gathering too many people to cause trouble openly. Even if they do, they choose nighttime or midnight.","The moment they see the police arriving, they scatter immediately.","Even if they're unlucky enough to get caught, it's usually just charged as a brawl, a few days in detention at most.","But what did Liu Yutong do?","She directly brought hundreds of people to storm someone else's hotel, smashing things, beating people, detaining people... and it was all witnessed by two officials. That changes the nature of it completely.","That's why Zhao Weixiang was so certain that Liu Yutong and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society were doomed this time.","But now, all his judgments, all his planning, had become a complete and utter joke.","So, the clown was himself all along.","The few investors were once again nervous and fearful.","Having been in the business world for years, this was the first time they'd encountered such a surreal scene. A group that was just using violence moments ago had now been completely whitewashed, even able to turn around and invite them to discuss cooperation?","Just how deep are the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's... connections?","Or rather... just how 'clean' are they?","Chu Hai and Ji Zhe, however, calmly stood up and straightened their clothes.","\"Everyone, since Miss Liu has invited us, let's all go over together.\"","Who would have thought the calmest ones would be these two.","From their perspective, they had already experienced something similar once, so they weren't surprised.","When they stepped out of the private room, they were met with a jaw-dropping scene.","Not only were those men in black fine, they were actually assisting the police in escorting the small-time thugs from the East Sea Alliance downstairs.","The main reason was there were too many people to fit in the police cars, and the members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society were particularly enthusiastic, eager to help, so they volunteered to help deliver the people to the police station.","But in the eyes of those investors, this scene looked all wrong.","There could only be one explanation: Collusion!","In the Emperor's private room.","Those underworld figures had already been handcuffed by the police, including Zhao Tianxing.","Liu Yutong, meanwhile, was chatting and laughing amiably with several men who looked like officials.","When she saw Ji Zhe and the others arrive, especially when she saw Zhao Weixiang, she actually took the initiative to greet him.","\"Mr. Zhao, I believe this is our first meeting?\"","Zhao Weixiang's eyes narrowed almost imperceptibly. He was excellent at maintaining appearances, looking quite enthusiastic.","\"Miss Liu, I've long heard of your reputation. I'm finally fortunate enough to meet you today. I've long heard that the young lady of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society is both talented and beautiful. Seeing you today, the rumors are indeed true.\"","\"You flatter me, Mr. Zhao.\"","Liu Yutong smiled slightly, her tone meaningful: \"Mr. Zhao, it's strange. Although this is our first meeting, I feel as if I already know you quite well. You must have put a lot of thought into me and my Ten Thousand Dragons Society, haven't you?\"","The smile on Zhao Weixiang's face froze for an instant before quickly returning to normal: \"Miss Liu, you jest. I have nothing but admiration for you and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. How could I have any other intentions?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Is that so? Then why were you so sure that I, Liu Yutong, would definitely fall here today, and that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society would definitely collapse? Could it be that you were the one stirring the pot behind the scenes?\"","Zhao Weixiang: \"Rumors, they must be rumors, spread by someone. Miss Liu and I have no grievances, this is our first meeting today. How could I possibly engage in such underhanded behavior? Someone must be trying to drive a wedge between us. Please don't believe it, Miss Liu!\"","Even as he said this, cold sweat was already beginning to seep down his back.","It was laughable, really. This was the first time he had felt this way towards someone, especially a woman.","Perhaps it was because all his meticulous schemes had been dismantled by this young woman before him without him even realizing it.","He didn't even know when he himself had been exposed.","Liu Yutong nodded: \"I see. So it really was a misunderstanding on my part.\"","\"However, Bright Pearl City isn't that big, nor is it that small. We'll have plenty of opportunities to deal with each other in the future. We have a long road ahead, don't you agree, Mr. Zhao?\"","That last sentence made the hairs on Zhao Weixiang's neck stand on end, but he still forced himself to remain calm, a smile on his face, repeatedly agreeing.","Liu Yutong no longer looked at him, turning instead to the several uneasy investors.","\"Gentlemen, a minor misunderstanding occurred earlier. I hope it didn't startle you? It was my poor hospitality.\"","The investors were overwhelmed by the attention, quickly waving their hands.","\"Not at all, not at all!\"","\"Miss Liu, you're too kind!\"","\"We're the ones intruding, intruding!\"","\"......\"","Liu Yutong smiled slightly and turned to introduce them to a man who looked like an official beside her.","\"Director Zhou, let me introduce you. These gentlemen are very important investors in our Ten Thousand Dragons group-buying project. They came specifically today to review the project's progress. They are all well-known investors with great confidence in Bright Pearl City's economic development.\"","The investment promotion official laughed heartily: \"Miss Liu, I've already met these gentlemen. I didn't realize they were the distinguished guests you invited. What a coincidence!\"","\"Welcome once again, gentlemen. If you need any support or coordination, please don't hesitate to let me know!\"","The three investors quickly nodded in response.","\"Certainly, certainly.\"","\"Thank you for your concern, Director Zhou.\"","\".......\"","Shortly after, the investment promotion official received a phone call, bid farewell to Liu Yutong and the others, and left first.","Liu Yutong turned to the investors once more. \"I'm afraid you gentlemen haven't had a proper meal tonight. Please allow me to fulfill my duties as your host. Let me invite you to a restaurant under my management to try Bright Pearl City's signature dish, the small fish pot sticker, to help settle your nerves.\"","The three investors felt a sudden tightness in their chests, a vague premonition dawning on them: this meal probably wouldn't come cheap!","Just as they were wrestling with how much to offer or thinking of making a polite excuse to slip away later, Zhao Tianxing, who was being held by the police officers, suddenly began to struggle violently, demanding to speak to Liu Yutong alone.","When Liu Yutong approached him, she was met with his bloodshot eyes fixed on her with an intensity that seemed to want to skin her alive.","\"Liu Yutong, I'll get out eventually. I still have money stashed overseas, a safety net I prepared for me and my son, Junjie...\"","\"You still have family, don't you? Once I'm out, I'll make sure every single one of them is dealt with, one by one. Hahaha...\"","Suppressing the fury in her heart, Liu Yutong spoke in a voice only the two of them could hear. \"Zhao Tianxing, you're laughing too soon. You failed to kill me twice, and now you're a prisoner, yet you still dare to threaten me?\"","\"Don't worry. As long as I'm around, you will never get out. And as for your foolish son, I'll make sure he's taken care of in advance...\"","She deliberately left the sentence unfinished, referring to sending Zhao Junjie to a mental institution.","Then she turned and walked away, beginning a silent count in her mind.","Just as she reached ten, Zhao Tianxing suddenly erupted with a furious roar: \"LIU YUTONG!!!!\"","Liu Yutong instinctively turned her head.","She saw Zhao Tianxing, who had somehow retrieved a handgun from behind the sofa, now pointing it directly at her, his expression maniacal and twisted.","\"You die first!!!!\"","He jerked the trigger, but only heard a dry click.","No reaction?","In the moment he stood frozen, Liu Songxia beside him suddenly cried out in alarm, \"He's going to shoot!\"","The police officers had already drawn their service weapons and aimed at Zhao Tianxing the moment they saw him pull out the gun. Their initial intent was to try and talk him down.","But Liu Songxia's sudden shout triggered their instincts, and they reflexively squeezed their triggers....","\"Bang! Bang! Bang!...\""]},{"number":428,"title":"Chapter 428: 428, At the Zenith of One's Power","paragraphs":["The sudden burst of gunfire inside the room terrified everyone who had just reached the doorway.","Before they could even recover from the shock and fear, they saw Liu Yutong walk out, her face slightly pale.","A police officer apologetically asked Liu Yutong if she was frightened and whether she needed to go to the hospital for a check-up, and so on.","After all, what had just happened was too sudden; it was perfectly normal to be scared.","Liu Yutong shook her head, indicating she was fine, then looked at the investors and said, \"Gentlemen, let's go. I've already had a private room reserved.\"","Those investors, including Ji Zhe and Chu Hai, had beads of cold sweat on their foreheads.","Although they hadn't witnessed what had just happened inside the Emperor's private room, the sound of gunfire was more than enough to suggest the outcome.","That Zhao Tianxing was probably not long for this world.","Otherwise, there wouldn't have been gunfire for no reason, and so many shots at that.","Simultaneously, they had gained a thorough understanding of just how ruthless Miss Liu could be. To leave no loose ends, she had actually had Zhao Tianxing dealt with directly.","This was just too terrifying, too downright insane!","Upon hearing Liu Yutong's words, the investors became more eager than the next.","\"Y-yes, Miss Liu, please, after you!\"","\"This is really... really too much trouble for you, Miss Liu.\"","\"It's our honor to taste the signature dishes at Miss Liu's establishment!\"","\"Yes, yes, I can hardly wait already, hehe...\"","\"........\"","The group headed towards the elevator.","The investors almost instinctively followed behind Liu Yutong, as obedient as a group of schoolchildren, not even daring to breathe too heavily.","They had previously thought about being perfunctory and then making a quick exit later, as they still felt the public security in Bright Pearl City was too poor.","After the gunshots, those thoughts were immediately flung to the far ends of the earth.","Now their only thought was: This Wanlonghui project must be invested in! At any cost!","This was no longer a simple commercial investment; it was paying for protection!","After all, this Miss Liu was too unpredictable in her actions. If they upset her, she might just mow them all down too.","And honestly, that possibility was not small at all.","That Zhao Tianxing had already been in such a miserable state—his establishment smashed, his underlings taken out, himself detained by the police and facing prison time.","It could be said he was utterly ruined, and yet he still got whacked!","Even these bosses, who were usually treated as honored guests wherever they went, had never witnessed such a frightening scene.","It was downright pitch black, wasn't it!","Liu Yutong had no idea that her persona as the mob matriarch had been firmly cemented in the minds of these investors, likely never to be shaken off in this lifetime.","Not long after, a rumor began circulating in investment circles.","It said that no matter who went to Bright Pearl City, their efficiency would become exceptionally high. If you dared to dawdle even a little, your host would promptly treat you to a live performance demonstrating marksmanship that was both fast and accurate within seven paces.","Naturally, the result was that the big shots were 'moved' to tears, signing contracts with remarkable alacrity.","When Liu Yutong got into her car and left, Zhao Weixiang, with a grim expression, followed and got into a police car; he also needed to give a statement.","Although he should have been happy about Zhao Tianxing's sudden death, as it would make it harder for the matter to be traced back to him, the true mastermind behind the scenes, he couldn't feel any joy at all.","Zhao Tianxing was dead, but Liu Yutong was completely unscathed. In fact, her relationship with the authorities seemed even more 'solid' now.","Not only had she not fallen, she had instead established a terrifying persona of someone absolutely not to be messed with in the investors' minds. Without a doubt, her subsequent fundraising would become even smoother.","He could tell those investors were utterly terrified of Liu Yutong. He estimated the valuation for the Wanlonghui group-buy would likely surge because of this.","\"Damn it!\" Zhao Weixiang roared inwardly.","He prided himself on being a master strategist, believing everything was under his control.","Yet ever since Liu Yutong appeared, he felt as if everything he did was effortlessly anticipated and neutralized by her, as if he were transparent in her eyes.","It was utterly frustrating and infuriating!","Once in the police car, Zhao Weixiang closed his eyes and began carefully reviewing the events.","No matter how he analyzed it, he could only reach one conclusion: the backing hidden behind Liu Yutong was likely immense.","Otherwise, how could she have caused Deputy Chief Liu and the investment attraction officials to do a complete one-eighty in their attitudes in such a short time?","He was absolutely certain those two officials had never had any dealings with Liu Yutong before.","Therefore, the only reasonable explanation was that the patron behind Liu Yutong held a higher rank than the two officials he had gone to great lengths to invite today.","He originally thought Liu Yutong's backer was that precinct chief, Qi Wei. Now it seemed he had been wildly mistaken.","If this assumption held true, then everything made sense. How could a girl with no foundation grow Wanlonghui so large in just over half a year?","Was it possible without powerful backing?","Almost impossible!","It would never occur to Zhao Weixiang that Liu Yutong actually had no backing at all.","He could only speculate in that direction; it was impossible for him to guess something as absurd as her being a reincarnator.","The more Zhao Weixiang thought about it, the more resentful and jealous he became.","Why?","He had painstakingly laid out such an elaborate scheme, dragging all the local gang bosses in Bright Pearl City into the mess to eliminate them, all to gain complete control over the city's underworld. After that, he planned to find an opportunity to latch onto an even more powerful patron.","By then, he would become the true underground emperor of Bright Pearl City.","Power, wealth—he would possess it all.","He might even escape a life of dependence on others' whims, truly seizing control of his own destiny.","He absolutely would not allow some suddenly appearing young upstart to so easily snatch away everything that was rightfully his!","\"Liu Yutong, no matter who stands behind you, no matter what your true origins are, if you dare block my path, you must be eliminated!\"","..........","Time passed bit by bit.","During this period, several major events occurred in Bright Pearl City.","First, the Donghai Alliance was completely wiped out by Wanlonghui. Many people witnessed Wanlonghui mobilizing almost its entire force, charging straight for the Donghai Alliance headquarters.","That day, crowds of people in black gathered, blotting out the sky. The scale of the scene was unprecedented in Bright Pearl City's recent history.","Besides the Donghai Alliance, many other underworld bosses were also dealt with by Wanlonghui, mostly those connected to the Alliance.","Although the scale used wasn't as large as against the Donghai Alliance, the results were similar.","Those gang bosses' operations were almost completely uprooted, and most of the people involved were sent to secure locations offering free room and board to contribute their labor.","Through this campaign, Wanlonghui thoroughly established its fearsome reputation. Its prestige in the underworld, in particular, became unmatched for a time, even surpassing the Yilian Society at its peak.","Although the Righteous Union Society was once hailed as the top syndicate in Bright Pearl City, it never reached the level of absolute dominance. When faced with police crackdowns, it could only obediently take its lumps.","But today's Ten Thousand Dragons Society is a completely different story. They seem to utterly disregard the unspoken red lines of this world, operating with ruthless and overbearing brutality.","What's even more astonishing is the police's remarkably tolerant attitude towards them, almost turning a blind eye.","This sends chills down the spines of many.","The scenarios they once only fantasized about have actually materialized with the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","As denizens of the gray underworld, who hasn't dreamed of having sway in both the black and white worlds, acting with impunity, and holding absolute power?","Yet, until now, no one had ever achieved it—until the emergence of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","That fantasy has become reality."]},{"number":429,"title":"Chapter 429: 429. New Development Plan.","paragraphs":["Bright Pearl City.","During this period, aside from the sensational major events that occurred on the streets, several other matters successfully made it onto the local trending lists, and were even reported in domestic financial news and major portal websites.","That is the group-buying project, formerly known as Wanlong Group-Buy, now officially renamed Wanhui Premium, which has successfully completed its Series A funding round.","This round of financing was led by Qixing Capital and AEG Capital, with Bright Pearl Capital, Zhaosheng Capital, Yunrui Fund, and Changxing United Holdings participating. By giving up 10% of equity, they raised 50 million in funds, achieving a valuation as high as 500 million.","That's right, a valuation of 500 million.","It's worth noting that not long ago, this figure was only 40 million, and even that was considered an overvaluation at the time.","In fact, for this Series A round, Ji Zhe, Chu Hai, and others had originally estimated a valuation of at most 150 to 200 million.","But they simply couldn't hold back the newcomers like Zhang Zhaoyuan and others from driving the price up.","That evening, Liu Yutong, the daughter of the Wanlong Society, merely treated them to a meal at a restaurant. Before Ji Zhe and Chu Hai could even expend much effort persuading them, Zhang Zhaoyuan and the other two directly pushed the valuation up to 500 million.","Under the guise of: Wanhui Premium is currently undergoing massive expansion; raising this 50 million is actually considered low, might not even be enough to spend, so the valuation is very low.","Hearing this, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai were absolutely thrilled inside.","In just about a month, the value of their shares had multiplied several times. Although this was currently just a paper gain on the books, as long as someone was willing to take over their shares later, it would mean real, substantial profit!","With the 50 million in funding secured, Wanhui Premium officially launched its major strategy to expand into first-tier cities. Taking advantage of the lack of similar competitors in the market, they began aggressively capturing territory.","Simultaneously, this suddenly emerged juicy piece of meat also attracted the attention of some interested parties.","............","After resolving the matters with Zhao Tianxing, more and more people came to visit Liu Yutong at the Wanlong Group during this period, mostly consisting of gang leaders operating on the streets.","Of course, compared to the already swept-away East Sea Alliance, these people were far inferior in both strength and scale.","They could be directly described as insignificant.","Their purpose was easy to guess: they wanted to latch onto the Wanlong Society's coattails.","The Wanlong Society's influence in Bright Pearl City was now at its peak, unrivaled in momentum.","There was no more promising path than following the Wanlong Society.","In the future, just being able to shout outside \"I know so-and-so from the Wanlong Society\" would allow one to swagger around Bright Pearl City.","Unfortunately, they got one thing wrong.","The Wanlong Society was not some street gang or social organization at all, but a proper, legitimate corporate group.","Regarding these individuals who came to pay their respects, Liu Yutong had only one attitude: turn them all away at the door.","For anyone who dared to pester relentlessly, or commit misdeeds under the banner of the Wanlong Society, she would not be polite and wouldn't mind offering them an all-expenses-paid \"iron rice bowl\" (imprisonment).","Having dealt with some bothersome matters and found some peace and quiet, Liu Yutong began sorting through the group's business.","The supermarket business, originally the most developed and largest under the Wanlong Society, had essentially stopped expanding and was gradually being surpassed by the Wanhui Premium project.","This was mainly due to Liu Yutong's philosophy being different from the norm.","The supermarket business could certainly continue expanding outward, but if they blindly raced to grab territory, they definitely couldn't achieve the ultimate service and reputation they had in their Bright Pearl City home base.","Just like the highly reputable Laidong Supermarket from her previous life, its expansion was very slow. Often, wanting to do things well was easier said than done.","Therefore, the expansion of branch stores had to be extremely cautious: better slow than sloppy. They couldn't lose their hard-earned reputation just for the sake of scale.","Moreover, once they lost the advantage and reputation they had painstakingly built, venturing to other regions could easily lead to a failure to adapt.","She had seen far too many instances in her previous life of large chain supermarkets closing stores in large batches during later stages.","Although online shopping impact was also a reason, ultimately it came down to an unsteady foundation.","Wanlong Supermarket still needed to advance steadily and securely, hold its basic market, and develop slowly for the long term.","Before that, they could first focus their efforts on the Wanlong Shopping Center, also called Wanlong Plaza, which would open soon.","This commercial plaza would be the model for Wanlong Supermarket's future outward expansion, similar to the Qianda Plaza of her previous life.","Only, she intended to do it better, more refined, more perfect, and more successful than the Qianda of her previous life!","\"I'll need to discuss this with Yu Mo,\" Liu Yutong thought.","Currently, Yu Corporation had secured the land plot in the northern part of the city, planning to develop it into a large-scale trade mart.","Although that project had a long payback period, Liu Yutong knew that it would indeed become a landmark wholesale and retail center for the northern district of Bright Pearl City in the future, following a path of good quality and low prices.","Wanlong Plaza, on the contrary, would take a relatively high-end route, aiming to become a comprehensive commercial complex integrating fashion department stores, brand flagship stores, boutique dining, and entertainment experiences.","One north, one south; one affordable, one luxury — they happened to form a complementary pair, becoming two future business name cards for Bright Pearl City.","Of course, the trade mart model wasn't easy to replicate further, as it held no advantage compared to Wucheng in that regard. If it weren't for Yu Mo's father having previously secured connections in Wucheng to arrange things like the trade mart's five-year naming rights, they might not have been able to develop it at all.","Apart from this project, Yu Corporation basically had no potential for outward development afterward.","Aside from funding issues—after all, the trade mart project required massive investment, completely tying up Yu Corporation and causing them to stagnate—there was also the lack of follow-up development plans.","Liu Yutong planned to collaborate with Yu Corporation to establish a commercial management company.","Both Yu Corporation and her Wanlong Group had tight cash flow. Independently developing and holding more pure commercial plazas would be very difficult.","This heavy-asset model occupies capital to a terrifying degree, with long development cycles and slow returns.","If they learned from certain giants of her previous life who relied on high leverage for crazy expansion, they would be highly likely to fall into a debt quagmire when the real estate market declined a few years later. The final outcome would be nothing other than cutting off an arm to survive, frantically selling assets to repay debts, or even worse.","However, there was one direction they could completely pursue: skip the heavy-asset stage altogether and directly adopt a light-asset output model."]},{"number":430,"title":"Chapter 430: 430. Another Chance Encounter with Guo Yani.","paragraphs":["Soon, a mature business plan rapidly took shape in Liu Yutong's mind.","She was almost certain that the Wanlong Shopping Center would inevitably become one of the commercial landmarks of Bright Pearl City.","This was determined by its geographical location.","Furthermore, the next seven or eight years would be a golden period for the real estate industry.","She planned to first partner with Yu Corporation to establish a commercial management company. Through operating the Wanlong Shopping Center, they would accumulate experience and use it as a successful case study and a calling card to attract further investment and partnerships.","As for real estate development, Liu Yutong definitely would not get involved, especially in the highest-risk, most competitive residential projects—she wouldn't touch those with a ten-foot pole.","At most, she would only participate in the cooperative development of commercial plazas.","Once the Wanlong Shopping Center model proved successful, she and Yu Mo could seek out developers who owned prime locations but lacked commercial operation experience and brand power for collaboration.","The other party would provide the assets, while they would be responsible for operations and management.","In simple terms, the partner would bear the main development and construction costs. The commercial management company, established by Yu Corporation and her Wanlong Hui Group, would be responsible for the entire project's planning, architectural design, tenant recruitment, marketing, property operations, daily management, and so on. In return, they would collect management fees, operational profit shares, brand licensing fees, etc.","This way, they could achieve rapid replication and expansion of their brand and management model with minimal investment and the lowest risk, while perfectly avoiding the issue of high debt.","To be honest, Qianda in her previous life had already been quite successful; at least in many cities, Qianda Plaza was considered a landmark.","If it weren't for the excessive debt caused by their early high-leverage expansion, they wouldn't have later been reduced to selling off core assets.","Later, Qianda also realized this and shifted to a light-asset model, but unfortunately, it was already too late by then.","If they had transitioned just a year or two earlier, they wouldn't have ended up in that situation.","The fact that Liu Yutong could conceive this light-asset model ahead of time was, frankly speaking, also because she was standing on the experience of her predecessors, allowing her to avoid falling into the pit early on.","Wanlong Supermarket, as the first industry established after the founding of the Wanlong Hui company, was also one of the industries Liu Yutong valued most.","Because it could create a large number of job opportunities, providing a livelihood guarantee for the brothers and sisters below.","Therefore, no matter what, it had to be done well, and done to the extreme.","Since she had decided on a long-term strategy and wanted to build reputation and word-of-mouth, the best approach was to take the boutique route.","In the future, the supermarket would no longer open standalone branches but would be tied to their own or cooperatively developed shopping centers.","Wherever her commercial management company opened a plaza in the future, Wanlong Supermarket would follow. This would also be the development path for other consumer businesses under the Wanlong Group's own operations.","Of course, apart from the supermarket, other consumer industry businesses could be franchised once they expanded beyond Bright Pearl City, although the franchise requirements would be stricter—quality over quantity.","Liu Yutong called Yu Mo to schedule a time for a detailed discussion.","However, Yu Mo seemed to be busy and said he would come to the university to find her tomorrow.","Liu Yutong didn't think much of it; she wasn't in a hurry about this matter anyway.","Afterwards, she called Yang Xin over and asked him to continue monitoring the renovation progress of Wanlong Plaza, make plans, coordinate with the major consumer subsidiaries, have each subsidiary select their branch locations in advance, and prepare for the renovation work.","Additionally, the tenant recruitment work for Wanlong Plaza needed to be pushed forward urgently to minimize the vacancy period for shops. Pre-leasing could start now.","Given Wanlong Hui's current reputation in Bright Pearl City, as long as they sent invitations to locally well-known brands to set up shop, they should easily agree.","After roughly reviewing the group's various documents and signing all the contracts requiring her signature, it was already getting late.","Liu Yutong planned to have a simple dinner and then return to the university to rest.","Although she had a place to live off-campus, she still sometimes stayed in the dormitory. Living alone in such a big house occasionally felt lonely.","Also, she was, after all, still a university student and needed to attend her major's required classes.","When Liu Yutong reached the first floor, she ran into an acquaintance, her childhood friend Guo Yani, who originally worked in property management.","Guo Yani was holding a box, seemingly having just come down from the office.","When she encountered Liu Yutong in the first-floor lobby, she was visibly taken aback for a moment, then instinctively tried to lower her head and avoid her.","Liu Yutong spoke first to stop her: \"Yani, just finished work? Have you eaten?\"","Guo Yani stopped, looking slightly nervous, and said, \"Yu... President Liu, not yet. I was planning to go back and cook.\"","Hearing that formal \"President Liu,\" Liu Yutong let out an almost imperceptible sigh.","Although they worked in the same building, they had hardly seen each other, and with the status gap between them, Guo Yani always seemed very reserved whenever they met.","Liu Yutong walked straight up, very naturally took the box from her and handed it to Yun Cheng beside her, then linked arms with Guo Yani.","This intimate gesture made Guo Yani's body stiffen slightly.","\"Perfect timing, I haven't eaten either. Let's go to Yu Yue Fang for a bite. It's been days since I've tasted the chefs' skills.\"","Yu Yue Fang updated its menu almost every month, and Liu Yutong often chose to eat at the restaurant.","Partly because she genuinely wanted to eat there, and partly to check if there were any issues.","Guo Yani quickly waved her hands: \"No, no, it's okay, Yutong. It's too extravagant. I can just grab something simple...\"","\"Why stand on ceremony with me?\"","Liu Yutong smiled and pulled her towards the exit: \"Just keep me company for a meal. Among our childhood friends, you're the only one in Bright Pearl City. If you don't keep me company, who will? After eating, we can go shopping. It's been ages since I last went shopping.\"","Hearing her say that, Guo Yani couldn't refuse anymore and nodded in agreement.","At first, she was still somewhat unable to relax because she had heard the rumors lately—that Liu Yutong had taken hundreds of people to raid a fairly famous hotel in Bright Pearl City some time ago.","Although she hadn't witnessed the scene herself, just hearing those rumors was frightening enough.","There were also people spreading terrifying rumors about how ruthless the Wanlong Hui young lady's methods were, and even that she had had people \"taken care of,\" and so on.","This was one of the main reasons she felt so reserved when encountering Liu Yutong.","After all, anyone would be nervous around a mafia princess, especially when the status was completely unequal.","But upon actually interacting with her, she felt that Liu Yutong seemed completely different from what was being said outside—not that scary at all.","Instead, she seemed largely unchanged from before, still the childhood friend she could talk about anything with.","Gradually, she became less tense."]},{"number":431,"title":"Chapter 431: 431. Shopping, Yu Xin is on a featured interview.","paragraphs":["Guo Yani arrived at the Yu Yue Fang university town branch in Liu Yutong's car.","They did not choose a private room.","Generally, if there was nothing specific to discuss and the dining party was small, Liu Yutong rarely opted for a private room, preferring to leave them for guests who needed them more.","Liu Yutong ordered several newly launched dishes and three hot drinks, and the three of them sat down to eat together.","As she tasted the food, she picked up the suggestion notebook provided on each table and carefully wrote down her evaluation and feedback.","Seeing her focused expression, Guo Yani couldn't help but laugh.","\"You're still the same, taking everything so seriously.\"","Liu Yutong looked up, her eyes curving like crescent moons. \"If you're going to do something, you should do it to the best of your ability. Besides, only when customers eat well and enjoy themselves can a restaurant operate successfully in the long run.\"","Hearing Liu Yutong's words, Guo Yani felt even more that those rumors were completely unreliable.","How could her childhood friend, who cared so much about the customers' dining experience, be as cold and ruthless as the rumors suggested?","It was likely just haters deliberately smearing her reputation.","After the meal,","Liu Yutong really did drag Guo Yani out shopping.","The two chatted as they strolled.","\"You know, it feels like it's been ages since we went shopping together like this.\"","\"Yeah, ever since we started high school, everyone got so busy, especially you.\"","\"Yutong, I don't know if you usually check the group chat messages, but everyone really misses talking with you. It's just that they all feel your status is different now and are afraid of disturbing you.\"","\"I know. Sometimes I look at the chats too. I want to say something, I just don't know what to say.\"","\"When I have time later, I'll treat everyone to a meal to make up for it.\"","\"They'd be over the moon. After all, the famous Chairwoman Liu treating everyone to dinner? That's a huge honor.\"","Often, the shift in relationships between people from pure to later becoming more calculating tends to start when they enter society.","During school days, everyone's status was the same, and friendships were much more genuine.","But as people grow older and their statuses change, some things can never go back to how they were. Otherwise, there wouldn't be so many people complaining that class reunions have turned into competitions of one-upmanship.","Of course, if Liu Yutong actually attended a class reunion, it's unlikely anyone would dare try to compete with her.","No matter how successful you are, could you compare to a single strand of Liu Yutong's hair?","When girls go shopping, especially in an era before online shopping was so prevalent and people weren't as homebound, their favorite places are inevitably cosmetics stores, clothing shops, and nail salons.","These two were no exception. They started by browsing the cosmetics counters, trying out the latest spring makeup collections, and helping each other pick out suitable shades.","\"This dusty rose color is lovely, it really suits you.\"","Guo Yani tried it on and her eyes lit up. \"It really is! You should try this peach shade, I think it complements your skin tone perfectly.\"","After buying skincare and cosmetics, the two walked into a clothing store.","Liu Yutong picked up an apricot-colored knit cardigan and held it up against Guo Yani. \"This would pair really well. Do you want to try it on?\"","Guo Yani glanced at the price tag and hesitated. \"It's too expensive, isn't it? Maybe forget it.\"","Liu Yutong nudged her towards the fitting room. \"Just try it on first. If it fits well, it's my treat.\"","When Guo Yani walked out after changing, Liu Yutong's eyes brightened. The apricot cardigan paired with a white top perfectly accentuated Guo Yani's gentle, soft demeanor.","\"Yani, you look absolutely stunning. Come look in the mirror, see for yourself.\"","Standing before the mirror, Guo Yani was also very pleased with the outfit.","Liu Yutong then handed her a pale pink silk scarf. \"Add this, and it'll complete the look.\"","Sure enough, with the scarf, Guo Yani's entire aura was elevated a notch.","Before Guo Yani could say anything, Liu Yutong asked the shop assistant to wrap it up.","She then turned to Guo Yani and said, \"Don't refuse. Consider it an early birthday gift from me.\"","She remembered Guo Yani's birthday was at the end of this month.","After all, since elementary school, Guo Yani had been very close to her, practically her best friend.","After buying clothes, both feeling a bit tired from shopping, they found a very high-end beauty salon to rest, and conveniently got some skincare treatments and manicures.","Liu Yutong was a premium VIP here.","The two lay on the beauty beds, chatting while enjoying the beauticians' services.","Just then, the evening news from a local TV station began playing on the wall-mounted television, and a familiar figure suddenly appeared on screen.","It was Yu Xin.","Yu Xin was being interviewed by Bright Pearl City's local TV station. The topic was about Wanhui Youxuan, a new project by an entrepreneurial university student at the Finance University.","Wanhui Youxuan's momentum had been incredibly strong lately.","With Series A funding of 50 million, its valuation had soared to over 500 million in just a few months—a feat unparalleled among recent startup projects in all of Bright Pearl City.","Bright Pearl City had indeed produced one or two major fortunes in the internet and tech fields before, but they had all been built by people hustling in big cities. Not a single one chose to base their headquarters in their hometown; at most, they'd set up a subsidiary, create a few jobs, and symbolically give back to their roots—a rather perfunctory effort.","Wanhui Youxuan was the only internet tech company in recent years to locate its headquarters in Bright Pearl City.","Normally, no local official would pass up the chance to attract more tech companies to set up shop, as the potential and comprehensive benefits of tech firms far surpass industries like real estate.","No matter how prosperous real estate is, it's essentially a one-time transaction.","For a city to develop healthily and sustainably, it must prioritize emerging industries.","Although Bright Pearl City had a good geographical location with convenient transportation, the awkward reality was that it was only a third-tier city. It struggled to attract talent to settle down and similarly found it hard to attract internet companies to put down roots.","Precisely because of this, the emergence of Wanhui Youxuan received special attention from local officials.","This level of treatment was something even Wanlong Supermarket had never received.","Under these circumstances, it was entirely normal for Yu Xin, as the person in charge of Wanhui Youxuan, to appear on TV, in newspapers, and so on.","Actually, the TV station would have preferred Liu Yutong herself to appear on camera, but she had refused all such requests.","She did not want to appear in front of the lens and had even specifically arranged for people to clean up her related information online.","At least, apart from locals in Bright Pearl City who might know her name through some hearsay, once you left Bright Pearl City, almost no one recognized her.","This, of course, was mainly at the level of the general public.","For those investors, it was hard to forget her.","In the interview, Yu Xin spoke confidently and fluently, not showing a trace of stage fright.","If you didn't see her face, you wouldn't be able to tell she was still a university student.","If you rewind to last year, no one could have imagined that the once introverted girl would undergo such a dramatic transformation.","Of course, this was also inseparable from her own efforts.","The girl who used to be too shy to speak to strangers later pushed herself by going to the wet market to haggle, nearly driving the vendors crazy.","Step by step, she had demonstrated her capabilities and risen to her current position.","What's even more remarkable is that despite being so busy, Liu Yutong still managed to rank in the top five in her major within her class.","\"Yutong, this Yu Xin is your classmate, right? She's really amazing,\" Guo Yani said sincerely.","After all, what young woman doesn't aspire to be such a confident and dazzling person?","Liu Yutong hummed in agreement and said with a touch of emotion, \"Yes, Yu Xin is truly outstanding. But you might not know, last year she was still the kind of girl who would blush and be speechless when meeting strangers.\"","\"Really?\"","Guo Yani exclaimed in surprise, \"Her transformation is incredible!\"","She felt even more admiration for Yu Xin in her heart.","Liu Yutong looked at the TV screen and suddenly asked, \"Yani, weren't you doing quite well at the property management company before? Why did you suddenly resign?\""]},{"number":432,"title":"Chapter 432: 432. Investing in a Beauty Shop.","paragraphs":["When Liu Yutong suddenly threw out that question, Guo Yani, beside her, gave a slight tremble.","Her expression turned somewhat unnatural as she said, \"Actually, there's no special reason. I just felt that job wasn't really suitable for me.\"","Liu Yutong turned sideways and made a pause gesture to the beautician, signaling her to stop for a moment.","Then she looked at Guo Yani again, speaking earnestly, \"We've known each other for so many years. Do you really think I can't tell when you're lying? Tell me, what really happened?\"","Guo Yani bit her lip tightly, hesitating for a good while before saying, \"I might... might be getting married.\"","Liu Yutong: \"???\"","She was a bit surprised, but didn't overthink it.","\"You're seeing someone? You've kept that hidden pretty deep, even from me.\"","In their area, especially in the countryside, people generally married quite early. It wasn't uncommon to get married right after coming of age, so she didn't find Guo Yani's impending marriage strange in itself.","\"Are you going to another city to work with your partner?\"","Guo Yani first shook her head, then nodded. \"I didn't mean to hide it from you all. It was an introduction my family arranged during the New Year. You know, my dad is somewhat disabled, can't do heavy work. All these years, our family has relied entirely on my mom to hold things together. The other family's circumstances are quite good, and they're willing to offer a higher bride price...\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong unconsciously furrowed her brow.","\"Yani, marriage is a lifelong commitment. I don't think you should agree to it so hastily. What's more, there's no emotional connection between you two. At the very least, you should get to know each other first, understand what kind of person he really is, before making a decision. It's not too late, is it?\"","Guo Yani said, \"I went to see his place. His family is from Xing Town, runs a small business there. He seemed quite honest.\"","“As for feelings, I think that can develop slowly over time.”","To be honest, as she said this, she felt genuine envy... no, it should be said admiration, for Liu Yutong from the bottom of her heart.","Back when Liu Yutong's gambler of a father had privately sold her off to be the wife of the village head's son, Wang Ergou, she too had hoped Liu Yutong would refuse, that she wouldn't resign herself to marrying like that.","Later, Liu Yutong actually did it, and with such forceful and ruthless methods, she even managed to send her own father and that 'fiancé's' whole family to jail.","It stunned the entire village.","The day she got the news, she was genuinely happy for Liu Yutong and admired her immensely.","It was truly amazing. She felt Liu Yutong was really living life on her own terms.","Originally, she thought she could be like Liu Yutong, break free from constraints, and walk her own path.","But when her family arranged the blind date after the New Year, she realized that facing the pressure of reality and her family's expectations, she ultimately lacked the courage to burn her bridges.","Liu Yutong seemed to think of something and asked, \"Is it because of your brother's situation? You don't need to worry about that. He can be considered as having made a meritorious contribution, and he didn't gain much actual benefit. Probation should still be possible.\"","\"Of course, if you don't want him to get probation, I can also have someone make sure he serves the full sentence.\"","Guo Yani: \"...\"","\"No, no, probation is good, probation is good.\"","Her brother, Guo Longzhi, though a bit idle and not tending to proper business, was a total doting brother who treated her very well.","She naturally didn't want to see her brother actually go to jail.","People say jail builds character, but really serving time would also carry a bad reputation in the village. They'd definitely be pointed at and gossiped about, unable to hold their heads up for a lifetime.","Liu Yutong pondered for a moment before speaking again. \"Alright then. Your brother's matter can also be considered as indirectly helping me. I'll give you two choices now.\"","\"First, regarding that man, I can have someone inquire about his character for you, see if he's truly reliable. If he's a good person and you get along well, then I'll give you a red envelope. It's not a huge amount, but it can temporarily solve your family's difficulties.\"","\"The second choice: I remember you really wanted to open your own beauty salon, right? If you're willing, I can invest and help you open one. You'll manage it, I'll just collect the profits. The shares would be 70% for me, 30% for you. You might have a harder time, but this would be your own business. If you do it well, it can not only help your family gradually improve but also make you truly independent.\"","Guo Yani was stunned upon hearing the second choice.","She hadn't expected Liu Yutong to still remember what she said when she first started working.","Back when she left school, she had joked with Liu Yutong, saying she would work hard to earn money, open a beauty and nail salon, be her own little boss, and live a carefree, happy life.","At that time, she naively believed that just by working hard for a while, she could save enough money to realize her dream.","However, reality was...","Her first salary was six hundred, later eight hundred, and even now it's only a little over a thousand, maybe two thousand at most, and that was only because the property manager raised it out of consideration for Liu Yutong.","That kind of money, forget opening a shop, even saving it was difficult.","It was precisely these two years of experience after starting work that she gradually realized something: back in school days, even a bit more effort, the probability of getting into a first-tier university was probably higher than the chance of earning enough to open a shop now.","This was also why she admired Liu Yutong and admired Yu Xin, who was being interviewed on TV.","They were all around the same age, yet the gap was so vast.","It wasn't that she had no regrets.","If she had persisted a little more, worked a bit harder back then, insisted on going to university, would she be better now?","Unfortunately, there's no medicine for regret in this world.","Of course, she didn't know that even if she hadn't dropped out of school back then and had broken through her family's layers of obstacles to attend university, she might not necessarily be better off than she is now.","Because she lacked a benefactor.","Seeing her hesitation persist, Liu Yutong asked again, \"Have you decided?\"","Then she pointed at Yu Xin being interviewed on TV. \"Haven't you always admired and looked up to her? But do you know, when she first went to the market to practice bargaining, she was so nervous her whole body trembled, even felt socially dead for a time. No one is born knowing how to succeed. Often, it's forced out of you.\"","\"Now, I'm forcing you once, giving you two choices. One is comfort, the other is challenge. Which path to choose is up to you, but whichever you choose, I will help you.\"","\"Also, before making your choice, I hope you know that life doesn't always offer choices. You're not even twenty yet. The fact that you still have a choice now means you should consider yourself lucky.\"","Guo Yani was completely moved by Liu Yutong's words and gradually made up her mind. She looked up at her and said, \"Yutong, I've decided. I won't get married. I want to open the shop! I choose the second path. No matter how hard or difficult it is, I accept it!\"","\"Only, I probably can't open it right away. I want to find a shop to learn at for a while, understand how operations work before opening my own.\"","Liu Yutong smiled. \"That's simple.\"","She directly said to the beautician, \"Call your boss over. I'm buying this shop.\"","Guo Yani: \"...\"","The beautician: \"...\"","It felt so sudden. Who would have thought that chatting would lead to their boss being replaced?"]},{"number":433,"title":"Chapter 433: 433, Investing in Games","paragraphs":["The facts proved that Liu Yutong wasn't just making an empty promise.","She was serious.","Not only did she directly buy out the entire shop, but she even kept the original owner as part of the package deal.","Having received the money, the former owner wasn't sure what to do next, so he agreed to stay on temporarily to help out around the shop.","Currently, this shop made a couple hundred thousand a year without much trouble, an income level that basically surpassed 95% of ordinary people in Mingzhu City.","Generally speaking, for a shop this profitable, the owner wouldn't easily transfer it. Those wanting to sell were either failing or making too little.","But Liu Yutong offered a very high price. The owner agreed almost without hesitation and even promised to properly mentor Guo Yani and help her run the shop well.","By the time the two of them left the shop, Guo Yani felt like she was dreaming.","Had her dream just come true so suddenly?","Having money really is wonderful!","Of course, her dream had now changed; it couldn't be limited to the current situation, or else she would be letting down her childhood friend's trust too much.","She planned to enroll in an adult undergraduate program later, managing the shop while improving herself, determined not to muddle through life aimlessly like before.","Guo Yani didn't let Liu Yutong drive her back to her place.","Before parting, she suddenly remembered something and said, \"Yutong, when I went to resign from the manager today, I ran into a few people who seemed to be asking about Wanhui Youxuan.\"","Liu Yutong nodded: \"I know. They might be looking to discuss cooperation.\"","Now that Wanhui Youxuan was developing better and better, it was common for some businesses or partners to actively seek them out for collaboration.","After saying goodbye to Guo Yani, Liu Yutong went straight back to school.","Yun Cheng dropped her off at the school gate before heading back.","She walked alone, unhurriedly, along the campus path.","Although it was already late, she could still see students in twos and threes passing by her, chatting and laughing, their faces brimming with the unique vitality of campus life.","This also allowed Liu Yutong to enjoy a rare, distinct kind of tranquility.","Being at school was when she felt most relaxed.","Just as she was nearing the vicinity of the dormitory building, a middle-aged man's voice came from behind: \"Is that student Liu Yutong?\"","Liu Yutong turned to see a gentlemanly middle-aged man walking towards her with a smile. It was Vice President Zhang, in charge of academic affairs.","However, this year Vice President Zhang had taken on an additional responsibility: handling alumni relations, and he would be especially busy this year.","Because this year happened to be the 50th anniversary of the University of Finance and Economics, and a grand celebration would be held.","\"Hello, President Zhang,\" Liu Yutong politely stopped and greeted him.","\"It really is you. I thought it looked like you from afar.\"","Vice President Zhang walked up close, his smile particularly warm: \"Lately, I've been seeing news about your Wanhui Youxuan frequently. You're really bringing honor to our school!\"","\"You flatter me, President. We're still working hard,\" Liu Yutong replied modestly with a smile.","\"Ah, this isn't just politeness, it's the truth.\"","Vice President Zhang waved his hand, then changed the subject: \"Since I've run into you, let me mention something. In a few months, it will be our school's 50th-anniversary celebration. The school wants to take this opportunity to establish an 'Innovation and Entrepreneurship Fund' to support and incubate student teams with ideas and drive, just like yours.\"","\"I wonder if you'd be interested in learning more? Of course, it's completely voluntary.\"","Liu Yutong immediately understood the vice president's intention. She barely hesitated before agreeing readily: \"This is a wonderful initiative. My alma mater nurtured me, and now that there's a chance to give back, I'll definitely support it. Let the Wanlong Hui Group provide the first round of funding for the fund's launch.\"","Whether Vice President Zhang genuinely wanted to promote and cultivate more university student entrepreneurs or was simply after political achievements, she would agree.","Only a fool would refuse.","If this entrepreneurship fund could really be run well and truly cultivate some entrepreneurial talent, then she would have the inherent advantage to invest first and bring both the talent and the startup teams into her fold.","Hearing this, Vice President Zhang's smile grew even more amiable: \"Excellent! I knew student Liu was a visionary and responsible entrepreneur. On behalf of the school, I thank you first. This is truly timely help for those senior students!\"","Liu Yutong: \"It's the least I should do.\"","Vice President Zhang nodded: \"By the way, this year's anniversary celebration will be very grand. I plan to recommend you, student Liu, as the current student representative to give a speech on stage representing our student body. It's a great opportunity.\"","A flicker of understanding passed through Liu Yutong's eyes, but she wasn't averse to this kind of speaking engagement at school.","After all, it was a great chance to be seen by many important leaders, completely different from those messy interviews outside.","After a moment's thought, she agreed gracefully: \"Thank you, President, for giving me this opportunity. It's my honor. I will prepare seriously and strive not to disappoint the school and your expectations.\"","\"Good, good, good!\"","Vice President Zhang's smile became even more satisfied: \"Then it's settled. Once the anniversary preparation committee finalizes the detailed plan, I'll have my secretary contact you with the specific arrangements.\"","\"Okay, President Zhang.\"","Liu Yutong thought of something and added: \"Oh, President, I wonder if you're free tomorrow? Last year, I mentioned setting up a student aid fund. There are some details I still need to discuss with you.\"","\"Of course, I'm free.\"","President Zhang thought for a moment and set a time: \"Then let's make it tomorrow at 3 PM. I'll wait for you in my office, and we can talk in detail then.\"","\"Alright, President Zhang. See you tomorrow.\"","\"See you tomorrow!\"","After exchanging a few more pleasantries with Vice President Zhang, Liu Yutong turned and went back to her dorm.","Inside the dorm, the other three were all there.","Ling Yan still had that cool, detached demeanor, but upon seeing Liu Yutong enter, she still obediently said hello.","Lin Lele was lying in bed reading a book, though her mental state didn't look too good.","Li Xiaohui seemed to be chatting in a group message, looking animated. When she saw Liu Yutong return, she immediately climbed down from her bed.","\"Yutong-jie! My Purple Lord team made it to the finals! Your captain is amazing, right? Hohoho~\"","Seeing Li Xiaohui's excited look, Liu Yutong smiled: \"Amazing, amazing. Our Captain Li is the most amazing.\"","\"By the way, with esports competitions being so popular now, how has the recent revenue been for our Huangquan Esports?\"","She suddenly asked Li Xiaohui about this to see if she had been neglecting her duties for pleasure, focusing only on gaming and ignoring the internet cafe management.","Mentioning this got Li Xiaohui even more excited.","\"You're asking the right person! Our internet cafe's revenue is exploding. Yutong-jie, you have no idea, just the tips and revenue sharing this month have doubled compared to last month.\"","\"Yutong-jie, you wouldn't believe it. In a small place like our Mingzhu City, there are so many rich people hiding. One guy actually spent over a hundred thousand in tips at our cafe. I couldn't bear to tip that much myself.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Really? Sounds like you've found a sugar daddy then. But I should remind you, this kind of event can't last forever. Running the internet cafe well is the real foundation.\"","Li Xiaohui nodded repeatedly: \"I know, I'm not planning to run esports tournaments long-term anyway. It's mainly because the game's official company is too stingy. Our tournament videos went viral online, which is basically free advertising for their game. Yet the official company won't spend a single cent, and now they're planning to start their own professional league. That means our tournament will definitely lose its appeal in the future. It's a lot of effort for no reward.\"","\"Yutong, how about we develop a similar type of game ourselves? Then if we run tournaments, we won't be doing all the work just to benefit someone else.\"","\"I've made up my mind. My second project later will be investing in a game, specifically an FPS game. What do you think?\"","Liu Yutong: \".........\""]},{"number":434,"title":"Chapter 434: 434. Lin Lele Is Not Acting Like Herself.","paragraphs":["Li Xiaohui having such an idea did not surprise Liu Yutong in the slightest.","However, given the current circumstances, it's definitely not feasible to invest in it.","The primary issue is the technical aspect. This isn't as simple as building a website, which is relatively much easier and could be handled by someone like Xiao Bin and his team.","But game development is completely different; it requires a much more professional team.","Currently, there are very few teams domestically with mature experience in 3D engine development and the capability for large-scale FPS projects. The barrier to independent research and development is simply too high for them.","Moreover, even if they could develop something now, it might not stand a chance against FPS games like CF.","User habits and market environments differ in every era.","Take the wildly popular 'Valorant' from her past life as an example. From the perspective of current technology, market conditions, and user habits, even if they had the ability to recreate it, snatching users away from CF would be extremely difficult.","Big Goose Company now possesses the largest user base and a near-monopoly on distribution channels. The difficulty for a new game to take a bite out of its market share is easy to imagine.","Furthermore, the Wanlong Hui Group isn't as wealthy as Big Goose.","Developing a large-scale PC game, from project initiation to testing, would take at least a year or two; it's too time-consuming and burns through too much money.","Therefore, to truly get a foot in this field, two things need to be done first.","First, create a social software platform that can rival Big Goose, to control their own traffic gateway.","Second, make money, lots of it!","There are just too many places needing funds right now.","The Wanlong Shopping Center is under renovation, costing at least tens of millions, even up to a hundred million, and this project cannot be halted.","The group also holds several plots of land awaiting development—one to be built into employee housing, another for the group headquarters. These plots can't be left idle indefinitely.","They also require massive capital investment.","Wanhui Youxuan has already secured investment, but it's still far from being profitable. If it weren't for the investment they secured, the group would have had to pour a significant amount of money into it.","The supermarkets and restaurants are indeed making money, but that income is still far from sufficient to cover the group's overall expenditures.","As for Mingzhu Capital, while they managed to raise some funds from members through the connections of Lin Muyang and Yu Mo, it only amounts to tens of millions in total. Part of it was invested into Wanhui Youxuan, and the rest was used by Lin Muyang to purchase various copyrights.","This leaves Liu Yutong with few choices: either seek financing or take out loans. For now, those are the only two paths available.","Of course, she actually has a bold plan in mind that could generate a lot of money in a short time, but the required startup capital is enormous; she can't do it alone.","She needs to bring more people on board, preferably those with some influence abroad as well.","In short, Liu Yutong herself is also worrying about money.","The bigger the ventures she expands into, the more she feels the money isn't enough.","Unless the group can have a project that consistently generates profits and can also support other projects, for now, they can only proceed step by step according to the established plan.","Games are actually a great choice, but it's just not feasible right now.","At least FPS games aren't.","Hearing Li Xiaohui suddenly want to invest in games, Liu Yutong replied, \"Xiaohui, regarding the game matter, I can support you, but we need to solve the funding issue first. You understand that, right?\"","Li Xiaohui nodded. \"I know, Yutong-jie. With our big family business now, money is needed everywhere. Don't worry, I'm just thinking out loud for now. I'll definitely focus on doing well with the internet cafe part first and try to earn more money.\"","Seeing how sensible Li Xiaohui was, Liu Yutong smiled with relief.","It was getting late. She told Xiaohui to go back to bed and, after a quick wash-up herself, returned to her own bunk.","She checked her phone messages for a while, flipped through a book, and soon fell asleep.","Roughly a few hours later.","Li Xiaohui and Ling Yan were already sound asleep.","But Liu Yutong, in a half-asleep state, was awakened by a series of intermittent, muffled sounds.","She was a light sleeper to begin with, easily roused by the slightest noise.","At first, she was groggy and thought it was Li Xiaohui grinding her teeth.","After all, this girl did tend to grind her teeth in her sleep, a loud, grating sound. Liu Yutong would usually put a mouthguard in her mouth whenever she heard it.","Subconsciously, Liu Yutong felt for the mouthguard she always kept by her pillow, ready to solve Li Xiaohui's teeth-grinding problem as usual.","But just as she reached out, she paused.","That's not right.","This sound wasn't teeth grinding.","It was crying.","Lin Lele.","The usually cheerful and adorable girl was now tightly wrapped in her blanket, curled into a small ball.","From inside the blanket came waves of barely suppressed, almost breaking sobs, accompanied by a sense of struggling to catch her breath.","Realizing something was wrong, Liu Yutong quietly climbed down from her bed, walked over to Lin Lele's bedside, and reached out to pat her.","\"Lele?\"","\"What's wrong? Did you have a nightmare? Or are you feeling unwell somewhere?\"","The crying under the blanket abruptly stopped, followed by sounds of panic.","\"N-no... it's nothing, Monitor. I'm sorry I woke you up.\"","\"I'll be fine soon, really, I'm sorry...\"","This didn't sound like 'nothing' at all.","Liu Yutong didn't leave. She remained by the bedside, comforting her. \"Don't be afraid, it's okay. What happened? Tell me. Did you run into some difficulty? Let's figure it out together. It's better than keeping it bottled up alone.\"","Faced with this sudden concern, Lin Lele finally couldn't hold back anymore. She slowly peeked out from under the blanket.","Her eyes were swollen like two ripe peaches, her face streaked with tears, and strands of hair were stuck to her cheeks and forehead by the tears. She looked utterly pitiful.","\"Monitor, I think I've been scammed!\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Come down. Let's talk outside, so we don't disturb Xiaohui and the others.\"","Lin Lele hesitated for a moment, then climbed down from her bed.","Liu Yutong casually picked up her coat and draped it over herself, put on an outer garment, and, holding her hand, quietly opened the dorm door and walked out.","The two walked to the window ledge at the end of the corridor.","It was some distance from the dorm rooms, so talking wouldn't disturb others.","\"Tell me. How were you scammed?\"","Perhaps because Liu Yutong held too much prestige in the class and at school, Lin Lele didn't dare to hide it. She told Liu Yutong what had happened in a fragmented manner.","It turned out that, wanting to ease the burden on her family, she had been looking for part-time jobs.","Not long ago, through a Big Goose group chat, she came into contact with a so-called high-end tutoring platform. The website looked quite professional, claiming that by becoming a VIP member, one would get priority access to high-paying, reliable tutoring jobs.","VIP membership fees ranged from tens to hundreds, with higher levels supposedly granting access to better information.","Lin Lele, with a try-it-out mindset, first paid for a junior VIP membership. Sure enough, she received several contact details and even successfully landed an online video tutoring job.","Being able to teach through online videos without even leaving home was an ideal part-time job for her, incredibly convenient too.","Things went quite smoothly at first, with a daily income of seventy or eighty yuan.","But when she wanted to withdraw her earnings, problems arose. Customer service informed her that the withdrawal amount had to reach a minimum of 1,000 yuan to be processed, citing easier financial management.","Later, the customer service contacted her again, saying that if she wanted unlimited withdrawal privileges, she needed to upgrade to a premium VIP membership.","If she was short on funds for the upgrade, she could also recommend classmates to register and deposit money. This way, she could not only earn back her own membership fee but also receive a commission from their deposits. Using that commission to fund the upgrade would be even more cost-effective.","It was this scam, later overused to the point of cliché, that step by step pushed Lin Lele toward the abyss."]},{"number":435,"title":"Chapter 435: 435. Familiar Scams","paragraphs":["Lin Lele, desperate to withdraw her earnings, began frantically recommending this tutoring platform to classmates who also wanted to do part-time work.","As a class monitor, she already had some persuasive power. Coupled with the fact that online tutoring sounded convenient and profitable, many were swayed and, following her recommendation, paid for VIP memberships.","\"I truly believed I could help everyone earn some extra pocket money. I even created a small group chat to share tips. It wasn't until a few days ago when someone told me she had spent eight hundred yuan on a premium VIP membership, only to have her funds frozen.\"","\"That's when we all discovered that no one could withdraw their money anymore. Some were even tricked by customer service into depositing another two or three thousand yuan to 'unfreeze' their accounts...\"","\"Monitor, I didn't mean to. I really didn't know they were scammers. But now so many classmates have been cheated because of me, over thirty thousand yuan in total. They're all asking me what to do. Some are calling me a scammer in the group chat, threatening to report me to the counselor, accusing me of fraud. Will I be expelled? How can I possibly repay them? If my parents find out...\"","Lin Lele was now in tears, unable to continue.","Liu Yutong listened quietly, her expression growing increasingly grave.","This scheme sounded all too familiar, almost identical to a scam she had fallen for right after graduation in her previous life.","It was the same step-by-step manipulation that had swindled her out of several thousand yuan meant for living expenses.","She hadn't expected this type of fraud to appear in this era already.","Frankly, for university students like them who hadn't yet entered society and lacked experience, such scams were incredibly hard to guard against.","Forget whether Lin Lele could afford to cover the losses; if the university found out, she would likely face disciplinary action, or even potential legal trouble.","For a girl who had just started university, this was no different from the sky falling.","For someone with weaker mental fortitude, the despair could even lead to thoughts of a drastic, irreversible path.","Seeing Lin Lele's emotional state deteriorating further, Liu Yutong spoke up.","\"Alright, Lele, calm down.\"","\"Crying and being scared won't solve anything. Now, listen to me and do exactly as I say.\"","Lin Lele nodded desperately, as if clutching a lifeline.","\"First, immediately take screenshots of all your chat logs with the customer service, the website URL, your transfer records, and your promotion history. Also, the chat history in that small group you created is crucial evidence. Save everything.\"","\"Second, first thing tomorrow morning, I'll arrange for a lawyer to accompany you to the police station to file a report and get a case acknowledgment receipt. Regardless of whether the money can be recovered, this shows your stance. It proves to your classmates that you are also a victim and are actively addressing the issue, not an accomplice who intentionally defrauded them.\"","\"Third, proactively contact every classmate who suffered losses because of you. Apologize sincerely first, then inform them you've reported it to the police. Remember, the apology must be genuine—attitude is everything. Tell them you will take responsibility for compensating their losses.\"","Lin Lele: \"But Monitor, I... I don't have that much money right now...\"","Liu Yutong: \"I'll lend you the money.\"","\"It's over thirty thousand, right? Tomorrow, I'll have someone bring it to you. Use it immediately to compensate your classmates and cover their losses first.\"","\"Also, you need to make amends for your mistake. Our university has twenty to thirty thousand students across all campuses. Since you encountered these scammers, others might too. First, resign from your position as class monitor. Then, proactively contact the student union and the academic affairs office. Turn your experience into an anti-fraud case study and give presentations in various classes and clubs, using your personal story to warn everyone about such scams.\"","\"Remember, this isn't a punishment. It's another form of responsibility and duty. You have an obligation to do this.\"","Lin Lele was completely stunned.","She had expected to be scolded by the monitor after confessing.","She never imagined that not only would the monitor offer the money without hesitation to help her through this crisis, but also point her toward a path to redeem herself.","\"Monitor... I... I really don't know how to thank you.\"","\"I was wrong, I truly know I was wrong. I'll listen to you. I'll do this properly, warn everyone not to be fooled, and I'll work my hardest to repay you as soon as possible!\"","Liu Yutong: \"Knowing you were wrong and having the courage to face it and make amends is what matters most.\"","\"Don't worry about the money for now. Repay it when you're able. For now, go back and get some proper sleep. Starting tomorrow, handle things one step at a time.\"","By the time she finally managed to comfort Lin Lele, it was almost 3 AM.","The girl tossed and turned until after 4 AM before gradually falling asleep, but Liu Yutong found herself wide awake.","Her mind kept circling around the issue of part-time jobs.","Actually, Wanhui Youxuan already offered quite a few part-time opportunities for university students, but it still couldn't meet everyone's needs.","For instance, the call center had added many temporary positions, and delivery jobs, though tough, could still earn you living expenses if you were willing.","But apparently, it still wasn't enough.","Perhaps they could add a local tutoring section on Wanhui Youxuan to enrich the local services and give students more part-time options.","Of course, it would involve a fee.","But at least with Wanhui Youxuan running the platform, it would ensure neither students nor parents got scammed, so charging a small fee would be justified.","If it took off, it could be a good way to expand the platform's user base.","But the most important thing right now was to catch the website scammers.","Liu Yutong could have simply helped Lin Lele solve her immediate problem and left it at that.","Yet this incident had stirred up her worst memories from her past life.","She truly, utterly despised scammers, even more than those enemies of Zhao Tianxing.","Fresh out into the world in her past life, she had been swindled out of all her living expenses by a similar scheme. Her reaction back then was much like Lin Lele's—she felt she couldn't breathe, suffocating, as if she were dying.","Such online fraud was notoriously hard to trace, leaving it as an unresolved grievance in her heart.","In her past life, if not for a close friend who counseled her through it, she might have done something reckless back then.","She never expected to encounter an almost identical scam so much earlier in this life.","If she remembered correctly, many scammers at this time were still operating domestically, not yet having moved their operations overseas as they did later in her past life.","Especially these kinds of phishing website operations targeting students—the technical barrier was relatively low. They were likely hiding somewhere within the country.","As everyone knows, she was never one to hold a grudge, especially over things that happened in a past life.","In this life, she was determined to round up that gang of fraudsters once and for all!","The next morning.","Liu Yutong didn't immediately send someone to take Lin Lele to the police station. Instead, she first contacted Xiao Bin and Zhao Tianyi.","At the same time.","An outrageously arrogant second-generation heir summoned Yu Xin to a meeting.","He brazenly demanded to buy out all remaining shares of Wanhui Youxuan at a shockingly low price."]},{"number":436,"title":"Chapter 436: 436. Radio Advertising Cooperation.","paragraphs":["Yu Xin had been overwhelmingly busy lately, scarcely any less so than Liu Yutong.","Today, following a previously scheduled appointment, she met with the provincial television station's deputy director in charge of advertising to discuss cooperation on ad placements.","Although, from a future perspective, radio and TV stations might seem almost obsolete, nearly phased out by the times.","In the present day, however, television remains one of the most prominent channels for exposure.","Even as the number of domestic internet users rapidly grows, television media still possesses unparalleled penetration.","Especially for Wanhui Youxuan's current focus on the local lifestyle platform, securing cooperation with the provincial television station is quite necessary.","Of course, their ultimate goal was to place a few dozen seconds of advertising during prime time on the capital's television network, but the cost there was simply too high for them to afford at the moment.","Therefore, they decided to start with the provincial station.","Cooperation with local stations like those in Bright Pearl City was relatively straightforward, and ad placements there had already been arranged. It was the provincial satellite channel that hadn't been finalized yet.","After all, their provincial satellite channel ranked quite well nationally and had decent viewership ratings.","Generally speaking, without some personal connections, it wouldn't be easy to secure a deal, especially for prime-time ad slots.","Through an introduction from a leader in Bright Pearl City's publicity department, Yu Xin obtained the contact information and even learned about the hobbies of the provincial TV station's deputy director overseeing advertising.","The deputy director's name was Bi Jin. His hobby was calligraphy, with a particular fondness for collecting Hui-style ink sticks.","Accordingly, Yu Xin prepared a gift for him: a high-quality, newly made She inkstone, paired with a set of Hu writing brushes.","Originally, she planned to visit Deputy Director Bi at the television station.","Since this was their first meeting, and given his position at the station, it seemed more appropriate for such a business discussion to first take place at his workplace. Inviting him for a meal later, once they were more familiar, would be the proper procedure.","Unexpectedly, when scheduling the meeting over the phone, he proactively suggested meeting outside.","This took her somewhat by surprise.","However, she understood that the chances of reaching an agreement might be higher in a private setting, so she made preparations accordingly.","Yu Xin chose a private kitchen restaurant with a good local reputation, which, incidentally, she found through Wanhui Youxuan.","Wanhui Youxuan now had a review system. Even if local businesses hadn't activated delivery services on the platform, as long as their information was listed, people could still leave reviews.","This feature was somewhat similar to later platforms like Yelp.","Knowing that people within the system often cared about face, Yu Xin made a point of arriving early to wait at the restaurant entrance.","Soon, she met Bi Jin, the provincial station's deputy director in charge of advertising.","He appeared to be around forty, with neatly combed hair parted to the side, wearing a bureaucratic smile and possessing the particular cautiousness characteristic of leaders within the system.","After a brief exchange of pleasantries, Yu Xin led him into the reserved private room and they took their seats.","\"President Yu is truly young and accomplished,\" Bi Jin remarked, genuinely surprised that the general manager of Wanlong Technology was so young, even excessively so.","She looked probably only eighteen or nineteen, an age when one should typically be a freshman or sophomore in university, yet she already held the position of general manager.","He couldn't help but think that his own daughter didn't seem much younger than this girl in front of him and was still quite immature.","Of course, this surprise stemmed from him not having paid attention to any interviews related to Yu Xin before.","\"You flatter me, Deputy Director Bi. I just had good luck to become the general manager,\" Yu Xin said modestly.","\"Ah, don't be so modest! Achieving what you have at this age is truly remarkable.\"","Deputy Director Bi then flipped through the Wanhui Youxuan materials Yu Xin handed over. \"Your model is quite innovative, combining online and offline, targeting household lifestyle services. It has great development potential. However, placing ads on our station isn't cheap, and we have high requirements for partner brands. A comprehensive assessment is still needed...\"","Yu Xin smiled. How could she not understand the implied meaning in his words?","Put simply, whether and how the ads could be placed largely depended on his say.","Yu Xin took out the prepared gift bag and pushed it towards him. \"Deputy Director Bi, a small token for our first meeting, not worthy of your esteem. I heard you enjoy calligraphy. As a junior who knows little about this, I asked a friend to find a new inkstone and a set of brushes, hoping they might add a bit of enjoyment to your leisurely practice. Please don't think poorly of it.\"","Her words were very well-chosen, specifically emphasizing that it was a new inkstone, not an antique, of modest value, focusing on the sentiment, implying it would be acceptable to accept.","Bi Jin didn't refuse immediately. He just smiled, took it, and opened it for a look.","Being something of a connoisseur in this area, he immediately recognized the She inkstone's fine, smooth texture and elegant craftsmanship. Though newly made, it was certainly no ordinary item. The set of Hu brushes was also of superior quality.","This gift was clearly chosen with careful thought, catering to his interests without being so overt as to cause gossip.","It was only then that he began to regard this girl, who looked under twenty, with more seriousness.","To reach such a position at such a young age, she was indeed no ordinary person.","Just a pity...","Bi Jin pushed the gift back.","\"President Yu, you're too kind. I won't accept this gift.\"","Seeing the gift returned, Yu Xin was somewhat surprised.","She could sense that this deputy director actually quite liked the gift she had chosen.","Yet now he had refused.","There was probably something else at play.","Yu Xin kept a smile on her face, exchanged more polite words with him, and only after confirming his insistence on not accepting the gift did she take it back.","You can't force a fruit to be sweet; doing one's best is enough.","Although Bi Jin had refused Yu Xin's gift, he still showed interest in Wanhui Youxuan and initiated further conversation.","Yu Xin discussed the platform's positioning and development ideas with him, even touching on advertising costs.","For the provincial satellite channel's prime time slot, specifically the period after 8 PM when major TV series air, a 20-second ad spot cost around twenty thousand yuan per day, and even that required bidding. Airing twice a day would mean a baseline cost of over a million yuan per month.","This price sounded expensive, but compared to the capital's television network, it was small potatoes.","A 10-second ad during prime time on the capital's network cost at least tens of millions, even hundreds of millions, per month.","After all, the capital's network reached the entire nation, covering an exceptionally vast user base.","They simply didn't have the capability to place ads there yet and had to settle for the next best option.","Just as Yu Xin was trying to negotiate for a prime-time ad slot, mid-conversation with Bi Jin...","Suddenly!","A young man wearing a flashy pink jacket, with dyed pink spiky hair, pushed the door open with a laugh.","Behind him followed another young man and a young woman, both quite handsome and pretty.","\"Uncle Jin, sorry I'm late.\""]},{"number":437,"title":"Chapter 437: 437. Threat","paragraphs":["\"Uncle Jin, sorry I'm late!\"","The young man greeted him and then casually took a seat between Yu Xin and Bi Jin. He helped himself to the decanted red wine on the table, pouring a glass.","Then, he gestured with his chin towards the young man and woman behind him. \"This is my Uncle Jin, the Director of the Provincial Radio Station.\"","\"Uncle Bi, these are both my friends. They're quite popular in the industry right now. I hope you can look out for them in the future.\"","The man and woman immediately greeted Bi Jin respectfully, their tones laced with a hint of flattery.","\"Director, hello!\"","\"Director, hello!\"","Bi Jin merely gave a faint nod.","To be honest, his impression of these two minor celebrities was far less favorable than his impression of Yu Xin, who sat diagonally across from him.","Yu Xin was quite attractive too, and compared to these two overly polished and powdered stars, she was more intelligent, possessing an innate air of confidence.","This was something those two couldn't hope to match.","Yu Xin had also recognized the pair. The girl was a rising starlet who had recently gained attention in a youth idol drama. The young man also looked familiar, seemingly a singer from some talent show.","\"Xiao Chen, what are you doing here? Can't you see I'm discussing business?\" Bi Jin said.","Xue Chen replied nonchalantly, \"Just came here for dinner with my friends.\"","\"Uncle Jin, who is this beauty? You're not being fair, keeping such a pretty lady to yourself for a date without telling me. I had to come find you myself and catch you red-handed, hahaha...\"","Bi Jin frowned. \"Don't talk nonsense. This is President Yu from Wanlong Technology. We're here on business. President Yu, this is Xue Chen, the son of an old superior of mine. Young people speak their minds, please don't mind him.\"","Yu Xin smiled slightly. \"It's fine. I can see Young Master Xue is a straightforward person, speaking his mind.\"","Hearing this, Xue Chen wasn't offended at all. Instead, he chuckled heartily. \"Haha, beautiful lady, I'll take that as a compliment.\"","He leaned forward, staring at Yu Xin. \"I've heard of your 'Wanhui Youxuan'. I just never expected the president to be so young and beautiful. Impressive!\"","His tone clearly carried a condescending air.","The young starlet who had just sat down also chimed in with a flattering laugh. \"Young Master Chen is absolutely right. President Yu is truly both beautiful and elegant.\"","Xue Chen obviously enjoyed this, smiling smugly before getting straight to the point. \"Beautiful Miss Yu, your Wanhui Youxuan is doing quite well. So, interested in collaborating on something else? I have plenty of resources on my end.\"","Yu Xin asked calmly, without showing her hand, \"What kind of collaboration do you have in mind?\"","\"I want to...\"","Xue Chen suddenly became coy. \"How about we have a drink first? Whether we can collaborate depends on how well the drinks go down. Someone as beautiful as you, President Yu, must have a good tolerance, right? Come on, let me propose a toast to celebrate our meeting!\"","With that, he filled Yu Xin's glass to the brim, then raised his own, looking at her with an air of insistence that brooked no refusal.","Yu Xin looked at the nearly overflowing glass of red wine before her, the smile on her face fading a little.","She did not reach for the glass. Instead, she met Xue Chen's gaze head-on, not yielding an inch.","\"Young Master Xue, I apologize. My alcohol tolerance isn't great. I'm afraid I'll disappoint you.\"","Xue Chen clearly wasn't buying it, and his tone hardened. \"President Yu, that's not very gracious, is it? In this circle, who doesn't drink? Look, even my Uncle Jin is here. Won't you even give him this little bit of face? Or do you look down on me, Xue Chen?\"","Seeing the atmosphere turn sour, Bi Jin wanted to smooth things over. After all, it was because of Xue Chen's request that he had changed the meeting venue today.","Xue Chen's sudden appearance, claiming it was a coincidence, was all an act. In fact, the person who really wanted to meet Yu Xin was Xue Chen himself.","Bi Jin was only helping him out of respect for his father.","Precisely because of this, he didn't want to see Xue Chen go too far.","\"Xiao Chen, President Yu is a lady. If she can't drink, let it be. You should focus on discussing business...\"","Hearing Bi Jin say this, Yu Xin understood completely why the other party hadn't chosen the radio station for their first meeting. It seemed this Xue Chen was the one who truly wanted to see her.","This visitor meant no good!","\"Uncle Jin, please don't worry about this.\"","Xue Chen cut Bi Jin off, his eyes fixed intently on Yu Xin as he continued, \"President Yu, you're not going to refuse even a single glass with me, are you? Around here, not many dare to refuse me this courtesy.\"","Yu Xin still wouldn't comply. She knew that once she started with this first glass, there would be a second, a third... an endless stream.","Moreover, when out and about, she would never allow herself to get drunk.","In short, no matter how much influence Xue Chen had, she would not drink this wine.","\"Young Master Xue, forced fruit is never sweet. I've said I don't drink. If you really want a toast, I can use tea instead.\"","Xue Chen's face darkened completely. \"Don't you fucking dare refuse a favor when it's offered! In Lucheng, when I, Xue Chen, ask you to drink, it's an honor! You're just a small-time boss from out of town. Who the hell do you think you are, putting on airs? Believe me, I can make your pathetic little company disappear with just one word!\"","Faced with Xue Chen's sudden insults and threats, Yu Xin showed not a trace of fear. Instead, she stood up, looking down at Xue Chen who remained seated.","The last vestiges of her polite smile vanished completely from her face, leaving only icy coldness.","Did he think such a petty scene could intimidate her?","Then she would have wasted her time at the Wanlong Association.","\"I thought I was going to meet someone of importance today. Turns out, what showed up was a third-rate, utterly useless piece of trash.\"","\"Always threatening people with just your mouth, talking about making our Wanlong Company disappear. You're like a toad yawning—what a big mouth you have!\"","\"If you've got nothing better to do, don't go out. Go home to your mommy. Otherwise, if you get lost, it'll be hard to find you.\"","Xue Chen's face instantly flushed crimson.","In all his life, he had rarely encountered an outsider who dared speak to him like that, and with such harsh words.","\"You're fucking looking for death! Do you believe I...\"","Before he could finish, Yu Xin directly picked up the glass of red wine he had just filled to the brim. Then, under the astonished gazes of everyone present, she tilted her wrist.","Splash!","The crimson wine, not a drop spared, poured entirely over Xue Chen's head.","Xue Chen froze completely in place, seemingly unable to believe it.","Damn it, this was his turf! He'd been drenched with wine? And by a woman?","Yu Xin placed the empty glass back on the table with a sharp clack, pulled out a tissue, and meticulously wiped her hands.","\"Young Master Xue, this glass of wine is for you. How does it taste?\"","The two minor celebrities were the first to react, immediately accusing Yu Xin.","\"How dare you treat Young Master Chen like this! Do you know who he is?\"","\"You're finished! Absolutely finished!\"","\"Shut up!\" Yu Xin swept a cold glance at them, and the two immediately fell silent, too scared to utter another word.","Xue Chen finally snapped out of his shock and humiliation, his face twisting into a vicious snarl.","\"Bitch! I'll fuck your mother! You filthy whore who doesn't know what's good for her!\"","He then roared towards the door, \"Get the fuck in here, all of you! Now! Immediately!\"","No sooner had the words left his mouth,","Several young thugs with dyed hair burst into the private room from outside.","They probably would have barged in sooner if Bi Jin hadn't been present.","After all, Bi Jin was a man of some influence, and most importantly, he was quite familiar with Xue Chen's father.","That was precisely why Xue Chen hadn't brought those thugs into the room initially—to avoid a lecture from Bi Jin.","\"Master Chen!\" The thugs were shocked to see Xue Chen drenched head to face in red wine.","Who in Lucheng would dare to throw wine in Xue Chen's face?","Had they grown tired of living?","\"Beat her! Beat this bitch to death! I'll take care of any fallout!\" Xue Chen screamed, pointing at Yu Xin.","Bi Jin could stand it no longer and shot to his feet. \"Enough! All of you, stop right there!\"","\"Xue Chen, I'm warning you, you'd better not do anything reckless!\"","If Xue Chen actually laid hands on Yu Xin here today, it would be a direct slap in Bi Jin's face, since he was the one who had arranged for her to come out.","If it weren't for the respect he held for his old superior, he would have thrown this punk out long ago.","But Xue Chen was beyond caring. Publicly humiliated and disgraced in front of so many people, this young master, spoiled and arrogant since childhood, could not swallow this insult.","\"Get her! Anyone who doesn't, don't blame me for being ruthless!\"","The thugs clearly obeyed Xue Chen more. They immediately lunged towards Yu Xin.","Yu Xin's face remained utterly calm, without a trace of fear. She merely parted her lips slightly and uttered a single word: \"One.\"","Boom!","The door to the private room was instantly kicked open with tremendous force from the outside, and a powerfully built man in a black suit strode in.","The man's gaze was sharp, his expression resolute.","Before anyone could react, he had already positioned himself between the thugs and Yu Xin.","The next second!","A series of agonized screams erupted within the private room."]},{"number":438,"title":"Chapter 438: 438. A Group of Young Masters.","paragraphs":["Before anyone could react,","the man in black decisively struck, under the horrified gazes of Bi Jin, Xue Chen, and the two minor celebrities. The thugs were knocked to the ground before they could even lay a hand on Yu Xin.","Xue Chen was just about to curse, \"Who the hell are you?\"","Before the words could fully leave his mouth, a large hand clamped onto the back of his neck and slammed his face down onto the round table.","Thud!","A dull sound rang out.","Xue Chen's face made intimate contact with the tabletop, the pain contorting his features.","Yu Xin held up her phone, the screen squarely facing Xue Chen's somewhat handsome yet now twisted and fearful face, which was being pressed firmly against the table.","\"Mr. Xue, look here, look at the camera before you speak.\"","\"Come on, say it again for the recording. I want a good record so our company staff can study it later, learn how Mr. Xue can decide a company's fate with a single sentence. Otherwise, they might not even know why the company dissolved, which would be a real injustice.\"","\"You dare record this? Put that phone down!\" Xue Chen struggled and roared.","Yu Xin shook her head. \"I can't do that. This is evidence. I know you have some influence in Lucheng. To protect myself from your retaliation, I need to keep something for leverage.\"","After saying this, she adjusted the angle slightly, capturing Xue Chen's disheveled expression and the groaning thugs on the floor beside him.","\"See, you made the first move. We were merely acting in self-defense.\"","\"You...\" Xue Chen was fuming with rage.","But he was completely immobilized. He had no idea how this stranger trained to be so strong.","Bi Jin could no longer stay seated. He hadn't expected things to escalate to this point, nor did he anticipate that Yu Xin, a young woman, would be so ruthless. They were dealing with Xue Chen, after all.","The infamous playboy of Lucheng.","Regardless, he had set up today's meeting. If anything serious happened to Xue Chen, he would definitely be implicated.","\"President Yu, President Yu, this won't do. Let's talk this out. Please put your phone away.\"","\"We're all friends here. It's just a misunderstanding. Why let it come to this?\"","\"A misunderstanding?\"","Yu Xin put her phone away and looked at Bi Jin. \"Director Bi, when Mr. Xue was shouting about making my company disappear earlier, why didn't you say it was a misunderstanding? When these thugs rushed in to attack me, why didn't you say we were all friends?\"","She turned her gaze back to Xue Chen. \"And Mr. Xue, where's that domineering aura you had when you threatened to wipe out my company? Gone now?\"","\"Don't think you can do whatever you want just because you're in Lucheng. People from Wanlong Hui aren't afraid of bullies like you who think they control everything!\"","\"Today, out of respect for Director Bi, I'll let this slide. But if there's a next time, it won't be so simple.\"","\"Brother Yang, let him go.\"","Chu Yang nodded and released his grip. \"Behave. It's all on record.\"","Xue Chen stood up, clutching his reddened cheek, his eyes filled with fury. Yet, when he looked at Chu Yang, there was clear apprehension mixed in—he was angry but didn't dare speak out.","He truly hadn't expected the bodyguard Yu Xin brought to be this formidable.","But this wasn't over!","Xue Chen was just about to hurl some threats at Yu Xin to salvage a shred of his dignity.","At that moment, the private room door was pushed open from the outside.","Three young men walked in, each carrying an indescribable air of aristocratic aloofness.","After entering, they casually surveyed the messy room, their eyes finally settling on Yu Xin and the cold, imposing Chu Yang standing behind her.","The leader, a young man who appeared to be in his late twenties, spoke up with a smile.","\"Quite lively in here. Xue Chen, what act are you putting on this time? Causing such a commotion.\"","Seeing the newcomers, Xue Chen seemed to find his backbone. Covering his face, he hurried over to the leader's side and pointed at Yu Xin and Chu Yang.","\"Brother Chen, you're finally here! You have to back me up. They're the ones who hit me!\"","The young man addressed as Brother Chen—Zhou Muchen—examined the lingering red mark on Xue Chen's face and teased, \"Young Master Xue, someone managed to grind your face into a table right here in Lucheng? That's a new one.\"","The other two couldn't help but chuckle.","\"Quite rare indeed. Young Master Xue getting bullied by a woman today.\"","\"Do you need us to call an ambulance for you?\"","\"Hahaha...\"","Xue Chen's face flushed with alternating shades of green and white at their remarks. Although he wished he could grind these three into the dirt, he could only entertain the thought in his mind.","While Xue Chen indeed had some clout in Lucheng and was considered a figure, the identities of these three men before him were all superior to his.","Take Zhou Muchen, for example. He ranked easily within the top three in the province's elite circles.","The top spot belonged to The Li Family's Daughter, but she wasn't in the provincial capital; she was studying elsewhere, kept a low profile, hardly interacted with their crowd, and didn't run in the same circles.","Zhou Muchen and a few fellow second-generation friends had formed an exclusive high-end circle. Its members were primarily young masters who weren't pursuing careers within the system, focusing instead on business. Their ventures were mostly concentrated in places like Mocheng, with holding companies located outside the province.","In a sense, it was also a way to avoid scrutiny.","In short, Zhou Muchen had established this small circle to consolidate resources and make bigger profits.","Though the membership was limited, it consisted almost entirely of top-tier young masters from various regions.","For instance, the other two: one was Gu Yebai, a top-five young master from the neighboring province.","The other was Lu Chen, also ranking within the top five in their own province.","As for Xue Chen, while he barely qualified to join, he was at best a peripheral underling within the circle.","Of course, this was relative to figures like Zhou Muchen.","Out in the world, especially in Lucheng, few dared not give Xue Chen face.","To draw a parallel, Xue Chen's status was roughly equivalent to that of Bright Pearl City's prominent young master, Lin Muyang—they were on similar footing.","Even so, within this circle, he remained merely a fringe member.","This gives an idea of how elevated the status of Zhou Muchen and his companions was.","\"Brother Zhou, Brother Gu, Brother Lu, please stop mocking me! It was this woman and the guy she brought who started it. They completely disregarded us!\"","Upon hearing this, Zhou Muchen didn't confront Yu Xin and her companion as Xue Chen had expected. Instead, his tone was surprisingly mild.","\"Let this matter drop. Don't pursue it further.\"","\"But Brother Chen, they hit me...\"","\"I said let it go. Would you have lost face if you hadn't tried to force Miss Yu to drink?!\"","Zhou Muchen ignored him further and turned to Yu Xin.","\"Miss Yu, allow me to introduce myself. I'm Zhou Muchen. The earlier unpleasantness was due to my brother's lack of judgment. Let's consider today's incident a misunderstanding and put it behind us, shall we?\""]},{"number":439,"title":"Chapter 439: 439. Harsh Conditions","paragraphs":["Yu Xin was not someone who couldn't read a situation. She could tell that the young man before her was of no ordinary status; otherwise, even the habitually arrogant Xue Chen wouldn't be showing him such deference.","Since the other party had proactively offered a way out, there was no need for her to remain locked in a stalemate.","\"You flatter me, Young Master Zhou. It was just a minor misunderstanding, cleared up now. Since you've spoken, I naturally must give you this face.\"","Zhou Muchen seemed rather appreciative of her, his gaze lingering on her face for a moment as he nodded with a smile. \"Miss Yu is straightforward.\"","\"Perfect timing, we haven't eaten either. Would you mind joining us for a meal? My treat.\"","At this moment, Bi Jin stood up. \"Since you all still have matters to discuss, I won't overstay my welcome.\"","He had absolutely no desire to get further entangled with these young people.","Zhou Muchen did not try to keep him, merely giving a slight nod. \"Take care, Director Bi.\"","Bi Jin picked up his briefcase and left the private room directly, even forgetting to bid farewell to Yu Xin.","All he wanted now was to distance himself from this trouble spot immediately. The clashes among these young people lacked any finesse, and his old bones couldn't withstand such turmoil.","If it weren't for the favor owed to his old superior, he wouldn't have bothered helping Xue Chen in the first place.","After Bi Jin left,","Zhou Muchen very naturally pulled out a chair and gestured for Yu Xin to sit.","\"Please, Miss Yu, have a seat.\"","Then, he casually said to Gu Yebai and Lu Chen behind him, \"Find yourselves seats, don't just stand there.\"","Gu Yebai gave a lazy smile. \"You chat first. Lu Chen and I will go see what good wine they have.\"","\"Alright, go ahead then,\" Zhou Muchen nodded.","Yu Xin sat down composedly, and Chu Yang also sat down silently by her side.","Zhou Muchen called a server, instructing them to clean up the private room, remove all the previous dishes, and bring a new set.","Once things were more or less arranged, the two minor celebrities who had been hovering nervously on the side finally found an opportunity. They hurried over, trying to ingratiate themselves. \"Young Master Zhou, shall we keep you and this elder sister company? We can help pour the wine.\"","This was a rare chance to access the top social circles. Although they claimed to be Xue Chen's friends, they were actually just two minor artists under Xue Chen's entertainment company.","On ordinary days, they had no opportunity to come into contact with top-tier figures like Zhou Muchen.","Now, with three more arriving at once, plus Xue Chen, that made four. Naturally, they wanted to curry favor.","To their surprise, Zhou Muchen didn't even lift his eyelids. He waved his hand dismissively and directly said to a nearby server, \"Please escort these two unrelated individuals out. We need a quiet environment to discuss matters.\"","The smiles on the two minor celebrities' faces instantly froze. They instinctively looked towards Xue Chen, hoping he would put in a good word for them.","Xue Chen was still seething over the earlier incident. Why would he bother with them? He shot them an impatient glare. \"Didn't you hear Brother Chen? Still standing here being an eyesore? Get lost!\"","The girl's eyes instantly reddened, and the young man's face also turned very ugly, both filled with humiliation.","They had clearly been brought here by Xue Chen, yet now they were being shooed away like stray dogs, and they didn't dare to voice their anger.","Despite their glamorous, idolized image in front of fans, in the presence of genuine elites like Zhou Muchen and Xue Chen, their star aura counted for nothing.","They were truly the kind of people who could be summoned and dismissed at will, with no dignity to speak of.","Failing to climb the social ladder, the two slunk away dejectedly.","The private room door closed again, finally falling completely quiet.","Zhou Muchen picked up a hot towel to wipe his hands, then looked at Yu Xin. \"The nuisances are gone, Miss Yu. We can talk over the meal.\"","Yu Xin: \"I won't be staying for the meal, Young Master Zhou. If you have something to say, please speak directly.\"","Zhou Muchen gave a slight nod. \"In that case, I won't beat around the bush.\"","\"I am very optimistic about the future of Wanhui Youxuan. However, the internet industry is volatile, and going it alone carries significant risks.\"","\"Myself, and the capital I represent, are prepared to offer your Wanlong Technology an opportunity—a ticket to a higher level.\"","Yu Xin frowned slightly. \"Mr. Zhou, no need for circumlocution. What exactly do you want?\"","Zhou Muchen held up two fingers. \"Twenty million, to acquire 51% of Wanhui Youxuan's shares. I've done my research. Your team should still hold 60% of the shares. I'm leaving you 9%. This is already an extra favor granted out of personal regard for you, President Yu. My original plan was to take it all.\"","\"After obtaining controlling interest, we will pour in substantial resources and push Wanhui Youxuan towards a full-scale listing. At that time, the value of the 9% shares you retain could multiply tenfold, even a hundredfold.\"","\"So, how about it? Am I not showing considerable sincerity?\"","Upon hearing this, Yu Xin almost laughed in anger, though she controlled her emotions and didn't erupt on the spot.","Is he treating us like beggars?","How utterly shameless, dressing up robbery in such pretty words.","\"Mr. Zhou, are you sure you're not joking, or that I misheard? Wanhui Youxuan recently completed its Series A funding round with a valuation of five hundred million. For 51% of the shares, the market price would be at least two hundred and fifty million. And now you want to take absolute control for twenty million?\"","\"Frankly, I'm questioning whether you're here to discuss cooperation or to engage in outright robbery?\"","Zhou Muchen seemed to have anticipated her response. He slowly picked up his teacup and took a sip.","\"Miss Yu, that's not how the calculation works. Valuation is valuation, cash is cash. A five hundred million valuation is the pie-in-the-sky picture capital paints for outsiders. How much of that is inflated, you, as the person involved, know better than I do.\"","\"Twenty million. If you agree, it goes directly into your company's account immediately.\"","\"Moreover, the name 'Zhou Muchen' and the resources and influence I represent, once invested, would bring Wanhui Youxuan a premium far exceeding those couple hundred million. You're a smart person, Miss Yu; you should be able to calculate that value, right?\"","\"Also, I feel it necessary to remind you, Miss Yu, the market environment changes rapidly. What's worth five hundred million today might not be worth that tomorrow. Sometimes, it's wise to seize opportunities and secure gains in hand. Refusing our investment might mean that before long, you won't even have twenty million left.\"","Zhou Muchen's final statement was almost an open declaration, essentially telling Yu Xin directly that if she didn't agree, he had the power to make Wanhui Youxuan go under.","Hearing this, Yu Xin knew there was no point in continuing the conversation. It would be utterly meaningless. So she stood up directly and raised her teacup.","\"I appreciate Young Master Zhou's sincerity.\"","After taking a sip, she said directly to Chu Yang, \"Brother Yang, let's go!\"","Chu Yang also gave Zhou Muchen a deep look before decisively following Yu Xin out.","Zhou Muchen did not stop them.","Xue Chen, however, grew anxious. \"Brother Chen, you're just letting them leave like that?\"","Zhou Muchen toyed with his teacup, lost in thought. \"So she left. Did you really think we'd close the deal in one meeting?\"","Xue Chen replied, \"Well, why not? That bitch didn't even give you the time of day, Brother Zhou. I say we should have just detained her and locked her up!\"","Zhou Muchen looked at Xue Chen as if he were an idiot. \"When will you ever learn to think?\"","Xue Chen fell silent.","Zhou Muchen said calmly, \"We need to be civilized. Avoid causing trouble for the family if we can help it. Besides, Yu Xin doesn't have the authority to make decisions anyway. This meeting was mainly to test the waters.\"","Xue Chen asked, \"So, did you get a read on the situation?\"","Zhou Muchen sighed. \"I did. But I'm not letting this opportunity slip away.\"","As he spoke, a name surfaced in his mind—Liu Yutong!"]},{"number":440,"title":"Chapter 440: 440, A Woman a Hundred Times More Remarkable Than Yu Xin","paragraphs":["Yu Xin and Chu Yang had just left the restaurant when Gu Yebai and Lu Hong walked into the private room with two bottles of fine wine.","Upon entering, they saw only Zhou Muchen and Xue Chen inside, but the girl was nowhere to be seen, which left them somewhat puzzled.","Gu Yebai was the first to speak up, asking, \"Muchen, where is she?\"","Zhou Muchen casually tossed the towel aside and said, \"She's gone, naturally.\"","Gu Yebai was taken aback. \"Gone? Did you reach an agreement? Your efficiency is impressive.\"","Lu Hong also smiled and said, \"Then we've hit the jackpot this time.\"","Zhou Muchen, however, shook his head. \"No agreement was reached. She refused.\"","Hearing this, both men were momentarily stunned, struggling to process the information.","\"What? It really fell through?\"","\"Well, this is interesting. That girl actually dared to turn us down. She certainly has guts.\"","Xue Chen, sitting to the side, couldn't hold back and interjected, \"I told you that woman doesn't know what's good for her! Brother Chen offered her a deal and she didn't want it. If you ask me, we should just teach her a lesson!\"","A single glance from Zhou Muchen silenced Xue Chen immediately, and he didn't dare say another word.","\"She's not ungrateful. It's because the real decision-maker isn't her; it's that young lady from the Wanlong Society. To be honest, if I hadn't double-checked and confirmed the information was accurate, I wouldn't have believed there was such a formidable figure in Pearl City.\"","Hearing the name, Gu Yebai found it somewhat familiar. \"Muchen, are you talking about that young lady, Liu Yutong?\"","Zhou Muchen nodded. \"Let me ask you both, what are your impressions of that Yu Xin from earlier?\"","Gu Yebai and Lu Hong exchanged a look. They had only crossed paths with the girl; they hadn't even exchanged a word with her before she left. Asking them was practically pointless.","Nevertheless, they gave it serious thought.","After a moment.","Gu Yebai spoke first. \"Knowing who we are, that Yu Xin remained completely composed. That's no small feat; she's definitely not just a pretty face.\"","Lu Hong nodded in agreement. \"The girl is very clever, and most importantly, decisive in her actions—no hesitation or messing about. Also, judging by the bodyguard she brought along, who seemed highly skilled, the fact that she can command someone like that speaks volumes about her own capabilities.\"","These assessments were based entirely on first impressions, supplemented by inferences drawn from Xue Chen's disheveled state.","After listening to their evaluations, Zhou Muchen turned his gaze to Xue Chen, who still looked sullen. \"Xue Chen, what do you think?\"","Xue Chen, currently seething with hatred for that woman, naturally wouldn't have a good word to say about her. \"What do I think? She's just a woman who doesn't know her place!\"","\"Brother Chen, you personally offered to reserve shares for her, and instead of being grateful, she had the nerve to walk out in a huff. What's there to say about a woman like that who doesn't understand the rules or recognize what's good for her? If she ever falls into my hands, I'll make sure she learns some manners!\"","Although Zhou Muchen inwardly despised this useless Xue Chen, he didn't let it show on his face.","After all, Xue Chen was on his side.","The more Xue Chen disparaged the girl, the more it highlighted her remarkable qualities.","Being able to handle Xue Chen so effortlessly wasn't something just anyone could do—or rather, something most people wouldn't dare to do.","It showed just how strong-willed and confident Yu Xin's character was.","Of course, it was precisely because he admired Yu Xin's capabilities that he had made the snap decision to offer her team a 9% stake.","It was just a shame she refused.","\"So it seems you both have a rather favorable view of that Yu Xin,\" Zhou Muchen asked again.","Gu Yebai and Lu Hong nodded simultaneously. \"Setting aside our opposing positions, the girl is indeed talented. It would be even better if we could secure Wanhui Youxuan and keep her on board.\"","\"Muchen, if we could really get her to work for us, giving her a small share wouldn't be out of the question.\"","Zhou Muchen said, \"I already told her what you suggested. I was willing to set aside 9% for her and her team, but she didn't agree.\"","If Yu Xin had heard his words, she would have spat in his face.","Using their Wanlong Society's assets and talking as if it were his charity?","Have you no shame?!","\"Of course, that doesn't change the fact that I think highly of her. She is indeed a woman of courage, skill, and daring.\"","\"But that's not the point. The reason I asked you is to tell you that according to the information I obtained, the truly formidable one isn't the Yu Xin we met today.\"","\"It's the woman behind her, named Liu Yutong.\"","\"To put it this way, Yu Xin's abilities are probably not even one percent of Liu Yutong's.\"","Hearing this, Gu Yebai and the other two were stunned once more, their faces filled with disbelief.","\"Really? Muchen, aren't you exaggerating a bit?\"","\"Muchen, you can't just say things like that. That Yu Xin is already considered a rare talent. If what you say is true, and that Liu Yutong is really a hundred times more capable than Yu Xin, then is she even human?\"","\"Exactly, she's just a woman. How could it be that exaggerated?\"","\".......\"","Zhou Muchen looked at the stunned reactions of the three and continued, \"My initial reaction was the same as yours, but the source is absolutely reliable. This Liu Yutong is truly extraordinary.\"","He then gave them a general rundown of Liu Yutong's information.","How she rose from an ordinary high school student with no background to become the young lady of the largest society in Pearl City.","How she demonstrated astonishing business acumen, step by step pushing the valuation of the Wanlong Group into the ten-figure range, reaching billions in scale.","Even though it's a valuation, it's terrifying enough.","Even if you don't count the valuation, the net assets alone likely exceed a billion.","And she accomplished this in less than a year.","Also, how the Wanlong Society she established became the largest society in Pearl City under her leadership, and how she swept away various forces in Pearl City within a mere six months—those underworld bosses either dead or imprisoned, almost completely wiped out by her.","All of this fully demonstrates that this Liu Yutong not only possesses top-tier business brains but also formidable methods. She can truly be described as accomplished in both literary and martial arts.","In short, a young girl with no foundation, able to rapidly consolidate resources, eliminate obstacles, and establish a vast empire combining business and society in such a short time, certainly can't be explained by mere luck.","\"Muchen, hearing you say all that, this girl is indeed impressive!\"","\"To achieve this starting from scratch is truly remarkable. Just from this point, she is indeed more formidable than that Yu Xin.\"","\"It's not exactly starting from scratch, is it? Didn't she have a father mixed up in the underworld?\"","\"An underworld father? Heh... wouldn't he be like a mouse seeing a cat when encountering us? We could handle him however we please.\"","\"Meow...\"","\"Hahaha............\"","\"Muchen, I admit I'm interested in her now. How about we go to Pearl City to meet her?\"","Zhou Muchen was about to nod, because to completely secure controlling ownership of Wanhui Youxuan, they had to make a trip to Pearl City to negotiate with the other party face-to-face.","Of course, you could also call it delivering an ultimatum.","As someone said earlier, Wanlong ultimately has that layer of being a society, which is a point of vulnerability.","Zhou Muchen had received insider information that the provincial authorities had already sent an investigation team down.","Perhaps by then, he wouldn't even need to exert any effort to make them comply obediently."]},{"number":441,"title":"Chapter 441: 441, Yunshan Gathering","paragraphs":["Just as Zhou Muchen was about to speak, Xue Chen stood up first, volunteering eagerly.","\"Brother Chen, let me go to Pearl City first to meet that Liu Yutong. I want to see for myself if she really has three heads and six arms as the rumors say!\"","Zhou Muchen frowned slightly, but before he could say anything, Gu Yebai, sitting beside him, chuckled and poured cold water on Xue Chen's enthusiasm.","\"Give it a rest, Young Master Xue. If you charge over there like that, are you going to negotiate or just serve yourself up on a platter? Don't end up getting pinned to the table and humiliated again, or our Cloud Mountain Society's reputation will really be dragged through the mud all the way to Pearl City.\"","The small circle initiated by Zhou Muchen did indeed have a private name: the Cloud Mountain Society.","The name \"Cloud Mountain\" was taken from the idiom \"clouds and mountains shrouded in mist,\" which conveyed a sense of low-key discretion while also hinting that their circle was extraordinary and utterly inaccessible to ordinary people.","Currently, the Cloud Mountain Society had seven members: five were children of influential families from large compounds for high-ranking officials/military, and two were top-tier domestic heirs to immense fortunes.","However, only four were present at the moment; the other three were not here.","The Cloud Mountain Society didn't have internal rankings; it leaned more towards being a consortium for collaboration and making money, somewhat similar to the Pearl Chamber of Commerce initiated by Liu Yutong.","The Pearl Chamber of Commerce was also just a nominal organization, never formally registered. Its purpose was to screen for potential business partners to invest alongside and provide investment capital for Pearl Capital.","Lu Hong also shook his head. \"Muchen, I also think it's inappropriate for Xue Chen to go now. Let's not mess things up.\"","He too was starting to find Xue Chen unreliable, mainly because Xue Chen had made a poor impression on them today and seemed particularly fond of showing off.","Of course, they liked to show off too, but at least they weren't as brainless as Xue Chen, who could easily get himself pinned down and embarrassed.","Hearing both Gu Yebai and Lu Hong speak of him this way, Xue Chen's face fell.","\"How would I mess things up? This time I'll definitely...\"","Zhou Muchen cut him off. \"Alright, Xue Chen, go if you want. If you can't handle it, let us know.\"","He hadn't wanted Xue Chen to go either initially, given how poorly the guy had demonstrated his capabilities—impulsive and quick to anger—making it highly likely he'd botch things.","If Xue Chen hadn't begged him persistently and even pulled some strings, Zhou Muchen wouldn't have accepted him into the Cloud Mountain Society in the first place.","But then he reconsidered. Letting this hothead go test the waters first, to gauge the depth and reaction of that Wanlong Society's young mistress, might not be a bad idea.","If he succeeded, all the better.","If he failed, and if Xue Chen truly proved too incompetent, it would provide the perfect excuse to remove him from the Cloud Mountain Society.","Hearing Zhou Muchen actually agree, Xue Chen immediately beamed with joy. \"Brother Chen, don't worry. I'll definitely handle this matter beautifully, make that Liu Yutong beg to transfer the shares to us!\"","Zhou Muchen looked at his eager-to-prove-himself expression and merely gave a faint \"hmm,\" offering no further response.","The other two seemed to have understood Zhou Muchen's intention and tacitly acquiesced.",".............","Pearl City.","Liu Yutong and the vice-principal finalized the usage plan for the student aid fund.","The Wanlong Group would provide approximately two million in student aid funds annually. This money was primarily to support truly needy students, but the assistance wouldn't be given as direct cash. Instead, it would be provided as targeted subsidies based on the students' meal card usage patterns.","If a student's daily spending in the cafeteria consistently fell below the set minimum threshold for several consecutive days, and their purchases were concentrated in the most basic, budget-friendly food sections, the system would automatically flag that student as a potential aid recipient.","Subsequently, the foundation's platform would discreetly deposit a nutritional subsidy into the student's meal card at regular intervals, without alerting the student.","This plan was adapted by Liu Yutong from a method used by a school in her previous life. She thought it was quite a good approach.","While there might still be loopholes—for instance, some internet-addicted teens might skimp on meals every month to save money for gaming—it was arguably more reliable and fairer than having people fill out application forms for assessment.","Most importantly, it preserved the dignity of more introverted students.","After settling the student aid fund, the two discussed the Wanlong Group's campus recruitment event. Once Liu Yutong promised to give priority consideration to students from the Finance University, the smile never left the vice-principal's face.","A group of seniors would be graduating this semester, so this would provide them with some full-time job opportunities, helping to address employment challenges.","After discussing the first two matters,","the vice-principal proactively brought up the university anniversary celebration with Liu Yutong, informing her that her name had been submitted and approved very quickly.","This meant Liu Yutong would be the only student representative in nearly a decade to take the stage and speak at the anniversary ceremony.","Although this grand celebration was only held once every ten years, it was still a significant honor.",".......","Liu Yutong had just stepped out of the vice-principal's office when she ran into Yu Xin, who was hurrying over.","\"Sister Yutong, something bad happened. I might have messed up.\"","Then she recounted everything that happened in Lu City in detail, including how the arrogant young master Xue Chen had been thoroughly humiliated by Chu Yang.","Of course, that wasn't the important part. What mattered was the identity of those people—all children of influential families from the big courtyard—and that they had set their sights on an industry under their Wanlong Society, wanting to acquire Wanhui Youxuan at an extremely low price.","After listening to Yu Xin's account, Liu Yutong smiled slightly. \"Interesting. I didn't expect to attract big sharks from outside so quickly.\"","She didn't seem the least bit anxious, as if what she had just heard was as ordinary as a greeting like \"Nice weather today.\"","In contrast, Yu Xin, who had remained unflappable in front of Zhou Muchen and the others, was now getting worried.","Of course, it was only in front of Liu Yutong that she didn't bother to conceal her true feelings.","\"Sister Yutong, why aren't you worried at all? They clearly want to devour our Wanlong Society whole!\"","Liu Yutong: \"It's normal for them to come after us. Our projects are currently the pig flying on the trend/frontier. Everyone wants a bite.\"","\"The difference is, some people want to raise the pig together and share the meat when it's fat, while others want to snatch it for themselves to devour alone. Obviously, the group you mentioned belongs to the latter.\"","\"Sister Yutong, what should we do then?\" Yu Xin asked.","Liu Yutong: \"I'll handle this matter. If anyone approaches you again, just tell me. I'll go meet them personally!\"","\"Don't worry. Our Wanlong Society has come this far, weathering all sorts of storms. A few spoiled heirs thinking they can swallow us up won't find it so easy.\"","Hearing Liu Yutong say this, Yu Xin felt reassured.","After all, in her heart, Liu Yutong was an omnipotent presence. It was precisely because she had such a formidable backer that Yu Xin had been able to remain so calm and unflinching in Lu City.","\"Alright, don't worry. We'll cross that bridge when we come to it. You go back and rest properly. Leave this matter to me.\"","Yu Xin gave an affirmative \"hmm\" and left.","After seeing Yu Xin off, the smile on Liu Yutong's face gradually faded.","She wasn't as completely indifferent as she appeared on the surface; she understood very well just how deep the waters ran here. The resources these children of the compound could mobilize were in no way comparable to the likes of Zhao Weixiang.","However, she was no longer the person she used to be.","Liu Yutong took out her phone and made several calls in succession.","The content was largely the same—gathering some information to prepare a response in advance.","Of course, she could also have Li Xiaohui step in directly.","That silly girl Li Xiaohui still hadn't really suspected that Liu Yutong had known her true identity all along.","Regardless, unless absolutely necessary, she didn't want to involve Li Xiaohui.","Because if things weren't handled properly, Li Xiaohui might have to completely sever ties with the Wanlong Society.","Sometimes, a low-profile mascot can be more of a deterrent than one openly placed in the spotlight."]},{"number":442,"title":"Chapter 442: 442, Classmate Liu Treats Everyone","paragraphs":["These past few days, Liu Yutong had mostly stayed on campus, and she was quite enjoying the unique tranquility found only in a school environment.","Walking around campus, she always felt like every face was familiar, because everyone would greet her politely when they saw her.","This feeling was actually quite nice. At least this way, she hadn't encountered any overly dramatic incidents at school.","Even when boys had arguments and got red-faced, as soon as they saw her, they would immediately make up, even wishing they could hug on the spot to prove it was all just in fun.","It was particularly harmonious.","At noon that day, Liu Yutong went to the cafeteria for lunch as usual.","To be honest, the food at the Finance University's cafeteria couldn't be called delicious, but it wasn't bad either—just the taste of ordinary mass-produced meals.","It was just that Liu Yutong was used to eating at her family's restaurant, so after eating at the school cafeteria for days, she was really starting to 'miss' that taste a bit.","As soon as Liu Yutong got in line at the serving window, the students who saw her were all extremely polite, insisting on giving her the spot at the very front.","She wasn't one to enjoy special treatment, but if she didn't proactively move to the front, the students ahead would just stand there waiting for her with expectant eyes.","So she stopped being polite, picked up a tray, and walked to the front of the line.","Just as she reached the front, even the cafeteria lady serving food broke into a smile and greeted her proactively: \"Liu Yutong's here? We have sweet and sour pork ribs today, your favorite.\"","Liu Yutong smiled in response: \"Thank you, auntie. I'll have half a portion, then.\"","Even though she didn't intend to get extra, when the lady scooped the food, her hand didn't shake at all, still piling her plate high.","Liu Yutong could only smile and thank her again, then ordered two light vegetable dishes and half a portion of rice.","Then, she said to the lady: \"Auntie, could you please add a chicken drumstick and a marinated egg for every student in line at this window today? Put it on my tab.\"","She couldn't just cut in line for nothing; she should at least show a little goodwill.","\"Sure thing, no problem!\" the lady agreed cheerfully.","Liu Yutong nodded. Just as she picked up her tray and turned around, she couldn't help but pause in surprise.","Originally, there were only about a dozen people in line at their window, but now the line actually stretched all the way outside the cafeteria doors.","The students in line immediately began thanking her eagerly.","\"Awesome, we get extra food today!\"","\"Thank you, Liu Yutong.\"","\"Thank you, junior Liu.\"","\"Thank you, Sister Yutong...\"","\"Sister Yutong is way too nice!\"","\"How can we accept this...\"","\"I told you we didn't need to be so afraid of her. She's actually quite generous.\"","\"Get in line, get in line...\"","Looking at the students' cheerful expressions, Liu Yutong felt an indescribable emotion in her heart.","She actually saw genuine gratitude and smiles from her classmates.","Was the power of a drumstick and an egg really that great?","There was a time when students at the Finance University showed more respect and fear when they saw her, their greetings tinged with nervousness.","Almost no one dared to exchange even half a sentence of casual chat with her, let alone act like they were now.","But... they were actually quite cute like this.","She had always had another worry: she felt the distance between her and the other students was too great.","Now, they seemed to be gradually changing, even showing a hint of closeness, not as afraid of her anymore.","And then...","Liu Yutong beckoned a male student over and whispered something in his ear.","The male student immediately turned around and shouted excitedly: \"Announcing great news to everyone! Liu Yutong is paying for everything in the cafeteria today!\"","The entire cafeteria instantly fell silent.","The next second, a tidal wave of cheers erupted!","\"Whoa, really?!\"","\"Long live Sister Yutong!!\"","\"Junior Liu, you're so awesome!!\"","\"I love Finance University, I love Liu Yutong!\"","\"...\"","Originally, only the line for one window had stretched outside, but now, the entire cafeteria was in an uproar.","The commotion was so loud it even caught the attention of the teachers getting food at the staff window.","A teacher couldn't resist joking: \"Student Liu Yutong, can we mooch a meal too?\"","Liu Yutong replied politely with a smile: \"Of course you can.\"","The teacher said with a laugh: \"Well then, thank you for your kindness, Liu Yutong. We won't stand on ceremony.\"","Several teachers also happily accepted this unexpected treat.","The atmosphere in the cafeteria immediately became even more lively.","Liu Yutong didn't forget to remind everyone: \"Everyone, order whatever you like, don't be polite with me. But I only have one requirement: no wasting food!\"","As soon as she said this, the whole place responded immediately.","\"We guarantee to complete the mission!\"","\"Don't worry, Sister Yutong!\"","\"Don't worry, junior Liu!\"","\"We'll clean our plates for sure!\"","\"Auntie, give me twenty drumsticks first!\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","She really wanted to ask this male student if he could even finish that many drumsticks.","Then she realized she had underestimated the appetite of this nearly six-foot-tall male classmate.","He was sitting diagonally across from her, and she just stared in amazement as the guy polished off five large drumsticks in a few bites.","His eating speed and capacity were a match for Ji Yu.","The boy seemed to notice Liu Yutong's gaze. He looked up from his pile of drumsticks, grinned sheepishly, and said indistinctly with his mouth full: \"Don't worry, junior Liu, I won't waste a thing! I'm on the university soccer team, just finished training, and I feel like I could eat a whole cow!\"","The surrounding area immediately erupted in laughter.","\"Da Zhuang, you're really taking advantage of the junior's treat to go all out!\"","\"Junior, put this guy on a blacklist next time. He eats way too much!\"","\"Hahahaha...\"","Liu Yutong couldn't help but laugh too, then picked up her chopsticks and started eating her own meal.","Among all the tables in the cafeteria, only hers had her sitting alone.","Just as she was halfway through her meal, three girls who looked like freshmen shuffled over to her table, pushing each other hesitantly, their faces showing a mix of shyness and nervousness.","Finally, a girl with a ponytail was pushed forward by her companions. She asked cautiously, \"Sister Yutong... um, can we sit here? We... we don't mean to disturb you.\"","In the past, no student would have proactively asked to share a table with her.","Li Xiaohui and a few girls from her class were the exceptions.","Liu Yutong looked up, a gentle smile appearing in her eyes.","\"Of course you can. It's empty here, please sit.\"","The three girls immediately looked relieved, their faces breaking into delighted smiles. They quickly thanked her and sat down across from her and beside her.","\"Thank you, Sister Yutong!\"","\"...\""]},{"number":443,"title":"Chapter 443: 443. The Production Crew Arrives","paragraphs":["Once the first step was taken, the rest became noticeably easier.","The three girls gradually became less reserved and started talking more.","The girl with the ponytail was named Chen Yue, and she was the boldest. Looking at the barely touched sweet and sour ribs on Liu Yutong's tray, she couldn't help but whisper, \"Sister Yutong, you eat so little.\"","Liu Yutong smiled. \"I ate a lot for breakfast, so I'm not very hungry for lunch.\"","Naturally, she wouldn't say that she had originally asked for only half a portion of ribs, but the cafeteria lady had insisted on giving her a full heaping portion, which she couldn't possibly finish, so it just looked like she hadn't eaten much.","\"If you'd like some, please help yourselves. I'm really not hungry anyway.\"","\"Thank you, Sister Yutong! I won't stand on ceremony then!\" Chen Yue took the lead, picking up a rib from Liu Yutong's tray.","Seeing someone take the initiative, the other two girls each took a rib as well.","Sometimes taking the initiative is a gesture of wanting to get closer and show friendliness, not rudeness.","Some students who had been sneaking glances in their direction were utterly shocked by this scene.","There was a time when no one would dare to even get close to Liu Yutong, let alone take food from her tray.","After all, the string of rumors about Liu Yutong outside the school were truly terrifying.","Last year, many people witnessed firsthand how Liu Yutong, leading a group of men in black from the underworld, taught those outsiders a lesson.","Furthermore, last year, many had seen with their own eyes how Liu Yutong, accompanied by a dense crowd of black-clad individuals from society, had dealt with those off-campus delinquents and how their university, Cai Da, had become the top dog in the university district.","Of course, according to official university rankings, Cai Da was indeed number one in Mingzhu City.","But this \"top dog\" status had nothing to do with academics; it was purely a social ranking.","At least now, when they encountered those delinquents outside, simply saying they were from Cai Da was enough to deter most from bothering or bullying them.","All of this was because their school had produced a Liu Yutong, the young lady of the Wanlong Hui.","It's fair to say that Liu Yutong's \"dark\" reputation was deeply ingrained in everyone's minds, including her classmates and schoolmates.","Therefore, seeing those three girls now laughing and chatting while taking food from Liu Yutong's tray was extremely surprising.","Whether boys or girls, who doesn't have a bit of admiration for the strong?","Moreover, Liu Yutong not only had the powerful Wanlong Hui behind her, but she was also exceptionally wealthy, recognized as the campus belle, and excelled in her studies.","She often skipped classes and was absent from school, yet she passed her major courses effortlessly at the end of the semester. That was a true genius.","Talent, beauty, wealth, and power—she possessed them all.","In everyone's minds, she was almost a flawless person.","Just imagine, who wouldn't want to get on good terms with such an impressive schoolmate?","Even a little bit of her favor could mean not having to worry about finding a job after graduation.","Consequently, watching those three girls chatting so happily with Liu Yutong, everyone was filled with envy.","\"My God, they actually dared to do that...\"","\"That's Liu Yutong's tray...\"","\"How did they manage it? They look like they're having such a good time chatting.\"","\"If I had known Sister Yutong was so easy to get along with, I would have gone over too........\"","\"..........\"","Some boys also joked half-seriously, \"I suddenly envy Da Zhuang a bit. At least he managed to get Liu Yutong's attention with his appetite.\"","\"Why don't you go order 20 chicken drumsticks?\"","\"Better not, shouldn't waste food.........\"","Liu Yutong ate very slowly.","The three girls didn't eat quickly either, mainly because they enjoyed chatting while eating. Especially when they talked about gossip, celebrity gossip, they got particularly excited and would forget they were still eating.","Unexpectedly, Liu Yutong learned from their conversation that last year's \"Celebrity Campus Visit\" variety show was really coming to Cai Da.","She had originally thought that after suffering such a big loss, the director wouldn't choose to come to Mingzhu City.","She hadn't expected them to actually come.","Was it stubbornness, or did they genuinely think there was something special about their Cai Da?","Liu Yutong couldn't be bothered to think about it. She never liked paying attention to such gossip, firstly because she was busy, and secondly because current variety shows didn't really appeal to her; she didn't enjoy watching them.","Of course, even knowing the show would still come to Cai Da to film was irrelevant to her. As long as they didn't bother her, she didn't care what they did.","Just as they were chatting animatedly, Chen Yue's phone rang.","She apologized and answered the call.","It seemed to be her father on the other end.","\"What? My little brother is sick?\"","\"What exactly happened?\"","\"Okay, I understand. I'll head over right now.\"","\"........\"","As soon as Chen Yue hung up, she stood up, her expression grave.","\"What's wrong?\" The other two girls asked quickly, seeing she wasn't planning to finish her meal.","Chen Yue said, \"My dad called and said my little brother is sick, crying nonstop. They're taking the bus to the city to see a doctor but don't know how to register at the hospital. He wants me to take them to register.\"","\"I hope it's not serious. Otherwise, I'll have to take leave and stay at the hospital for the next few days.\"","Nowadays, many people, especially those from the countryside, might never have been to a city hospital in their lives.","They usually solve medical issues at the town clinic, rarely making the trip to the city.","Firstly, they think medical care in the city is expensive, even charging for registration.","Secondly, they find it too troublesome and exhausting.","Only when the town clinic encounters a difficult case would they make the long journey to the city for treatment.","Although Chen Yue said this, she had a bad feeling in her heart.","She also felt some resentment towards her parents. They were already so old, yet they insisted on having a son.","Of course, she knew the reason was simply that people in the village gossiped and mocked her father for having no heir.","Otherwise, her parents, nearly fifty, wouldn't have insisted on giving her a little brother.","Moreover, her brother wasn't very healthy, frequently getting fevers and colds. They usually treated him at the village clinic or in town.","Unexpectedly, this time it was serious enough to require coming to the city.","\"Sister Yutong, I'm sorry, but I have to go to the bus station to pick up my parents and brother. Please take your time eating.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Go ahead. Important matters come first.\"","From their conversation, Liu Yutong learned that Chen Yue's brother was less than two years old, making them siblings with a very large age gap.","For a moment, she didn't know what to say.","Just as Liu Yutong finished eating and was about to leave,","a commotion suddenly erupted at the cafeteria entrance, accompanied by excited screams.","The dining atmosphere, which had just settled down, was disrupted again. Many students craned their necks to look towards the door.","\"Wow, they really came! They're really here at our school to film!\"","\"I see her! It's Jinbao! It's really her!\"","\"Where, where? Jinbao! Oh my God! Jinbao, I love you!\"","\"Ahhh! Jinbao! Look over here! Look here!\"","\"Mom, I'm on TV! The camera is panning over!\"","\".........\"","Cameras, lighting equipment, and a large entourage of staff surrounded several celebrities who came pouring into the cafeteria in a noisy crowd.","The noise arrived before the people did.","\"This is the renowned Second Cafeteria of the University of Finance and Economics. It certainly lives up to its reputation—so bustling with activity! Let's see what the students are having for lunch today...\"","The celebrity guests walked into the dining hall with practiced, professional smiles, fully prepared to be enthusiastically surrounded by the students.","After all, it was lunchtime, and the cafeteria was at its busiest. With so many people around, surely the sight of so many celebrities appearing in their midst would trigger a frenzy, with fans swarming toward them.","Yet their expectations were mistaken. The anticipated scene of fans rushing over in excitement never materialized.","The students in the cafeteria were all quietly eating their meals, not a single one making a move."]},{"number":444,"title":"Chapter 444: 444. Is She Liu Yutong","paragraphs":["It wasn't that the students at the University of Finance weren't enthusiastic enough. At their age, even if they didn't chase celebrities, they'd usually love to join in the excitement of seeing one in person.","It's just that today, with Liu Yutong in the cafeteria, everyone was much more restrained.","Furthermore, the incident that happened last year served as a cautionary tale for them. Everyone knew Liu Yutong seemed to dislike being on camera.","Otherwise, you wouldn't find a single photo of her online.","Seeing a group of camera crew enter, Liu Yutong put down her chopsticks and stood up.","\"I'm finished. Everyone, don't waste food, and please maintain order.\"","After saying this, she left directly and headed back to her dorm.","Since a production crew had come to film a variety show, she would just go back to her dorm to rest. She had no desire to be in the public eye.","Once she left, the students in the cafeteria visibly relaxed, though they remained relatively well-behaved.","The program crew and the celebrity guests were somewhat astonished by this scene.","They had naturally noticed the girl with the striking presence, but they hadn't expected her influence to be so profound.","A single sentence from her had made the entire dining hall remarkably orderly and disciplined. It was unlike other universities they had visited, where students would scream and swarm around them the moment they appeared.","\"What's the deal with that girl?\"","\"Not sure.\"","\"Did you hear that just now? After she spoke, nobody really made a move. Why are these college students so willing to listen to her?\"","Curious, someone took the initiative to ask a student who was still eating.","\"Hey, classmate, was that female student who just left a student council officer? Why does everyone seem to pay such heed to her?\"","The student hesitated for a moment before saying, \"That's Liu Yutong.\"","Few words were spoken, but the meaning carried by that name needed no further explanation.","The crew members had heard this name before when they scouted the university location. Their eyes immediately lit up.","So that was Liu Yutong.","Truly extraordinary.","No wonder Director Wang had repeatedly emphasized that when they got to the University of Finance, they shouldn't just focus on filming the campus belle, Xue Linna, but also make sure to get plenty of shots of a student named Liu Yutong.","Leading this episode's shoot was the assistant director, not the main director, Director Wang.","It wasn't that no one had asked why Director Wang wasn't coming to oversee the filming at the university, but the moment they raised the question, Director Wang's face had contorted as if he were constipated. He made an excuse about needing to shoot other footage and said the assistant director had enough experience anyway—in short, he absolutely refused to come.","The assistant director, seeing this as a chance to direct independently, naturally didn't decline. He happily accepted the task for this episode, promising to do a good job, especially in following Director Wang's request to give more screen time to that Liu Yutong.","He had always assumed Liu Yutong was some connection of Director Wang's, hence the special treatment.","In reality, he had no idea he was being set up by Director Wang.","Director Wang intentionally wanted him to give Liu Yutong more screen time, hoping to use the show's exposure to \"accidentally\" reveal Liu Yutong's identity as the daughter of a crime syndicate boss.","This way, Liu Yutong would get into trouble, and their show could wildly hype up this topic, maximizing its popularity.","It was a perfect two-for-one deal.","And if they happened to anger Liu Yutong during the filming, well, the assistant director would be the one to take the fall. Wasn't that what assistant directors were for—to handle the dirty and difficult work?","As soon as the assistant director heard the girl who had just left was Liu Yutong, he hurriedly said to the staff, \"Quick, quick, go and invite that student back!\"","The staff member nodded and rushed out, but was a step too late.","Liu Yutong had already ridden off on her electric scooter, disappearing in a flash.","To be precise, she had gone back to her dorm.","Liu Yutong knew these kinds of shows usually filmed on campus for quite a while. She didn't like crowds or being on camera, so she figured she might as well go back to her dorm for a nap.","What she didn't expect, however, was that this production crew would actually dare to barge into the girls' dormitory."]},{"number":445,"title":"Chapter 445: 445. Ferocious Onslaught","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong had just stepped into her dorm when someone from the company called to report the information they had gathered, with a particular focus on the situation of that second-generation heir named Xue Chen, who had previously clashed with Yu Xin.","This Xue Chen was indeed no simple character, or rather, he was exceptionally arrogant and overbearing.","He had actually managed to drive a billion-yuan scale enterprise in Lucheng into the ground, though certainly not by any legitimate means.","Truth be told, whether in business wars or competition in other fields, things are often very simple and brutal, much like the food delivery wars and the thousand-group wars of the previous era.","Back then, it was all about who could burn more money and who could burn it longer.","Extremely plain and unadorned.","And that was the contest between top-tier major companies, which was, to some degree, already quite fair.","If a small company caught the eye of a big corporation, there were generally only two outcomes: either get acquired, or refuse the acquisition and then be suppressed by the big company using its own resources and connections until it goes bankrupt and shuts down. Finally, the big company would poach the core personnel and replicate a similar project.","This tactic is equally plain and unadorned.","When you get down to it, the vast majority of business wars always revolve around two words: power and money.","Was Xue Chen arrogant?","He certainly was, and he had the capital to be arrogant.","Relying on his connections, this guy controlled a medium-sized entertainment company and had ruined a billion-yuan scale enterprise, all because the other party refused to sell it to him at a low price.","His method of destroying that company was similarly simple and brutal, yet very effective.","First, subject them to all sorts of inspections, and then, in a bad mood, find a pretext to have people detained for a period.","Ultimately, that company's funding chain broke, leading to bankruptcy and even family ruin.","Later, he applied the same method, acquiring 20% of the shares of a company called Xiaolu Dairy at a low price.","As Xiaolu Dairy's market share continuously expanded and its valuation broke through ten billion, his personal wealth also skyrocketed, exceeding two billion.","Although net worth is often inflated, if he wanted to sell his shares, he could easily fetch over a billion.","It was precisely through this method that Xue Chen showed Zhou Muchen, another second-generation heir from a prominent family who was also preparing to enter the business world, a different kind of 'business opportunity.'","This was also the main reason why Zhou Muchen was willing to let Xue Chen join the small circle he had formed, the Yunshan Club.","Xue Chen had both money and 'entrepreneurial experience.' From these two aspects, he was indeed helpful to Zhou Muchen and other second-generation heirs wanting to start businesses.","Shortly after Xue Chen joined the Yunshan Club, they quickly locked onto their first target: Wanhui Youxuan.","Originally, Zhou Muchen had intended to enter the real estate industry. For him, real estate was the easiest field to make money. Land that others couldn't obtain, he could easily secure and then resell at a high price. The price difference alone could allow him to effortlessly make billions, becoming an invisible tycoon.","However, the real estate industry was, after all, quite murky. Once something went wrong, the impact would be enormous.","Furthermore, his family's elder still had the potential for further advancement. For the sake of caution, they ultimately decided not to touch this area.","Thus, they turned their attention to some seemingly normal industries, like the internet.","In this era, the internet industry belonged to the innovative sector and aligned with policy direction. Even if their methods were slightly over the line, it was easy to cover up and not easily give critics ammunition.","And Wanhui Youxuan had just started, not yet grown large, making it the perfect time to strike.","Of course, they could also start their own similar company to compete with Wanhui.","But that would be too troublesome. How could it be as fast as simply taking it?","This was also the reason why Zhou Muchen was willing to give Yu Xin a 9% stake. To put it bluntly, it was to have these professionals work for him.","After roughly understanding their tactics, a glint of coldness flashed in Liu Yutong's eyes.","At the same time, she also secretly felt fortunate to have met that girl Li Xiaohui at the University of Finance and Economics.","Otherwise, even if she personally stepped into the ring to fight these people, it would be extremely tricky.","After all, when dealing with a group with special status like the Yunshan Club, there were too few usable tactics; the Wanlong Group was naturally at a disadvantage.","Perhaps she could try talking with the other side.","Sometimes, having one more friend is better than having one more enemy.","If the other side insisted on making things difficult for her, then she could take action later.","Liu Yutong didn't know that Zhou Muchen also intended to talk with her. If they could reach an agreement, naturally there would be no need for a major confrontation.","However, Xue Chen, who had arrived in Mingzhu City first, had no intention of talking with her first.","Not long after Liu Yutong hung up the phone, someone else reported to her that the company was in trouble.","And it was coming on strong.","Various departments in Mingzhu City seemed to have made an appointment in advance. Departments including Fire Safety, Taxation, Industry and Commerce, and Cultural Market Inspection all received real-name reports on the same day, one after another, and dispatched teams to various subsidiaries of the Wanlong Group for surprise routine inspections.","This inspection was extremely thorough, the requirements exceedingly strict. Any minor flaw was unacceptable, and immediate suspension for rectification was demanded.","If it were an ordinary person reporting, the relevant departments, considering that the Wanlong Group was a local enterprise, wouldn't be so harsh.","But this time, the identity of the whistleblower was not ordinary; there were even people from the provincial level who had put in a word. The relevant departments had no choice but to take it seriously, and during the inspection, they did indeed find some minor issues.","No one is perfect, and neither are companies. It's simply impossible to be completely flawless.","These exposed minor issues could originally have been resolved with on-the-spot rectification, but unfortunately the whistleblower was closely watching and wouldn't let go, so the relevant departments could only follow procedure.","Just like that, the company's normal office order was completely disrupted. Employees were busy preparing various materials for submission, and core business operations were also forced to be interrupted.","Almost simultaneously, the online public opinion, which had been calm for months, stirred up again.","A large number of marketing accounts suddenly emerged on portal websites, simultaneously publishing exposés targeting the Wanlong Group.","The content of the exposés was nothing new, merely claiming that the Wanlong Group was a black society organization that also used illegal means to acquire wealth.","The company internally also encountered external poaching. Some non-core but crucial technical personnel, sales managers, regional ground promotion leaders, etc., were approached by headhunters.","Even worse, the Wanhui Youxuan website actually went down.","The reason was that a major cloud service provider partnered with Wanlong Technology suddenly notified them of a service suspension due to so-called technical reasons, requiring a so-called security review.","The headquarters of this cloud service partner company was located in the provincial capital, Lucheng.","This set of combination punches was fast, fierce, and ferocious!","To put it bluntly, if an ordinary company encountered this incoming set of combination attacks, it would probably kneel on the spot.","Listening to one piece of bad news after another on the phone, Liu Yutong's expression grew increasingly grim.","Even she actually felt a bit at a loss.","Although these tactics wouldn't necessarily crush the Wanlong Group, if they came every now and then, the company would inevitably suffer significant losses and could even be driven to collapse.","Could it be that she really had to actively ask Li Xiaohui to intervene in advance?","She was now truly experiencing the means of these second-generation heirs.","Although somewhat underhanded, they were harder to deal with than any opponent she had encountered before.","In the past, her opponents either settled things the way street toughs do—by seeing whose fists were harder—or resorted to low-level frame-ups, or hired some online trolls to smear her.","For her, these were easy to handle, even effortless.","But this time was completely different.","Almost in an instant, the Wanlong Hui Group was violently yanked off its high-speed development track, plunged into a situation of being besieged on all sides, with all operations grinding to a halt.","The second-generation offspring of the compound elite—truly not to be underestimated."]},{"number":446,"title":"Chapter 446: 446. How to Welcome the Production Crew","paragraphs":["With the other side pulling such a move, Liu Yutong naturally wasn't about to sit back and do nothing. She prepared to make a phone call to rally support.","After all, the Wanlonghui Group was a major taxpayer in Mingzhu City, a key enterprise driving significant employment, and even certified by local leadership as a rising star and an outstanding private enterprise.","Letting the other side run amok like this was simply unacceptable. Shouldn't the leadership offer some protection?","She could guess that this time, the other side had most likely reported directly to the local authorities, not to the higher-level leadership above Mingzhu City.","Because at that higher level, it wasn't so easy for these second-generation heirs to boss people around; those officials might not give them that face.","The lower-level departments, however, had to show those heirs some consideration to a certain extent.","Liu Yutong had another purpose for making this call: she wanted to determine whether it was just one person targeting her or if the whole group was.","From the situation reported by Yu Xin, she could judge that at the very least, the leader Zhou Muchen wouldn't likely make a move against Wanlonghui without giving a heads-up.","Because Zhou Muchen was clearly somewhat arrogant and self-assured.","On the other hand, that Xue Chen was rather petty and vindictive, and his actions were brazen. It was most likely his doing alone.","After the call, the result largely matched her judgment.","Because that Xue Chen had already arrived in Mingzhu City.","In that case, she might as well meet this guy first.","Just as Liu Yutong was about to leave her dorm to ask her advisor for leave, a sharp, startled scream suddenly echoed from the hallway.","\"What are you doing? This is the girls' dormitory! You can't just come in, and you definitely can't film!\" The dorm supervisor tried to stop the program crew, but she simply couldn't hold them back.","The group barged in anyway.","\"Wow, so this is the girls' dorm at the University of Finance? Pretty clean!\"","\"Look over there! Hahaha, so cute!\"","\"Camera, follow! Lao Wang, this girl's reaction is priceless!\"","\"Hahaha...\"","\"...\"","The playful and boisterous voices of several celebrity guests rang out in the hallway, including even male voices.","Probably thinking they were filming a show, they not only saw nothing wrong with their behavior but even deliberately teased the flustered students.","It was currently nap time. Many girls were dressed casually, quite a few still in their pajamas. Suddenly seeing so many men carrying cameras appear in the hallway, with lenses deliberately pointed at them, instantly caused panic.","\"Ah! Why are there men here!\"","\"Don't film me, I'm not wearing makeup!\"","\"Who let them come up? Where's the dorm supervisor?!\"","\"This is too much! How can they just barge into the girls' dorm and film like this!\"","\"My underwear is still hanging out.\"","\"Close the door! Quick, close the door!\"","\"...\"","The female students screamed in panic, and the hallway descended into chaos in an instant.","The program crew and the celebrities, however, found these reactions great for the show's entertainment value. Instead of stopping, they got even more excited.","Hearing the commotion, Liu Yutong's brows furrowed tightly, and a chill instantly surfaced on her face.","She yanked her dorm room door open and strode out.","\"What is going on here?!\"","The previously chaotic hallway fell silent in an instant. The girls all started greeting her.","\"Sister Yutong!\"","\"Sister Tong!\"","\"...\"","This scene left the program crew and the celebrities momentarily stunned.","They had come here to film precisely because they knew Liu Yutong was somewhat extraordinary.","After all, she almost commanded immediate obedience from the school's students, and they were very curious how she managed it.","Now they were witnessing it firsthand again.","The moment this girl with a top-tier appearance appeared, the other girls instantly became quiet and orderly, showing her obvious respect.","The male guest's eyes lit up upon seeing Liu Yutong, already starting to scheme in his mind about how to interact with this girl.","The director wanted to film her, so whoever interacted with her would definitely get the most screen time. Plus, interacting with such a beautiful and poised girl would be a very pleasant experience in itself.","Liu Yutong's appearance also gave the girls a backbone.","Immediately, a girl wearing cartoon pajamas with disheveled hair ran up to Liu Yutong to complain.","\"Sister Yutong, these people came into our girls' dorm to film without permission! And they're deliberately filming us in embarrassing situations! It's too much!\"","Liu Yutong's gaze swept coldly over the group of uninvited guests before her.","The smiles on the faces of the celebrities and crew members gradually faded. They clearly sensed the atmosphere had turned rather hostile.","All the female students from the University of Finance spontaneously stood behind Liu Yutong or on either side of her, united in their indignation as they glared at the program crew.","The assistant director steeled himself and stepped forward, trying to break the deadlock.","\"Student Liu, we're from the 'Celebrity Campus Tour' program. We're currently recording, and we just wanted to capture some more authentic campus life footage. There might be a bit of a misunderstanding...\"","Liu Yutong cut him off. \"A misunderstanding? Entering a female living space without permission, violating others' privacy, disturbing their rest—is that what you call a misunderstanding?!\"","As she spoke, she took a small step forward.","Though just one person, she made the entire crew instinctively take a step back.","They hadn't expected a female student to exude such an intimidating aura, and they even felt an inexplicable sense of trepidation.","\"Since when did the girls' dormitory at the University of Finance become a place you can barge into at will?\"","\"Who let you in? Step forward!\"","The dorm supervisor stepped out, looking guilty. \"I... I couldn't stop them.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Auntie, this isn't your fault. There were so many of them; you couldn't have stopped them even if you tried.\"","Then she looked back at the assistant director. \"Stop filming immediately. Delete all video footage taken inside this dormitory building.\"","\"Then, get out!\"","The assistant director, unwilling to give up, said, \"We can leave. But, um, could we invite you, Liu Yutong, to come downstairs and cooperate with filming a bit? Our show has quite high ratings...\"","Liu Yutong: \"Delete, and then get out! Don't make me say it again!\"","Her eyes held a murderous glint as she said this.","\"Delete! Delete it now!\"","The assistant director shouted at the cameraman, though he deliberately winked at him, hinting to just pretend to delete.","The footage they had just shot had some potential explosive moments; it would be a shame to really delete it.","How could such a small move/trick escape Liu Yutong's notice?","However, she didn't stop it.","Just as they finished their \"deletion\" and prepared to leave, a somewhat popular female celebrity couldn't help but mutter, \"What's she so cocky about? Just a student acting so high and mighty.\"","She suddenly remembered her boss, the young master from Lucheng, was also in Mingzhu City. She could act coquettishly and ask him to teach this extremely arrogant and ignorant girl a lesson. It would also be a chance to vent the anger she'd been holding since Lucheng.","The commotion caused by the program crew forcing their way into the girls' dorm to film was huge. People in the nearby boys' dormitory also noticed.","Especially after some girls complained in their class group chats, many boys and girls who were originally outside the dorms gathered around, all filled with righteous indignation.","The dormitory is, after all, a relatively private space. Barging in without any notice, isn't that going too far!","Even if you're from the production crew, even if you're celebrities, you can't just violate someone's privacy like that, right?","Liu Yutong went downstairs almost right after the crew members.","Just as she stepped out of the main door, a sudden gust of wind blew by, making her sneeze uncontrollably.","Even though it's already April, the temperature is still quite low, especially since it rained this morning and brought the temperature down. It's probably only around four or five degrees Celsius now, so wearing light clothes is still pretty chilly.","When Liu Yutong saw the hundreds of students gathered on the scene, she suddenly had an idea and called out to the assistant director.","\"Director, didn't you want to film some footage?\"","The assistant director thought Liu Yutong had changed her mind, and a smile instantly spread across his face. \"Student Liu is willing to film with us? That's fantastic!\"","After all, Director Wang had instructed him to give Liu Yutong more screen time, and he really didn't want to get scolded later.","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"Not me, them!\"","She pointed at the few hundred students present.","Assistant Director: \"??? You mean them?\"","Liu Yutong: \"They want to prepare a grand welcome ceremony for your production crew. It's quite special, perfect for giving you some extra material.\"","The assistant director's eyes immediately lit up. \"Really? That's so enthusiastic of them!\"","Liu Yutong nodded, called over a few students, and whispered some instructions to them.","Those students' eyes immediately sparkled, and they quickly spread the word to the others.","In moments, the hundreds of students on the scene scattered in all directions.","Just as the crew members were wondering what they were up to,","the students returned from the dormitories in long, snaking lines. They were carrying basins—some were washbasins, some were foot-washing basins, and some even carried kettles. They surrounded the entire crew, forming a circle.","Assistant Director: \"???\"","The Actors: \"???\"","\"What are you all doing?\"","Liu Yutong smiled slightly. \"Welcoming you, of course.\"","\"Fellow students, I hereby declare the Finance University Water-Splashing Festival officially open!\"","\"Water-splashing? Splash who?\"","Before the assistant director, the crew members, and the celebrities could react, the students, poised and ready from all directions, fiercely hurled the water from their basins and kettles straight at them.","This included, among other things, the foot-washing water that had been accumulating on some boys' dormitory balconies for who-knows-how-many days—water with a truly memorable aroma."]},{"number":447,"title":"Chapter 447: 447. The Embarrassed Program Crew.","paragraphs":["\"Ah! My makeup!\"","\"Pah! Pah! Pah! What is this smell? It's disgusting!\"","\"The cameras! Protect the cameras! This equipment is all rented and expensive, we'll have to pay if it breaks!\"","\"They're insane, these students have all gone mad!\"","\"........\"","The crew and celebrity guests screamed as they were drenched.","There was no sun today, and it had rained earlier. Even though it was noon, the temperature was only around six degrees Celsius. The moment the cold water splashed into their collars, it made them gasp sharply.","Especially when those foul-smelling, unidentified liquids landed on them, some couldn't help but vomit on the spot.","The celebrities were also a pitiful sight. Their meticulously applied makeup was ruined, their hairstyles flattened, and their designer clothes soaked through. They hugged their arms, shivering uncontrollably, looking utterly disheveled.","It wasn't that they didn't try to shield themselves, but water was being flung from all directions, making it impossible to block. They couldn't even run away, as they were already surrounded by the excited students.","And the ammunition here wasn't running out; nearby, classmates were rushing to fetch water from the first-floor washrooms and toilets, ensuring a continuous supply of 'reinforcements'.","Liu Yutong stood not far away, arms crossed, her eyes curved into crescents as she watched this lively scene.","The assistant director wiped his face, barely managing to open his eyes.","He finally understood now. Liu Yutong's so-called 'welcome ceremony' was deliberately meant to mess with them.","Furious, he pointed at Liu Yutong and shouted, \"You're finished! I'm going to find your superiors! I must report you!\"","Liu Yutong shrugged. \"Suit yourself. We just wanted to express the finance university students' welcome for your production team. Don't you like it?\"","\"If you don't like it, tough luck. It's perfect for your cameras to get some good footage, let the audience see how enthusiastic our school's students are. Oh, by the way, those machines of yours shouldn't break from just a little water, right?\"","The assistant director sputtered, \"You... you...\" He was too angry to speak.","Just then, several university administrators, having heard about a conflict between students and the production team at the dormitory building, hurried to the scene with a group of security guards.","This was no small matter. If anything happened to the students, they would all be held accountable.","But as they rushed to the scene, they gradually slowed their pace, staring in confusion at the students fetching and splashing water everywhere.","What was going on?","Weren't they told the students and the crew were fighting?","Why were they having a water fight?","At that moment, a quick-witted student ran up to them and reported the situation: \"We're just holding a welcome ceremony for them, as the director requested.\"","The assistant director yelled, \"Bullshit! When did I ever say that?!\"","Hearing this, the university leaders immediately breathed a sigh of relief. As long as it wasn't a fight, it was fine.","They didn't leave but stood to the side and watched.","Honestly, seeing the students gleefully splashing water around the crew was quite amusing.","\"My, the students are so full of vitality. They're under a lot of academic pressure usually, it's good for them to relax occasionally.\"","\"Indeed, I didn't expect the students to be so enthusiastic. It fully reflects the united, lively, and expressive spirit of our finance university students!\"","\"It's just that the weather is still a bit chilly. Won't they catch a cold?\"","\"It's fine. Have the cafeteria prepare some ginger tea. Once they're done playing and the crew finishes filming, they can have some ginger tea to warm up.\"","\"Look how much fun the crew members are having.\"","\"This production team is good, very professional!\"","\".......\"","The assistant director, shivering, wiped his face several times before finally spotting the university leaders standing on the periphery. Tears immediately mixed with the water streaming down his face.","The rescuers had finally arrived!","He was determined to lodge a fierce complaint against that Liu Yutong, against these students, and demand compensation for their losses!","The assistant director scrambled and crawled, finally making his way out of the crowd. Once on his feet, he ran towards the leaders.","He crawled and stumbled, emerging from between the students' legs out of the warzone, then ran towards the leaders, waving at them and shouting, \"Leaders, leaders, you're finally here to...\"","Splat!","One of the leaders now held a water balloon and threw it squarely at the assistant director's face.","Hitting his target, he burst into laughter: \"Director, you told me to throw it! My aim's pretty good, huh? Hahaha...\"","Because there were too many students and the noise was chaotic, he hadn't heard the assistant director's words clearly. He only saw the other man waving at them and pointing at himself. Didn't that mean he wanted him to join in the welcome ceremony and throw one at him?","The assistant director was completely stunned by this water balloon to the face.","Actually, he had pointed at himself to show them his miserable state, to file his complaint. He never expected to be misunderstood.","And then he saw who had thrown the water balloon: the school's dean of students, the one who always wore a stern face and was strict about discipline.","Right now, not only was he not stern-faced, he was laughing like a child who had pulled off a successful prank, and even winked at the assistant director.","The assistant director pointed, stammering, \"You... you all...\"","Before he could voice his protest,","Another leader nearby seemed to have also 'understood' his gesture. Without hesitation, he snatched a bucket full of water from a male student beside him and flung its contents at the assistant director, giving him a second facial wash.","\"The students are right, guests from afar shouldn't just stand there dry! Director, we welcome you too!\"","\"Hahaha, well done, Dean!\"","\"Great aim, Dean!\"","\"The Vice President splashed well too!\"","\"......\"","Seeing the leaders not only failing to stop them but personally joining in, the students' enthusiasm soared even higher.","Someone shouted, \"The Dean and the Vice President have given their orders! Don't hold back, everyone! Splash away, give our guests a proper welcome!\"","This shout attracted passing students who didn't know what was happening, and they all joined this \"Water Splashing Festival.\"","However, the ones being splashed remained only one party: the production team and the celebrity guests.","The university leaders seemed to have completely let loose, directly instructing the security guards,","\"Quick, Xiao Zhang, Xiao Wang, you go help the students fetch water! That one... that basin is big, yes! Use that one to get water!\"","\"......\"","In the end,","When the production team and celebrity guests first entered the finance university, they were all smiles. When they left, however, each one sported a bird's nest hairstyle, their bodies emitting a nauseating 'fragrance,' as they fled in utter disarray.","As they ran, they cried and cursed, \"Like superiors, like inferiors! The academic atmosphere at this finance university is terrible! This is too much bullying!\" and so on.","Li Xiaohui had just rushed from the library to the scene in a hurry, only to see the mess downstairs. Clutching her chest in distress, she exclaimed, \"I'm too late!\"","\"Sister Yutong, how could you not call me ahead of time for something this fun!\"","She had just heard there was some kind of water-splashing festival at the dorm building, that it was incredibly lively, and had immediately sprinted over.","The library was quite a distance from the dormitory, and by the time she arrived on the scene, she just caught sight of a group of drenched individuals running off with their equipment.","She was too late.","Liu Yutong didn't hide it from her and told her directly about the incident in the dorm.","Li Xiaohui was furious at first, but then she laughed and clapped her hands. \"Serves them right! Let's see if they dare barge into the girls' dormitory again.\"","\"Oh, by the way, Sister Yutong, their photography equipment must be pretty expensive, right? If they make us pay for it, wouldn't we have to compensate a huge amount?\"","Liu Yutong wasn't the least bit concerned about the matter.","\"Don't worry. If they want compensation, we'll give it to them. I'm just afraid they won't dare to ask for it!\""]},{"number":448,"title":"Chapter 448: 448. Is There a Way to Deal with Liu Yutong","paragraphs":["Putting aside what had just happened, Liu Yutong thought of something and asked.","\"By the way, Xiaohui, your team has made it to the finals now, right? How does it feel?\"","Mentioning this, Li Xiaohui got excited, her whole spirit instantly lifting.","\"Hahaha... Sister Yutong, I almost forgot to give you the battle report.\"","\"Our 'Lady Zi' team is absolutely invincible, okay? We're the top contender for the championship now.\"","\"You have no idea how completely we've dominated these matches. Last game, against that 'Wild Wolves' team from the Tech College—sounds intimidating, right? We wiped the floor with them, ending each round in under two minutes on average!\"","\"I even ran into some guy who called himself the 'God of Guns,' camping behind the middle lane door trying to ambush me. I cooked a grenade and tossed it over, scared him into jumping out, and then I flicked my AK and headshot him... Hohoho!\"","Li Xiaohui got more and more excited as she spoke, proudly planting her hands on her hips and laughing.","Liu Yutong nodded with a smile. \"Not bad, not bad. I'll come watch your finals match live. Go get that championship.\"","\"That would be awesome, Sister Yutong. When I win the championship, I'll treat you to a meal.\"","\"Deal!\"","\"Oh, right, Sister Yutong.\"","Li Xiaohui suddenly remembered something. \"I just got a call saying our internet cafe got inspected out of the blue. Did you know?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"I found out not long ago myself.\"","Li Xiaohui immediately waved her little fists angrily, saying fiercely, \"Don't let me find out which bastard did it. If it messes with my competition, I'll definitely track him down, smash his stupid head in, and grind his face into a keyboard!\"","Looking at her fierce-yet-cute expression, Liu Yutong said with a laugh, \"You'll know soon enough.\"","Li Xiaohui was a bit confused. Liu Yutong didn't explain, just said, \"I'm heading to the company first,\" and left.","............","Evening.","Xue Chen met with his artists, Meng Yuan and Liu Lulu, as well as Deputy Director Zheng of \"Star Campus Visit,\" in a private room at a hotel.","Meng Yuan and Liu Lulu were precisely the two minor celebrities Yu Xin had seen back in Perch City.","Thanks to Xue Chen's connections, they had smoothly become the celebrity guests for this episode of \"Star Campus Visit.\"","They had originally hoped to ride a wave of popularity after the show aired, never expecting to get drenched in 'flow' during the recording itself.","Though, it was the flowing kind of liquid.","At the moment, the three of them were wrapped in thick blankets, shivering as they sat huddled on chairs, denouncing the atrocities of the students at Finance University, especially that hateful Liu Yutong.","\"Young Master Xue, they bullied us so badly! Pouring cold water on us in such freezing weather. Look at Director Zheng, he's still running a fever. We've all caught colds too... Achoo!\"","\"Young Master Xue, you have to stand up for us. Those students are simply awful. The water they used was even foul. I still feel like I smell stinky feet, ugh~~ I still feel like throwing up, ugh~~~\"","\"Yes, yes, especially that Liu Yutong. She's the one who incited the students to splash us, and they used foot-washing water, toilet water... Smell this, just smell it!\"","Deputy Director Zheng moved his arm towards Xue Chen's nose.","Xue Chen recoiled in disgust. \"Alright, alright, get away!\"","\"So, you're saying all of this was Liu Yutong's doing?\"","The three nodded in unison.","\"That Liu Yutong seems to have quite high prestige among those students. I felt they all respect and are even a bit afraid of her, doing whatever she says.\"","\"Young Master Xue, what's her background anyway? A relative of the university president?\"","Xue Chen sneered. \"What background could she have? She's just the boss of a gang of a few hundred people in the underworld. Heard she's even 'taken care of' a few people, including some local big shot, that's all.\"","Meng Yuan: \".......\"","Liu Lulu: \".......\"","Director Zheng: \".......\"","A... a gang boss?","They had considered Liu Yutong might be a student council officer or a relative of the school administration, but they never imagined she was a female gang leader with underworld ties who had 'taken care of' people?","And they had provoked her on her own turf?","Aren't they completely screwed then?","With a shudder, Meng Yuan suddenly threw off his blanket and declared righteously, \"Well... Young Master Xue, I suddenly don't feel cold anymore. What's a little splashed water? It just cools you down, gets rid of the heat, promotes blood circulation. I feel great now!\"","Liu Lulu immediately wiped her tears too. \"Right, right, Brother Yuan is correct. Actually, I took a careful sniff just now, that water... that water isn't smelly at all. It has a touch of... earthly vitality, quite refreshing. I feel full of energy now, don't feel like throwing up at all, really!\"","Director Zheng also promptly tossed his blanket aside. \"Hey, isn't it strange? I didn't even take medicine and I'm cured! The fever's gone, head's not dizzy, throat doesn't hurt, even my old rheumatic legs are better. I feel fantastic now!\"","\"Young Master Xue, see, we're all fine. Maybe we should just let it go with that woman?\"","Xue Chen: \"......\"","\"Look at you, scared out of your wits by a little water? What kind of thing is Liu Yutong? To me, she's nothing but a rat that can't see the light! I can handle her however I want. Why are you so afraid of her?\"","\"I'm putting it out there right now, I'll get you justice for this humiliation! She thinks she's tough? I specialize in dealing with the unyielding!\"","He felt today's incident was no coincidence; it was likely the other party declaring war and demonstrating against him.","First, he had people mess with her company, and then immediately she had students drench his artists. Wasn't this a blatant slap in his face?","She clearly knew his artists were among the guests and did it on purpose.","In that case, he didn't need to hold back either.","This was the perfect opportunity to take care of Liu Yutong.","\"Director Zheng, how are your production team's cameras and equipment?\"","Hearing this, Deputy Director Zheng's newly 'recovered' face turned pale again. \"Young Master Xue, don't even mention it. I don't know how I'm going to explain this to the company.\"","\"Our main Komodo cinema camera, the lens set is completely done for, the body ports are probably rusted. Two Sony cameras also took a bath, their circuit boards are likely shorted. And the follow focus, monitors...\"","\"Most of this equipment is rented, costing tens of thousands a day in rental fees alone. Now not only do we have to keep paying rent, but we also owe huge repair fees, even depreciation costs. A rough estimate puts the losses on equipment at least... no less than a million!\"","Mentioning this figure made Deputy Director Zheng's heart tremble.","He was the primary person responsible for this incident.","After listening, Xue Chen didn't get angry but instead laughed. \"Good! Excellent! This is perfect!\"","\"Now I have ample reason to deal with that Liu Yutong.\"","He planned to pin the charge of intentionally damaging others' property with a significant amount on Liu Yutong. Then, by putting pressure on the police department, arresting her would be as easy as turning over his hand.","However, he didn't want things to end so simply. At the very least, he had to get revenge for the humiliation of being pressed against the table back in Lucheng.","If she were actually sent to prison, it would instead become harder to take action against her.","His plan was to use this as a threat to force Liu Yutong to hand over Yu Xin and Chu Yang. After subjecting them all to torture, he would then send them to prison.","Once these key members of the Wanlong Society were inside, he would have plenty of ways to bring down the society, even take it over for himself.","Although Xue Chen was an arrogant second-generation heir, he wasn't that foolish; in fact, he was somewhat cautious.","After all, Mingzhu City was Liu Yutong and Yu Xin's turf. What if, during the meeting, they refused to yield and, in a fit of anger, decided to attack him? What would he do then?","By the time the police arrived, he might already be finished.","So, just in case, he planned to find some locally influential underworld figures to back him up.","To put it plainly, he wanted to hire a few bodyguards for protection."]},{"number":449,"title":"Chapter 449: 449, The Legendary Boss Scarface","paragraphs":["Xue Chen made a phone call, summoning a young street tough he hadn't known for long.","While these low-level gangsters weren't exactly high-class, they were very useful for gathering information.","Not long after, a young hoodlum named Wang Chaoze walked into the private room. Being a local of Pearl City, he was quite knowledgeable about the local underworld gossip.","\"Young Master Xue, what did you need me for?\" Wang Chaoze asked.","Xue Chen didn't beat around the bush: \"I just want to ask you, what's the name of the most powerful, largest-scale gang in Pearl City? Help me arrange a meeting with their boss.\"","He figured if he was going to find help, he might as well find a force that even the Ten Thousand Dragons Society would think twice about.","Wang Chaoze thought for a moment and said, \"Well... the biggest gang in Pearl City is only the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.\"","Xue Chen: \"......\"","\"Is that the Ten Thousand Dragons Society run by that woman?\"","Wang Chaoze hurriedly nodded: \"Yes!\"","Xue Chen: \"Tsk tsk, who would've thought. Those two women are quite capable.\"","\"Besides the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, is there any other gang with strength comparable to them? Help me arrange a meeting.\"","Wang Chaoze visibly showed a troubled expression: \"That... Young Master Xue, I'm afraid that won't be easy to arrange.\"","Xue Chen frowned: \"What do you mean? For someone of my status to summon them is giving them face! Whoever dares not give me face, I'll make them regret it!\"","Wang Chaoze quickly waved his hands: \"No, no, that's not what I mean, Young Master Xue. It's not about not giving you face.\"","\"It's that I simply don't know who to contact.\"","\"You have no idea, ever since the Ten Thousand Dragons Society emerged, basically all the big and small gangs in Pearl City have been cleaned out by them in one fell swoop.\"","Xue Chen: \"......\"","Although he had previously inquired about some information regarding the Ten Thousand Dragons Society—like how they had apparently offed people, wiped out a major gang called the East Sea Alliance, and even killed their boss—he didn't know that the East Sea Alliance wasn't the only one that got swept away.","All the well-known gang bosses in Pearl City were basically locked up, now sitting behind bars.","The ones left were just some insignificant small fries who didn't dare oppose the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","Of course, a few gangs managed to escape the purge, but they had all disbanded, or more accurately, were merged.","However, the one who merged them wasn't the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, but the current legendary boss of the Righteous Union Society, Scarface.","Brother Scarface's reputation in the underworld was only slightly less than that of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's young lady.","As for why he had such a big reputation, one had to mention the inspirational story circulating about him in the underworld.","Scarface was originally just a low-level enforcer for the Righteous Union Society. He gained some fame thanks to his unique skill of catching blades bare-handed.","Later, because he luckily picked the right side, he was promoted to a small-time boss managing one of the Righteous Union Society's establishments.","Later still, there were rumors that he led men to Misty Water County to capture the daughter of the Righteous Union Society's former boss—who is now the young lady of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society—but failed and was instead captured and tortured by her.","Scarface gritted his teeth and endured, nearly beaten to death, yet never revealed the name of the person who sent him, keeping his mouth tightly shut.","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society's young lady, Liu Yutong, respected him as a man of character, even praising him as 'a true man of this era, like Scarface,' and ultimately let him go.","That's how Scarface narrowly escaped with his life.","After returning to Pearl City, he turned shame into motivation, worked hard to improve himself, and demonstrated remarkable leadership. The men he trained were all formidable fighters. In a very short time, he cleared out all the shady characters from the most complex territory in Pearl City—the train station area.","Boss Pan Xing, wary of Scarface's growing power, staged a 'cup of wine to recall military power' move. He not only took back his territory but also commandeered his group of highly combat-effective enforcers in white suits.","Normally, if a boss did this, anyone with a bit of ambition would turn hostile.","But Scarface not only showed no resentment, he handed over his men to the boss without hesitation. All the money earned from the territory he had secured was also handed over to the boss, not keeping a single cent.","Later, a major incident occurred within the Righteous Union Society. Boss Pan Xing was assassinated, and several hall masters began to stir. Just as Pearl City's number one gang was about to split apart...","Scarface stepped up once again!","Scarface displayed extraordinary cunning. He started by faking his own death, making his rivals lower their guard against him. Then, catching them off guard, he led a surprise attack, rounding up all the old-timers and hall masters in one go, completely taking over the Righteous Union Society and becoming its third boss.","The current external evaluation of Scarface can be summarized in four phrases.","Peerlessly loyal and brave, exceptionally resourceful, able to bend and stretch, a born leader!",".......","Xue Chen truly hadn't expected that woman Liu Yutong could dominate Pearl City's underworld.","Left with no choice, he had to find another approach.","If he really let the cops arrest Liu Yutong, he wouldn't be able to accept it.","Especially since his last embarrassing incident was witnessed by Zhou Muchen and the others. If he didn't get back at her, his mind wouldn't be at peace.","Just then,","Wang Chaoze slapped his forehead, suddenly remembering someone: \"I've got it, Young Master Xue! There's still one person in Pearl City now who can stand up to the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.\"","Xue Chen perked up: \"Who?\"","Wang Chaoze said: \"The current boss of the Righteous Union Society, the legendary Brother Scarface!\"","He then proceeded to tell Xue Chen the legendary story about Scarface that he had heard.","\"Young Master Xue, you have no idea, some folks in the underworld don't even worship Guan Gong anymore; they worship Scarface, for his peerless loyalty and bravery!\"","The more Xue Chen listened, the brighter his eyes became.","As a second-generation rich kid, he usually only encountered sycophants. He had never come across such a gutsy, loyal, and righteous gang boss before.","If it weren't for his own status being unsuitable, he'd almost want to become sworn brothers with him.","\"Peerlessly loyal and brave, exceptionally resourceful...\"","Xue Chen murmured these eight words, then suddenly slapped the table: \"What a man, Scarface! Now that's a gang boss with true feeling and righteousness!\"","He turned to Wang Chaoze and said: \"This is exactly the kind of person I'm looking for. Go make arrangements, I want to meet him.\"","If he didn't know about Scarface's character, he might not have decided so quickly.","But now that he knew Scarface was such a righteous man, what was there to worry about?","A man like this definitely wouldn't back down from that Ten Thousand Dragons Society young lady.","Wang Chaoze looked troubled again: \"Young Master Xue, Brother Scarface's status is different now. I'm afraid he won't agree so easily...\"","Xue Chen wasn't worried at all: \"No need to hide my identity. If Scarface thinks well of me, Xue Chen, he'll naturally come to the meeting.\"","\"Also, tell him that I, Xue Chen, respect men of loyalty and righteousness like him the most. If he's willing to help me deal with an enemy today, should he ever get into trouble and catch the attention of the cops in the future, I won't stand by and do nothing.\"","Hearing Xue Chen say this, Wang Chaoze immediately felt more confident.","At the same time, he couldn't help but feel excited—he actually had a chance to get to know the legendary boss of the Righteous Union Society!","\"I'll go contact Brother Scarface's people right away. But Young Master Xue, according to underworld rules, they get to decide the meeting location.\"","Xue Chen waved his hand with a carefree air. \"It's no trouble. Since we're looking to make friends, sincerity is key. Just go and pass on the message. Say that I, Xue Chen, am ready to receive him at any time.\"","Watching Wang Chaoze's hurried departing figure, Xue Chen suddenly felt this trip to Mingzhu City might not be so dull after all.","If he could win over a legendary underworld boss like Scarface, he'd have some serious bragging rights in front of those young masters like Zhou Muchen and his crew.","\"Scarface, I hope you don't disappoint me.\""]},{"number":450,"title":"Chapter 450: 450. The Milk Powder Has Issues.","paragraphs":["Wang Chaoze never dreamed that one day he would not only get to know a young master from Lucheng, Xue Chen, but also act as a middleman, connecting with the legendary Scarface Brother of the Righteous United Society.","\"Xue Chen, Young Master Xue, right? Go back and pass the message. I'll definitely keep the appointment. I won't disappoint him.\"","\"Alright, Scarface Brother, I'll go back and deliver the message right away.\" Wang Chaoze left excitedly.","No sooner had Wang Chaoze left than Scarface, who just moments before had worn a defiant smile, instantly wiped the expression from his face.","He glanced around, confirmed no one was there, then quickly walked into an inner room and swiftly made a phone call.","Once the call connected, all traces of Scarface's former gangland boss demeanor vanished, replaced by an obsequious and respectful tone.","\"Hello, Young Miss? It's me, Little Scarface.\"","\"Just now, a small-time hoodlum named Wang Chaoze came to see me. He said a Young Master Xue Chen from Lucheng wants to meet me. It looks like he wants to win me over to deal with you and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. Don't worry, I wouldn't dare!\"","\"I pretended to agree to the meeting. It's a good chance to probe this Young Master Xue's background.\"","\"Okay, okay, I'll follow your arrangements. Do you think we should take the opportunity to set a trap for him?\"","\"...\"","...","On the campus of the University of Finance and Economics.","Liu Yutong, having just finished handling company affairs and her call with Scarface, had returned to the university.","The whole way, she was thinking about Xue Chen.","She truly hadn't expected that a young master like Xue Chen would try to use underworld methods against her.","Unfortunately for him, he didn't know that the Righteous United Society was also under her control.","After dealing with the gang bosses like Zhao Tianxing, Liu Yutong had originally wanted to disband the Righteous United Society, but the proposal was temporarily vetoed.","And the one who vetoed it wasn't her, but her sister, Gao Min.","Her first reaction at the time was, could it be that you, sister, really want to be the 'Young Miss' of the Righteous United Society?","Later, she realized she had been mistaken.","Currently, Qi Wei and his team's investigation had hit a bottleneck. Gao Min had also become a member of the special task force, with Qi Wei, as the deputy team leader, mainly assisting Zheng Yi.","From last year's homicide case to this year's major arson case, although they had arrested many people and racked up achievements one after another, they strangely felt the resistance growing stronger.","Liu Yutong had also pointed them in a new direction: Zhao Weixiang, the owner of the Royal Extreme Club.","Although she knew some even more explosive information, like which certain leaders would be investigated in the future, she couldn't say it. Not only were these things that would happen in the future, but also, she didn't want to get involved in some matters. These were internal affairs for Zheng Yi and his team, best left for their own internal investigation.","So she only provided the lead on Zhao Weixiang.","It was only a lead because she had too little concrete evidence against Zhao Weixiang to completely bring him down.","The guy was too cautious, preferring to scheme from behind the scenes. For now, there was no direct evidence pointing to him.","Just like the major arson case at the beginning of the year—the arsonist was dead.","In the case of Zhao Tianxing's attempt on Liu Yutong's life, there was also no evidence proving Zhao Weixiang was the mastermind behind it.","If Liu Yutong didn't possess an almost god-like perspective of future events, she might have fallen into Zhao Weixiang's trap.","Later, Qi Wei told her that just as they were preparing to set up surveillance on Zhao Weixiang, the man suddenly disappeared.","Learning of Zhao Weixiang's disappearance also surprised Liu Yutong.","Because she had always felt that, given his character, he wouldn't willingly leave like this.","But the fact was, he had indeed vanished.","Liu Yutong thought it was also possible that because of her, the butterfly, Zhao Weixiang had changed his mind from his previous life's course. Feeling he could no longer stay in Mingzhu City, and to avoid her influence, he decided to develop elsewhere.","Besides the Zhao Weixiang lead going cold, the smuggling and money laundering cases Zheng Yi was simultaneously investigating had also stalled.","After sweeping away social forces like the East Sea Alliance, they found the accounts didn't match up. About seventy percent, nearly three billion in illicit funds, had vanished without a trace.","They speculated that behind it all, there was likely a more powerful figure or group who had taken the lion's share, and this behind-the-scenes player's influence was far beyond the likes of Zhao Tianxing.","It was precisely because they encountered this resistance and bottleneck, coupled with Qi Wei and the team feeling that having those underworld figures assist their investigations would be more convenient—especially after tasting the sweet efficiency of working with an 'informant' like Liu Yutong—that they naturally didn't want to easily give up this line.","As everyone knew, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was a legitimate company with busy employees who couldn't always help with investigations.","So this heavy responsibility fell on Gao Min's shoulders, which was also one of the reasons why the Righteous United Society hadn't been disbanded yet.","Gao Min was now thriving in the Righteous United Society, standing above ten thousand.","Even Scarface, the nominal boss, had to respectfully call her 'Sister Min' in private.","Besides, there was another reason.","If they really disbanded the Righteous United Society, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, not being a true gang, couldn't take over those territories. New gangs would surely emerge to fight over them.","So it was better to let the Righteous United Society maintain order on the streets for now.","Those lawless hoodlums would never imagine that the biggest traitor on the streets was the Righteous United Society.","No sooner would someone boast about their glorious criminal record to join the society than they'd be invited for 'tea' (arrested).","Of course, the Righteous United Society's original illegal operations had long been abolished, and many inside had been sent to prison, effectively undergoing a major purge.","The Righteous United Society, which at its peak had thousands of underlings, now had fewer than six hundred members left.","As for their income, it was now only from protection fees for watching over venues.","Of course, these protection fees were, on the surface, for watching venues, but in reality, they were shareholder dividends.","Because the venues the Righteous United Society watched over, they had genuinely invested real money into as shareholders. So it was a legal form of 'protection fee,' and it was barely enough to support the society's members.","Don't look down on the Righteous United Society's mere six hundred members now. In the current landscape of Mingzhu City, it was truly the undisputed number one gang.","Again, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society is a legitimate company, not a gang, so it doesn't count.","Believe it or not, having the largest gang in Mingzhu City act as an undercover informant made the city's public security visibly better.","Originally, the area with the best security was the Carp and Brocade District, where the Ten Thousand Dragons Society headquarters was located.","Now, security across the entire city had noticeably improved.","Many people received commendations and awards for this, especially Gao Min.","If she hadn't joined the police force so recently, the merits she had accumulated could have earned her several promotions.","...","As Liu Yutong walked towards her dormitory, she was thinking about how to dig a pit for Xue Chen and bury him in it.","Just as she reached the dormitory building, she saw a very familiar-looking girl.","She quickly recognized her. It was the girl named Chen Yue who had shared her table in the cafeteria before.","Chen Yue was holding a tote bag that seemed to contain clothes and daily necessities.","She also saw Liu Yutong and immediately stepped forward to greet her: \"Hello, Sister Yutong!\"","\"Chen Yue, are you heading to the hospital for caretaking duty?\" Liu Yutong asked.","Chen Yue nodded with a dejected expression, saying, \"Yes, my father still has to go home to do the farm work. I can only take turns with my mother to look after my little brother.\"","\"Sister Yutong, tell me, how could my brother, so young, already have kidney stones? I just can't wrap my head around it.\"","Liu Yutong almost instinctively uttered four words: \"Melamine!\"","Chen Yue was stunned: \"Melamine?\"","Liu Yutong's expression immediately turned serious: \"Your brother drinks formula milk, right?\"","\"That's right, he was weaned and switched to formula at eight months...\"","Chen Yue suddenly caught on: \"Sister Yutong, do you think there's something wrong with the formula?\"","\"That can't be, right? How could anyone be so heartless as to add melamine to baby formula?\"","\"By adding melamine, the protein content reading in tests becomes higher. To cut costs, what wouldn't some formula manufacturers do?\"","Liu Yutong thought of something and quickly asked: \"By the way, what brand of formula does your brother drink?\"","Chen Yue thought for a moment and said: \"I think it's called... Xiao Lu Formula.\""]},{"number":451,"title":"Chapter 451: 451, Handling the Milk Powder Crisis.","paragraphs":["\"Chen Yue, I'll handle your brother's situation. I can have someone advance the costs for you. I'll send a lawyer to the hospital to meet you shortly,\" Liu Yutong said.","Chen Yue was somewhat overwhelmed by the favor. \"Sister Yutong, this... this is too much trouble for you. How can we possibly... this...\"","Liu Yutong reassured her, \"Don't stand on ceremony. This isn't just your personal matter. If it really is a problem with the formula, then many more babies might be victims behind the scenes. We must get to the bottom of this. You just need to cooperate fully with my lawyer, alright?\"","Chen Yue nodded, her eyes growing warm. \"Alright. Thank you, thank you so much, Sister Yutong.\"","She was genuinely deeply moved.","She had always heard others say Liu Yutong was aloof and unapproachable, but after actually interacting with her, she realized everyone had completely misunderstood her.","Turns out she was such a warm, caring person. It was truly wonderful.","Liu Yutong comforted her a few more words, urging her not to worry, then turned and hurried away without even entering the dormitory building.","She couldn't afford not to hurry, because she wasn't sure if their supermarket chain sold Xiao Lu formula. If they did, an emergency recall was imperative to nip the potential hazard in the bud.","As soon as Liu Yutong got into her car, she directly called Yang Xin.","\"Yang Xin, arrange for an immediate check. See if any of our supermarkets are selling Xiao Lu formula. I'm heading to the University Town branch now.\"","\"What's wrong, Miss?\"","\"I suspect this brand of formula might have issues. Go check right now. Pull all stock from shelves immediately. For any already sold, dispatch people for an immediate recall. Also, arrange company vehicles to take babies who consumed this formula to major hospitals for comprehensive check-ups. We'll advance and cover all costs...\"","Liu Yutong spoke rapidly, yet her instructions were meticulous and clear.","Yang Xin rarely saw the young mistress so urgent and grasped the seriousness of the situation. He promptly hung up and frantically contacted all branch managers, ordering the immediate removal of all formula from shelves.","By the time Liu Yutong arrived at the University Town branch, supermarket staff were already urgently removing the relevant formula. It wasn't just the Xiao Lu brand; other formula brands were also temporarily pulled.","Whether they could be restocked would depend on the results of self-inspections and third-party testing.","In truth, when Wanlong Supermarket initially introduced brands like Xiao Lu, the procedures were sound.","The suppliers provided complete third-party inspection reports, and Wanlong conducted standard sampling checks, confirming no issues before putting them on shelves.","After all, Xiao Lu formula wasn't some small brand but a major enterprise with a market value in the billions.","The real problem lay in the testing standards, as the published standards did not require testing for melamine.","This wasn't due to incomplete standard-setting but rather the standard-setters underestimating the depths of human malice.","As the saying goes, with 100% profit, people dare to take desperate risks, even trampling the law.","Wanlong Supermarket's efficiency was impressive. Within less than twenty minutes of Liu Yutong's order, all branches had completed the removal of all formula brands.","During the removal, Zhao Tianyi and his law firm staff fully participated, assisting supermarket employees with evidence collection throughout the process.","After this, nearly all of the group's hundreds of vehicles were mobilized for the formula recall, especially for Xiao Lu formula.","Subsequent events proved Liu Yutong's judgment correct.","After expedited processing.","The next day, both the group's internal lab and third-party testing agencies reported results. Among the dozen-plus formula brands sold in the supermarkets, five were substandard, testing positive for melamine.","Among them, Xiao Lu formula had the highest additive levels and was also the most well-known and best-selling brand of the five.","At the hospital.","Liu Yutong personally visited the little babies in the pediatric wards.","Although the formula wasn't produced by them, they were the sellers. They failed in their duty of due diligence, so they bore responsibility; they were at fault.","Admit mistakes when you make them, and correct them promptly—this was what she always emphasized to her subordinates.","After all, no one is perfect, no enterprise is flawless; problems will arise to some extent, herself included.","If not for Chen Yue's brother's situation alerting her, she might have truly forgotten about this matter.","Fortunately, the remedy was timely. By tracing back to retained samples from shipments, they discovered that only the most recent two or three batches were problematic; last year's batches were all qualified.","Meaning, the illegal practice of adding melamine by those unscrupulous businesses hadn't been going on for long.","Among the currently hospitalized babies, not many showed obvious symptoms; most cases were relatively mild, which allowed Liu Yutong to breathe a slight sigh of relief.","After seeing the children.","Liu Yutong went to the parents and offered a sincere apology.","\"Everyone, brothers and sisters, I am Liu Yutong, Chairman of the Wanlong Group. I am deeply sorry. Our work had oversights, causing your babies to suffer. Please rest assured, all medical expenses and subsequent nutritional care will be fully advanced and borne by our supermarket. I guarantee every child will receive the best possible treatment.\"","\"Regarding this incident, Wanlong Supermarket will absolutely not shirk responsibility. We have now completely removed and recalled all related products.\"","\"Simultaneously, I hereby announce the group will establish a special fund for the long-term tracking and safeguarding of these children's healthy development. As for pursuing accountability from the related formula brands, our legal team has already initiated proceedings. We will pursue this to the end and guarantee our utmost effort to secure the highest possible financial compensation for everyone!\"","\"............\"","To be honest, among these parents, if Wanlong hadn't proactively sent people to pick them up and urgently recalled the formula, many might still not know the problem was with the formula.","Now, with the group's boss personally apologizing and making commitments, even though their hearts ached for their children, they truly couldn't muster anger towards her. Some even felt grateful inwardly.","If not for their insistence on bringing the babies to the hospital for check-ups, some parents wouldn't have known their children's fussiness was due to physical discomfort.","Coupled with Wanlong Supermarket's usually excellent service and reputation, and their sincere, proactive handling of the problem, the parents had nothing more to say.","After calming the parents, Zhao Tianyi also hurried over with several lawyers.","\"Miss, we have collected all relevant evidence, witness statements, and materials provided by the parents. We are ready to file lawsuits against those five companies at any time.\"","Zhao Tianyi adjusted his glasses and held up three fingers. \"This time, we anticipate securing compensation of no less than eighty million.\"","From last year to now, Wanlong Supermarket has sold a significant quantity of formula. Although the problematic ones were the most recent batches, they intended to trace back all sales to maximize the compensation claim!","Liu Yutong nodded. \"I trust you. Once the compensation is settled, make sure the affected families receive what they're owed immediately. As for the remainder, after deducting your legal fees and our procurement costs, donate it all to the welfare home.\"","She had no intention of keeping money like that.","\"Understood, Miss Liu!\"","Zhao Tianyi thought for a moment and added, \"Miss Liu, I suggest we delay filing the lawsuit for now? Let's keep the news under wraps first.\""]},{"number":452,"title":"Chapter 452: 452. Who Are You Calling \"Young Lady\"","paragraphs":["Although Zhao Tianyi was not officially listed under the Wanlonghui Group, he was in fact a genuine core member.","Generally, important internal news within the group was never hidden from him, nor was there any need to. Informing him in advance was often to avoid certain legal risks.","Therefore, he also knew that the group had recently been targeted, with the mastermind being a young master from Lucheng.","As a lawyer, he had privately arranged for an investigation and knew that this young master named Xue Chen was a major shareholder of Xiaolu Dairy.","Now that Xiaolu infant formula was involved in a scandal, given Xiaolu Dairy's production value and market share, it was only a matter of time before the melamine incident would erupt on a large scale.","When that happened, that Xue Chen would certainly be in deep trouble. Not only would he go bankrupt overnight, but his backers would also face repercussions, and he would lose the privileged status he flaunted.","At that point, the young mistress could deal with him however she wished, as easily as turning over her hand.","Upon hearing Zhao Tianyi's words, Liu Yutong's face instantly turned cold.","\"Tianyi, what have I always said? We cannot do things that go against our conscience!\"","\"Young Mistress, it's not... I...\"","\"I know what you're thinking, but we must weigh the severity of matters. This is a matter of life and death. Can we deliberately conceal it for half a year, waiting for it to explode, just to gain a little more benefit?\"","\"If we didn't know, that would be one thing. But since we do know, we cannot intentionally hide it. That would be treating human life as worthless!\"","\"Just look for yourself. Those babies are so small, so adorable, yet now they have to suffer from illness and pain. For every day we delay the announcement, tens of thousands more children could be harmed! Can we bear that responsibility?\"","\"We can think of other ways to deal with Xue Chen, but it must never be built upon the suffering of more children. That is the bottom line!\"","Zhao Tianyi hung his head in shame.","He had indeed been thinking about how to maximize profits, completely overlooking the potentially severe consequences.","If outsiders found out they had deliberately concealed the information, they would become liable even if they weren't originally.","\"I'm sorry, Young Mistress! I was being foolish!\"","\"I will arrange immediately to report the situation to the regulatory authorities at once, contact the media to issue a public warning, and simultaneously initiate legal proceedings against all responsible companies without any delay!\"","Liu Yutong nodded and said, \"Don't let our company take the field alone on this matter. Get other supermarket competitors on board as well, have them share some of the pressure. If anyone is uncooperative, you can use public opinion appropriately to pressure them.\"","She was almost certain that Xiaolu Dairy would put up a fight, and that Xue Chen would also intervene desperately to protect Xiaolu Dairy.","If he didn't protect it, his billions in assets could be wiped out overnight, and it might even implicate those behind him.","Liu Yutong also believed Xue Chen had the ability to suppress public opinion in the early stages, which is why she reminded Zhao Tianyi not to go it alone.","As long as they rallied other competitors and united with the affected parents to condemn them, the effect might not be worse than waiting for the incident to explode on its own.","\"Understood, Young Mistress,\" Zhao Tianyi replied.","Liu Yutong waved her hand: \"Go on!\"","\"Yes!\" Zhao Tianyi responded firmly, turned, and left quickly.","Right after Zhao Tianyi left.","Liu Yutong received a call from an unknown number. Upon answering, she found it was Xue Chen calling.","She immediately sneered coldly: \"How timely indeed.\"","Xue Chen on the other end of the line didn't waste words either, directly telling her and Yu Xin to come to a meeting, and threatening serious consequences if they didn't go.","She didn't hesitate and agreed directly.","..............","At a certain hotel.","Scarface arrived at the hotel with dozens of his men to meet Xue Chen.","As soon as Xue Chen saw the fierce scar on Scarface's face, he felt a jolt run through him.","The boss of the Yilian Society truly had an extraordinary aura!","He had long heard that Scarface was once slashed across the face with a knife in his early years, yet didn't even blink, while instead the attacker was the one scared into kneeling and begging for mercy.","Now that's a real man!","Xue Chen felt like he had met a kindred spirit in Scarface. As soon as they sat down, they started drinking heavily.","After a few drinks, they began boasting to each other. Strangely enough, Xue Chen found boasting with Scarface quite enjoyable, feeling like he had met a soulmate.","\"Brother Scarface, meeting you today, your reputation is indeed well-deserved!\"","\"You're too kind, Young Master Xue. It's Young Master Xue who is young and accomplished. Having the honor to meet Young Master Xue today is my, Scarface's, good fortune!\"","\"Easy now, easy.\"","\"Brother Scarface, to be frank with you, in Lucheng, I, Xue Chen, am the sky! Last time, some clueless guy tried to compete with me for a project. With one word from me, his company was shut down the very next day! Tell me, isn't that badass?\"","\"Young Master Xue's power and methods... in all my years in the underworld, I, Scarface, have rarely seen anyone like Young Master Xue. Admirable! Truly admirable!\"","\"However, although I don't have Young Master Xue's background, when it comes to fighting, I, Scarface, am no pushover either. Back in the day, I, alone with a single knife, fought my way from the east side of the city to the west, without even blinking an eye....\"","\"Brother Scarface is indeed a fierce man! With a social big brother like you as my ally, plus my resources, what problem couldn't we solve in the future!\"","\"That's right, that's right!\"","\"Come, let's keep drinking!\"","\"............\"","After several rounds of toasts, Scarface's face was flushed red from drinking, and he finally remembered to ask about the real business.","\"Young Master Xue, in this little patch of land called Mingzhu City, I, Scarface, still carry some weight. Just tell me who you want dealt with, I guarantee he won't see tomorrow's sun!\"","Xue Chen really liked Scarface's straightforward personality, so he didn't hide it from him.","\"To be honest, Brother Scarface, I came to Mingzhu City this time to confront that Wanlonghui's young mistress, Liu Yutong, and that woman named Yu Xin. I'll need your help with this!\"","\"What? They dare to offend Young Master Xue? How audacious! Young Master Xue, just tell me, what should I do? Do you want me to tie them up, or just finish them off right away?\"","Because he had drunk a bit too much, Xue Chen didn't catch the problem in Scarface's words, thinking Scarface was talking about dealing with those two women.","\"Brother Scarface is indeed a straightforward man. No need to finish them off. Later, just rub their faces on the ground a bit will do.\"","Scarface nodded, with an 'I understand' expression: \"No problem, I guarantee you'll have a satisfying rub!\"","Xue Chen laughed heartily: \"Then I'll thank you in advance, Brother Scarface.\"","\"What's to thank.\"","Scarface: \"I, Scarface, live by the code in the underworld: if there's a request, it must be answered!\"","The two of them chatted very happily, each speaking their piece, just not on the same wavelength.","Right at that moment, the private room door was pushed open.","Xue Chen was in the middle of his boasting streak and, thinking it was a waiter, roared impatiently.","\"Who is it? Get in here!\"","The door opened, and a cool, aloof figure appeared at the entrance.","Liu Yutong was wearing a black pantsuit, her long hair loose over her shoulders. Her gaze swept indifferently over Xue Chen's flushed face as she walked in.","Behind her, Yu Xin, also dressed in a black pantsuit, followed her in.","A faint smile still hung on Yu Xin's face as she proactively raised her hand to greet Xue Chen.","\"Hey, Young Master Xue, long time no see~\"","As soon as Xue Chen saw her, he sprang to his feet. Pointing at Yu Xin, he shouted arrogantly at Scarface, \"Scarface! It's her! It's this bitch who doesn't know her place! Hurry up! Teach her a lesson. Start by grinding her face into the dirt for me!\"","However, the scene he anticipated did not unfold.","The Scarface beside him also stood up, even taking a moment to solemnly straighten his collar and cuffs.","His previously imposing gangster aura vanished completely, replaced by an attitude of deference.","Under Xue Chen's stunned gaze, Scarface and the several dozen underlings he had brought all turned in unison towards Liu Yutong. They bowed their heads slightly and greeted her in a unified chorus.","\"Young Mistress!\" Dozens of voices echoed.","The arrogance on Xue Chen's face instantly froze, and a profound sense of foreboding rose in his heart.","\"Scar... Scarface? Who... who are you calling Young Mistress?\""]},{"number":453,"title":"Chapter 453: 453. Two Men and One Woman.","paragraphs":["Xue Chen's drunkenness evaporated in an instant.","But before he could utter any threats to Liu Yutong and the others, Scarface reached out and slammed his face hard onto the dining table.","Bang!","That familiar pain shot through him instantly.","\"Ah!!!\"","Seeing this, Yu Xin stepped forward, tilting her head to look at Xue Chen. Her slightly upturned peach blossom eyes were smiling.","\"Surprised, Young Master Xue?\"","\"You spent so much money, hired so many 'brothers', created such a big scene... did it ever cross your mind that the people you went through all that trouble to find to scare us were actually our own people?\"","\"Don't forget, this is Pearl City!\"","Xue Chen's face turned purple with rage. He glared at Yu Xin, wishing he could bore a hole through her face with his stare. Gnashing his teeth, he forced out the words.","\"You'd better let me go, or I'll make sure every single one of you regrets this!\"","\"Oh, I'm so scared.\"","Yu Xin leaned in slightly, cupping her hand by her mouth and lowering her voice to tease him.","\"Hey, to be honest, Young Master Xue, watching you buddy up with Brother Scarface, boasting and drinking just now... you actually looked kinda cute.\"","\"Yu Xin! You damn...\" Xue Chen completely lost his composure and roared.","Liu Yutong, who had been watching coldly from the sidelines, gave a timely cough.","\"Yu Xin, that's enough playing around.\"","\"Alright, Sister Yutong.\"","Yu Xin immediately obediently returned to Liu Yutong's side, her change of expression so swift it was as if the person who had just infuriated Xue Chen moments ago wasn't her at all.","Xue Chen now turned his gaze to the girl in the little black suit.","He had to admit, Liu Yutong possessed a unique aura he had never seen in any other woman.","She wasn't just simply beautiful; she carried a commanding presence, a kind of authority he had only ever seen in his father's generation.","He never expected to sense that kind of feeling from a girl who looked barely seventeen or eighteen today.","No wonder, no wonder the Ten Thousand Dragons Society could become the largest syndicate in Pearl City, and even a society like the Righteous Union had been subdued by them.","Which meant, from start to finish, he had fallen into a pit they had dug.","To be precise, he had jumped into it himself.","Because it never occurred to him that the two largest syndicates would both take orders from one person.","This situation would be unbelievable anywhere.","As the saying goes, two tigers cannot share one mountain. It's highly unlikely for two major syndicates in one place to be on good terms.","But in Pearl City, it was different. Both societies were connected to Liu Yutong, which was truly rather unbelievable.","Also, he couldn't quite figure out why they would do this. It made no sense at all.","\"Liu Yutong, tell Scarface to let me go, and we'll consider this matter settled, how about that?\"","\"Young Master Xue, do you think I'd believe you?\"","\"From the very beginning, our Ten Thousand Dragons Society doesn't seem to have had any feud with you, right? You came demanding we hand over Wanhui Youxuan, then you went to my turf to mess with my company, and now, you've even set your sights on my people.\"","\"Tell me, how should I deal with you?\"","\"Liu Yutong, you can't...\"","Before Xue Chen could finish, Liu Yutong waved her hand. \"Then let's give him the lesson he asked for, as he suggested.\"","Hearing this, Scarface stopped holding back. He immediately called over another man, and right in front of Xue Chen's horrified expression, the two of them dragged him off the table and pressed his face against the floor.","But just as they were about to proceed with dragging Xue Chen, there was a sound at the private room door.","Knock, knock, knock.","Someone gently rapped on the doorframe.","Then, three figures walked in.","Leading them was a tall, slender young man with an extraordinary bearing. Beside him was a somewhat flamboyant young man with dyed silver-white short hair.","Apart from these two men, a woman followed behind them.","The woman had chestnut-colored long hair and wore a pair of black sunglasses that covered nearly half her face. Though her full features were obscured, she exuded a cool, aloof aura befitting a noblewoman from a prestigious family.","Yu Xin recognized the two men in front: Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong, both major young masters from this province.","The young master from the neighboring province, Gu Yebai, hadn't come this time.","As for this woman with the cool, noble air, Yu Xin was seeing her for the first time and didn't know her.","\"Director Yu, we meet again.\"","\"This lady must be the young mistress of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, Ms. Liu Yutong, right?\" Zhou Muchen looked towards Liu Yutong, who clearly had the strongest presence and aura in the room, and asked with a smile.","\"And you are?\" Liu Yutong, having never met these people before, frowned slightly.","Seeing this, Yu Xin immediately stepped forward to introduce them to Liu Yutong. \"Sister Yutong, this is Young Master Zhou Muchen, and this is Young Master Lu Hong. They are the ones I met in Perch City last time.\"","Liu Yutong immediately knew who they were. She hadn't expected the two top young masters from the province to have come as well.","After introducing the two gentlemen, Yu Xin turned her gaze to the woman wearing sunglasses, her smile unchanged. \"As for this beautiful lady, I must admit my eyes are clumsy, this is our first meeting. May I ask how to address you?\"","The chestnut-haired woman didn't answer immediately. She merely lifted her chin slightly, her gaze seeming to assess Liu Yutong through the sunglasses.","The reason she had suddenly followed Zhou Muchen here was because she had heard about the remarkable young woman who had appeared in Pearl City. Barely eighteen or nineteen, she had built a fortune worth hundreds of millions from scratch and single-handedly nurtured the strongest force in Pearl City's underworld.","This naturally piqued the curiosity of her, who had always been fiercely competitive, about this extraordinary woman Zhou Muchen spoke of.","She even felt a desire to measure herself against her.","To see who was the true favored daughter of heaven.","That's why she had come with Zhou Muchen today.","\"My name is Zhu Silin.\"","Zhu Silin gave a simple introduction, her tone straightforward yet carrying an edge.","\"I've long heard of Ms. Liu's remarkable methods in Pearl City. I came specifically today to see for myself.\"","Then, she looked down at Xue Chen with his face pressed to the floor. \"It seems I've arrived just in time, not missing this good show.\"","Xue Chen's face flushed a deep purple, a mix of shame and fury.","Not only was he being humiliated by having his face rubbed against the floor for the second time, but Zhou Muchen and the others were witnessing it for the second time as well.","Now, any shred of his dignity was completely gone.","At this moment, he would rather have been beaten or roughed up by Liu Yutong and her crew than be seen by Zhou Muchen in such an embarrassing state.","Liu Yutong remained neither subservient nor arrogant. \"So it's Ms. Zhu. A pleasure.\"","Zhu Silin said, \"Ms. Liu, by acting like this, aren't you showing far too little regard for our Cloud Mountain Club?\""]},{"number":454,"title":"Chapter 454: 454, Betting","paragraphs":["Zhu Silin's question was blunt, her tone clearly accusatory.","After all, Xue Chen was also a member of the Yunshan Association.","Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong's expression remained unreadable, only her eyes growing slightly colder, like the deep, still waters of a winter pond, calm yet exuding a faint chill.","Before she could speak, Yu Xin, standing beside her, let out a light, mocking laugh.","\"Sister Zhu, that's not quite right.\"","\"It was this young master Xue who came to our Pearl City to cause trouble first. Not only did he try to forcibly seize our business, but he also brought all these people intending to harm Sister Yutong. We were merely acting in self-defense. How does that translate to us looking down on the Yunshan Association?\"","Just as Zhu Silin was about to retort, Zhou Muchen gently shook his head at her, stopping her.","\"Miss Liu, we had a bit of an unpleasant encounter with President Yu last time in Lu City. Today, we came hoping to have a chat with you.\"","Liu Yutong's demeanor was indifferent. \"There's nothing to chat about. If you refrain from causing trouble for me in the future, we can stay out of each other's way.\"","\"Of course, if you still have designs on my Wanlong Association, we won't be easy to push around either!\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the members of the Yilian Association in the room and outside the private dining room all took a step forward, their expressions hostile.","Zhou Muchen's face changed slightly. He had underestimated this woman's resolve.","He could tell she was genuinely willing to take action against them. The sharpness in her eyes was no bluff.","As the founder of the Yunshan Association, Zhou Muchen knew when to bend and when to stand firm, especially when facing overwhelming odds.","\"This whole matter is a misunderstanding. We came here with sincere intentions. Could you release my brother now, and we can talk over the meal?\"","Seeing him adopt a lower posture and speaking as such, and considering she genuinely didn't want to make enemies of these well-connected individuals, Liu Yutong waved her hand, signaling Scar to let Xue Chen go.","Xue Chen scrambled to his feet, feeling flustered. Instinctively, he wanted to utter threats, but seeing Scar's eager stance and the Yilian Association members in the room rolling up their sleeves, he forcefully swallowed his words.","A wise man doesn't fight when the odds are against him. He'd find an opportunity to settle the score later.","He no longer held any hope of using underworld figures to deal with Liu Yutong, Yu Xin, and the others.","He'd just have the police arrest them directly. After all, he had witnesses who could prove Liu Yutong damaged the production crew's equipment. With a little pressure from him, he could definitely make Liu Yutong and the others end up behind bars.","Then he could take his time dismantling the Wanlong Association.","Zhou Muchen casually gestured an invitation, and Liu Yutong subsequently took a seat with them.","However, after the dishes were served, Liu Yutong didn't initiate conversation or engage with them, merely eating her food unhurriedly.","It was Yu Xin who kept up a sporadic, rambling chatter with them, deliberately stringing them along.","Finally.","Zhou Muchen lost patience and took the initiative to address Liu Yutong again. \"Miss Liu, let me be direct. Regarding your group-buying project, we can make a concession.\"","Liu Yutong remained calm. \"My apologies, no concessions.\"","Zhou Muchen suppressed his anger, a vein faintly pulsing on his forehead. \"Do you truly wish to make an enemy of our Yunshan Association?\"","Liu Yutong raised her eyes, meeting Zhou Muchen's gaze directly. \"Young Master Zhou, with all due respect, your Yunshan Association has power and influence, with plenty of avenues to make money. Why must you fixate on us? Could it be you genuinely think a few women are easy to bully?\"","Zhou Muchen neither denied nor confirmed. \"Since you ask, Miss Liu, let me pose a question first. What do you think is the most profitable business?\"","Liu Yutong answered without hesitation. \"Real estate. With your resources, raising billions for a real estate venture wouldn't be a problem, far more lucrative than our Wanhui Youxuan.\"","Zhou Muchen shook his head. \"My father still has a chance for further promotion. I won't touch real estate.\"","Liu Yutong frowned slightly. \"So, you set your sights on my Wanhui Youxuan?\"","\"If you insist on taking it, I can hand it over. But let me be blunt: I can create a new platform at any time and crush you with it.\"","\"You're not wrong. You are indeed formidable in business management.\"","Zhou Muchen paused, then continued. \"Precisely because we recognize your capabilities, Miss Liu, we approached you. We have the resources, you have the skill. We can achieve a win-win situation.\"","Liu Yutong shook her head firmly. \"My apologies. As I said before, I don't like anyone telling me what to do. The Wanlong Association answers only to me. Nothing can change that!\"","At that moment.","Zhu Silin, who had been watching Liu Yutong intently, spoke up.","\"Miss Liu, Brother Chen has always believed you're more skilled in business than any of us. Coincidentally, I happen to disagree. My field is finance. Last year, I managed funds totaling around 100 million, with a final profit of 16 million.\"","\"I wonder, given 100 million, how much could you earn?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Miss Zhu, your finance work involves mainly stock market investments?\"","Zhu Silin nodded. \"Correct. I also have overseas investment operations. I invested ten million US dollars last year, with a surplus also exceeding one million dollars.\"","Liu Yutong smiled faintly. \"Miss Zhu is indeed impressive, earning over 20 million with less than 200 million in capital.\"","\"If I were given 200 million in capital, I could probably turn it into around one billion.\"","Zhu Silin, who had initially been about to nod in acknowledgment, froze upon hearing this, her eyes widening in disbelief.","Her expression then turned visibly colder. She felt Liu Yutong was simply mocking her.","\"Tenfold?\"","\"Miss Liu, I know you might have your methods in business, but financial investment isn't child's play, and it certainly doesn't rely on boasting. Turning 200 million into one billion in a year, a fivefold return? Do you have any idea what kind of return on investment that signifies? Hah!\"","Zhou Muchen also couldn't help but frown slightly, a flicker of doubt in his eyes.","He had originally admired Liu Yutong's boldness and ability, but hearing this made him wonder if the woman was being overly arrogant.","One billion?","Even the so-called 'Stock God' wouldn't dare claim he could make money this year, would he?","Liu Yutong saw their disbelief and the corners of her mouth lifted into a confident smile. \"It seems you don't believe me. Then let me ask you all, do you think Lehman Brothers, the American investment bank, will go bankrupt and collapse?\"","Zhu Silin was the first to jump in. \"How could that be? Although there's significant volatility in foreign markets right now, Lehman is, after all, the fourth-largest investment bank in the US. There's no way it could collapse.\"","The others nodded in agreement.","Never mind that it was just some volatility—fluctuations are normal in stock investments. Even if real problems arose, the US government wouldn't sit idly by. Given Lehman Brothers' massive scale, its collapse would be disastrous, potentially affecting the entire world.","So they believed the US government would inevitably intervene.","Liu Yutong looked at Yu Xin. \"Yu Xin, what do you think?\"","Yu Xin said without hesitation, \"Since you put it that way, Sister Yutong, I think Lehman Brothers will go bankrupt.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"What Yu Xin said is my judgment. Since you all have doubts, let's make a bet first.\"","Zhou Muchen raised an eyebrow slightly. \"Bet on what?\"","Liu Yutong's tone shifted as she pointed at Xue Chen. \"Let's bet that within three days, you will kick Xue Chen out of the Yunshan Club!\"","Xue Chen was taken aback, his face completely bewildered. \"How did this circle back to me again?\"","\"Liu Yutong, are you fucking targeting me on purpose?!\""]},{"number":455,"title":"Chapter 455: 455. Raising the Stakes.","paragraphs":["Xue Chen's curse had just left his lips when Yun Cheng, who had been standing silently behind Liu Yutong, having barely spoken the entire time, walked over to him, raised his hand, and slapped him hard across the face.","The force behind that slap was explosive; Xue Chen, chair and all, was sent flying.","This sudden turn of events gave everyone else present a huge fright.","Zhou Muchen and the others were both shocked and furious—shocked by the cold, stern young man's strength, and furious that the other party had acted without hesitation, showing them no regard at all.","In this province, this woman before them was the first to dare be so arrogant in front of them.","\"Liu Yutong, what is the meaning of this? Do you truly intend to tear up all pretense of cordiality?!\" Zhou Muchen roared angrily.","\"Mr. Zhou, calm down,\" Liu Yutong said with a composed expression. \"Yun Cheng was merely teaching a lesson to someone who doesn't understand decorum and spews filthy language. How does that constitute tearing up cordiality?\"","\"Does Mr. Zhou perhaps believe that I, Liu Yutong, am someone anyone can insult, and I should still greet them with a smile?\"","\"If it were members of the Yunshan Society who dared to offend you so brazenly outside, Mr. Zhou, would you merely issue a verbal warning?\"","Zhou Muchen was momentarily left speechless by her questions.","If someone really dared to curse at him, he'd probably retaliate even more harshly.","He just found it somewhat unacceptable that this group could be so audacious. In this province, Liu Yutong and her people were absolutely the first to show them not an ounce of face.","Liu Yutong continued, \"I am a person who judges matters, not people. Xue Chen offended me, and my subordinate meted out punishment. That is perfectly reasonable. This has nothing to do with the Yunshan Society, and I have no intention of making enemies of Mr. Zhou, Mr. Lu, or Ms. Zhu.\"","Hearing her say this made Zhou Muchen feel slightly better.","Finally, he took a deep breath and forcibly suppressed his rage.","A little impatience spoils great plans.","For the sake of a good-for-nothing like Xue Chen, to completely break with Liu Yutong and her group now would be utterly unwise.","After all, the vast majority of people in this room were on her side; their few people wouldn't even be enough to fill the gaps between their teeth.","Originally, Zhou Muchen and the others had dared to come to the meeting without bringing their own men because they were certain Liu Yutong wouldn't dare lay a hand on them.","Not just Liu Yutong—anyone who knew their identities would treat them with respect, no matter how many people they had.","They just hadn't anticipated that Liu Yutong wasn't the type to swallow an insult, or rather, had no intention of swallowing any insult, even when facing second-generation elites like them.","This temperament could also be called formidable.","\"Miss Liu, what skillful methods! Today we have indeed learned a lesson!\" Zhou Muchen said through gritted teeth. \"Since you want to make a bet, I'll accept. If we kick Xue Chen out of the Yunshan Society within three days, then you win. I can promise you that henceforth we'll stay out of each other's way.\"","\"But if we don't kick him out...\"","Liu Yutong said, \"You just want Wanhui Youxuan, don't you? If I lose, I can give you the remaining shares for free. However, in that case, your stake in the bet seems rather lacking in sincerity, doesn't it?\"","These guys provoked her and her Wanlong Society first, and now they think they can use a mere promise of non-interference as their betting stake, paying no price at all? They're thinking too wishfully.","\"What do you want then?\" Zhou Muchen asked grimly.","Liu Yutong smiled slightly. \"You don't really have anything I want, so let's make it money. If you lose, cough up one hundred million. You all don't seem short on cash; this amount should be a drop in the bucket for you, shouldn't it?\"","Zhou Muchen couldn't miss the veiled sarcasm in her words.","She was mocking them for their earlier wishful thinking, or perhaps calling them paupers for trying to buy Wanhui Youxuan shares with just twenty million.","But to be honest, they weren't exactly rolling in money.","This \"rolling in money\" is relative; it depends on who you compare them to.","The three of them currently controlled funds totaling around four hundred million, with Zhu Silin having the most liquid capital at her disposal.","Zhu Silin's father's family background was similar to Zhou Muchen's and Lu Hong's, but her mother was involved in transnational business and was extremely wealthy.","The startup capital for her ventures all came from her mother.","Also, they hadn't been involved in business for very long, given their age—they were all around twenty-four or twenty-five, having just graduated from university not long ago.","Moreover, according to their thinking, they definitely still wanted to earn \"clean money.\"","You could also say they currently had a somewhat delusional confidence in their own abilities.","At that moment, Zhu Silin, who had been restless, spoke up again: \"Miss Liu, I accept your condition.\"","\"However, I'd like to add another stake to the bet.\"","Liu Yutong looked at her with interest. \"Ms. Zhu, what stake would you like to add?\"","Zhu Silin said, \"I just think betting on whether we kick Xue Chen out of the Yunshan Society is rather boring. It's impossible we couldn't even wait three days; we're bound to win. I'm actually more interested in what you mentioned earlier. Earlier you said you thought Lehman Brothers would go bankrupt. Based on my experience in overseas investments and the information I know, that's simply impossible. You don't understand Lehman's scale or the magnitude of the impact its bankruptcy would have.\"","\"How about we add another wager? Just between you and me. If in three days, you win, I, Zhu Silin, will steer clear of you from then on, convinced and outmatched. I can even promise to do one thing for you that doesn't violate my principles.\"","\"If you lose, then it proves you were just lucky. I want you to publicly admit that, in terms of vision and boldness, you are inferior to me, Zhu Silin! Furthermore, in the future, that Mingzhu Capital you're setting up with those wealthy individuals from Mingzhu City must have me as the lead.\"","\"Agreed,\" Liu Yutong agreed without hesitation.","Then she looked at Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong. \"Mr. Zhou, Mr. Lu, would you like to add stakes as well?\"","\"If I recall correctly, there are one or two other wealthy individuals in your Yunshan Society. How about losing means pooling an extra few hundred million in funds for me? I can put up the supermarket business under my Wanlong Society Group as additional stake.\"","Upon hearing this, Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong both hesitated. Originally, they thought Zhu Silin was being somewhat rash by proactively adding to the bet.","However, Zhu Silin had the foundation to add stakes with Liu Yutong, after all—her mother was a billionaire worth several billion.","They didn't. Their families currently only had the two of them deciding to go into business. They had worked hard to gather that bit of capital over the past few years; how could they bear to bet it all?","Moreover, it wouldn't be appropriate for them to presumptuously agree to stakes on behalf of those other top-tier second-generation heirs.","But now that Liu Yutong had said this, they couldn't back down either, or else it would mean they were afraid of her.","\"Let me make a call first.\"","With that, Zhou Muchen stood up, walked to the window of the private room, turned his back to the group, and made a call.","A moment later.","He hung up, came back to stand before Liu Yutong, and said word by word, \"We accept this bet. Add another five hundred million!\"","Although Zhou Muchen didn't know why Liu Yutong was so confident, or perhaps so insane, as to dare bet on what seemed like a sure-loss wager.","Never mind that they had no intention of kicking Xue Chen out of the Yunshan Society; even if they did intend to, would they really be so impatient they couldn't wait three days before kicking him out?","In short, the advantage was on their side; Liu Yutong was bound to lose!"]},{"number":456,"title":"Chapter 456: 456, Thunderous News","paragraphs":["\"Since the bet is set, we'll take our leave now. Enjoy your meal, everyone.\"","\"Three days from now, at the same time, I'll be waiting quietly for you all to honor your commitment.\"","After saying this, Liu Yutong stood up directly and said to Yu Xin, \"Yu Xin, let's go.\"","\"Right away, Sister Yutong!\"","Yu Xin quickly came to Liu Yutong's side, not forgetting to shoot Zhou Muchen and Zhu Silin a look that said 'good luck to you'.","Like all core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, her trust in Liu Yutong was almost blind.","No matter what decision Liu Yutong made, their first reaction wasn't to question or hesitate, but to firmly believe things would unfold exactly as she predicted.","This was the authority possessed only by the absolute leader of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society Group.","That's why she felt sorry for Zhou Muchen and the others. These arrogant second-generation heirs had no idea how badly they were going to lose.","Liu Yutong left the hotel, surrounded by Scarface, Yun Cheng, and a group of members from the Righteous Union Society.","Once seated in the black Maybach waiting at the entrance, Yu Xin finally couldn't contain her excitement. She grabbed Liu Yutong's arm, her eyes sparkling.","\"Sister Yutong, you were so cool just now! Once those hundreds of millions come in, won't we be able to start the headquarters construction plan?\"","Liu Yutong shook her head: \"We can't take that money.\"","Yu Xin looked puzzled: \"Huh? Why not?\"","Liu Yutong explained: \"Although Xue Chen is like a grasshopper after autumn, not long for this world, the resources and influence represented by those few people behind him are far more valuable than that money.\"","Hearing Liu Yutong say this, Yu Xin seemed to understand her plan.","Although she felt it was a pity to miss out on a free six hundred million, she also knew Liu Yutong's decision was right.","Even though they had seemingly gotten the upper hand over Zhou Muchen on the surface, if they truly made mortal enemies of these few people from the Cloud Mountain Club, it would be a huge trouble for the Ten Thousand Dragons Society Group.","It's always better to have one more friend than one more enemy, especially when that enemy is a group of top-tier young masters and wealthy heirs.","................","Two days later.","Zhao Tianyi held a press conference. Whether by spending money or using other means, he invited numerous media outlets, including television stations and major portals, launching a fierce attack on Xiao Lu Milk Powder and other companies that had added melamine to their products.","Because the preparation was extremely thorough, with a complete chain of evidence including witnesses, physical evidence, and case files all in place, it caused a huge social uproar that very day.","Simultaneously, a flood of posts surged online all at once. Even if someone reacted and tried to delete them, it was too late. The news had already spread completely and couldn't be suppressed.","Xue Chen, who was still lingering in Pearl City and hadn't left, saw the news and his face instantly turned deathly pale.","Not just him, even Zhou Muchen and the others were stunned.","Looking at the hundreds of cases reported and the tragic state of those infants less than a year old, even these heirs felt a wave of fear.","Yes, they had money and power.","But some things could also easily strip them of everything, like this milk powder scandal.","The severity of this incident goes without saying; labeling the responsible parties with 'reckless disregard for human life' wouldn't be an overstatement, and the lives disregarded were those of future blossoms.","No wonder, no wonder that Liu Yutong was so confident in making the bet with them. She was already prepared.","Now they only had two choices before them: admit defeat, or become deadbeats.","If they didn't forcefully cut ties with Xue Chen, they might even be implicated themselves. There was simply no other way.","Unless they could control the public opinion.","But the other side was so well-prepared, finding media from other provinces, even from the capital city. Controlling it was impossible.","Although they knew they were bound to lose, they still felt somewhat unwilling.","After all, that was six hundred million, an absolute blow to their finances.","The group fell silent for a long time.","Finally, Zhu Silin was the first to make a decision.","\"Brother Chen, no matter what you all think, I accept my loss. I'll pay my share.\"","Deep down, she still felt somewhat unconvinced, as this was clearly something the other side had planned long in advance.","So, she still didn't believe she was inferior to Liu Yutong in terms of investment ability and such.","However, that didn't mean she would renege. She could afford to lose.","Lu Hong irritably ran his hand through his hair, cursing angrily: \"Damn it! Six hundred million! Just giving it to her like that? I can't accept it!\"","“What can you do even if you can't accept it? We have no choice. If we don't cut ties with that waste, Xue Chen, quickly, what we'll lose later won't be just six hundred million. I've already stated my position. You all make your decisions soon.”","\"Silin is right, we have no choice. Silin, notify everyone to pool the money.\"","Zhou Muchen stood up somewhat irritably: \"I'm going out for a walk.\"","With that, he prepared to leave.","To be honest, this matter had really dealt a blow to him.","He considered himself a top performer among his peers, yet he ended up being manipulated by a girl several years younger than him. This feeling was really hard for him to accept.","Lu Hong felt much the same. Seeing Zhou Muchen going out, he followed.","\"I'll go with you.\"","The two had no intention of inviting Zhu Silin; it was obvious they were planning to go to some business club or similar places.","Zhu Silin gave them a disdainful glance, then stopped caring. She picked up the phone and started calling the other members of the Cloud Mountain Club.","After going downstairs.","Lu Hong kicked an empty soda can on the roadside.","\"Damn it, the more I think about it, the angrier I get!\"","\"Six hundred million! How many supercars do I have to sell to earn that back? Just thinking about it makes my flesh ache!\"","\"Brother Chen, are we really just letting it go like this?\"","Zhou Muchen retorted: \"What else do you want to do?\"","Lu Hong: \"I... sigh, forget it.\"","\"Brother Chen, where are we going? Do you know any fun places?\"","Lu Hong was about to say he just came downstairs to wander aimlessly.","Just then, a group of students passed by them, excitedly heading in one direction.","\"Hurry! The match is about to start. The Phoenix Throne Cup finals must be amazing.\"","\"Who do you think will win the championship, Team Zi or Team Haoyang?\"","“Hard to say, but whatever, there are definitely lots of wealthy people here today. We can freeload some milk tea.”","\"........\"","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong, seeing the students excitedly discussing some competition, suddenly became interested too.","They weren't that old themselves, and online games were one of their favorite forms of entertainment, especially FPS games.","\"Phoenix Throne Cup?\"","\"That name sounds quite intimidating! Phoenix Throne! Wonder if there's a King of Hell?\"","\"Hahaha...\"","“Whatever, should we go check out the excitement?”","\"Sure, sounds lively. We've got nothing to do anyway, might as well go take a look.\""]},{"number":457,"title":"Chapter 457: 457. The Lively Finals Venue.","paragraphs":["Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong, having nothing else to do, followed the group of students all the way to the vicinity of a square.","From a distance, they could see several eye-catching large characters hanging on the wall.","\"Phoenix Power Esports. So it's this 'Phoenix Power' after all this time.\"","\"That name... it feels somewhat familiar.\"","\"Maybe we saw it while passing by before.\"","\"Possibly.\"","\"........\"","Although Zhou Muchen had previously had someone investigate the Wanlonghui Group's information and knew they had invested in opening a few internet cafe esports venues, their scale wasn't large, so he hadn't paid much attention.","Their main focus was the infinitely potential Wanhui Youxuan, followed by the supermarket business.","As for internet cafes, they simply didn't register on their radar.","Furthermore, they didn't know Li Xiaohui was at Wanlonghui, as that information couldn't be found through simple document checks.","The Wanlonghui Group was not a listed company and had no obligation to disclose information. Moreover, Liu Yutong had deliberately concealed the fact that she had joined Wanlonghui.","Unless you specifically sent someone to inquire about a person named Li Xiaohui, but even then, you'd probably only hear about a purple-haired \"Sister Hui\" type.","Because within Wanlonghui, people mostly preferred to call each other \"Brother XX\" or \"Sister XX,\" rarely using direct names or official titles.","Therefore, it never crossed Zhou Muchen's mind that Li Xiaohui was within Wanlonghui.","The place Zhou Muchen and the others arrived at was a branch of Phoenix Power Esports, located on the first floor of a department store building.","This building also housed a branch of Wanlong Supermarket and a branch of Yuyuefang restaurant.","As for why this branch was chosen to host the finals, firstly, it wasn't too far from the university district. Secondly, there was an open space outside the department store, a square, where a temporary viewing area outside the cafe could be set up.","The match between the two teams would naturally still be held inside the internet cafe, as moving the computer setups outside would be unstable, plus the evening weather outside was a bit chilly, and they were afraid it might affect the players' performance.","However, broadcasting the match footage outside was no problem; it just required a large screen and a sound system.","At this moment, most of the spectators had gathered in the small square outside the department store.","The internet cafe had also prepared a large number of plastic stools well in advance, but the estimated number of spectators had conservatively exceeded three thousand. There simply weren't enough seats for everyone, and those who didn't get a stool had no choice but to stand.","Among them, no less than three hundred people from Wanlonghui had come, all to show support for Sister Hui.","Of course, to avoid causing unnecessary alarm, everyone was in casual clothes, not work uniforms.","Liu Yutong had also come, but she was watching the match inside the internet cafe, wearing a hat and large bug-eye sunglasses, keeping a low profile as well.","Apart from the Wanlonghui members, the rest were almost all students from the university district, especially from the Finance University and the Institute of Technology.","This was because the other team in the finals, the Haoyang Team, hailed from the Institute of Technology. Their captain, Mu Yang, was an AK expert, capable of landing headshots almost every time, a highly skilled player.","The other members of Haoyang Team were also quite strong. In fact, more people were betting on them to win the championship than on the Purple Lord Team.","After all, some people, seeing that the captain of the Purple Lord Team was actually a girl, naturally felt their chances of winning were somewhat lower.","Besides the Wanlonghui crowd and the university students, the scene had also attracted many passersby who stopped to join the excitement.","Along the roadside, many vendors had seized the opportunity to set up stalls selling snacks, making the atmosphere incredibly lively.","The closer they got to the internet cafe, the denser the crowd became, to the point of people jostling against each other.","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong grew increasingly surprised.","They had completely not expected a small esports competition held by an internet cafe to attract such a large audience. It was utterly beyond their expectations.","\"Brother Chen, there are so many people here! Looks like several thousand. Even some domestic esports event venues might not have this many people, right?\"","\"No, current esports events are just so-so. This scale is a first for me too.\"","\"Tsk tsk... Look over there, they're even selling milk tea. The cafe owner is quite business-savvy. There's such a long queue just for milk tea.\"","\"The atmosphere is well done. Just wonder if the competition level matches the scene.\"","\"Hey, it's a university competition, just for fun. But I heard those students shouting earlier, that Haoyang Team seems pretty strong. Their captain is some kind of 'AK maniac'.\"","\"What about the other team? That... Purple something?\"","\"Look, there's a poster over there. Called the Purple Lord Team. What a lame name, so tacky! Heard their captain is a girl.\"","\"We'll see. If the skill level is too poor, we'll just treat it as entertainment.\"","\"........\"","When the two men reached the internet cafe entrance and tried to go in, they were promptly stopped by staff.","The reason given was that it was already full inside.","For this finals, the internet cafe did not offer standing room tickets, only seated tickets.","The main hall had roughly a hundred machines, meaning whoever booked a seat first could enter the cafe to watch.","For those who came late? Too bad, they could only watch from outside.","This was also to prevent overcrowding and excessive noise inside the cafe, which could affect the players' performance, hence the limit on numbers.","However, this didn't stump Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong.","They directly used the power of money to buy two seats and smoothly entered the internet cafe's interior.","Although the number of people inside was much smaller, it was still bustling with noise and excitement, but the viewing experience was noticeably better.","A huge projection screen hung in the center, split into left and right halves, alternately displaying previews of several competition maps.","These were all maps for the Bombing mode to be used in the upcoming match.","Members of both teams had also taken their seats at the respective competition stations.","Right at this moment.","A young man dressed in the internet cafe's uniform, looking like the manager, walked to the center of the venue holding a wireless microphone, a smile on his face.","\"Distinguished guests, esports enthusiasts, welcome to the live finals of our Phoenix Power Cup CF tournament! Before the match officially begins, let's warm up a bit and cheer for the team you support!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, one side of the projection screen immediately switched to a simple leaderboard interface. It listed the two team names, 【Haoyang Team】 and 【Purple Lord Team】, followed by long numbers, both currently at zero.","\"Same rules as before!\"","\"All milk tea stalls at the venue and on the outside square are serving our signature 'Boyah's Broken Strings' milk tea. For every cup purchased, you can specify which team you want to send your support to!\"","\"We will tally the cup counts in real-time and display them on the big screen. The team receiving more support cups will have all its members receive an additional championship bonus prize provided by Phoenix Power Esports!\""]},{"number":458,"title":"Chapter 458: 458. A Reward of Six Thousand Cups of Milk Tea","paragraphs":["As soon as the rules were announced, the venue erupted into excitement.","This approach of bringing the future online live-streaming tipping model into the offline space had truly ignited the audience's enthusiasm for participation.","Right after the shop manager finished speaking, a wealthy supporter of one of the teams couldn't hold back and started showing off.","A young man who looked like a student from the Institute of Technology suddenly stood up, waved his hand grandly, and shouted to a nearby server.","\"Bro, get us a hundred cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings' for the Haoyang Team first, to cheer the brothers on!\"","On the big screen, the number behind Haoyang Team instantly jumped to 100.","Simultaneously, the host began hyping up the atmosphere.","\"Thank you Young Master Liu from the Institute of Technology for the hundred cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings'! Young Master Liu is truly generous! On behalf of the Haoyang Team, I thank you for your tremendous support!\"","Almost immediately after.","A girl wearing glasses, who looked quite quiet and gentle, also stood up.","\"Go, Purple Lady Team! I support Purple Lady with one hundred and twenty cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings'!\"","\"Wow! Another beauty throwing down a hundred cups in support! Thank you for your generous support, miss!\"","\"Whoa!!\" The venue erupted in another wave of exclamations.","On the big screen, Purple Lady Team's number leaped to 120, surpassing Haoyang Team in one go.","Following the lead of these two wealthy students, more and more people joined the cheering ranks.","\"I support Purple Lady with twenty cups!\"","\"Haoyang Team is the best, I'll add thirty cups!\"","\"Go Purple Lady! I... I'll buy five cups!\"","\"........\"","The numbers behind the two teams began to scroll rapidly. Supporters from both sides seemed to be fighting a war without gunpowder smoke, competing over who was more passionate and whose financial power was stronger.","Of course, the host didn't forget to remind everyone to act within their means, especially that minors couldn't participate in sending milk tea.","\"Huh, the atmosphere is pretty heated,\" Lu Hong raised an eyebrow, his interest piqued.","This kind of fervent atmosphere was indeed very infectious.","\"Brother Chen, this is kinda fun. This internet cafe really knows how to create a vibe. Isn't this way more interesting than just sitting around watching the match?\"","Zhou Muchen also smiled. This simple, direct method of stirring up emotions was indeed refreshing.","It was his first time seeing someone use this method for marketing. It seemed the boss behind this internet cafe was a marketing genius.","Today's revenue would probably easily break six figures.","Even he felt a little tempted, wanting to send a thousand cups of milk tea to show off and make the whole crowd shout \"Brother Chen is awesome!\"","Just thinking about it felt great.","Right at that moment.","A core member of the Wanlong Society, a burly man, suddenly stood up and roared.","\"Quit dawdling with such small amounts! For our Sister Hui... I mean, for the Purple Lady Team, get us eight hundred cups to start!\"","He almost slipped up. Everyone was in casual clothes today, so they couldn't just expose their identities; otherwise, people might say they were plants.","\"Whoa!\"","The venue erupted in another wave of exclamations, everyone looking at this burly man.","This was followed by more shouts: \"Brother Sun is awesome!\"","This was the wealthiest supporter with the highest number of gifts so far.","Lu Hong watched, his heart itching unbearably. He suddenly really wanted to show off!","Then he looked eagerly at Zhou Muchen: \"Brother Chen, shall we play too?\"","Zhou Muchen didn't refuse. Like Lu Hong, it was his first time seeing such a novel tipping method, and his desire to show off was also stirred.","\"Who do you want to support?\"","Lu Hong: \"That Haoyang Team. I don't like the look of that female captain of Purple Lady. Participating in a competition all wrapped up like a zongzi. I just can't stand people who act all mysterious like that.\"","Although they were some distance from the competition stage, they could still see the players' faces.","Everyone else looked normal, but the female captain of the Purple Lady was particularly mysterious.","She was wearing a large mask that covered almost half of her face, along with a baseball cap on her head. If she lowered her head slightly, it would even cover her eyes, making it impossible for others to see her face clearly.","This naturally made some people think she was deliberately being mysterious.","But there was no helping it. Li Xiaohui didn't want her father to see the news the next day and suddenly spot her in the footage. She'd be scolded to death.","That's why she came fully armed to participate in the competition, even using a cute emoji to cover her face on the printed team poster.","Zhou Muchen's thoughts were similar to Lu Hong's. He also felt the girl was putting on an act.","\"Then let's play.\"","He directly took out his wallet from his pocket, pulled out a black credit card, placed it on the table, and instructed a nearby server: \"Get us three thousand cups of that 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings' thing first, for the Haoyang Team.\"","Lu Hong similarly drew a card: \"Same for me!\"","The server looked at the two exceptionally textured black cards on the table, then at the two young men of extraordinary bearing before him, knowing he had encountered true wealthy individuals.","“Gentlemen, to confirm, you two are each sending three thousand cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings' to the Haoyang Team?”","Zhou Muchen gave a soft \"Hmm.\"","Lu Hong grinned: \"Stop the nonsense. We're not short on money.\"","On the big screen at that moment, Haoyang Team's number had just broken a thousand, far behind Purple Lady Team's two thousand-plus cups.","The host was still working hard to create the atmosphere.","“Brother Sun of the Purple Lady Team makes a powerful move, eight hundred cups to stabilize the situation! Are there any heroes from the Haoyang Team who will step forward and turn the tide for our team?”","Before he could finish his sentence.","All the sound systems and broadcasting systems in the internet cafe simultaneously played an electronic female voice, completely different from the host's passionate voice.","[Mr. Zhou at Machine 12 cheers for Haoyang Team with three thousand cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings'!]","[Mr. Lu at Machine 13 cheers for Haoyang Team with three thousand cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings'!]","The number behind Haoyang Team instantly skyrocketed to around five thousand cups, directly crushing the Purple Lady Team.","After confirming it was real, the host's emotions became excited.","\"Gods! Whale spenders! True whale spenders have descended! Oh my heavens! Mr. Zhou and Mr. Lu, please accept my kneel! Six thousand cups of 'Bo Ya Severed the Strings'! Awesome!!!\"","Boom!","The entire internet cafe was almost overturned by the sound.","\"Holy shit! Holy shit! Six thousand cups?\"","\"Insane!\"","\"Who are these two guys? Are they that rich?\"","\"Six thousand cups is sixty thousand bucks, damn. These rich bastards really don't treat money as money.\"","“Crazy, completely crazy. I declare the Haoyang Team has taken off directly!”","\".........\"","Everyone instinctively looked towards the direction of Machines 12 and 13, wanting to see who these two big spenders were.","Since the Phoenix Cup competition began, this was the first time anyone had sent three thousand cups at once, and it was two people simultaneously, adding up to six thousand cups, breaking the record.","This number might not be much in the later live streaming or short video era.","But at the present time, it was absolutely incredibly extravagant.","When Lu Hong saw the eyes of the entire venue focused on them, he proudly nudged Zhou Muchen with his shoulder.","\"Brother Chen, that was a sick way to show off! So satisfying!\"","A faint smile also curled at the corner of Zhou Muchen's lips.","He had to admit, the feeling of instantly overwhelming everyone with absolute financial power was indeed pretty sweet.","What neither of them knew was that their earlier high-profile act had caught the attention of the purple-haired punk girl in the opposing team's seats.","Her big eyes were fixed intently on the two of them, her teeth grinding audibly.","\"Just you wait, Zhou Muchen. And you, Lu Hong. Not only did you not support me, but you deliberately backed my opponent and tried to ruin my moment.\"","\"You two are so dead later!!!\""]},{"number":459,"title":"Chapter 459: 459. Ecosystem","paragraphs":["Lu Hong instinctively hunched his shoulders, feeling as if he had been targeted by something dangerous.","\"Brother Chen, do you also feel a chill down your spine?\"","Zhou Muchen also looked around suspiciously. Although he didn't immediately answer Lu Hong's question, his actions showed he felt the same way.","However, after scanning the area, nothing seemed out of the ordinary.","How strange.","\"Maybe the air conditioning is just set too low?\" Zhou Muchen offered an excuse.","Although the weather wasn't as cold as winter anymore and air conditioning wasn't really necessary, the internet cafe still had it on to maintain an optimal temperature for the players' comfort and performance.","Lu Hong couldn't figure out why he had that strange feeling either, so he accepted Zhou Muchen's reason. \"Probably.\"","Neither of them paid much more attention to the matter.","In a small place like Mingzhu City, who would dare to cross them?","Except for that particularly stubborn Liu Yutong, perhaps.","Not long after, the cheer support segment ended.","Team Haoyang completely crushed Team Zidaren with about 8,300 cups of milk tea votes versus a little over 3,000, gaining an overwhelming advantage in momentum.","The game then commenced.","Lu Hong focused all his attention on the match screen. He quite liked playing this game himself; to be precise, most guys didn't have much resistance to FPS games.","While Zhou Muchen was also interested in the esports match, more of his attention was on observing the internet cafe's operational model.","Aside from being a bit lacking in experience, his business acumen was quite sharp.","As he observed more and more, he gradually let go of his initial slight disdain and began examining this internet cafe more seriously.","He often visited high-end internet cafes to game as well. Those places were nothing more than just a bit better in terms of equipment and comfort, nothing particularly special.","Huangquan Esports was definitely the first internet cafe he had ever seen that pushed both hardware/software and marketing tactics to the extreme.","Whether it was the peripheral wall for casual selection, the exclusive membership system, or the highly conceptualized operational model... it was easily several years ahead of the high-end internet cafes they usually frequented.","Of course, what interested him the most was the owner behind this internet cafe.","Just what kind of person could run a popular entertainment venue like an internet cafe so well and so uniquely?","He even vaguely felt that the business thinking of the internet cafe owner seemed to come from a higher dimension, completely transcending this era.","Especially after trying out that membership system, that feeling grew stronger.","Huangquan's membership system was named 【Starsea】, completely different from ordinary internet cafe memberships.","Internet cafe memberships in this era basically only served the purpose of recharging for consumption, with a single simple functionality.","But when he just turned on the computer and casually clicked into the membership system, he discovered its functions were far more extensive than he imagined.","It integrated internet cafe consumption, match predictions, peripheral rentals, game accounts and asset hosting, and even included a points exchange system linked with surrounding shops like Wanlong Supermarket and Yuyuefang.","This was evidently an entry point to a localized lifestyle and entertainment ecosystem built around young consumers.","Proposing the concept of building an ecological circle in 2008 was simply shocking!","Even Zhou Muchen was completely shocked.","It was too ahead of its time.","Of course, what truly surprised and puzzled him was seeing two familiar prefixes \"Wanlong\" on the membership system. Combined with the fact that the system was linked with Wanlong Supermarket, the answer was almost obvious.","This internet cafe was actually also Liu Yutong's business?","\"Ah Hong.\"","Zhou Muchen nudged Lu Hong beside him, who was fully absorbed in watching the match.","\"Huh? What's up, Brother Chen? Look quick! Team Haoyang is about to win the first round. I told you supporting them was the right call,\" Lu Hong said, staring at the big screen without turning his head.","\"Take a look at this first.\" Zhou Muchen pointed at the membership system interface on the computer screen, especially the prefix 【Wanlong】.","Hearing this, Lu Hong casually turned his head and glanced over, initially not paying much mind. But a few seconds later, it suddenly clicked.","\"Wan... Wanlong?\"","\"This internet cafe belongs to that woman, Liu Yutong?\"","Zhou Muchen nodded. He had been wondering who the owner of this internet cafe was earlier, never expecting it to be Liu Yutong.","It seemed this woman's business talent was even higher than he imagined.","He had long heard of Wanlong Supermarket. A newly established local brand actually beating those well-known national brands to a pulp, taking first place in local market share.","Later, they launched Wanhui Youxuan, becoming the first local lifestyle platform both domestically and internationally.","As for the internet cafe and restaurant, he hadn't paid much attention originally. After all, compared to the supermarket business and Wanhui Youxuan, these two ventures held no attraction for him.","Because he always felt the potential of these two traditional businesses was far less than that of Wanhui Youxuan and the supermarket.","But now, seeing with his own eyes the bustling scene and revenue of the internet cafe, he suddenly realized that he might have made a huge mistake.","He had severely underestimated Liu Yutong's ambition and ability to integrate offline traffic with a lifestyle service ecosystem.","Although what he saw now was only the rudiment of a local life ecosystem, once scaled up, the kind of behemoth it could grow into in the future was simply unimaginable.","Once Wanhui Youxuan grew large and had massive traffic for support, the local life ecosystem formed by the physical industries under the Wanlong Hui group would also create powerful synergistic effects, ultimately building an almost unshakable business closed loop.","\"Ah Hong, we may have made a big mistake.\"","“We’ve only been focusing on Wanhui Youxuan, thinking that it was the most valuable asset in Liu Yutong’s hands. But it seems now that the supermarket, restaurant, internet cafe... these traditional businesses we looked down on are actually the cornerstones for building her moat. Wanhui Youxuan is just the amplifier that connects these cornerstones together.”","“We shouldn't have only thought about acquiring Wanhui Youxuan from the start. We should have aimed to acquire shares in the entire Wanlong Hui group.”","The fact that Zhou Muchen could see all this proved his business acumen was indeed sharp. Just from the investigation materials and what he saw with his own eyes now, he judged that Liu Yutong was planning to play a big game of chess.","And with her abilities, she really has the potential to achieve it.","To put it bluntly, in terms of business, Liu Yutong alone completely outperformed everyone in their Yunshan Hui.","No wonder Liu Yutong dared to show them no respect at all. A top-tier business genius like her was bound to have a proud personality, naturally unwilling to be subordinate to others.","Lu Hong also understood. \"Brother Chen, you mean that by previously focusing on her platform, we were actually picking up sesame seeds and losing watermelons?\"","\"Pretty much.\"","Zhou Muchen's expression was serious. \"Wanhui Youxuan is indeed a platform with great prospects, but in the end, it also depends on who is running it. If Wanlong Hui's future layout succeeds, a conservative valuation would be in the hundreds of billions...\""]},{"number":460,"title":"Chapter 460: 460, Champion","paragraphs":["Lu Hong gulped audibly, his eyes wide with shock.","A hundred billion?","They had to remember, their original expectation for Yunshan Club was simply to acquire the remaining shares of Wanhui Youxuan, push for an IPO in about two years, and consider cashing out once the valuation reached around ten billion. At that point, after splitting it evenly, each of them could have walked away with several hundred million.","Making several hundred million each in two years was already an incredibly lucrative deal.","It wasn't that they lacked ambition and wanted to exit so early, but based on their current business judgment, Wanhui Youxuan's potential and scale were far inferior to e-commerce platforms like Ali.","Ali's market cap post-IPO was around sixty billion, which they considered the ceiling.","So, expecting Wanhui Youxuan to reach ten billion was already an ideal scenario for them.","And that was without considering potential future competitors.","But now, Zhou Muchen was saying the Wanlonghui Group's overall valuation could exceed a hundred billion in the future. If they could secure even a 10% stake, each member of Yunshan Club could get over a billion.","If they could control even more shares...","That was almost unimaginable.","\"Brother Chen, what should we do then?\" Lu Hong was eager and ready.","Zhou Muchen pondered for a moment before speaking. \"When it's time to collect on the bet, we'll give her another chance. This time, we'll relax our terms; we only want a portion of the shares.\"","If it were his old self, he would have insisted on a controlling stake.","But now, he honestly admitted he couldn't possibly pull off a strategic layout like Liu Yutong's—mainly because his abilities weren't on par with hers.","Moreover, after this encounter, he knew she would never agree to play second fiddle. Forcing her would likely lead to a lose-lose situation.","In short, as long as they could make money, he was willing to take another step back.","This time, surely that Liu Yutong wouldn't refuse again, right?","No matter how capable Liu Yutong was or how sharp her vision, she had one weakness: she lacked substantial backing.","This was also why Wanlonghui still hadn't expanded beyond Mingzhu City. For instance, despite Wanlong Supermarket's explosive growth last year, not a single new branch had opened this year.","Of course, Liu Yutong's lack of background was a good thing for them.","Just as they were contemplating how to make Liu Yutong give up group shares the next time they met her, the match in the internet cafe had reached a fever pitch.","Mu Yang, captain of the Haoyang Team, nicknamed \"AK Madman,\" truly lived up to his reputation. His gunplay was fierce and precise, repeatedly single-handedly tearing open the defenses of the Purple Lady Team.","On the Purple Lady Team's side, besides captain Li Xiaohui, the sniper with the ID [Ran] also stepped up multiple times.","His AWM usage was masterful, repeatedly making crucial long-range kills on Haoyang Team members at critical moments, stubbornly dragging the match into a deciding round.","Final round, Desert Dust.","Mu Yang, wielding an AK47, made a powerful push through mid, scoring consecutive headshots to take down two Purple Lady members, his momentum unstoppable.","Simultaneously, the Purple Lady Team's sniper [Ran] took out a Haoyang player attempting a flank with a single shot.","The situation instantly became a 2V2!","After a brief tactical chat with his teammate, Mu Yang and his partner began to spread out left and right, aiming to first eliminate [Ran].","After all, [Ran] posed the biggest threat to them. As for their captain, she'd be easy to handle.","They almost simultaneously swung out from cover. [Ran] indeed scoped in and took down one, but before he could pull back into cover, bullets from Mu Yang's AK were already flying towards him.","\"Nice!\"","Lu Hong slapped his thigh excitedly. \"They're going to win! Haoyang Team is awesome!\"","At the same time, all the Haoyang Team supporters in the venue erupted in cheers.","With the sniper [Ran] dead, they all felt victory was assured for Haoyang Team.","After all, Mu Yang was clearly more skilled than the purple-haired girl who was the captain of Purple Lady.","Just as everyone thought Haoyang Team was about to claim the championship, a dramatic turn of events occurred.","[Zi], who had been missing in action, had just quietly crawled out of the vent in the B tunnel, planning to sneak to the bombsite to plant the bomb, muttering to herself about how all her teammates were dead.","But just as her character poked half its head out, the face of Mu Yang's in-game character suddenly appeared, almost pressed against her screen.","\"Whoa! A ghost!\"","Li Xiaohui was startled, her hand jerking violently, nearly throwing the mouse.","Bang!","The USP pistol in her character's hand fired a shot.","Immediately after, a kill notification she never dreamed of seeing popped up on her screen.","[Zi] killed [Sun] with a USP headshot!","Victory!","???","Purple Lady Team... won?","\"Uh...\" The entire audience was dumbfounded.","What just happened?","The AK Madman got headshotted just like that?","After a few seconds of silence, the entire internet cafe burst into roars of laughter.","\"Hahaha... you've got to be kidding me.\"","\"Got scared and headshotted the enemy by a flinch... Mu Yang must be in shock.\"","\"Purple Lady's luck is just too good.\"","\"........\"","At the player station, Li Xiaohui stared blankly at the golden victory symbol on her screen. First confused, then, realizing she had actually won, she immediately puffed up with pride. Planting her hands on her hips, she shouted to the crowd,","\"Your grandma here took down the AK Madman with one shot! Who else?!\"","\"Whoo-hoo...\"","After the teasing died down, the venue erupted in cheers once again.","\"Let's congratulate Purple Lady on winning the championship!\"","\"Purple Lady rules!\"","\".........\"","Even the thousands of spectators gathered outside the internet cafe broke into waves of cheering.","The scene even attracted many passing citizens to stop and watch.","For many people in Mingzhu City, this was their first real taste of the excitement of an esports competition.","On the other side, Mu Yang looked at his suddenly greyed-out screen, silently took off his headphones, rubbed his face, and revealed a bitter smile uglier than crying.","This way of losing... was just too theatrical.","Then he looked towards the celebrating, cheering members of the Purple Lady Team. Though he felt disappointment, what stirred more within him was a strange sense of excitement.","Is this esports?","He thought he might be starting to like this feeling.","Just then, the Purple Lady Team's sniper, the \"Sniper God\" Fang Haoran, came up to him.","\"Mu Yang, interested in going out to make a name for ourselves together? To play real professional esports!\"","Mu Yang was taken aback for a moment, then smiled. \"Alright!\"",".........","Meanwhile, on the other side.","\"Damn! Blind luck catching a dead mouse, huh?\"","\"How the hell did they lose like that? That Purple Lady captain must have stepped in dog poop today!\" Lu Hong grumbled indignantly.","He had spent thirty thousand supporting Haoyang Team, and now this?","Zhou Muchen was also speechless; he hadn't expected such a dramatic ending either.","At that moment, the organizers invited the champion team to the outdoor award podium to receive their prize.","The members of the Purple Lady Team excitedly rushed onto the stage.","Li Xiaohui also walked to the center of the stage, hands on hips, striking a pose as if she were second only to the heavens.","Perhaps because she was too excited, she accidentally tripped over something, sending the baseball cap flying off her head and revealing a head of dazzling purple hair extensions.","Although she still wore a face mask, the entire outline of her face and those large eyes were now completely exposed under the stage lights.","Lu Hong, who had just walked outside and was still ranting furiously about Purple Lady's unfair victory, suddenly fell silent the moment he saw the eyes and brows of the purple-haired girl on stage, his expression gradually freezing.","When he finally snapped out of it, he grabbed Zhou Muchen's arm and pointed at the stage, saying, \"Chen-ge, look! That purple-haired... ahem, ahem... doesn't she look like that little demon Li Xiaohui from Uncle Li's family, the one who always set the dog on us?\"","Prompted by him, Zhou Muchen took a closer look at the purple-haired little punk girl on stage who was flusteredly picking up her hat.","She did look more and more like that straightforward yet particularly vindictive Li Xiaohui from Uncle Li's family.","\"Oh crap, it really is her!\"","The next second, both of them almost simultaneously remembered what they had just done.","We're done for!","\"Run!\"","Just as they turned to flee, they were blocked by over a dozen members of the Wanlong Hui.","This was all arranged in advance by Li Xiaohui.","Not long after, Li Xiaohui walked over, trophy in one hand and hat in the other, and began mocking them.","\"Well, well, look who's throwing their money around so lavishly. If it isn't the fine sons of the Zhou and Lu families?\"","\"You've really grown some guts today, haven't you!\"","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong, these two second-generation heirs who feared nothing, instinctively felt a pang of guilt at this moment.","\"Um... Xiaohui, what if we said we came specifically to watch your match? Would you believe us?\"","\"Right, right! We actually wanted to support you, but we accidentally said the wrong thing!\"","\"We really didn't mean it...\"","\"Didn't mean it? Then let me apologize first, I didn't mean it either.\"","Li Xiaohui waved her hand: \"Beat them up for me. Beat the crap out of them!\"","Zhou Muchen: \"!!!\"","Lu Hong: \"!!!\"","The next second, two blood-curdling screams rang out."]},{"number":461,"title":"Chapter 461: 461. Meeting Again.","paragraphs":["The next day.","In the largest private room of the Yuyuefang University Town branch, a special news report was playing on the LCD TV.","Liu Yutong sat alone at the table, in front of which was placed a set of exquisite tea ware.","She was watching Lawyer Zhao Tianyi, dressed in a suit and looking solemn, speak on the television screen.","\"The addition of melamine was by no means accidental, but systematic, a deliberate illegal act by unscrupulous merchants to lower production costs.\"","\"We have obtained solid evidence proving that these enterprises, fully aware of the harm this industrial chemical poses to infant health, still added it in large quantities...\"","The TV footage cut to close-ups of a series of documentary evidence, followed by scenes of grieving families of the affected infants.","Liu Yutong picked up her teacup, gently blew on it, a trace of imperceptible cold light flashing in her eyes.","That Xue Chen, and those milk powder factories, truly got what they deserved!","As expected, the broadcast of this special report should trigger a major upheaval.","Just then, the door to the private room was pushed open.","Three young people, two men and one woman, filed in.","They were precisely Zhou Muchen, Lu Hong, and Zhu Silin.","This time, however, the aura around the trio was noticeably less imposing than last time, much more subdued.","Especially Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong, who both looked rather odd. Each wore a baseball cap, and though they pulled the brims down low, a closer look revealed redness, swelling, and bruises on their noses and chins, their eyes swollen to mere slits.","Liu Yutong looked up and, seeing their comical appearance, almost laughed out loud.","\"Young Master Zhou, Young Master Lu, what happened to you?\"","\"It's only been a day since we last met, how have you two acquired such distinguished new looks?\"","Zhou Muchen instinctively tried to pull his hat brim even lower, saying calmly, \"It's nothing, we accidentally walked into a door last night.\"","\"Oh? Really?\"","Liu Yutong then looked at Lu Hong: \"Did Young Master Lu also walk into a door? Could it be you both walked into the same one?\"","Lu Hong's words tugged at the corner of his injured mouth, making his speech sound a bit slurred: \"Yes, yes, it was the same door. That door was terribly inconsiderate, it just suddenly swung into us.\"","Zhu Silin, standing beside them, couldn't help but roll her eyes at this, muttering under her breath, \"Could you two come up with a lamer excuse?\"","Lawyer Zhao's voice from the TV happened to carry over at that moment: \"On behalf of the victims' families, I solemnly state that we will never compromise and will definitely make the other party pay the price!\"","Hearing this, the three of them all looked somewhat uncomfortable.","Although it was just a news interview on TV, the words somehow felt like a deliberate jab at them.","Hadn't they also originally intended to target the Wanlong Hui? The other party not only didn't compromise but also made them pay a price.","Their utterly disfigured faces were proof of that.","Liu Yutong smiled and gestured for the three to take their seats. \"Since you're here, please sit. I've had the kitchen prepare some good dishes, including our shop's signature fish potstickers.\"","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong sat down stiffly, their movements awkward and clearly pained.","Liu Yutong didn't miss the chance to rub salt in their wounds. \"Speaking of which, it's quite a coincidence. I have a close friend who, for some reason, was so furious last night after winning a match that she went to vent her anger on a punching bag. Don't you think her temper is a bit strange?\"","Lu Hong: \"....\"","Zhou Muchen: \"......\"","They were starting to realize that the women of the Wanlong Hui were truly, one after another, sharp-tongued and heavy-handed.","That Yu Xin really enjoyed provoking people, ready to pin Xue Chen down on a table at the slightest disagreement.","Li Xiaohui was the same; despite being somewhat acquainted, she had treated them to a helping of \"bamboo shoots fried with pork\" (a beating) as soon as they met.","As for Liu Yutong, the helm of the Wanlong Hui sitting before them, needless to say, she was the true source of the violence.","They suspected Yu Xin and Li Xiaohui had been led astray by her.","Lu Hong couldn't hold back any longer, saying angrily, \"Miss Liu, what you did was really not on the level, was it?\"","Liu Yutong blinked her bright eyes, looking utterly innocent. \"Young Master Lu, I don't understand what you mean.\"","Lu Hong: \"Stop playing dumb! Since you already knew Li Xiaohui, why didn't you just tell us? Deliberately hiding it, were you playing us for fools? Did you enjoy watching us get beaten up?\"","\"Let me tell you, even if you have Li Xiaohui backing you, if we really wanted to move against you, it's not like we couldn't find a way!\"","Their pride had taken a serious hit, just like the Xue Chen they had previously looked down upon.","Who would have thought the young lady of the prestigious Wanlong Hui could be so scheming? Clearly, the Wanlong Hui had a powerful backer, yet she hadn't revealed a thing, causing them to suffer two thorough beatings for nothing.","The first was naturally for backing the wrong side in the competition, and the second was when Li Xiaohui found out they were planning to mess with the Wanlong Hui and gifted each of them a pair of black eyes.","To be honest, they weren't exactly afraid of Li Xiaohui, but she wasn't someone to be trifled with either. Otherwise, just like last night, they'd have to take the beating without recourse.","They certainly couldn't go home and tell their families they'd been beaten up by Uncle Li's daughter, could they?","Forget about their families standing up for them; they'd be lucky not to be scolded for bringing shame on themselves.","Liu Yutong smiled faintly. \"Young Master Lu, that's not quite right. How could I deliberately play you for fools? It's just that Xiaohui dislikes being in the public eye. I genuinely consider her a friend, a close confidante, so naturally, I wouldn't use her or hide behind her.\"","\"Alright, alright, Miss Liu, no more excuses, please.\"","Zhou Muchen cut her off. \"We've witnessed Miss Liu's capabilities. We admit defeat this time. From now on, let's keep to our own territories and not interfere with each other.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Fine.\"","\"But according to the bet, you lost, didn't you? Don't tell me the Yunshan Hui still hasn't kicked Xue Chen out?\"","Just then, the TV host delivered another perfect assist.","\"It is reported that senior leadership is paying high attention to this food safety incident. A special investigation team has been established to conduct a thorough investigation into all involved enterprises and individuals, with no leniency!\"","As soon as the host's words fell, the footage switched to scenes of the Little Lu and other dairy factories being sealed, followed by a shot of Xue Chen's father being led away from his office.","Although the images were processed, anyone could tell what was happening.","Seeing this, Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong's expressions instantly became even more colorful.","Fortunately, they had severed ties with Xue Chen in time; otherwise, they wouldn't be the only ones implicated now besides the Xue father and son.","When they looked at Liu Yutong again, their gazes held a touch of complexity.","Strictly speaking, Liu Yutong had also saved them once.","If the milk powder scandal hadn't been exposed by someone Liu Yutong found, they would most likely have acquired shares in the milk powder factory, becoming part of the group harming infants, as Xue Chen had previously intended to transfer some shares to them.","Xue Chen knew that with Zhou Muchen and the others on board, operations would be even more secure.","But they also understood that you can't wrap fire in paper forever.","No matter how much influence they had, there would always be people and situations beyond their control. Once the truth exploded, their fate wouldn't be much better."]},{"number":462,"title":"Chapter 462: 462. Top-Tier Big Shot Turned into a Lackey","paragraphs":["After a moment of silence in the private room,","Liu Yutong took an elegant sip of tea, a hint of amusement in her eyes. \"It seems you two are quite relieved to have made the right choice in time.\"","Zhou Muchen cleared his throat and said seriously, \"You jest, Miss Liu. Our Yunshan Society has always abided by the law. Naturally, we expelled a black sheep like Xue Chen at the first opportunity.\"","\"We did lose this bet. Miss Liu, please provide your bank account number. We will raise the funds and transfer them to you as soon as possible.\"","However, Liu Yutong's next words left all three of them stunned.","\"I don't want the money.\"","A faint smile curled at the corner of her lips. \"Let's consider it a gesture of friendship. After all, it's better to resolve enmity than to create it. We don't have any deep-seated hatred, do we?\"","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong looked at each other, completely unprepared for Liu Yutong's move.","They had already braced themselves for a massive financial blow, and now she was casually saying she didn't want it?","That was a full six hundred million!","Just written off, just like that?","Was this woman so wealthy that six hundred million meant nothing to her?","Even Zhu Silin, who had been mostly quiet on the side, was so surprised her mouth fell open.","Liu Yutong was casually using six hundred million to curry favor and make friends? That was incredibly generous.","No wonder she could be the helm of the Wanlong Society. She truly had nerve and vision.","After his initial surprise, Zhou Muchen's expression turned solemn. \"Miss Liu, we accept your goodwill. On behalf of the Yunshan Society, I, Zhou Muchen, acknowledge you as a friend. If you ever need help in the future, we won't refuse!\"","Using six hundred million to befriend them—her sincerity was undeniable, even if it was technically their money.","Of course, if she had insisted on taking the six hundred million from them, they would have had to swallow the bitter pill, unable to truly oppose her, given her backer was Li Xiaohui.","Lu Hong also nodded in agreement. \"That's right, Miss Liu. We are definitely friends now. If you ever need anything from me, Lu Hong, just say the word!\"","Even the somewhat prideful Zhu Silin sincerely promised, \"Miss Liu, we were rude before. Now that the misunderstanding is cleared up, we are all friends from now on.\"","Seeing their sincere attitudes, the smile on Liu Yutong's face brightened a few degrees.","She personally picked up the teapot and poured a cup of hot tea for each of them. \"Since we're all friends now, no more of this 'Miss Liu' business. Just call me Yutong. From now on, let's visit often, help each other out, and make money together.\"","Hearing Liu Yutong's last sentence, Zhou Muchen's eyes immediately lit up.","He was just about to say something more when the private room door was pushed open again, and a clear voice came through.","\"Yutong-jie, I'm here. I need to tell you something...\"","The newcomer was Li Xiaohui. Today she was wearing casual sportswear, not sporting her favorite purple wig but with her hair in a high ponytail, looking full of energy.","Before she could finish her sentence, she saw the three people sitting in the room and stopped mid-sentence.","A moment later.","\"Well, well, well...\"","Li Xiaohui put her hands on her hips, her eyes darting around the three of them before finally landing on Zhu Silin, and she laughed happily. \"Silin-jie, what are you doing here too? Wait...\"","She suddenly realized something and glared at Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong like a little tiger showing its claws. \"You two aren't here to cause trouble for my Yutong-jie, are you? Is your skin itching for a beating again?!\"","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong reflexively jumped up from their chairs, hurriedly waving their hands. \"Xiaohui, it's a misunderstanding. We came to befriend Miss Liu.\"","\"That's right, to make friends!\"","\"Really?\"","\"Really, truer than gold!\"","Hearing this, Li Xiaohui laughed and slapped Lu Hong on the back, making him stumble in fright. \"Good, you know what's good for you!\"","Then she looked at everyone, striking a pose as if she were taking charge.","\"Since we're all friends now, perfect timing. I'm announcing something: starting today, Yutong-jie is the boss of our new circle.\"","She pointed at Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong and said to them, \"From now on, you two are my Yutong-jie's little brothers, got it?!\"","Zhou Muchen: \"???\"","Lu Hong: \"!!!\"","Both wore utterly bewildered expressions.","They were prominent young masters in the province, becoming someone's little brothers?","And for a girl younger than them?","\"Xiaohui, this... we're a few years older than her. Wouldn't being little brothers be a bit inappropriate?\" Zhou Muchen said, forcing himself to speak.","Li Xiaohui's big eyes widened. \"What? Not convinced? Do you need me to help you 'loosen up your joints' again? I'm quite good at that now. Our company has a martial arts hall; perfect for taking you two for some proper training.\"","As she spoke, she was about to call for someone, ready to forcibly take the two away.","\"Someone...\"","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong were terrified and quickly admitted defeat. \"We're convinced! We're convinced!\"","\"We'll be little brothers, okay?! We'll do it!\"","While they agreed on the surface, they felt deeply wronged inside.","To think they, the top young masters of Lucheng, who had dominated the province for so many years, were now forced to become someone's little brothers—and a young girl's little brothers at that.","Was this really okay?","But it seemed Li Xiaohui had already beaten them to it, recognizing Liu Yutong as her 'jie'.","Right now, what they wanted most was to go back and complain to Uncle Li—why on earth did he send Li Xiaohui to Mingzhu City for university?","Li Xiaohui already disliked them; during the New Year, she had even deliberately set dogs on them. She was especially spoiled and willful.","Now, she wasn't just spoiled and willful; she was downright violent.","They had personally witnessed Li Xiaohui's rallying power last night. With just one shout, over a hundred people appeared, nearly scaring them to death.","Also, they truly never expected Li Xiaohui would dare to get involved in the underworld scene.","Even they didn't dare get involved in that, at least not personally joining in.","If their families found out, the leather belts would probably be worn out from the beating.","But Li Xiaohui, fearless, had done just that, completely boarding Liu Yutong's \"black car.\"","The most crucial thing was, now she was forcing them to get on board too.","They could be friends with Liu Yutong, they could make money together, but getting on that car was a whole different matter.","\"Since you agreed, then call her 'Yutong-jie' for me to hear.\" Li Xiaohui crossed her arms, chin slightly raised, striking a pose that threatened a beating if they didn't comply.","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong exchanged a glance, seeing on each other's faces a complex expression of humiliation mixed with fear, and fear mixed with a will to survive.","In the end, fear won. They called out softly.","\"Yu... Yutong-jie.\"","\"Yutong-jie.\"","\"Didn't you eat? Louder!\" Li Xiaohui frowned in dissatisfaction, raising her hand as if to knock their heads.","The two shuddered in fright and quickly shouted loudly, \"Hello, Yutong-jie!\"","After shouting, Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong both covered their faces simultaneously.","So embarrassing!","To think they, the esteemed top young masters of Lucheng, were forced to call a girl younger than them 'jie'.","If word of this got out, how could they ever show their faces again?!"]},{"number":463,"title":"Chapter 463: 463. Joining the Yunshan Society.","paragraphs":["Seeing Zhou Muchen and the others being so sensible, Li Xiaohui nodded with satisfaction, then took Zhu Silin's hand and said, \"Sis Silin, you can just follow my lead!\"","Zhu Silin was quite straightforward: \"No problem! I've actually wanted to be friends with Sister Yutong for a while now.\"","Perhaps because they were all girls, she seemed much more relaxed than Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong, and calling someone 'sister' came more naturally to her.","Liu Yutong said, somewhat amused and exasperated, \"Xiaohui, stop fooling around.\"","Li Xiaohui, however, gave her a playful wink, putting on an expression that said, 'See how amazing I am? Praise me!'","And so, under Li Xiaohui's forceful matchmaking, Liu Yutong was more or less forced to accept two new 'little brothers'.","Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong were utterly speechless, thinking to themselves, \"What on earth is all this?\"","But when they looked at Li Xiaohui, they could only sigh helplessly.","Fine, little brothers it is then.","Zhou Muchen stood up and formally extended an invitation to Liu Yutong: \"Miss Liu... uh... Sister Yutong, I now formally invite you to join the Yunshan Society.\"","Since the situation was settled, it was better to take the initiative; at least it would leave a good impression. Besides, there was no way he was going to join the Wanlong Society and become her subordinate.","The Yunshan Society he founded was fundamentally different in nature from Liu Yutong's Wanlong Society.","To put it bluntly, the Yunshan Society was an elite circle operating in the form of a business association. Most members were second-generation elites from influential families or prominent backgrounds. They gathered to integrate resources, exchange what they had, and make money together.","The composition of the Wanlong Society was far more complex, even with a hint of underworld connections. In short, they would absolutely never join the other side's organization.","Moreover, they were different from Li Xiaohui.","Li Xiaohui joined the Wanlong Society mostly because she thought it was fun. She didn't have such grand ambitions, so having a position was enough for her.","But for them, it was about genuinely starting a business and earning real money.","Therefore, their relationship with Liu Yutong could only be primarily based on cooperation.","Inviting her into their circle now meant accepting her, allowing for future collaboration.","Furthermore, after these several interactions, they also felt Liu Yutong had the qualifications to enter their circle.","Although Liu Yutong had the most ordinary background among everyone present, her demonstrated capabilities were beyond doubt.","The Yunshan Society currently had six members, with Xue Chen already kicked out.","Among the six, four were second-generation from influential families, and two were top-tier rich second-generation heirs from families with assets exceeding tens of billions.","Liu Yutong had met three of them, while Yu Xin had met four.","It could truly be said that this group was full of proud and ambitious individuals.","Generally speaking, the only ones who could outrank them in status were probably the top young masters from the capital.","However, they didn't mingle with those Beijing elites either. It was like there was a regional barrier; they had their own barriers with the young masters from the capital and from Mo City as well.","They had their circles, and we had ours.","Liu Yutong didn't answer immediately but instead looked at Li Xiaohui.","Li Xiaohui nodded at her.","Although she didn't particularly enjoy hanging out with Zhou Muchen and the others, feeling like she didn't quite fit in, she wasn't the same self-centered, playful little girl she used to be anymore.","She also knew that for the Wanlong Society to grow bigger and stronger, it still needed support.","Before, she had deliberately hidden her identity and hadn't actively helped Sister Yutong because she was afraid her father would find out and cause trouble.","She even felt a bit guilty towards Sister Yutong for keeping it a secret for so long. If she hadn't run into Zhou Muchen and the others yesterday, she might not have revealed her identity proactively.","Now that the secret was out, it was better to seize this opportunity to help Sister Yutong truly step into this circle that could bring tangible resources.","Liu Yutong said, \"Since you are all so sincere, I accept this invitation.\"","\"However, since we're all on the same side now, it's best to be clear upfront. I operate based on clear rules and transparent information. I detest internal friction and mutual concealment the most. If you all agree with this, then from now on we are truly comrades, and I will bring everyone opportunities to make money together.\"","After hearing this, Zhou Muchen suddenly felt that acknowledging this \"sister\" didn't seem like a bad deal after all.","Wasn't the original purpose of forming the Yunshan Society exactly what she described—mutual help and making big money together?","And Liu Yutong did have the ability to lead them to profit.","\"Of course, you can rest assured, Sister Yutong.\"","Lu Hong and Zhu Silin also nodded in agreement.","Li Xiaohui happily clapped her hands: \"Great! Then it's settled! We must celebrate tonight. I'll have the kitchen add a few more dishes.\"","Relationships between people can sometimes be this wonderful.","Two parties who were initially hostile actually saw their relationship change over the course of a single meal.","After a few drinks, Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong found calling her \"sister\" more and more natural.","After several rounds of drinks, the server brought in the signature dish of Yuyue Fang—Small Fish Potstickers.","Golden, crispy potstickers were arranged in a circle around the edge of the pot, with richly fragrant stewed small river fish in the middle, steaming hot and aromatic.","\"Mmm~ This is delicious!\"","Zhu Silin picked up a potsticker, dipped it in the fish broth, and put it in her mouth. Her eyes instantly lit up.","\"The outside is crispy, the inside is soft, and it's soaked up all the fish flavor. This is amazing!\"","Zhou Muchen also nodded repeatedly: \"It's truly authentic. This is the first time I've had such delicious small fish potstickers. Sister Yutong, the chef at your Yuyue Fang is really skilled!\"","Liu Yutong smiled slightly and explained, \"This is our signature dish at Yuyue Fang. We have a secret recipe, and the master chef at the first store has been making it for many years, so the flavor is definitely guaranteed.\"","\"What, you don't have this dish over there?\"","\"We do, we do.\"","Lu Hong's tone carried a hint of regret: \"There are quite a few places that make small fish potstickers where we're from, but the flavor always seems to be missing something. Either the potstickers are soggy, or the freshness is lacking. Sister Yutong, when are you planning to open a branch over there? It would definitely be a huge hit!\"","\"Right, Sister Yutong, consider expanding? Open a branch where we are. We can handle things like location selection,\" Zhou Muchen added.","Liu Yutong replied, \"There will be opportunities, but the conditions aren't quite ripe yet. We don't have enough chefs.\"","\"Muchen, are you also thinking about opening a restaurant?\"","Having his thoughts seen through, Zhou Muchen chuckled a bit sheepishly: \"I do have some ideas. The food at your restaurant, Sister Yutong, is so delicious; you should open more branches. I was thinking, maybe I could franchise a few later.\"","He was quite a foodie himself, and with no particularly good investment directions at the moment, after tasting the dishes at Yuyue Fang, he had started considering investing in the food and beverage industry.","Liu Yutong, however, shook her head: \"Wanting to franchise my Yuyue Fang isn't the wisest choice. It would be better to open a hotpot restaurant. As long as the marketing is done right, the service is good, and the ingredients are selected well, you can make money just the same. It could even develop into a chain and go public; that's not out of the question.\"","Hearing her tactful refusal, Zhou Muchen felt some regret but also knew she was telling the truth.","For a premium restaurant like Yuyue Fang, which heavily relies on skilled chefs, expansion speed is inherently limited. It's not like a hotpot restaurant, which is easier to standardize and scale up.","However, for now, he wasn't planning to immediately venture into the restaurant business; that could wait for later.","Moving past the previous topic, the group clinked glasses a few more times.","Zhou Muchen suddenly thought of something and said, \"Sister Yutong, since we're all on the same side now, there's something I should give you a heads-up about in advance.\"","\"Go ahead,\" Liu Yutong nodded.","\"The remaining three members of our Yunshan Club, aside from Gu Yebai, the other two will be returning from abroad next week.\"","\"One is Shen Hao from the Shen family; his family is in the appliance business and also deals with exports. The other is Bai Shisui from the Bai family; her family primarily focuses on cross-border trade and has strong resources in Europe and America. We'll arrange a gathering then for everyone to meet formally.\""]},{"number":464,"title":"Chapter 464: 464. Target: Short Lehman Brothers","paragraphs":["This was a rule established by Zhou Muchen and the others: every time the Yunshan Club admitted new members, they would get together first to get to know each other.","Liu Yutong naturally understood what he meant.","As a newcomer who had just joined the Yunshan Club and had suddenly become the \"big sister\" in Zhou Muchen and the others' eyes, she needed to show some real capability to earn everyone's genuine respect.","Especially when she heard the words \"the Bai family\" and \"cross-border trade,\" a sharp glint flashed extremely quickly in her eyes.","This was one of the important reasons she had agreed to join the Yunshan Club—to utilize their resources.","\"Alright, just notify me once the time and place are set.\"","Liu Yutong paused briefly before adding, \"Actually, I've recently been looking into a potentially very lucrative opportunity. Perhaps we can all discuss it together then.\"","Zhou Muchen's eyes lit up. \"Sister Yutong, do you have a good lead?\"","Lu Hong, Zhu Silin, and even Li Xiaohui all turned to look at her in unison upon hearing this.","Liu Yutong first kept them in suspense, asking, \"Do you remember the bet we made last time?\"","Zhu Silin was the first to react. \"I remember, Sister Yutong, you said Lehman Brothers would go bankrupt?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"I know, Silin, and all of you, actually don't quite believe that a major investment bank like Lehman could really collapse. That's understandable. After all, its size is enormous; even a slight disturbance could trigger a massive shock. When I dared to make that bet with you, it was based on some information I had learned and my own judgment.\"","She paused and asked again, \"Have you been following the financial markets in the U.S. recently? Especially their subprime mortgage sector.\"","Zhou Muchen said, \"I think I've heard something about it. They say their housing prices have gone crazy, maybe there's a bubble?\"","Zhu Silin thought carefully for a moment and then said, \"Hmm, there are indeed some signs. My family's recent business dealings with the U.S. side—it feels like the banks' funding reviews have become much stricter than before.\"","Liu Yutong nodded again and then revealed the earth-shattering idea she had been brewing for a long time: \"Whether you believe it or not, I think it's not just a bubble, but a volcano about to erupt. Investment banks like Lehman Brothers, which are deeply involved in subprime business, will likely be the first to bear the brunt.\"","\"So I believe, shorting Lehman or, more directly, shorting the U.S. stock indices, is a great opportunity to make a lot of money.\"","\"Short Lehman?\" Zhou Muchen drew a sharp breath.","Even someone with his family background was stunned by Liu Yutong's idea.","That was one of the giants of Wall Street!","\"Sister Yutong, isn't the risk too high?\"","\"High risk means high return.\"","\"I've analyzed some data and market reports. Their leverage ratios and holdings of high-risk assets are nearing a critical point. The storm is gathering; it's just that most people are still intoxicated by the false prosperity. What we need to do is prepare our hunting nets before the storm hits.\"","\"However, this requires massive capital, professional traders, and, most crucially, secure and discreet cross-border fund channels. My own strength is limited. If we can combine everyone's resources, especially Miss Bai's family channels, we are sure to achieve returns far beyond everyone's imagination!\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the private room instantly fell silent.","Zhou Muchen and the others looked at each other, seeing shock, hesitation, and a hint of indescribable excitement in each other's eyes.","Although Li Xiaohui only had a superficial understanding of financial operations, she unconditionally trusted Liu Yutong, her eyes filled with admiration.","If Sister Yutong said they could make a lot of money, then they definitely could.","Zhu Silin, however, frowned slightly, clearly quickly assessing the risks and feasibility.","Among the group, she had a deeper understanding of investing and stock trading.","Liu Yutong's idea went beyond her conventional knowledge; it seemed more like a high-stakes gamble, a cross-border capital game.","To be honest, she really wanted to believe Liu Yutong, but her experience and rationality were warning her that this probably wasn't an easy deal to pull off.","To put it bluntly, she still didn't believe Lehman would go bankrupt.","Just then.","Zhou Muchen's phone suddenly vibrated.","He picked it up, glanced at the caller ID, his expression changing slightly. He gestured \"wait a moment\" to the others, got up, and walked to the corner of the room to answer.","\"Hello, Dad... Yes, still having dinner... What?!\"","\"The Xue family matter is already...? The investigation team is moving this fast?\"","\"Okay... I understand. I won't cause any trouble, don't worry, Dad.\"","After hanging up, he returned to his seat.","His gaze towards Liu Yutong now held a touch of complexity.","\"Just got news. Regarding the Xue family matter, the investigation team is taking serious action, faster and harsher than imagined. Xue Chen's father... I'm afraid it will be very hard for him to get out. The higher-ups are determined to make an example this time.\"","This news undoubtedly poured cold water over everyone's heads, making them more acutely aware of the meaning of: one wrong step, and you face eternal ruin!","At the same time, it also made them more clearly sense Liu Yutong's terrifying capability—she had arranged the Xue family's outcome well in advance.","Thankfully, they hadn't offended her irreparably, otherwise who knows what might have happened.","\"Sister Yutong, can we discuss this matter again after Shen Hao and Bai Shisui return?\"","Liu Yutong, however, shook her head. \"Time waits for no one. I understand your concerns about the high risk. Even if you don't participate, I will go ahead with this myself. You just need to help me make connections, secure some reliable overseas accounts and channel relationships. Once I make money, I naturally won't forget everyone's help. I'll host a banquet then to properly thank you all.\"","She had been thinking about shorting Lehman and the U.S. indices for a long time, mainly driven by financial pressure.","Although the Wanlong Association was thriving, its funding gap was also terrifyingly large.","To secure large sums of money in a short time, the stock market was the best choice.","She definitely wouldn't short the domestic stock market. Although she knew the A-share market would also plummet around this time, if she actually took action, she might face the regulatory iron fist first.","So, to get the wool, you have to go abroad.","Of course, if enough capital was prepared, the final returns would be greater, and they would have more force when selling off.","This was also one of the reasons she didn't hide her plan and told everyone directly.","At most, even squeezing everything, the Wanlong Association could only come up with five hundred million. That money would at best allow them to sip some broth.","To get a real feast, they ideally needed to raise two to three billion, preferably in U.S. dollars, to truly enjoy a full-course banquet.","Stirred by Liu Yutong's final words \"I will go myself,\" Zhou Muchen suddenly stood up.","\"Sister Yutong, what are you saying? Since we're all on the same side now, how can we let you take the risk alone? I'll contact Shen Hao and Shisui tonight, give them a heads-up first, have them return early. At the very least, we need to settle the overseas accounts and channels as soon as possible. As for how much to invest and how to do it, we'll talk directly as soon as they land!\"","Seeing this, Lu Hong immediately chimed in, \"Count me in. Just name the amount you need for cash flow, Sister Yutong, and I'll be there!\"","He still had considerable faith in Liu Yutong's judgment, largely because of that last bet.","Zhu Silin was still somewhat hesitant, but seeing both Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong commit, she nodded. \"I can contribute some funds. Also, I know a bit about overseas financial operations. If needed, I can help to mitigate some of the risks as much as possible.\"","Li Xiaohui also joined in the excitement, saying, \"Sister Yutong, if you're taking me along to make money, my funds might not be huge, but I can definitely pitch in!\"","\"Good. Since you've all chosen to trust me, I won't let you down.\"","Liu Yutong took her laptop out of her handbag, opened the stock trading interface, and slid it in front of Zhu Silin.","\"This is my proof of confidence for all of you.\"","Upon seeing the screen, Zhu Silin gasped in astonishment. \"An annual return of 862%! Sister Yutong, is this... is this really the profit from your trading account?\""]},{"number":465,"title":"Chapter 465: 465, Ten Billion","paragraphs":["Zhu Silin could hardly believe her eyes. In all her life, she had never seen such an outrageous rate of return.","Gradually, her face flushed red as she remembered how she had previously boasted about her investment skills in front of Liu Yutong, even thinking that Liu Yutong was exaggerating when she said \"two hundred million could turn into one billion in a year.\"","Back then, she simply couldn't believe anyone could achieve such high returns in a single year—wouldn't that make them a stock god?","She managed around 200 million in funds domestically and internationally, making over 20 million in profit, and had already been lavishly praised by everyone, with many calling her an investment genius.","But now, seeing Liu Yutong's 862% annual return, she finally understood what it meant that there's always someone better.","Moreover, judging from the transaction records, Liu Yutong hadn't traded frequently. She had simply selected a few stocks, made a few straightforward trades, and achieved such astonishing returns. Her eye was just too sharp.","Of course, what she didn't know was that Liu Yutong had concentrated her investments in those few stocks precisely because she remembered which ones had the biggest price surges, and her initial capital wasn't that large to begin with.","The majority of Liu Yutong's funds were invested in other industries.","Last year, Liu Yutong invested over twelve million into the stock market and cashed out around fifty million in about three months, while still leaving about six million in the account.","That six million then grew to seventy million over the next six to seven months.","In other words, in nearly a year, Liu Yutong had turned a principal of just over twelve million into one hundred million, and that was even after taking profits once in the middle.","Zhu Silin's two hundred million had only grown to less than two hundred and thirty million, while Liu Yutong had turned twelve million into around one hundred and ten million.","If Zhu Silin's gains were what human effort could achieve, then Liu Yutong's returns were nothing short of a miracle, the kind only a god could create.","When Zhou Muchen and the others heard Zhu Silin announce the returns, they were stunned for a moment before hastily getting up from their seats and rushing over behind her.","When they clearly saw the data on the screen, their eyes all went wide. Lu Hong even instinctively let out a curse.","\"Holy shit, Sister Yutong, is this a money printer?!\"","\"Ones, tens, hundreds, thousands, ten-thousands... Dad! Ancestor! It really is over a hundred million! Sis, my dear sister! Do you take disciples? The kind who serve tea, fetch water, do laundry, and fold blankets! I'm signing up right now!\"","\"Sister Yutong, you're too damn good! You're even more amazing than a stock god!\"","\"I think I'm hallucinating.\"","\"........\"","It wasn't that they hadn't seen the world; it was that the returns on Liu Yutong's account were just too outrageously high, looking almost fake and unreal.","After repeatedly confirming the data was real, Zhou Muchen couldn't wait any longer and said,","\"Sister Yutong, let's not wait for Shen Hao and the others to come back. Just tell us how much capital you need. However much it is, we can pool it together. I'll blow up my contact list calling everyone tonight if I have to, but we'll get the money together for you.\"","You couldn't blame him for being so excited. It was mainly because Liu Yutong's rate of return was too tempting, even more tempting than the Wanhui Youxuan project they had been eyeing before.","Back when they wanted to acquire shares in Wanhui Youxuan, their ultimate goal was to push for an IPO in two years and be satisfied with cashing out a few hundred million each.","And there were risks involved.","After all, they couldn't guarantee Wanhui Youxuan would definitely go public. What if a more formidable competitor emerged and took them down?","They might end up with nothing.","That's why their eyes turned red with envy when they saw the returns on Liu Yutong's stock account.","If Liu Yutong could turn over ten million into a hundred million in a year, why would they still covet Wanhui Youxuan?","If they handed all their money over to Liu Yutong to manage, wouldn't it be easy for each of them to make a hundred million or even several hundred million?","Seeing him talk so big, Liu Yutong said directly, \"Then bring me ten billion.\"","\"H...how much? Ten billion?\" The excited expression on Zhou Muchen's face instantly froze.","Then he stammered, \"Sis... Sister Yutong, you think too highly of us, don't you? Do we look like people who can come up with that kind of money?\"","Although every member of the Yunshan Club was quite wealthy, forcing them to scrape together one or two billion would be pretty much their limit. Any more than that was beyond their capability; ten billion was simply impossible.","Even top-tier rich heirs like Shen Hao and Bai Shisui couldn't come up with that much cash. Although both their families had assets worth tens of billions, those assets were basically controlled by the older generation. Each of them being able to mobilize five hundred million was already a lot.","Adding the money the others had saved over the years, their absolute limit as a group was around two billion, unless they could secure funds from elsewhere.","Liu Yutong raised an eyebrow. \"Muchen, isn't that what you said? That you could get however much I wanted.\"","Zhou Muchen: \"......\"","\"I spoke too boldly.\"","\"But ten billion is way too much, isn't it?\"","Liu Yutong's tone was calm. \"I actually think it's too little. Compared to the daily circulation of trillions of US dollars overseas, this amount is just a drop in the ocean. Just pool together whatever you can for now; the more, the better. But I must state upfront: no matter how much money you raise, as long as I'm the one operating it, I will take fifty percent of the profits as my fee.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, Lu Hong and the others, who had just been burning with excitement, felt as if a bucket of cold water had been poured over them.","\"Fifty percent? Sister Yutong, isn't that rate a bit too high? Private equity funds usually only take around ten percent.\"","\"Yeah! After taking fifty percent, will there be anything left for us to profit from?\"","Liu Yutong was unfazed. \"Is it really too high? What if I guarantee the rate of return won't be lower than my domestic account here?\"","Hearing this, Zhou Muchen and the others' breathing became ragged. \"Sister Yutong, are you serious?\"","If she could guarantee such a high rate of return, then they absolutely had nothing more to say.","Take the simplest example: if they pooled two billion in principal and achieved an 800% return, that money would become eighteen billion. After subtracting the two billion principal, that leaves sixteen billion in profit. Even after giving Liu Yutong half, there would still be eight billion left.","Dividing eight billion among each of them, they could easily get over a billion each.","\"Gulp!\"","Zhou Muchen swallowed hard. His eyes turned red.","He was purely stimulated by that number.","Just moments ago, he thought Liu Yutong asking for fifty percent was cutting into their flesh. Now, with her guarantee, he felt she was practically a Bodhisattva descending to earth to deliver them all to prosperity!","Forget fifty percent, even sixty or seventy percent—as long as they could get such returns, there would be plenty of people kneeling with money in hand, begging to get in!","\"We're in! Fifty percent it is! Sister Yutong! Two billion! We'll definitely find a way to raise it for you!\"","\"Right! Let's do it! I'm going to make calls right now!\"","\"........\"","None of them had any mind for eating now; they just wanted to hurry up and make calls to raise the money.","They dared to play such a big game with Liu Yutong because they weren't afraid she would take the money and run.","Not to mention that Liu Yutong still needed their connections and channels to transfer the funds overseas, and the control of the fund would essentially remain in their hands.","Because Liu Yutong would mainly be responsible for the overall strategy and planning, while they would be responsible for executing the trades and managing the accounts.","With the added connection of Li Xiaohui in the mix, they had no worry that Liu Yutong would try any underhanded tricks to cheat them.","The meal was a thoroughly enjoyable one for everyone; in fact, it was the most pleasant meal Zhou Muchen and the others had ever had.","Who could have imagined that just a few days prior, they were scheming to seize the other party's business, yet in the blink of an eye, they were practically treating them like a god of wealth."]},{"number":466,"title":"Chapter 466: 466. Li Xiaohui Wants to Start a Club.","paragraphs":["\"Xiaohui, thank you.\"","\"Yutong-jie, I'm sorry.\"","They had just gotten into the car after leaving the restaurant when Liu Yutong and Li Xiaohui spoke almost simultaneously.","Hearing each other, they both paused for a moment.","Liu Yutong's thanks were for Li Xiaohui helping her out of a difficult spot, after all, the conflict with Zhou Muchen and the others was ultimately resolved thanks to her.","Li Xiaohui's apology was because she felt she shouldn't have kept her identity a secret, all the while letting Liu Yutong take care of her.","Liu Yutong shook her head, a hint of fondness in her tone. \"What are you talking about? Honestly, I had a pretty good guess about your background. The identity of the Li family's young miss isn't something to be revealed casually, I understand that. But no matter what your status is, from the moment you started calling me 'jie', I've considered you my own little sister.\"","\"Besides, if it weren't for you today, the bad blood between me and Zhou Muchen probably wouldn't have been so easily cleared up. I should be the one thanking you.\"","Hearing this, Li Xiaohui looked up, the slight guilt on her face instantly vanishing, replaced by her usual liveliness. \"So it's settled then! Yutong-jie, you're not allowed to be mad at me, and you can't call me dumb in the future either. I'm still your number one little sister! Woohoo!!!\"","\"Alright, no hard feelings.\"","Liu Yutong said with a smile, \"You'll always be my good sister, that will never change.\"","\"Mhmm! We'll be good sisters forever! For a lifetime!\"","Li Xiaohui then started swinging the arm linked with Liu Yutong's. \"So, Yutong-jie, should we go celebrate now? I know a newly opened dessert place that's super delicious.\"","Looking at her carefree expression, Liu Yutong was speechless. \"We just finished dinner, and you're already thinking about dessert? Aren't you afraid of gaining weight?\"","\"Ah, sweets go to a separate stomach!\" Li Xiaohui declared righteously.","\"Besides, I actually have something to discuss with you. I almost forgot about it earlier.\"","Unable to win against her, Liu Yutong had to agree. \"Fine, fine, let's go then. Might as well hear what grand venture our Xiaohui is about to announce this time.\"","The two soon arrived at a dessert shop decorated in a cute, pastel-pink style.","Li Xiaohui, familiar with the place, ordered several of their signature desserts.","As soon as the desserts were served, she scooped a large spoonful of mousse into her mouth, squinting her eyes in satisfaction.","Then, as if suddenly remembering the main point, she put down her spoon and blinked her eyes at Liu Yutong.","\"Yutong-jie, can I discuss something with you?\"","\"Hmm? What is it? Go ahead.\" Liu Yutong said, taking a small spoonful of her own dessert.","\"It's about... can we get someone else for the investment department at Wanlong Hui? And also, can I stop managing the internet cafe side of things?\"","\"Thinking of dropping the responsibilities?\"","\"No, no, it's not that. I genuinely don't understand all those numbers, reports, and stuff. They give me a headache. I couldn't really follow what you all were discussing earlier either. I'm just worried the investment department might go downhill under my watch. And now that the Huangquan Internet Cafe is more or less on track, it doesn't really need me anymore. I don't want to stare at data on a computer every day either, it's not fun at all.\"","Liu Yutong had long known that with her personality, she would eventually want to drop these duties; she just hadn't expected it to be so soon.","It wasn't that she was lazy or lacked ideas; it was just that this girl preferred doing things she enjoyed, following her heart more freely.","\"So, what do you want to do instead?\"","Sure enough, hearing this question, Li Xiaohui immediately perked up.","\"Yutong-jie, I want to start a professional esports team. I've even thought of a name: [Zilong]. Purple is my favorite color, and then I added the 'dragon' from our Wanlong Hui. How about it? Super cool, right?\"","\"I've done some research too. The esports industry is still developing, but there's definitely a market for it in the future. Then I can recruit the best players, give them the best training conditions, compete in tournaments, and win championships! Eventually representing our country on the world stage and making a name for ourselves. That sounds so much more interesting than looking at financial reports, anyway.\"","After finishing, she cautiously observed Liu Yutong's expression, a mix of nervousness and full-blown anticipation on her face. \"Yutong-jie, do you think it's feasible? You'll support me, right?\"","Hearing Li Xiaohui's words, Liu Yutong thought to herself, just as expected.","This girl really does want to move in the gaming direction.","Li Xiaohui loved playing games to begin with. Her sudden desire to start a team, or rather a club, actually had some of Liu Yutong's own influence behind it. The idea for the internet cafe esports tournament came from her, and it was no surprise that a gaming enthusiast like Li Xiaohui, inspired by it, would suddenly think of starting a club.","However, Liu Yutong had never insisted that Li Xiaohui had to do anything specific. As long as this girl was willing to stay with Wanlong Hui, she would support whatever she wanted to do.","\"Xiaohui, that's a great idea. The esports industry does have a promising future. I support you.\"","Li Xiaohui was overjoyed. \"Really? Yutong-jie, you're the best! I love you the most!\"","\"Don't celebrate too soon.\"","\"My support is one thing, but if you're going to do this, you can't just treat it as a casual hobby. If you're going to do it, you have to aim for the standards of a top-tier club.\"","\"Your name, Zilong, has a good concept and recognition, that's fine. But to really make it work, a good name alone isn't enough,\" Liu Yutong said.","Li Xiaohui immediately became serious, ready to learn humbly.","\"Yutong-jie, this time I'll really put my heart into building my team... ahem, my club.\"","\"Please teach me how to do it.\"","Seeing her so earnest was a rare sight, and the smile in Liu Yutong's eyes deepened.","Indeed, passion gives people greater motivation.","\"Alright, since you're asking, I'll mention the most important points.\"","\"First, localization. If you want to build a club, you need a place to put down roots. Organize more offline viewing parties, fan meet-and-greets. You can even collaborate with the city to host some amateur esports tournaments. Tie Zilong firmly to this city, make the locals proud of you. That way, you'll have a foundation.\"","\"Second, a youth training system. Top-tier players are hard to come by. For long-term development, you must have your own ability to cultivate talent. Set up a youth training camp to discover and nurture promising young players yourself. This system will be the club's core competitive advantage in the future. You can't just think about buying ready-made players. But this can be gradually perfected once the competition system is more mature; no need to rush for now.\"","\"Third, and this is the most easily overlooked yet crucial point: a professional operations team. Team performance is important, of course, but matters outside of competition require more specialized people to handle.\"","\"Running a club involves your hobbies and dreams, but hobbies and dreams don't put food on the table. Prize money alone definitely can't support an entire team, so good operations are vital.\"","\"For example, you'll need to establish a competition and training department dedicated to player training and strategy. Set up a marketing and business department specifically for securing sponsorships, negotiating partnerships, and brand promotion. You'll also need a content operations department, and so on...\"","Listening to Liu Yutong list out so many points one by one, Li Xiaohui felt her head was stuffed full, feeling a bit dizzy.","\"Ah? We need to set up that many departments? Isn't that too complicated? I originally thought just finding a few people to compete, providing room and board, would be enough.\"","\"You're thinking too simply. Did you really think managing a club would be easier than managing an internet cafe?\"","Liu Yutong looked at her with amusement and continued, \"What I just described to you is the proper, professional way of doing things. Of course, if you find it too troublesome, you don't have to go that far. You could just put together a makeshift team and keep things small-scale. If you lose money, it's no big deal—just consider it spending for some fun.\"","These words instantly pricked Li Xiaohui's competitive spirit.","The girl jumped up eagerly and declared, \"Who said I find it troublesome? I don't want some small-time operation! If we're doing this, we're going for the best! I, Li Xiaohui, either don't do something, or I do it to be the absolute best!\"","\"Just wait and see, Sister Yutong. Purple Dragon will become the greatest esports club in Dragon Country... no, in the entire world!\""]},{"number":467,"title":"Chapter 467: 467. First Quarter Meeting.","paragraphs":["Time passed quietly.","During this period, Zhou Muchen and the others had been busy raising funds.","Liu Yutong had already told them that time was tight; it was best to have all the capital ready by mid-May, along with completing all the preliminary preparations.","After all, this venture involved going abroad to, so to speak, 'shear sheep'—or more accurately, to take a bite out of someone else's pie. If they weren't properly prepared, the money might not make it back.","Therefore, ensuring the secrecy and security of the funds was absolutely crucial.","Around the beginning of the month, Liu Yutong received news that Zhou Muchen and his group's funds were fully in place.","A full 2.3 billion, three hundred million more than the originally estimated maximum.","This figure alone showed how seriously and proactively they were taking this matter.","Of course, this was also because Liu Yutong had revealed the specific timeframe to them—this money wouldn't be tied up for long, at most three or four months before it would likely be recouped.","Based on the return rate she had previously promised, in about three to four months, there was a chance to achieve returns several times over.","It would be downright strange if they weren't enthusiastic.","Three or four months, and potentially earning billions in profit. In the past, they wouldn't have even dared to think about it, as the return rate was simply terrifying.","But now, they at least dared to entertain the fantasy a little.","Naturally, even if such a high return rate wasn't achieved in the end, and it only doubled or tripled, they would still be perfectly satisfied.","Zhou Muchen and the others weren't truly holding out hope for Liu Yutong to deliver an 800% return.","They felt that while Liu Yutong was formidable, the capital in the stock account she originally operated wasn't that large. This time was different—this involved over two billion, not even counting Liu Yutong's own capital pool.","The scale of capital being managed was different, and so was the difficulty.","Their real expectation was roughly doubling the investment.","Doubling would mean over four billion in total capital including the principal. Earning over two billion in just a few months—what more could they ask for?","They were more than content.","............","Wanlong Hui Group.","On Liu Yutong's side, the second high-level group meeting of the year was convened.","She sat upright at the head of the conference table, as heads of various departments and subsidiary companies gathered to begin reporting on the first quarter's performance.","First, Yang Xin, General Manager of Wanlong Retail Co., Ltd., stood up to summarize the supermarket operations.","\"Miss Liu, colleagues, our eleven Wanlong Supermarket stores are currently operating well. Total Q1 revenue reached 522 million yuan, with a monthly average of 174 million, an 8% increase compared to Q4 last year. The gross profit margin remained at 23.5%, a year-on-year increase of 0.7 percentage points. Net profit also grew from 6.9% to 7.6%.\"","\"The revenue share of our fresh produce category has increased to 35%, making it the largest and fastest-growing segment. Simultaneously, through optimized supply chain management and centralized procurement, cost control was 2 percentage points better than expected. Furthermore, we have increased the proportion of local fresh produce supply and supported the expansion of green, organic farming for agricultural products in Miss Liu's hometown, Duan Village...\"","\"Regarding cash flow, Wanlong Retail currently has 320 million yuan in available funds on its books. Apart from needing to reserve a portion for procurement and operational funds in Q2 and Q3, we plan to invest 40 million to establish a new retail brand as a supplement to our supermarket business. The new brand will focus on 24-hour chain convenience stores, with a preliminary plan to open 10 pilot stores in core urban areas.\"","\"We have conducted research. There is very strong demand for high-quality, immediate consumption around downtown office buildings and high-end residential communities. Our 24-hour convenience stores will focus on high-quality fresh food, coffee, and heat-and-eat products, creating differentiated complementarity with our large-scale Wanlong Supermarkets.\"","\"We have done extensive market analysis and financial projections for this plan in the early stages. The estimated investment per store is around 500,000 yuan, covering rent, renovation, equipment, and initial store inventory. We request review and approval from Miss Liu and the group.\"","Liu Yutong listened quietly and, after brief consideration, replied.","\"Manager Yang's proposal is on the right track. Our large supermarkets cover centralized family shopping, while using convenience stores to capture immediate, fragmented consumption forms a complementary retail network. I agree with this strategic direction.\"","\"However, I have a question: isn't the single-store investment cost of 500,000 yuan somewhat on the high side?\"","In her impression, such 24-hour convenience stores shouldn't require such high costs.","Yang Xin quickly explained: \"Miss Liu, there is indeed room for optimization in terms of cost. It's just that our initial equipment procurement, due to small quantities and potential need for customization, will be priced higher. The cost will decrease once scale is achieved. The rent calculation is based on a three-month deposit plus one month's rent upfront. We preset inventory turnover at 15 days. If we can better utilize the central kitchen resources under Manager Yu's purview, we could reduce costs by another 3-5 percentage points. Once the model is fully refined and mature, opening a store for around 350,000 to 400,000 yuan should be possible.\"","\"Alright.\"","Liu Yutong nodded and said: \"Then I have no further questions.\"","\"I can approve the plan, but the official implementation needs to be postponed by three months.\"","Yang Xin was about to say, \"Thank you, Miss Liu.\"","But when he heard the last sentence, he was taken aback.","?????","Wait, if you've approved it, why postpone it for three months?","Got excited for nothing.","And for some reason, a faint sense of foreboding stirred within him.","Miss Liu is probably planning something!","Liu Yutong then turned her gaze to the next person in charge: \"Next, Yu Xin.\"","Yu Xin promptly stood up and reported on the progress of the projects under her responsibility, focusing on the development of Wanhui Youxuan.","\"Currently, our platform firmly holds the top position among domestic lifestyle service websites. However, from what I know, competitors have already started developing rival products to compete with us. Therefore, we need to accelerate our market capture speed.\"","\"As of last week, registered users for our Wanhui Youxuan have surpassed 2 million, mainly concentrated in economically developed first- and second-tier cities, as well as the thirteen cities within our home province. Active users remain stable at over 650,000, with daily website visits exceeding 4 million.\"","\"Current daily order volume has broken 20,000 orders, with a peak single day reaching 28,000 orders. Since the platform's launch over four months ago, total transaction volume has reached 89 million yuan, and it is expected to break the 100 million yuan mark in the latter half of this month...\"","Next, Yu Xin listed various data points for Wanhui Youxuan in great detail. Of course, what she talked about most was still the fund utilization situation.","The platform is still in the investment phase, far from profitability. All strategies are aimed at rapidly capturing market share.","\"The 50 million we raised not long ago is almost depleted now, and it's estimated it can only sustain our operations for another two to three months. Our current market strategy is highly effective, but the burn rate is simply too fast. Moreover, we cannot afford to slow down our pace; once our speed drops, we risk being overtaken or even swallowed up by competitors entering the market later.\"","\"Our next objective is very clear: we must initiate our Series B funding round before our capital runs out.","We need funding on a much larger scale—at least 500 million—to completely dominate the market, squeeze out the living space for latecomers. After establishing economies of scale and a monopolistic advantage, we should be very close to profitability.\""]},{"number":468,"title":"Chapter 468: 468, What Is the Young Lady Up To","paragraphs":["After listening to Yu Xin's report, Liu Yutong immediately stated, \"The financing matter cannot be delayed. After the meeting, you must immediately contact President Ji and the others to initiate the Series B process. Give it the highest priority and finalize the timing and specific plan as soon as possible.\"","\"Understood, Sister Yutong,\" Yu Xin nodded in agreement.","Internet companies are different from traditional enterprises.","Traditional enterprises, like physical businesses such as supermarkets or restaurants, can be meticulously cultivated step by step, slowly expanding their scale. Aside from funding issues, the industry itself is somewhat \"heavy,\" requiring more personnel. Unless through mergers and acquisitions, rapid expansion is difficult.","Internet companies are different; their core logic is users.","Only by acquiring a massive user base at any cost can they build a moat and maintain a leading position.","Once they slow down, they risk being overtaken by latecomers.","By then, not only would market share be eroded, but the advantages built from burning money earlier would also vanish, potentially leading to a passive position where they end up being acquired or forced out of the market.","Therefore, her only advice for Wanhui Youxuan was: Speed!","Although food delivery services aren't quite mature yet, with very high labor costs, group buying is perfectly feasible.","Wanhui Youxuan also has an urgent issue to resolve: maps.","Riders need detailed maps for product delivery. Currently, they are using maps drawn by an external company.","This is definitely not acceptable.","In the future, whether it's the widespread adoption of smartphones or integrating map functions into the website, data interfacing with external parties will be unavoidable.","So, if possible, acquiring a mapping company would be ideal.","Thinking of this, a faint, almost imperceptible smile appeared at the corner of Liu Yutong's lips.","This year really is a good time. With the financial crisis in full swing, she has much more room to maneuver.","Sorry, but she might just beat Ali to the punch by a few years.","Next, Yu Xin reported on the situation of Yuyuefang.","Yuyuefang achieved sales of 39 million in the first quarter of this year. Although it's far from matching the supermarket's figures, it is quite profitable, with a gross profit margin of about 65%. The net profit margin can also be maintained around 18%, which is significantly higher than the supermarket's net profit margin.","In other words, the eleven Yuyuefang restaurants have an annual net profit potential of roughly 30 million.","As for the supermarket, an annual net profit easily exceeding 100 million should be no problem.","An annual net profit of over a hundred million—this figure might not amount to much in those domineering CEO novels where characters make tens of billions effortlessly, but in reality, it can outperform over 90% of enterprises nationwide.","After Yu Xin finished her report, it was Zhang Tao's turn.","After being discharged from the hospital, Zhang Tao was transferred to oversee the internet cafe business, taking over from Li Xiaohui. However, he only took over the internet cafe operations for now; Li Xiaohui still nominally heads the investment department.","Actually, following the order, he definitely wouldn't have been the third to report.","The reason for this arrangement was that Liu Yutong wanted to hear about the profitable projects first.","That way, when she later heard about the loss-making parts and the projects requiring massive investment, she could feel a bit better.","Regarding the internet cafe business, after winning the bet with Deng Zheyan, Deng Zheyan was forced out due to funding issues, and all his stores were taken over by Huangquan E-sports.","Huangquan E-sports, leveraging the high popularity from the recent competitions and its avant-garde live-streaming tipping feature, has now achieved a monthly net profit exceeding one million.","The Boya Juexian milk tea has also gained fame. Plans are underway to spin it off as an independent chain milk tea brand.","Incidentally, the recipe for the signature Boya Juexian milk tea has been upgraded. It's no longer the original combination of Wangzai milk and jasmine tea but a new version jointly developed by over twenty master chefs based on the original flavor profile, offering a better taste. It has already started selling in the internet cafes.","Aside from these projects, other subsidiaries within the group are currently still operating at a loss.","As of now:","Wanlong Supermarket: Monthly net profit exceeds ten million.","Yuyuefang: Monthly net profit exceeds two million.","Huangquan E-sports: Monthly net profit exceeds one million.","Wanhui Youxuan: Continuous losses.","Wanlong Logistics: Continuous losses.","If it were just these two projects losing money, Liu Yutong might feel somewhat better.","Most of the money burned by Wanhui Youxuan comes from investors. Although they also invested a portion through Mingzhu Capital, the majority isn't their own.","As for Wanlong Logistics, turning a profit at this stage is indeed quite difficult, especially as the number of delivery personnel continues to grow, keeping labor costs high. The losses are essentially all going towards paying salaries.","Beyond this, they now have several other major holes to fill.","The Wanlong Shopping Center, also called Wanlong Plaza, will require at least 70 to 80 million just for subsequent decoration.","The two plots of land they hold also need development. Authorities have notified them that the land cannot remain idle long-term and construction must commence in the second half of the year.","Among these, building the Wanlong Group headquarters is expected to require an investment of no less than 5 billion. Of course, this will be carried out in phases (Phase I, II, III), taking about two to three years from groundbreaking to completion, with an average annual investment of around 2 billion.","Even if they have Yu Mo's side cover part of it, they still need to prepare at least 1 to 1.5 billion themselves.","She also plans to build an employee residential community, all constructed to a minimum standard of three bedrooms and one living room, which is expected to require another 500 million or so.","Sometimes you really shouldn't scrutinize the accounts too closely; it gives Liu Yutong a headache just thinking about it.","Clearly, Wanlong Hui is quite profitable, with an annual net profit in the hundreds of millions, but then you realize that this profit isn't even enough to cover the loose change for these projects.","Of course, the main issue is that they've been stretching their stride a bit too far.","For instance, the group headquarters could easily rent office space first and build later when they truly have the money.","It's just that she hadn't expected the two plots of land acquired earlier not to be resold. Besides feeling the price at the time was a bit of a loss, she also has some personal convictions.","Just like many women enjoy buying property.","She feels that rented offices lack roots. Only by having their own office building can Wanlong Group truly take root.","After listening to everyone's reports, Liu Yutong closed her eyes to think.","A moment later, she slowly opened her beautiful eyes.","\"Alright, the situation is quite clear now. Our current profit generation speed is far from keeping up with our investment needs.\"","\"Now, I require all department heads to act immediately and consolidate all funds from their respective subsidiary accounts, retaining only enough cash flow to maintain basic operations for three months.\"","\"Additionally, I'm giving you five days. I need to see at least 800 million in loan funds hit our accounts.\"","Hearing this, Yang Xin only wanted to say one thing: Is the young lady really going crazy?","She actually wants to pull together all the funds from the entire group and take out such a huge loan?","What on earth is she planning to do? Is she trying to bankrupt us?!","............"]},{"number":469,"title":"Chapter 469: 469. Personnel Scale.","paragraphs":["After the presentation of the Wanlonghui Group's first-quarter financial report concluded,","Liu Yutong gently massaged her temples and turned her gaze towards Ma Da, who had been in charge of logistics and personnel.","\"Ma Da, please give a final summary on the current staffing situation of the group.\"","For some reason, the moment the topic shifted to personnel, many in the conference room instantly perked up.","Especially core members of Wanlonghui like Yun Cheng, Yu Xin, and Li Xiaohui became noticeably more excited, even more so than when they heard about monthly revenues exceeding hundreds of millions.","Ma Da straightened up, his belly slightly smaller than before, and stood.","\"Miss Liu, colleagues, allow me to now brief everyone on our group's latest 'family assets'.\"","\"As of last week, the total number of direct employees under our Wanlonghui Group, excluding riders and temporary workers affiliated with the Wanhui Youxuan platform, has reached six thousand six hundred and eighty-eight. Given our group's development pace, we will break through the ten-thousand mark by year-end!\"","At this number, the conference room fell silent for a moment.","Smiles spread across many faces, particularly among the veterans who had followed Liu Yutong since last year's startup days.","They couldn't help but feel emotional inwardly.","So we've actually grown to this scale already?","We have nearly seven thousand employees. Once we hit ten thousand, the 'ten-thousand' in Wanlonghui will truly be realized, right?","We're amazing!","No, Miss Liu is amazing!","Who could have imagined that back then, they were driving an overloaded minivan to find Miss Liu in a state of despair, and in less than a year, everything had transformed so dramatically?","Ma Da was also very excited at this moment. Seeing the money pouring in didn't feel as thrilling as seeing their 'brothers' multiply.","\"According to statistics, Brother Yang's Wanlong Supermarket has the largest share of personnel, with over three thousand seven hundred employees distributed across the current eleven stores and the procurement system.","The eleven stores of Yuyue Fang have a total of six hundred and fifty employees.","The Huangquan Esports Internet Cafe project currently has around one hundred and eighty people.","The Wanhui Youxuan team is expanding the fastest, with a total of five hundred and eighty people in technology, operations, and ground promotion teams.","Wanlong Logistics has reached a scale of nine hundred and fifty people, including dedicated delivery personnel, dispatchers, and warehouse management staff.","Group headquarters and functional support staff across various sectors number approximately two hundred and ten people.","The security department has five hundred and sixty registered personnel...\"","\"........\"","\"From last year to today, in less than a year, we have not only established five major projects but have also directly or indirectly provided job opportunities for nearly seven thousand people.","Currently, based on reports from the finance department, our group's monthly expenditure on salaries, social security, and other benefits amounts to roughly thirty million. The average after-tax monthly income for entry-level employees is about two thousand five hundred yuan.\"","An average after-tax salary of two thousand five hundred might not seem high at first glance, but one must consider this is 2008, and in a third-tier city like Mingzhu City.","Currently, the average wage for ordinary workers in Mingzhu City is generally around one thousand yuan.","Many jobs, such as cashiers or internet cafe attendants, offer monthly salaries of only six to eight hundred yuan, often without social security or housing fund benefits.","Factory work might yield over two thousand yuan, but that typically involves working ten or even twelve hours a day, is very strenuous, and most also lack social security benefits.","Yet, the average after-tax income for employees under Wanlonghui has now reached two thousand five hundred, and this doesn't even include executive salaries.","Including taxes and social security contributions, the pre-tax figure would be around three thousand yuan.","This shows how good the benefits are.","Before Liu Yutong's rebirth, over a decade later, the average salary for ordinary people in Mingzhu City was still generally around three thousand yuan.","Over those more than ten years, prices and housing costs had risen in multiple rounds, but wages hadn't increased much, leading more and more young people to choose to leave Mingzhu City to seek opportunities in larger cities.","Mingzhu City's GDP also dropped from being among the top three in the province to the bottom three.","It really gave people the feeling back then that the city seemed to be growing 'old', just like its actual age.","Simply put, to keep a city from aging and make it younger, one must find ways to retain young people, even attract them. Only then will a city become more vibrant.","Only when young people earn money do they dare to spend, and spending drives commercial prosperity, injecting vitality and energy into the entire city.","Therefore, Wanlonghui must lead by example, offering the highest possible salaries within its capabilities, so that everyone dares to spend and is willing to stay.","This is also Liu Yutong's commitment to the nearly seven thousand employees of Wanlonghui Group, and the nearly seven thousand families they represent.","She estimated that, continuing at this pace, in ten years the average after-tax monthly salary for ordinary group employees would be no less than eight thousand yuan, and this doesn't include dividends from holding the group's restricted shares.","For example, even if a veteran employee, due to ability, doesn't get promoted and remains in an entry-level position, as long as they purchase the group's restricted shares and receive annual dividends, their average after-tax income combining salary and dividends could easily exceed ten thousand yuan per month.","Although this is Liu Yutong's prediction, she firmly believes it can be achieved.","Liu Yutong has always harbored a very grand ambition: to transform Mingzhu City into a city that rivals the provincial capital.","She wants to make her grandfather, a former educated youth sent to the countryside, proud of it.","Her grandfather's original wish was to see his hometown, Duan Village, and the surrounding town develop better and better, with fewer and fewer left-behind children.","So, she will fulfill her grandfather's wish, and even surpass it.","Of course, relying solely on herself and the Wanlonghui Group alone would be very difficult to achieve.","Therefore, she intends to slowly draw those partners in, no, bring them over. Have them invest more in Mingzhu City, and they must also keep pace with Wanlonghui Group's salary increases.","Only when more enterprises invest, providing a large number of job opportunities and increasing employee incomes, can the entire city's consumption be boosted, leading to greater prosperity for the city.","After listening to Ma Da's report, Liu Yutong stood up.","Seeing this, others immediately rose as well, all looking at her with a fervent gaze.","Liu Yutong's eyes swept over their faces too, from the original startup veterans to the core members who had joined later, and then she spoke:","\"Six thousand six hundred and eighty-eight people. That's a very auspicious number, signifying smoothness and prosperity.\"","\"We all know revenue, profit, and market share are important to us, but the number Ma Da reported today truly reflects the value of our Wanlonghui!\"","\"Six thousand six hundred and eighty-eight people represent six thousand six hundred and eighty-eight trusts. The livelihoods and hopes of six thousand six hundred and eighty-eight families are tied to our Wanlonghui Group.\"","\"So, I have only one demand: no matter how much money we make, we must always improve benefits, ensuring every employee's income is among the highest in the industry!\"","\"We must let everyone who chooses Wanlonghui see a future here, live with dignity, and feel proud and honored to be a member of Wanlonghui!\"","\"And we will make the Ten Thousand Dragons Society the true cornerstone and pride of Pearl City!\"","As her words fell, the conference room was briefly plunged into a stunned silence.","Then, Yun Cheng began to clapping first.","Immediately after, thunderous applause erupted, lasting for a long time without cease.","Whether it was veterans like Yun Cheng and Ma Da, or the other executives who had joined later, they all looked at Liu Yutong with the same feeling at this moment.","The Young Lady's vision always seemed to be several levels above their own!","For the Young Lady, we would go through fire and water!!!"]},{"number":470,"title":"Chapter 470: 470, The Second Formal Enrollment Ceremony.","paragraphs":["After the applause had completely died down, Yun Cheng finally spoke.","\"Young Miss, everyone has already gathered at the banquet hall of the Lakeside Hotel. They are waiting for us to arrive.\"","Liu Yutong nodded: \"Good, let's go over now.\"","Upon hearing this, everyone felt a stir in their hearts, their emotions a mix of excitement and complexity.","It's here, it's here, the real main event is about to begin!","In truth, all the discussions earlier about revenue reports, employee numbers, and the like were merely appetizers.","The upcoming core member promotion ceremony is the true highlight of today.","Within the Wanlong Society, this is referred to as [Opening the Incense Hall].","Although Liu Yutong has always emphasized that this is just an ordinary internal ceremony for core members to become full-fledged, and everyone superficially nods in agreement, saying \"whatever the Young Miss says goes,\"","whether they truly think that is another matter entirely.","Take Ma Da and the others, for instance. They believe the Young Miss has never forgotten her original aspirations, wholeheartedly dedicated to building the Wanlong Society bigger and stronger.","Of course, \"bigger and stronger\" here should be in quotation marks.","Nowadays, the Young Miss has indeed expanded the Wanlong Society's scale, making it look more and more like a legitimate corporation. Yet, under these circumstances, she continues to expand the number of core members.","Why would a normal corporation need to develop so many capable members dressed in black?","Especially since core members receive double salaries, enjoy fully-loaded social insurance and housing fund benefits, along with family care welfare, and so on.","Isn't this precisely the Young Miss ensuring in advance that every core member has no worries holding them back?","Only without worries holding them back can they work hard to conquer territory and expand influence. This point is mutually understood without being spoken.","The Wanlong Society already dominates Mingzhu City, but the Dragon Country is vast in territory. How could the current manpower be sufficient?","Expanding outward is an inevitable trend.","Moreover, Ma Da and the others already know the Young Miss's next target: Danan City, the provincial capital of neighboring JH Province.","As a first-tier city, though not comparable to super-first-tier metropolises, Danan City's scale far exceeds that of Mingzhu. It is a true ancient historical capital and will be the next main target for Wanlong Society's practical businesses/ventures.","Wanlong Supermarkets, Wanlong Shopping Centers, and other related enterprises will gradually be established there.","The reasons the Young Miss suddenly chose Danan City are twofold: first, it's close to them, and second, they have already established connections there who can help resolve some commercial issues.","When the time comes, they will use Danan City as a center to gradually radiate influence to cities across the northern and southern regions of JH Province.","Within HS Province, they will use Mingzhu City as a center to gradually radiate to cities across its northern and southern regions.","Industrial development cannot grow as rapidly as internet companies. Furthermore, the industrial projects under the Wanlong Society Group must be guaranteed to be the best, executed to perfection. Their strategy, for now, can only advance city by city.","Otherwise, blind and reckless rapid expansion would ruin the hard-earned commercial reputation and the absolute cohesion of the employees.","Since the next target is Danan City, the first stop outside the province, naturally more manpower must be brought along.","In terms of execution capability, no one is more suitable than core members who have undergone ideological baptism.","Just like now, the group is growing larger, with employees numbering six to seven thousand.","Generally speaking, as the organization expands, more parasites will inevitably infiltrate, and management difficulty increases exponentially.","Yet, the Wanlong Society doesn't have this worry, or at least very little of it.","The Wanlong Society Group still hasn't implemented a clock-in attendance system. Why do employees still come to work on time, rarely being late, with few trying to loaf on the job?","Besides the attraction of high benefits, it's because every department has core members present, imperceptibly creating a subtle deterrence.","Don't think about causing trouble, or trying to fish in troubled waters or steal while guarding.","Before considering doing anything bad, first think about how core members deal with those hoodlums and those societal big brothers outside.","Those societal big brothers and hoodlums have been dealt with submissively, let alone ordinary people.","As the group continues to grow, the selection mechanism for core members has also been continuously optimized.","Initially, anyone who joined the Wanlong Society was a core member.","Later, as the numbers grew, it changed to requiring active application, followed by study and assessment to join.","Now, it requires certain contributions, outstanding performance, and passing study and assessments to join.","Additionally, the Wanlong Society has requirements for core members' physique. Men must not have a potbelly (Ma Da excepted), must exercise regularly, and having abdominal muscles is best.","The requirements for women are relatively lower, but they must also exercise regularly.","In short, when needed, core members of the Wanlong Society must present their best appearance to embody the spirit and style of the Wanlong Society.","Currently, there are over five hundred core members in the Wanlong Society.","The first quarter of this year has already passed. Coupled with preparations to advance into Danan City, it's estimated that four to five hundred more will be added.","This ratio has already exceeded the approximately 10-to-1 ratio Liu Yutong originally planned.","However, the current situation is special, so an exception is made to recruit more, as roughly half will be transferred to Danan City later.","...........","Inside the banquet hall of the Lakeside Hotel, over a thousand people were already seated.","All core members and the candidate core members were all in their seats, about to be promoted this time.","The colors in the venue were roughly half black and half assorted/miscellaneous colors.","The atmosphere inside was exceptionally solemn, the air seemingly permeated with tension and excitement.","The Wanlong Society's core member recruitment time has now been changed to once per quarter. This was all Ma Da's doing, mainly because the ceremony to become full-fledged at last year's annual meeting was so effective.","It made Ma Da feel that this type of ceremony must be preserved. Core members must have their status personally bestowed by the Young Miss to appear solemn and to make everyone more united!","Not long after.","Liu Yutong emerged from the elevator with a group of executives who also held core member status.","On both sides of the corridor leading to the banquet hall, every five steps stood a core member in a crisp black suit with an earpiece, standing solemnly.","Each of them had an upright posture, looking handsome and cool.","As Liu Yutong entered the corridor, the two rows of members in black immediately bowed in unison to greet her.","\"Young Miss!\" X over twenty voices.","Upon hearing the voices coming from outside, the Wanlong Society members already seated inside the banquet hall instantly sat up straight, assuming their best posture as they awaited the Young Miss's arrival.","As the two heavy carved doors of the banquet hall were slowly pushed open by two members stationed beside them,","Liu Yutong's figure appeared at the entrance.","Whoosh!","Inside the hall, over a thousand core members and candidate core members abruptly stood up in unison!","Their gazes, burning with an intensity that seemed almost aflame, focused on that slender figure appearing at the doorway.","Each person's eyes were filled with anticipation, excitement, fervor... and other such emotions.","Liu Yutong wore a custom-tailored matte black velvet suit today, a crystal-like dragon brooch pinned at the collar, complementing her cool, refined makeup. Her originally shoulder-length black hair was swept back into a low chignon, revealing a smooth forehead and a slender, swan-like neck, adding an ethereal, icy allure to her beauty.","Behind her, core executives like Yun Cheng, Yu Xin, and Ma Da followed closely, like stars surrounding the moon. Their presence further accentuated the uniqueness of the figure leading them.","As she fully entered the hall and stood at the foot of the raised platform at the end of the red carpet...","Thud!","The black-clad man at the very front slammed his right fist heavily against his left chest, over his heart, producing a solid, muffled sound.","The next second!","Almost in unison, the entire assembly—over five hundred core members in black and more than four hundred probationary core members—mirrored the gesture, striking their chests with their fists in unison.","Immediately after, this crowd of over a thousand people shouted in near-fanatic unison.","\"GOOD MORNING, YOUNG MADAM!!!\"","The roar was immense, thunderous enough to make one's scalp tingle."]},{"number":471,"title":"Chapter 471: 471. Someone Stealing Techniques","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong stepped onto the high platform, her gaze slowly sweeping over every excited face in the audience below.","\"Sit!\"","With a rustle!","Everyone sat down in unison, their movements crisp and neat.","This scene left the newly arrived waitstaff outside the banquet hall utterly stunned.","The doors to the banquet hall weren't completely shut, leaving a narrow crack.","Outside, several hotel-uniformed waitstaff were secretly peeking through the gap.","They were all new hires from this year. The service industry itself has high turnover, and this was their first time witnessing a gathering of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society in person.","The synchronized standing up and sitting down just now had made them jump.","\"My god, what's going on here? A corporate meeting? That's terrifying!\"","\"Corporate meeting? Look at that crowd in black suits, does that look like a company meeting?\"","\"Looks more like a... gang meeting to me.\"","\"Whoa, seriously? Are people in that world so brazen about gathering openly now? Doesn't anyone do anything about it?\"","\"Do something? You want to do something? Even the cops would probably have to put on a polite smile if they saw this scene.\"","\"Look at the girl on the stage, she's as pretty as a movie star, but her aura is so intimidating! I bet she's the daughter of some underworld boss!\"","\"I think so too!\"","\"Keep it down, stop talking. It won't be good if we're overheard.\"","\"........\"","Right then, a voice from inside happened to carry through.","\"First group, to the stage!\"","Immediately after, they saw a line of young men spring to their feet, striding towards the front of the stage with visibly excited faces.","For some reason, the waitstaff outside gradually became infected by the atmosphere.","\"It's starting, it's starting! This is about getting promoted, right? I know this routine! That's how it goes in the movies. Next, they'll probably swear a blood oath and then hand out some 'tools'.\"","Their guess was correct; inside, they were indeed 'swearing a blood oath' and handing out items.","It's just that the reality differed quite a bit from what they imagined.","After the first group of ten ascended the stage, Yun Cheng stepped forward to address them:","\"Congratulations on becoming core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. We hope you will always remember the tenets of our Society!\"","The group immediately shouted in unison one of the Society's core maxims: \"Be cautious, meticulous, bold, understand the law, and unify knowledge with action!\"","Yun Cheng nodded. \"Now, please come before the Young Lady to receive your garments and books.\"","Still, no unnecessary words. The address ended, and the distribution began.","Ma Da and Yu Xin stood on either side of Liu Yutong, continuously handing over the prepared garments and the red-covered 'manuals'.","Liu Yutong then personally presented them to each new core member.","Every Ten Thousand Dragons Society core member who stood before Liu Yutong looked exceptionally excited, their eyes burning with fervor.","The scene was somewhat reminiscent of an ancient imperial appointment ceremony, as if from this moment on, the Young Lady was their acknowledged leader.","Each new member, upon receiving their items, would place a clenched fist over their chest and declare loudly: \"I pledge to follow the Young Lady unto death! Betrayers shall suffer three blades, six wounds!\"","Hearing this slogan, Liu Yutong's eyelid twitched slightly, and she shot a glance at Ma Da.","It must be you again, coming up with this stuff.","Wasn't it enough to have it plastered on the company walls? Now you have them shouting it one by one.","Fortunately, she was used to Ma Da and the others occasionally implementing their wild ideas and didn't react too strongly.","But the waitstaff outside felt their scalps prickle and their hearts pound.","\"Listen to that! 'Three blades, six wounds'—confirmed! They're definitely from the underworld!\"","\"Do you guys know what they're handing out? That red thing? Is it some special gang manual?\"","\"I think so! Look at their expressions, it's like they're receiving an imperial decree. Their cohesion is terrifying!\"","\".......\"","Right at that moment.","Right at that moment, a new member, overwhelmed with excitement, fumbled slightly while receiving the items. The red-covered book nearly slipped from his grasp.","But he reacted quickly and caught it in time.","However, in that instant, the title on the cover became visible to the waitstaff outside.","\"The Criminal Law?!\"","The waitstaff: \"???\"","Each wore a face of utter bewilderment.","They never expected the book these seemingly hardened gangsters were receiving to be the Criminal Law?","The contrast was so great it even made them wonder if this was some kind of performance art.","Even more incredibly, they then saw that people inside were being called upon to recite legal articles from memory—and those chosen could actually recite them fluently.","One waiter immediately felt his brain short-circuiting.","\"My mind is a mess. I need a moment... This feels even scarier than actual gangsters...\"","They finally concluded: it's not easy being in the underworld these days. Being good at fighting isn't enough anymore; you have to be able to recite the Criminal Law too. That's just too hardcore!","Among these waitstaff, a young man with side-swept bangs and a face mask hadn't spoken a word the whole time. He just watched the entire promotion ceremony with an intense, burning gaze.","His look seemed to suggest he was committing every detail of the process to memory.","After the ceremony ended, the man slipped quietly into the restroom. Locking himself in a stall, he yanked down his mask, revealing faint strap marks on his chin, his expression now one of excitement.","\"Damn, so that's how it is! So this is how the Ten Thousand Dragons Society rose up! Brilliant! Absolutely brilliant!\"","\"Now I've finally learned the essence. I can definitely make it big in Great South City!\"","He then immediately pulled out a notebook and pen tucked into the back of his waistband and began writing furiously, determined to record everything he saw today.","The Secret to the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's Growth and Success (Top Secret)","[1. The boss's aura and prestige are a must. From now on, when I give speeches, I must first coldly sweep my gaze over the crowd for three seconds, then be terse and only say one word: \"Sit!\" \"Stand!\" \"Eat!\"... Must keep them guessing about my thoughts as the boss! Yes! That's the way!]","[2. Uniform battle attire: The Ten Thousand Dragons Society's black suits are standard. On this point, I must innovate. I'll use green battle robes as our standard. After all, the color is easy on the eyes; they won't get tired even after looking at it for a long time. I'll get the brothers unified on this later!]","[3. Be humble and eager to learn! So the Ten Thousand Dragons Society hands out the 'Criminal Law.' I knew it! Just knowing how to fight is outdated. You have to understand the law. That way you know how to fight... ahem, I mean, how to operate flexibly within the legal framework. This is definitely something to study.]","[4. Ritual and ceremony are essential! Blood oaths and the like are weak! Look at them, handing out books and clothes. That's called being cultured, that's called elevating your prestige. I'll have to implement an initiation ceremony for my gang too. They'll also have to pledge to me, 'I pledge to follow unto death...' Well, I haven't thought of a harsher oath yet, I'll work on that later.]","[5. The ultimate secret to success! Relying on me, the boss, alone isn't enough. You also need a 'Young Lady' to command respect! Too bad I'm a guy... but no matter! I can get my little sister to do it! She stabbed me with a compass and made me cry when we fought in fifth grade—her aura is definitely strong enough! From now on, she'll be the 'Little Young Lady'!]","[...]"]},{"number":472,"title":"Chapter 472: 472. Proactively Offering Discounts","paragraphs":["After finishing all his notes, the man closed the notebook and let out a long, relieved sigh.","He felt he had now completely mastered the core secrets of leveling up from a street punk to a mafia godfather.","He could almost see the future of his gang: a bunch of guys in green T-shirts, with green-dyed hair... hmm, that part needed reconsideration, each holding a copy of the \"Criminal Law\"—spiritual youths, under his brilliant leadership, dominating the Great South City!","\"Heh heh heh...\"","Thinking of this, the man couldn't help but let out a gleeful, silly chuckle: \"Wanlong Society, just you wait! I'm destined to become the next legend!\"","Putting away the notebook, he tucked it into his waistband, carefully pushed open the restroom door, looked left and right to confirm no one was around, straightened his clothes, and walked out pretending nothing had happened.","Just as he was about to exit the hotel's main entrance, he almost bumped headlong into a figure dressed in a black suit.","While dodging, the bangs on his forehead parted, revealing a faintly visible celestial eye tattoo.","Before the other person could react, he covered his backside and scurried out with hurried steps.","This awkward movement and reaction left the young man in black quite puzzled.","\"In such a hurry, did he have the runs?\"","\"If he had the runs, why not use the hotel restroom? Or does the toilet at home smell better?\"","The young man in black merely glanced at the guy, didn't think too much about it, and hurriedly ran upstairs.","Because he had urgent business to report to the young mistress.","...........","In the banquet hall.","All four hundred-plus newly promoted core members had changed into uniform black attire.","In the entire hall, over a thousand members in black sat neatly, creating an extremely imposing scene.","Meanwhile, in the neighboring banquet hall, the invited suppliers were also feeling anxious.","Some of them were already old acquaintances and had joined the Wanlong Symbiotic Business Alliance.","They certainly knew what was happening next door; they had experienced it once before at last year's Wanlong Society annual meeting.","They were probably worried they weren't being compliant enough and wanted to give them another warning.","When Liu Yutong sent someone to invite them over, these suppliers grew even more apprehensive.","Some had even made up their minds, thinking they might as well transfer a portion of their shares to spend their way out of disaster.","\"Here it comes, time to lay the cards on the table.\"","\"Sigh, let's go. At least it's just about money, probably not our lives, right?\"","\"Hopefully, they just want shares and won't go too far...\"","\"Be sharp later, attitude must be good. We absolutely must not upset that young mistress!\"","\".......\"","Steeling themselves, as if marching to the execution ground, they shuffled hesitantly into the banquet hall occupied by the Wanlong Society.","As soon as they entered, a thousand pairs of eyes instantly fixed on them, immediately making the legs of these seasoned business owners tremble.","Even though it wasn't their first time seeing this spectacle, that intangible sense of oppression still left them feeling somewhat suffocated. Especially this year, the scale of the men in black had doubled compared to last year, making the visual impact even stronger.","They hardly dared to look up at the young mistress on the stage with her powerful aura, mentally figuring out how to tactfully propose a plan to transfer some shares that would both preserve their assets and satisfy the other party.","Last year, when the Wanlong Society established that Symbiotic Business Alliance, it was already made clear that they would have to accept Wanlong Society's investment in the future.","Wasn't their insistence on that clause precisely for today?","Since they couldn't avoid this blow, they might as well try to negotiate for more lenient terms.","\"Miss Liu!\"","\"Chairwoman Liu!\"","\".....\"","The group greeted Liu Yutong upon reaching her, their voices noticeably trembling.","\"Gentlemen, please don't be nervous.\"","Liu Yutong, sensing their tension, got straight to the point: \"The main reason for inviting you all here today is to inform you of one thing.\"","\"For all products you supply that sell exceptionally well in our supermarkets, the purchase price will be increased by 3% to 5%.\"","As Liu Yutong's words fell, everyone was stunned, finding it somewhat hard to believe.","Were they hallucinating from nervousness?","They weren't being asked for their shares?","Instead, they were being given more money?","A 3%-5% increase meant their profit margin would grow by that amount. In the current market environment, this was like manna from heaven.","\"Ch... Chairwoman Liu, did you just say the purchase price would be increased?\"","\"That's correct.\"","\"Not only will the prices be raised, but Wanlong Supermarkets will also actively promote your products.\"","\"However, I have two conditions. First, you must guarantee that the product quality supplied to us is always the best. Second, you need to establish factories or invest in Mingzhu City. I can guarantee you won't face harassment here and that your investments will be secure.\"","\".........\"","\"Of course, this is just my preliminary idea for now. You can go back and consider it carefully.\"","The suppliers gradually understood and nodded repeatedly.","Their feelings at this moment were also complex.","The Wanlong Society group looked intimidating, even occasionally subjecting them to a bit of dark visual intimidation, but when it came to cooperation, they were far more reliable than many ostensibly righteous and moral major clients who actually pushed down prices relentlessly.","Wanlong Supermarkets also had almost stringent requirements for the quality of supplied products, absolutely not allowing substandard goods to enter the market and harm consumers.","Now they were even taking the initiative to offer concessions and promised to help with promotion, all to bring the industrial chain to Mingzhu City and drive local development.","It even made some of them wonder if they were really dealing with organized crime figures?","Some among them had indeed encountered issues like demands for bribes, local protectionism, and organized crime figures demanding kickbacks when investing and building factories.","Even now, many of them still faced such problems, with local gang bosses and bullies coming to cause trouble from time to time, finding excuses to demand money.","And you couldn't just call the police to have them removed.","There were those who had stood their ground against such troubles from these figures, only to end up bankrupt and shut down due to retaliation.","If the Wanlong Society could truly guarantee a stable business environment, it might not be a bad idea to consider opening a factory here.","At the very least, after cooperating for so long, apart from being a bit scary, the Wanlong Society had never truly harmed their interests. On the contrary, they had earned more through this partnership.","\"Chairwoman Liu!\"","A food processing factory owner, deeply troubled by local bullies, couldn't help but speak up.","\"You've hit the nail on the head. To be honest, the factory I have in the neighboring city constantly has people coming up with all sorts of excuses to demand money, even threatening my workers. If Mingzhu City is really as good as you say, I'll be the first to move my factory here! Even if the profits are a bit lower, I'd value the peace of mind.\"","His words immediately resonated with several other bosses who had similar experiences.","\"Yes, Chairwoman Liu, we're in business precisely for a stable environment.\"","\"If we could really avoid those nasty troubles, we'd accept slightly higher costs.\"","\".........\"","Liu Yutong had investigations done on all the suppliers invited today.","For every supplier that joined the Wanlong Symbiotic Business Alliance, the Wanlong Society had stationed quality supervisors.","During the nearly half-year supervision period, there were constant reports that the instability in supply from some vendors was due to frequent harassment by local bullies in their areas.","Therefore, she decided that since she aimed to transform Mingzhu City into a headquarters for the Wanlong Association, one that could rival those in second-tier cities, it was essential to attract investment and businesses.","Given this, her first step would be to extend invitations to these suppliers, encouraging them to relocate or establish branch factories here.","Of course, apart from this, she also had a personal motive."]},{"number":473,"title":"Chapter 473: 473. Invitation Letter.","paragraphs":["After the meeting concluded, the suppliers gradually dispersed.","Liu Yutong stepped down from the stage, and Yun Cheng immediately followed close behind, whispering in her ear, \"Miss, the brothers below report that Pan Xing has woken up. Scarface's side wants you to make a decision.\"","Pan Xing had been lying in the ICU for so long. Just when everyone thought he might never wake up, he miraculously regained consciousness.","His life force is truly tenacious!","\"Have someone keep a close watch on him...\" Liu Yutong began, but then changed her question. \"Does my sister, Gao Min, know yet?\"","Yun Cheng shook his head. \"We haven't told her yet.\"","Liu Yutong pondered for a moment before saying, \"Then tell her. Since they didn't find a breakthrough with Zhao Weixiang, Pan Xing must know something. And... never mind, just notify her as I said.\"","\"Understood, Miss!\"","Yun Cheng remembered something else and added, \"Oh, Miss, the brother who came up to report the news mentioned that he bumped into a suspicious person downstairs who almost collided with him. The person then fled in a panic and seemed to have a Third Eye tattoo on his forehead.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Liu Hao?\"","Yun Cheng shook his head again. \"Not sure if it's him. Liu Hao did start that Third Eye Gang last year, but it seems to have disbanded later, and he himself ran off. Some of his former lackeys even wanted to join us back then, but we turned them down.\"","As the first gangster to have clashed with their Ten Thousand Dragons Society, Liu Hao had left a rather deep impression on them.","In fact, ever since they arrived in Mingzhu City, they had caught traces of Liu Hao and nearly had a second confrontation.","It's just that the moment that guy realized it was them, he turned tail and ran without a word, later disappearing entirely from the university district area.","Afterward, as the Ten Thousand Dragons Society came into conflict with the East Sea Alliance and eventually took out most of the local forces in Mingzhu City, they heard some news about Liu Hao and his Third Eye Gang during that period, but they never ran into the guy again.","Yun Cheng speculated that Liu Hao might have left Mingzhu City to avoid their rising power.","Indeed, some local bosses who felt they couldn't survive in Mingzhu City anymore had simply packed up and left.","So, the brother's report of someone with a Third Eye tattoo on his forehead couldn't confirm it was Liu Hao. After all, it wasn't only members of the Third Eye Gang who fancied such tattoos.","Some people just watch popular TV dramas, think Erlang Shen's celestial eye looks cool, and follow the trend by getting one tattooed. That's entirely possible.","Most crucially, a coward like Liu Hao probably wouldn't dare show his face in front of them again.","Liu Yutong didn't dwell on the matter too much.","Whether it was Liu Hao or not, they were no longer on the same level. It was unlikely their paths would cross meaningfully in the future.","Dropping the topic, Liu Yutong announced another piece of news to everyone. \"Since everyone's here, I have one more announcement to make.\"","The black-clad members below who were eating and drinking immediately fell silent, all eyes focusing on her once more.","\"The group will soon release another batch of restricted shares. The rules remain the same: core members can subscribe for up to 100,000 shares each, and regular employees have a cap of 50,000 shares.\"","\"The price per share this time is set at 5.5 yuan.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, suppressed exclamations of delight erupted from below.","According to the latest overall valuation of the Ten Thousand Dragons Group, it has now reached 5.5 billion yuan.","In fact, professional appraisal reports indicate the Ten Thousand Dragons Society Group's actual valuation is closer to 6.2 billion.","However, to ensure stable growth in the value of the restricted shares, the internal pricing is set slightly below the market price.","This latest valuation meant that for the earliest batch of core members who purchased restricted shares, the value of their holdings had skyrocketed from the initial 200,000 yuan to 550,000 yuan!","Furthermore, they had enjoyed a buy-one-get-one-free promotion at the time of purchase, meaning their actual cost was only 100,000 yuan.","In just half a year, 100,000 yuan had multiplied more than fivefold.","No wonder they were thrilled.","\"Holy crap! It went up again!\"","\"Back then I hesitated and only bought 60,000 shares... what a huge loss!\"","\"If only I had borrowed money to buy the full amount back then!\"","\"Working under Miss really pays off. Who would have thought I'd be worth half a million now? Last year I couldn't even scrape together a hundred yuan.\"","\"Tell me about it. Following Miss is truly our good fortune. Next year our net worth will definitely pass a million!\"","\"Absolutely, Miss has been incredible to us!\"","\"We'd go through fire and water for you, Miss!\"","\"...\"","Everyone couldn't help but shout excitedly.","The newly promoted core members were also particularly excited. Although their purchase price was higher than the earliest members, their purchasing limit had increased.","Moreover, before becoming core members, they were regular employees and had already bought some restricted shares, with some even having maxed out their limits early on.","Now, they had an additional 50,000-share quota.","Of course, due to the rising share price, many might not have enough money to buy the full 100,000 shares. Even with the quota, funds could be a constraint.","In short, they would buy as much as they could, firmly believing these shares would continue to appreciate.","They didn't need to worry about risks either. As long as Miss was here, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society would surely grow bigger and stronger.","After announcing the restricted share release, Liu Yutong left.","This release of restricted shares was estimated to raise around another 100 million yuan in capital.","The investment culture within the Ten Thousand Dragons Society was quite strong. With nearly 7,000 employees in the group, aside from those who had maxed out their purchases, at least half could still buy more group restricted shares.","Even if the remaining employees bought just 5,000 shares each on average, it would easily surpass 100 million.","In the future, if the employee count reached a hundred thousand, a simple share sale could raise billions.","And there was no need to worry about outsiders meddling or disclosing certain information—this was the advantage of internal financing without going public.","Of course, the prerequisite was ensuring the Ten Thousand Dragons Group employees could earn money.","If they couldn't make money, how could they talk about buying shares?","While their families could offer some support, not all families were in a position to do so.","As the banquet hall buzzed with discussions about the restricted shares, a government vehicle pulled up on the opposite shore of the lake downstairs.","Liu Yutong received the news immediately and headed straight for the first-floor lobby.","Just as she entered the lobby, she saw the bespectacled Secretary Huang walking in through the hotel's main entrance.","\"Secretary Huang, what brings you here?\" Liu Yutong greeted him with a smile.","Secretary Huang's face also broke into a smile as he quickened his pace to shake her hand. \"You're too kind, Chairwoman Liu. It's my presumptuous visit. I hope I'm not disturbing your gathering?\"","\"Not at all. We just finished our meeting, and colleagues are having a meal.\"","Liu Yutong gestured sideways. \"Would you like to join us in a private room upstairs, Secretary Huang?\"","Secretary Huang waved his hand with a smile. \"Thank you for the offer, Chairwoman Liu, but there's no need to sit. I came specifically to deliver an invitation to you.\"","As he spoke, he took an invitation from his briefcase and presented it to Liu Yutong.","\"Tomorrow evening, there will be a charity gala at the Pearl Convention and Exhibition Center, which our city's leadership will also attend. Several prominent local entrepreneurs are among the invited guests, and the leadership specifically instructed me to convey their hope that you, Chairman Liu, will make every effort to attend.\"","Liu Yutong received the invitation with both hands, feeling deeply honored. \"Secretary Huang, you and the leadership are too kind. I'm sorry to have troubled you to make this trip in person.\"","\"Please do convey to the leadership my sincere gratitude for their great favor and trust. I will definitely attend the charity gala tomorrow evening as scheduled.\"","After exchanging a few more pleasantries, Secretary Huang took his leave."]},{"number":474,"title":"Chapter 474: 474. The Unspeakable Prophecy.","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong watched Secretary Huang's departing figure, silent for a long time, even somewhat lost in thought, a trace of pain faintly visible between her brows.","She knew why this charity gala was being held. A natural disaster had occurred in the suburbs a few days ago. While there weren't many casualties, it had caused significant economic losses.","If it were just about donating money or similar things, she wouldn't mind; she wasn't unwilling to part with it.","The reason she felt pain was because it made her think of the catastrophic earthquake in BS Province from her previous life, one that shocked the world and plunged the entire nation into mourning.","Even now, recalling the scenes she witnessed in that past life, they remained vivid before her eyes: mountains collapsing, the earth splitting, lives devastated...","It was already May. There weren't many days left until that date.","The very thought of it made her heart ache terribly, even leaving her somewhat breathless.","She clearly knew the tragedy might repeat itself, yet she couldn't find a suitable way to prevent it all, to alter this predetermined course of fate.","This feeling of foreknowledge coupled with powerlessness was truly excruciating for her.","Standing beside her, Yun Cheng saw the look of pain on the young mistress's face. It was the first time he had ever seen such an expression on her.","Thinking she might be ill, he quickly asked with concern, \"Young Mistress, are you alright? I'll take you to the hospital right now.\"","Liu Yutong shook her head gently, her voice carrying a hint of weariness. \"I'm fine. I just thought of some things and feel a bit unsettled.\"","\"Yun Cheng, take me back to the company first.\"","Although worried about her condition, Yun Cheng instinctively nodded in agreement. \"Yes, Young Mistress.\"","The two of them walked out of the hotel one after the other, heading towards the black Maybach sedan parked by the lakeside.","Yun Cheng opened the car door for her. She bent down and settled into the back seat, her body sinking slightly into the soft leather.","After the car started, she directly pulled the curtain shut and closed her eyes, intending to rest for a moment.","But not long after,","through the rearview mirror, Yun Cheng saw the young mistress's shoulders begin to tremble slightly.","Then, a large teardrop rolled unexpectedly from the corner of her eye, tracing a path down her fair cheek.","Followed by a second, a third...","Until she suddenly raised her hand, pressing the back of it hard against her mouth.","Yun Cheng had never seen the young mistress cry so uncontrollably before. His own heart clenched in response.","In his impression, the young mistress was forever the calm, powerful queen who seemed to command everything.","But at this moment, she was as fragile as a child who had lost her way.","What was wrong with the young mistress?","He didn't know, and he couldn't figure out what could have happened to make her like this.","An unknown amount of time later, the car stopped at the main entrance on the first floor of the Wanlong Group headquarters.","Yun Cheng then softly reminded her, \"Young Mistress, we've arrived.\"","He looked through the rearview mirror and saw Liu Yutong had already sat up straight, carefully wiping her face with a tissue. Apart from her eyes and the tip of her nose being slightly red, one could hardly tell she had just been crying.","Only those usually clear and sharp eyes still held a lingering hint of moisture.","Yun Cheng very much wanted to ask her what had happened, but he also knew the young mistress's temperament. If she didn't want to say, no one could force her, and he was no exception.","It wasn't that Liu Yutong didn't want to say, but rather she couldn't.","How could she possibly tell him that she knew a place called XX might have an earthquake?","This matter could only be kept hidden in her heart.","She also prayed silently in her heart, praying that in this life, there would be no earthquake, that everyone could live and work in peace and health.","This possibility also existed because her current life did indeed have some deviations from her previous one.","For instance, the appearance of Yun Cheng and the others sometimes made her wonder if this might be a parallel world developing very similarly to her past life?","If it was the latter, that would be the best outcome.","As soon as Liu Yutong got out of the car, the sound of footsteps came from the lobby.","She saw Xiao Hu walking out of the elevator with seven or eight teenagers, each face beaming with excited smiles.","They were now completely different from when they had first been taken in by the Wanlong Society. Their physiques were noticeably much more robust, and some had even developed muscles.","Since Yun Cheng had taken them as disciples, he would teach them combat skills from time to time and had arranged for them to attend school.","Usually after school or on weekends, whenever they had free time, they would come to the company's martial arts hall to learn Sanda.","Seeing Liu Yutong and Yun Cheng, Xiao Hu and the others hurried over. They first greeted Liu Yutong respectfully, then called out \"Master\" to Yun Cheng in an orderly manner.","A smile reappeared on Liu Yutong's face as she asked, \"Xiao Hu, what's going on? You all look very happy today.\"","Xiao Hu said excitedly, \"Young Mistress, good news! The police officers just notified us that Xiao Bao and Xiao Xiang's parents have been found. Their home is in BS Province.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Really? That is indeed good news.\"","Xiao Hu continued, \"The police officers also said that several of the traffickers who were previously wanted have recently been spotted in the BS Province area as well. They are coordinating the arrest now.\"","BS Province! Human traffickers!","Hearing that name, Liu Yutong's eyes instantly turned sharp.","The anxiety and sense of powerlessness she had forcibly suppressed earlier surged back, but this time, she seemed to have found a course of action.","\"Yun Cheng, did you hear that?\"","Yun Cheng nodded. \"When the time comes, I will arrange for someone to take Xiao Bao and Xiao Xiang to BS Province to find their families.\"","Xiao Bao and Xiao Xiang had initially been thrilled to hear their parents were found, but upon seeing their Master and the Young Mistress, their spirits instantly fell.","If this family reunion succeeded, they didn't know if they would have another chance in the future to see their Master, the Young Mistress, and all the older brothers and sisters of the Wanlong Society.","Before they could express their reluctance,","Liu Yutong spoke instead. \"No, Yun Cheng, it's not just about sending them back.\"","\"We can't rely solely on the police coordinating for the trafficker matter. Those scum have ruined so many families. Since we have a lead, our Wanlong Society cannot stand idly by. Moreover, Xiao Bao and Xiao Xiang are also our family. Both emotionally and logically, we should send people over.\"","\"These traffickers who succeeded in abducting so many children are definitely operating as a gang. We can't even rule out the possibility of local criminal forces sheltering them. We need to round them up completely. We might even be able to extract information from them about where Xiao Hu and the others were taken from before they were trafficked, helping them find their own families.\"","Her reasoning, while somewhat forced, was sufficient, and it also fit her established persona of occasionally making decisions that others found hard to comprehend.","When the time came, she would use the pretext of cracking down on human traffickers to deploy as many people and resources as possible near that place about to suffer calamity.","It was the only thing she could do.","Hearing this, the sliver of doubt in Yun Cheng's heart resurfaced.","The young mistress's reaction seemed excessively intense and urgent. While they had been assisting the police in combating human traffickers, mobilizing on such a large scale like this... was it perhaps a bit...","Although he didn't understand why the young mistress was so urgent, he would still strictly carry out her orders.","\"Yes, young mistress! I will immediately dispatch a team to BS Province.\"","\"One team is not enough. I want all core personnel!\"","\"Yes, young mistress!\""]},{"number":475,"title":"Chapter 475: 475. The Highlight of the Dinner Party","paragraphs":["The following evening.","Liu Yutong changed into a custom-made, high-end evening gown.","Originally, she hadn't wanted to be so ostentatious, but Yu Xin had kept persuading her that for such an occasion, one must dress formally.","The moment she stepped into the charity banquet venue, she instantly became the focus of all eyes.","She wore a silver-gray sequined strapless gown that perfectly hugged her figure. The sequins shimmered under the lights like crushed stardust scattered across her form.","A necklace of the same color scheme adorned her neck, simple yet exuding an air of luxury.","The back of the gown featured a daring open-back design, revealing her flawless, fair skin, complemented by a pale gray tulle bow and train. She resembled a goddess who had stepped out of a dream, dazzling yet soft, making it impossible for anyone to look away. Everyone present, men and women alike, was utterly captivated.","Although Liu Yutong felt countless gazes fixed upon her, a faint, elusive smile played on her lips as she followed a server to the main banquet table.","She immediately spotted the name card bearing her title: \"Liu Yutong, Chairwoman of the Wanlong Group.\"","Liu Yutong was somewhat surprised to find herself seated at the main table.","After all, those seated there were the true heavyweights of Mingzhu City, including important city leaders and venerable senior representatives of the business community.","Given her seniority and the relatively recent rise of the Wanlong Group, she shouldn't have qualified for the main table. Moreover, her seat was right next to the leaders, which carried an unusual significance.","Combined with Secretary Huang's attitude, she had a vague sense that this was likely a deliberate arrangement by the leadership.","However, she didn't dwell on it too much. Since she was here, she would make the best of it.","Liu Yutong proactively greeted several senior business figures at the main table.","For some reason, these entrepreneurs, all over fifty, were not warm towards her. They were even somewhat cold, with a hint of wariness underlying their demeanor.","What she didn't know was that the reputation of the Wanlong Society had already spread throughout Mingzhu City's business circles.","Perhaps due to information bias, in the eyes of these conventional businesspeople, this rapidly rising young heiress was widely perceived as having built her fortune through shady dealings, with a complex background and ruthless methods, which naturally evoked caution and wariness.","That's why they were reluctant to engage with her more than necessary.","Liu Yutong didn't take it to heart either, maintaining a perfectly polite smile on her face as she gracefully took her seat.","Since these seniors were unwilling to show her a friendly face, she naturally wouldn't go out of her way to ingratiate herself.","Meanwhile.","Guests in the hall who kept stealing glances at her couldn't help but whisper among themselves.","From the moment she entered, many had been stunned, and only now were they gradually regaining their composure.","\"Who is that beauty at the main table? I've never seen her before. With that aura and looks, is she a celebrity? Or the daughter of some tycoon?\"","\"She doesn't seem like a celebrity. Celebrities lack that kind of presence. But her looks and figure are better than any actress on TV!\"","\"That evening gown suits her perfectly. When she walked past me earlier, I was almost blinded by her radiance. The key is it's not tacky at all.\"","\"Not just not tacky. That look in her eyes, that poise... definitely not something cultivated in an ordinary family.\"","\"I never thought we had such a figure in Mingzhu City. How come I never noticed before?\"","\"Hey, come to think of it, I think I saw the name card at her seat.\"","\"Really? What's her name then? Which family's daughter is she?\"","\"The card said something like Chairwoman of the Wanlong Society Group, Liu... Liu Yutong.\"","The chattering group suddenly fell silent for a moment, as if they had all realized something.","A moment later.","\"Liu Yutong? The Liu Yutong from Wanlong?\"","\"Wanlong Society? The Wanlong Society that's said to have wiped out most of the gangs in Mingzhu City? The actual female boss?\"","\"No way! You've got to be kidding me!\"","\"She looks like a celestial being, but she's actually involved with the underworld... That contrast is just too stark.\"","\"Shh... keep your voice down! It's her. I've heard despite her youth, her methods are formidable!\"","\"No wonder she's at the main table. Tsk tsk... You can't get a seat there just with money. She's got the leaders' backing.\"","\"Just a moment ago I thought she was stunningly beautiful. Now why do I feel a chill down my neck?\"","\"Me too. I was actually thinking of going over to strike up a conversation. In all my life, I've never seen such a beautiful, elegant woman. It's just a pity...\"","\"Don't all stare over there. A person like that, beautiful as she is, is a rose with thorns. No, a rose with blades! It wouldn't be good to get hurt.\"","\"No wonder Mr. Wang and Mr. Li at the main table looked so uncomfortable. If I were sitting next to her, I'd be nervous too.\"","\"Exactly. Better to be polite if we ever encounter anyone from the Wanlong Society in the future.\"","\"......\"","They couldn't afford not to be polite.","Although this was their first time seeing the heiress of the Wanlong Society, it wasn't the first time they had heard the name.","Anyone who wasn't completely out of touch couldn't possibly be unaware of the major stirs the Wanlong Society had caused.","For instance, how did Zhao Tianxing, the boss of the Donghai Alliance, die? Shot!","How did Zhao Tianxing's son become mentally disabled? Thrown off a building!","And these were all verifiable facts!","After learning the woman's identity, the looks in the guests' eyes shifted from initial awe and covetousness to something much clearer and more cautious.","Just as everyone was still exchanging pleasantries, a slight commotion arose at the entrance.","The somewhat noisy banquet hall quieted down again, all eyes turning towards the main door.","Several leaders, accompanied by an entourage, entered the venue with smiles.","At the forefront was Mingzhu City's second-highest ranking leader.","After offering a brief greeting to the crowd, the leader made his way to the main table.","Everyone at the table rose to greet him, offering smiling welcomes.","After shaking hands and exchanging pleasantries with the senior entrepreneurs, the leader finally turned his gaze to the most radiant figure in the room, Liu Yutong.","The smile on his face became noticeably more genuine, though tinged with a hint of subtle scrutiny.","\"Chairwoman Liu, this is our second meeting, isn't it? Actually, I've been wanting to invite you to my home for a visit, to introduce you to a promising young talent.\"","Liu Yutong offered a slight smile. \"The promising young talent you speak of, leader, would he perhaps have the surname Lin?\"","The leader was momentarily taken aback, then chuckled. \"Haha, I didn't expect Chairwoman Liu to already be acquainted with the young man I have in mind. It seems my effort was unnecessary.\"","\"You are correct, it's young Lin. I find his abilities quite outstanding. I think you young people would have more in common. If you could join forces, combining your strengths, it would be a wonderful thing, both professionally and personally.\"","His words were rather blunt, almost explicitly stating his hope for the two to spend more time together.","If they could get closer, then he could also reveal his other identity to her.","Liu Yutong understood perfectly well and had already guessed the leader's intentions.","The leader couldn't possibly be unaware of the fact that she and Lin Muyang were already quite close. Lin Muyang had joined the Bright Pearl Chamber of Commerce she founded and was also one of the partners at Bright Pearl Capital.","By saying this deliberately, aside from feigning ignorance, the leader likely had another motive.","However, she was destined to disappoint them.","\"Leader, I also think Mr. Lin is young and promising, and will undoubtedly become a successful entrepreneur in the future. However, for now, we are both focused on our careers, and our collaboration is based more on commercial considerations.","On a personal level, I believe maintaining some distance is better for both of us.\"","She slightly emphasized the last sentence."]},{"number":476,"title":"Chapter 476: 476. Badges.","paragraphs":["Upon hearing this, the leader's smile froze for an instant, a flicker of uncertainty passing through his eyes.","He wasn't sure if he had misunderstood the girl's meaning.","On the surface, her words seemed to indicate drawing a clear line with Lin Muyang, but upon closer consideration, it felt somewhat off.","Why did it instead sound like it was directed at him?","Could it be that she had guessed something?","Before the leader could ponder further, the host's voice sounded from the stage.","The banquet had begun.","After an enthusiastic opening by the host, the highlight of the evening commenced—the charity auction.","Items donated by various celebrities and dignitaries—collectibles, artworks—were presented one by one on the display platform, followed by successive rounds of bidding.","Most of those raising their paddles were doing so to earn a good reputation or to seize the opportunity to gain face in front of the leader and their peers.","Liu Yutong sat quietly, not rushing to place a bid.","To be honest, if not for the leader's invitation, she wasn't particularly fond of attending such events, finding them rather uninteresting.","And, to put it bluntly, it was hard to say whether the auction money would even reach the disaster victims.","However, regardless of her feelings about the occasion, the expected contribution still had to be made.","Liu Yutong's gaze swept over the auction items, but she never raised her hand.","The first few lots were mostly calligraphy and paintings by famous artists, limited-edition luxury goods, or decorative pieces with auspicious meanings. The bidding was lukewarm, with the highest bid so far only reaching 280,000 yuan.","At this rate, it seemed doubtful whether the total funds raised tonight would even exceed five million.","While this sum was not insignificant, for the leader, it was still somewhat lacking.","That was until a hostess brought up a black velvet tray, upon which rested an oddly shaped badge.","The badge was a dark gold color. Its main feature was a ferocious wolf's head entwined with thorns, its eyes inlaid with two tiny, dull red gemstones. Below it crossed two classical keys. The overall style combined a sense of ruggedness and antiquity, with even some signs of wear along the badge's edges.","Then, the host introduced with a smile, \"The next item is rather special, donated by an overseas Chinese resident who has lived abroad for a long time. According to the donor, he acquired this item from an antique shop overseas, and its specific origins can no longer be traced in detail. The material is a certain alloy, with inlaid decorations... The starting bid is fifty thousand yuan, with each increment no less than five thousand.\"","After the introduction, most guests in the audience showed puzzled expressions.","This badge looked somewhat aged, but its design was slightly eerie. It didn't resemble modern art, and the wolf's head even appeared somewhat menacing.","Was this even an antique? It looked more like a prop from some game.","But it was a charity auction after all.","No matter what the item was, someone would always place a bid.","\"I bid fifty thousand!\"","\"I bid fifty-five thousand!\"","\"...\"","Guests at other tables placed bids one after another, though the atmosphere was not exactly lively.","The entrepreneurs at the main table also glanced at it before losing interest, clearly having no appetite for something of unknown origin and lacking aesthetic appeal.","However, Liu Yutong's gaze grew doubtful and surprised.","The more she looked at it, the more familiar it seemed. She was certain she had seen it before, or more accurately, had come across a certain rumor about it.","In her previous life, after the short video era arrived, information exploded, and people's horizons broadened immensely.","In her previous life, with the advent of the short video era, people entered an age of information explosion, and their knowledge expanded greatly. Of course, there were also more fake news stories fabricated by all sorts of chaotic marketing accounts.","She vaguely remembered once scrolling past a quickly banned dark web story video that precisely featured a [Thorn-Wolf-Head Key Badge].","The rumor said that the ownership of this token directly triggered a brutal internal succession struggle within a certain mafia family abroad, even leading to a world-shocking street shootout at a high-end restaurant in America, resulting in many deaths.","And that video was quickly deleted and taken down.","Originally, she had just brushed it off as an amusing story, after all, what couldn't those marketing accounts fabricate.","But now, suddenly seeing this familiar object, she had the illusion—could this thing actually be real?","Whether it was real or not, her curiosity was indeed piqued.","Since this money was going to be donated anyway, what difference did it make what she bid on?","Just as the price was called to eighty thousand.","\"One million.\"","A calm female voice suddenly rang out.","The entire room was stunned!","All eyes instantly turned to Liu Yutong, who had just placed the bid, their faces filled with disbelief.","Spend one million on this weird iron plaque?","The young lady from the Wanlong Society truly acted in ways that were hard to fathom.","Even the senior entrepreneurs at the main table, who had been indifferent to her, couldn't help but cast surprised and doubtful glances her way again.","What they were thinking wasn't that Liu Yutong was foolish with money, but rather wondering if the leader was displeased.","After the leader arrived, he had only exchanged brief greetings with everyone, yet he had spoken the most with this Wanlong Society young lady, Liu Yutong.","Clearly, the leader's relationship with this Liu Yutong was unusual.","Perhaps the Wanlong Society was someone the leader supported.","Not thinking about it was one thing, but once they did, it felt even more terrifying.","The leader was on the 'white' side, the Wanlong Society was on the 'black' side, and these two had a special relationship... then wouldn't Mingzhu City be...","Sharp intake of breath","In short, they couldn't help but suspect that Liu Yutong's sudden bid of one million was perhaps a hint from the leader?","For example, that donations at this charity banquet were too low, and the leader wanted to use her to drive up the prices?","The more they thought about it, the more likely it seemed.","Especially seeing the leader frowning continuously, they became even more convinced of their speculation.","\"One million! Director Liu bids one million! Is there any other guest placing a bid?\"","\"Director Liu bids one million! Is there any other guest placing a bid?\"","Just as the host called three times and was about to drop the gavel.","Suddenly, General Manager Wang from the main table, his hair thinning, raised his hand.","\"One point two million!\"","\"Supporting charity is my duty!\"","As he spoke, he gave a slight nod towards the leader's direction, as if saying, 'Leader, I understand your hint.'","Another person at the main table, Manager Li, seeing this, immediately raised his paddle as well.","\"One point five million! Director Liu is young, capable, and charitable. We old folks can't just stand by and watch!\"","He thought to himself, this was definitely the leader finding the scene unimpressive, using this young girl to nudge them. Now was the perfect time to show loyalty.","Their actions were like lighting a fuse.","\"One point eight million!\"","\"Two million!\"","\"Two point three million!\"","The price soared as if on a rocket.","Guests at the other tables below were dumbfounded.","\"What's going on? Why are the big shots at the main table suddenly acting like they've been injected with adrenaline?\"","\"Is that iron piece actually some treasure we failed to recognize?\"","\"Treasure, my foot! Can't you see? This is a political task! The leader is dissatisfied. Miss Liu deliberately bid one million to remind everyone not to be too stingy.\"","\"So that's how it is. It has to be the leader. This move is masterful...\"","Then, gritting their teeth, this group also joined in.","\"I bid three million!\"","\"Three million six hundred thousand!\"","\"...\"","One after another, they shouted out bids, as if scrambling for some incredible treasure.","Liu Yutong: \"???\"","Internally, it felt like ten thousand alpacas were stampeding through her mind.","\"I just wanted to buy it myself to study it. What's with all of you joining in the frenzy?\"","Watching the price soar past five million and head straight for ten million, she was utterly speechless.","This whole situation made her hesitate again about whether to continue bidding. If this thing turned out to have no value at all, she'd be taking a huge loss.","While she had money, she didn't want to spend too much at this critical juncture. The funds in her accounts were all earmarked for making a fortune overseas.","When someone from the floor shouted a price of 12 million, her reason finally prevailed, and she ultimately chose to give up.","You all have fun!"]},{"number":477,"title":"Chapter 477: 477. Making Trouble.","paragraphs":["The auction hammer fell with a resonant thud.","That mysterious Thorn Wolf Head Key Seal was hammered down for a staggering twelve million, finding its new owner in Manager Li, a respected senior business figure seated at the main table.","A wave of polite applause rippled through the room. Many secretly breathed a sigh of relief, while their eyes couldn't help but dart furtively towards Liu Yutong and the Leader.","Truth be told, some of the earlier bids hadn't been entirely sincere; many had merely been symbolic gestures, performed for the Leader's benefit.","After all, they weren't fools. Spending over ten million on what looked like a piece of scrap metal was a bit much, even for charity.","Times were different now; the economic climate this year was tough, and every penny saved counted. So, many attendees had come with a mindset of just going through the motions.","As the item was delivered to Manager Li, Liu Yutong couldn't resist stealing another glance at the emblem.","Just then, the Leader's voice came from beside her, low enough that only the two of them could hear.","\"Chairwoman Liu seems quite taken with that little trinket?\"","Liu Yutong turned her head, meeting the Leader's eyes, which appeared gentle yet held a profound depth. She offered a slight smile and said,","\"I just find its design rather unique, unlike anything I usually see. I thought about acquiring it to study it further. I didn't expect our esteemed seniors to be so enthusiastic about philanthropy. It's truly been an eye-opener.\"","The Leader merely nodded in response, his expression softening somewhat.","Regardless, Liu Yutong's bid had single-handedly caused tonight's charitable sum to skyrocket, which was undoubtedly a good thing.","At the very least, it reflected well on him.","It also highlighted Liu Yutong's cleverness.","She had clearly sensed the room's lackluster, perfunctory atmosphere and decisively intervened, using an unexpected method to ignite the competitive bidding spirit.","This keen observation further elevated his opinion of her.","If only she could be of use to him...","Unaware of the Leader's thoughts, Liu Yutong would have been exasperated if she knew.","Her interest was purely in the object itself; she had no intention of driving up the price.","The auction continued.","Perhaps spurred by the example set by the sky-high emblem, the subsequent few lots sold for prices slightly above their estimates, and the host's smile grew increasingly radiant.","After all, the higher the final auction total, the happier the Leader would be. A happy Leader meant a job well done.","Liu Yutong sat quietly, no longer paying attention to the now-relinquished emblem, and refrained from raising her paddle lightly.","That was until the hostess presented a small, antique white jade Lingzhi fungus ornament.","The jade piece was warm and smooth to the eye, exquisitely carved with auspicious symbolism, but its modest size meant it wasn't among the most valuable items of the evening.","The opening bid was two hundred thousand, and the price quickly climbed to four hundred and fifty thousand.","Liu Yutong thought the jade's form was rather pleasing; it would make a suitable small accent for an office or study.","Of course, the main point was its reasonable price—it wouldn't seem like a perfunctory gesture, yet it would allow her to fulfill her obligation for the evening.","So, as the host asked for a second time, she raised her paddle once more.","\"Five hundred thousand!\"","She had thought her victory was assured this time, however...","\"One million!\"","The entire hall was stunned. All eyes swiveled towards the source of the voice.","There, leaning casually against the doorframe at the entrance, one hand in his pocket, stood a somewhat flamboyantly dressed young man in a suit. A self-satisfied smirk played on his lips as his gaze fixed directly on Liu Yutong at the main table.","Two other young men with similarly unruly airs stood beside him.","It was none other than the young masters Zhou Muchen, Gu Yebai, and Lu Hong.","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","Few in the banquet hall recognized them.","Primarily because most people had little contact with the trio; after all, Zhou Muchen and his friends had never visited Pearl City before.","Moreover, information about the Leader's family members was kept confidential online and not publicly disclosed.","As long as they didn't reveal their identities themselves, it was genuinely difficult for others to know who they were.","Of course, the Leader seated beside Liu Yutong was the exception.","Having reached his level, he frequently interacted with provincial authorities and thus immediately recognized Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong.","As for Gu Yebai, having had no prior contact, he didn't recognize him.","But anyone who could run in the same circles as a young master like Zhou Muchen surely came from a significant background.","Upon spotting the trio, the Leader began to rise to greet them—these were the sons of superiors, after all, and courtesy was necessary.","However, just as he started to stand, Liu Yutong, still at the main table, silently mouthed a word towards the entrance.","No sound emerged, but the lip movement was unmistakable.","A single, clear word: \"Scram!\"","Seeing this, Zhou Muchen tilted his head slightly and nudged Gu Yebai with his elbow. \"Hey, Old Bai, did Sister Yutong just say 'come over' to us?\"","Gu Yebai hesitated. \"It didn't seem like 'come over'? Her lips weren't that rounded. Looked more like... 'rod'? Praising us for being as handsome as rods?\"","Lu Hong, however, thought they were both mistaken and whispered, \"I think the mouth shape looked more like 'scram'.\"","\"Scram?\"","Zhou Muchen and Gu Yebai were taken aback simultaneously, their eyes darting back to Liu Yutong for confirmation.","There she sat, posture still impeccably elegant, the curve of her smile unchanged, but her beautiful eyes seemed to convey a clear message: \"If you don't scram now, you're dead!\"","The three young men jolted, the realization finally dawning.","\"Holy crap!\"","\"It really is 'scram'!\"","\"Beat it, quick!\"","Any pretentious notions they had flew out the window.","Their original plan had been to win the item and gift it to Liu Yutong.","Seeing her raise her paddle, they assumed she liked it and wanted to appear generous by securing it for her.","They hadn't anticipated angering her.","The main issue was that Liu Yutong hadn't yet completed her task for the evening, so she saw their antics as deliberate sabotage.","In the blink of an eye, the trio vanished, so quickly that the audience was left bewildered.","The Leader, his backside half-raised from his seat, froze mid-motion, utterly confused about what these young masters were playing at.","In the end, the lot was won by Liu Yutong for 1.1 million.","With that, the charity gala drew to a close.","The total funds raised surpassed thirty million, far exceeding expectations and setting a new record for the event's history.","The host announced the figure excitedly, met with another round of enthusiastic and prolonged applause.","A smile graced the Leader's face as he nodded frequently in acknowledgment to various guests, evidently quite pleased with the night's outcome.","As the host declared the gala officially concluded, guests began to rise and depart.","Just as Liu Yutong prepared to bid the Leader farewell, he extended an invitation.","\"Chairwoman Liu, if you're not in a hurry to leave, perhaps you'd join me in the lounge for a moment. The city is currently discussing plans for a development zone in the southern district. As a prominent local emerging enterprise, Wanlong Group might have some unique insights on the matter.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong felt a flicker of surprise.","Nevertheless, she still put on an air of being pleasantly surprised and accepted the offer."]},{"number":478,"title":"Chapter 478: 478. Just Like That, You Asked for It","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong chatted with the visiting officials for another half hour or so.","After seeing them off, the smile she had been wearing gradually faded from her face.","The situation she dreaded most was probably going to happen after all.","The development of the southern district was now essentially confirmed, following the finalization of the high-speed rail station plans.","Liu Yutong had learned long ago that a large industrial park was planned to be built east of the station.","This park was originally intended to attract tech industries, but due to some approval loopholes and other issues, it ended up hosting a batch of chemical plants instead.","Some chemical plants, to save on waste disposal costs, had even secretly built hidden pipelines to discharge untreated wastewater directly into nearby rivers, causing the water to deteriorate and even contaminating farmland.","Liu Yutong had made her moves early, even offering favorable terms to invite high-quality suppliers to invest and build factories in Mingzhu City, all to secure the best plots in the park's core area ahead of time.","As long as the initial tenants were a large number of environmentally-conscious, socially responsible legitimate enterprises, creating a strong industrial cluster effect and a healthy development atmosphere, then there would be no place for chemical plants in the entire industrial park.","This was her public-spirited motive, so to speak.","Of course, she also had a private motive. With so many businesses connected to her, all joining the Mingzhu Chamber of Commerce in the future, she would gain an extra layer of protection.","If anyone then wanted to move against her or the Wanlong Group, they would inevitably affect the entire industrial chain. Pulling one hair would move the whole body—enough to make anyone with ill intentions against her seriously weigh the consequences.","Besides this, she also planned to add a second layer of protection in the future: charity.","She intended to establish her own charitable foundation. This foundation would not solicit donations from the public, and she would make all its charitable deeds completely transparent.","However, that would have to wait until after she made some money from abroad.","Right now, she had no funds.","By the time Liu Yutong reached her car, Zhou Muchen and the other two were standing by their vehicle, chatting and laughing.","When they saw Liu Yutong, they immediately stepped forward to greet her.","\"Sister Yutong.\"","\"Sister Yutong, we've been waiting for you for ages.\"","\"........\"","Among the three, Zhou Muchen and Lu Hong's address of \"Sister\" was quite sincere.","After all, they had nearly tasted Li Xiaohui's iron fist, and having witnessed Liu Yutong's capabilities firsthand, they were genuinely convinced.","Gu Yebai's greeting was a bit more perfunctory. Ever since his first meeting with the \"big sister\" his friend kept talking about, he had been quite skeptical.","What was this all about? Actually acknowledging a girl younger than all of them as the big sister?","Would that mean the Yunshan Society would also be under her sole command in the future?","What would that make them?","His thoughts, and those of the other two top-tier rich kids who were meeting Liu Yutong for the first time, were quite similar.","Originally, this little circle Zhou Muchen had formed, the Yunshan Society, was all fun and games.","Now, suddenly having a seemingly somewhat domineering big sister looming over them, it was only natural they wouldn't feel comfortable.","If not for Zhou Muchen saying that Liu Yutong was going to help them make a huge profit, they might have considered disbanding right then and there.","Besides, they still harbored doubts about the rate of return Zhou Muchen had mentioned.","But ultimately, it would come down to the results.","If they ended up losing money instead of making any, they wouldn't spare Zhou Muchen or Li Xiaohui any face either.","Liu Yutong was well aware of their thoughts, but she didn't mind.","She knew that to truly win the genuine respect of these proud second-generation heirs, she would indeed have to demonstrate real capability.","As long as she delivered on her promise, she believed these people would have no further objections.","\"Sister Yutong, why did you shoo us away earlier?\" Zhou Muchen asked.","Liu Yutong shot him an exasperated glance. \"What do you think? Let's talk at my place first.\"","With that, she was about to get into the car when she saw Manager Li walk out of the banquet hall.","He was holding a small box—the very item he had just won at auction for twelve million.","She couldn't help but take another look.","Zhou Muchen noticed her gaze and asked, \"Sister Yutong, what are you looking at?\"","Liu Yutong didn't hide it. \"The thing in Manager Li's box... I originally wanted to bid for it....\"","Before she could finish, Zhou Muchen actually strode straight over to Manager Li and blocked his path.","\"Hey, can you lend that thing in your hand to my sister to have a look?\"","Manager Li, holding the box and about to get into his car to go home, was suddenly confronted by a young man in a flashy suit who rudely demanded the multi-million dollar collectible he had just acquired. His face instantly darkened.","Frowning, he looked Zhou Muchen up and down. Seeing the young man's frivolous demeanor, the very picture of a spoiled rich kid, only added to his irritation.","\"Young man, we don't know each other, do we? Is it not terribly impolite to approach me and ask for the collectible I just spent over ten million on?\"","Upon hearing this, Zhou Muchen's brow furrowed. \"Hey, why are you so stingy? My sister taking a liking to your thing is doing you a favor!\"","\"Just say, will you give it or not?!\"","Manager Li: \"And if I don't?!\"","Zhou Muchen reached up with his left hand and scratched the back of his neck. \"Don't? Then I'll have your Li Group shut down!\"","Manager Li grew even angrier. \"Such insolence! I—\"","\"What's lending it for one night, or even a month?!\"","Then, with an air of defiance, he thrust the box into Zhou Muchen's hands. \"Take it!\"","Zhou Muchen took the box and waved dismissively. \"Alright, alright, off you go.\"","Manager Li maintained his defiant posture as he got into his Rolls-Royce. Only after closing the door did he let out a sigh of relief and wipe the cold sweat from his forehead.","\"Dammit, just because you're the province's second young master, think you're so great? Always picking on us old folks!\"","\"What are you waiting for? Drive!\"",".........","Meanwhile, Zhou Muchen directly handed the box to Liu Yutong.","\"Sister Yutong, got it. Here you go!\"","Liu Yutong was speechless. She truly hadn't expected Zhou Muchen to obtain the badge in this manner.","It was less like asking and more like seizing.","However, she didn't refuse. She planned to take it back and study it first, to see if it was really as important as rumored or just a fictional item.","If it was genuine, she could directly buy it outright later.","If it was useless, she'd return it.","When the group arrived at Liu Yutong's villa, they explained the purpose of their sudden visit.","The trader was found!","The funds were ready!","The location was arranged!","Everything was set; all they needed was the final go-ahead.","........."]},{"number":479,"title":"Chapter 479: 479, Is This Just a Few People","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong took the box, opened it for a glance to confirm the badge was inside, then gently closed it.","Zhou Muchen and the others didn't ask much about the badge's origin. In their view, items from such auctions couldn't be anything special—at best, they were just pieces of art.","The group then split into several cars and headed directly to Qiongyue Bay, Liu Yutong's home.","After settling in the living room, Liu Yutong got straight to the point: \"What's the background of the trading team?\"","Zhou Muchen wiped the playful smile off his face and answered seriously, \"It's a team we invited from Hong Kong. The lead guy's surname is Chen, industry nickname 'Ghost Hand.' His methods are both fast and steady. His background is clean, and he's tight-lipped.\"","\"Reliable?\" Liu Yutong pressed.","\"Absolutely reliable!\"","This time, it was Lu Hong who chimed in, adding, \"His father received a favor from my Lu family years ago. Plus, the advance commission paid this time is enough for him to live comfortably for several years.\"","Liu Yutong gave a slight nod, then turned her gaze to Gu Yebai, who had been mostly silent. \"What about the venue?\"","Gu Yebai seemed caught off guard by her direct question to him. He paused before saying, \"The location is a high-end private club in the suburbs near Danan City. Shen Hao and I are partners in that club. The top floor has been completely cleared out. All equipment was installed and debugged this afternoon. The network is a dedicated line—absolutely secure and discreet.\"","\"Take me to see it.\"","Liu Yutong stood up. \"Right now.\"","All three men were taken aback.","Zhou Muchen asked in surprise, \"Sister Yutong, now? It's almost midnight.\"","Liu Yutong stated, \"The funds from my side are ready. Combined with yours, it's roughly 4.7 billion. This capital represents nearly all our liquid assets. The strategy and execution cannot have any slip-ups. Before we officially begin, I must personally verify every single detail.\"","Hearing that number, Zhou Muchen and the others inwardly gasped.","They knew Liu Yutong would contribute capital herself, but they hadn't expected her to raise 2.4 billion—one billion more than the total they had all pooled together.","Of course, the more Liu Yutong invested, the more reassured they felt.","They had a rough idea of the Wanlong Hui Group's valuation, which exceeded 5 billion.","For such a large group to only put in two or three hundred million would have made them seriously question her motives—was she lacking confidence in this operation, or did she have other plans?","Now, she had mobilized almost all available liquid capital, likely including substantial loans. This all-or-nothing stance fully proved she wasn't deceiving them and had sufficient confidence in herself.","Just then, Liu Yutong remembered something and immediately said,","\"Oh, Muchen, while you're at it, help me check if there are sellers for tents over there. Not just tents, but also large generators, medical first-aid kits... the procurement quantity... well, as much as can be bought within a day. I have a use for them.\"","It wasn't that such supplies didn't exist in Mingzhu City, but they were scarce and not commonly sold.","They were relatively easier to source in Danan City.","Upon hearing this, Zhou Muchen and the other two were momentarily stunned, struggling to process the request.","\"Wait, Sister Yutong, why do you suddenly need these emergency supplies? Are you taking the group employees on a wilderness expedition? Or organizing some large-scale outdoor event?\"","Beyond those possibilities, they couldn't imagine what else these items would be for.","There wasn't a war going on.","Hold on—they had heard about Wanlong Hui's nature. Could it be for a clash with other... underworld figures?","Come to think of it, that actually seemed plausible.","Liu Yutong had already prepared her explanation: \"Our group has been established for so long, yet we've never organized a single company trip. This time, we plan to take a small group out for some tourism, to relax and unwind.\"","Hearing this, the expressions on Zhou Muchen, Lu Hong, and Gu Yebai's faces became incredibly vivid, then settled into a look that said, \"I understand, but I'm utterly bewildered.\"","It was the first time they'd heard of someone taking underworld members on a \"tourism\" trip. The key was that this tourism didn't sound legitimate at all; it sounded more like survival training.","They guessed that this recently acknowledged \"big sister\" probably found her subordinates' combat effectiveness lacking, hence this militarized training.","Thinking of it that way made much more sense.","Yet, it once again shattered their worldview. Were underworld groups this competitive nowadays?","They actually needed military drills?","But for some reason, picturing the scene of Wanlong Hui returning from drills and then getting into fights... they felt a strange sense of excitement.","Zhou Muchen nodded. \"Alright, we'll check it out and try to get as much as possible. Should we also prepare some off-road vehicles and satellite phones?\"","If Zhou Muchen hadn't reminded her, Liu Yutong had almost forgotten about satellite phones.","\"Get as many satellite phones as possible. I'll have someone transfer the money to you for whatever they cost.\"","Zhou Muchen waved his hand. \"Hey, why talk about money? We can't let you pay for these little things, Sister Yutong! Consider it a small sponsorship for the Wanlong Hui brothers' trip!\"","Liu Yutong didn't refuse.","This amount was truly insignificant compared to what she would help them earn later.","\"Fine. Wait for me a moment; I need to change.\"","\"Sure!\"","A short while later.","Liu Yutong came down from the second floor and directly beckoned everyone.","\"Let's go.\"","Truthfully, she didn't want to rush things like this, but she was mainly worried about time running out.","There weren't many days left before that date. She had to get people there as soon as possible.","However, before leaving, she needed to see the preparations Zhou Muchen and the others had made with her own eyes to feel assured.","Both sides' funds were ready, and timeline-wise, it was about time to enter the market.","After all, dispersing this over 4 billion in capital, leveraged at least five times, would take considerable time.","They couldn't afford to be careless!","4.7 billion in principal with five times leverage amounted to 23.5 billion.","Even in overseas markets with daily turnovers in the hundreds of billions of dollars, that amount of capital would be quite noticeable.","Moreover, she knew the nature of a certain country—it was fine for them to take advantage of you and fleece you, but you trying to fleece them? That was unacceptable.","If the funds weren't dispersed when deployed, they would undoubtedly be frozen under various pretexts. Then, not only would any profits be lost, but even the principal would be irrecoverable, resulting in a total loss.","The group left the villa and arrived at the main gate of the villa community.","Just as Zhou Muchen and the others were still guessing where Liu Yutong planned to take the Wanlong Hui members for their \"training,\" they saw the scene outside the gate.","The three well-traveled young masters were utterly dumbfounded. They rubbed their eyes, as if unable to believe what they were seeing.","After confirming they weren't seeing things, they turned to look at Liu Yutong.","\"Wait, you call this 'a small group' of people?\""]},{"number":480,"title":"Chapter 480: 480. The Astonishing Motorcade","paragraphs":["Zhou Muchen and the others had originally thought that Liu Yutong would bring at most a few dozen elites, carefully selected from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, for the outdoor training exercise.","After all, this kind of training wasn't something just anyone could endure.","It was like in the military; those who truly undergo rigorous field training are often the one-in-ten-thousand special forces soldiers.","Although the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had many members—of course, they hadn't seen it with their own eyes, only heard that there were many—even so, finding one person with strong physical fitness suitable for such training out of several dozen would be considered good.","But now... what on earth was this situation?","When the three of them clearly saw the scene outside, their mouths involuntarily fell open, their expressions replaced by shock and awe.","Even for well-traveled top-tier young masters like them, this was the first time they had witnessed such a grand spectacle.","The scene on the broad road outside the villa was nothing short of astonishing.","The once quiet street now looked like a staging ground for some large-scale military exercise.","A seemingly endless motorcade was lined up on both sides. Leading the way were over a dozen uniformly painted, large luxury coaches with heavily tinted windows, preceded by more than ten identical black sedans.","But that wasn't the most frightening part.","The most frightening part was the dense crowd of Ten Thousand Dragons Society members in matching black suits standing beside the vehicles.","A sea of black-clad people and a sea of black vehicles almost filled the entire street, stretching all the way to the distant turn at the intersection. As far as the eye could see, there was only an unnerving, dense black that seemed capable of swallowing all light, with no end in sight.","Even though they were standing still, an overwhelming sense of oppression washed over them.","This was damn near a reinforced battalion assembling and awaiting orders!","In short, the impact of this scene thoroughly shocked Zhou Muchen and his friends.","It was terrifying!","Were these still the loud, tattoo-covered gangsters they knew of in their minds?","Or were the thugs and hoodlums they had seen before, and the gangsters in movies, the fake ones?","Was this what it truly meant to be part of the underworld?","Especially the scene they witnessed next finally made them understand why Li Xiaohui had joined the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","As Liu Yutong walked out, the atmosphere shifted dramatically.","She had changed her clothes. She wore the suit from earlier, the one with the dragon and phoenix patterns embroidered in gold thread on the cuffs, and casually draped a black overcoat over it.","Her hair was simply tied up in a bun.","When she appeared before this black dragon, the entire scene's focus instantly converged on her alone.","She walked forward step by step, arriving before the assembled ranks. Her gaze swept over the seemingly endless formation, her eyes resembling those of a commander inspecting troops about to embark on a campaign.","And where her gaze fell, that oppressive black dragon moved!","The young man at the very front, whose aura was the most composed and stern, sharply straightened his already ramrod-straight back. His right fist struck heavily against his left chest, over his heart, producing a dull thump.","Immediately after, the second row, the third row... like falling dominoes, the motion of striking their chests rapidly spread backward!","\"Thump!\"","\"Thump!\"","\"Thump!\"","A thousand people struck their hearts with their fists, their movements unnervingly synchronized!","Then, these thousand black-clad young men uniformly bowed their heads and loudly greeted in unison.","\"Eldest Miss!!!\"","\"Eldest Miss!!!\"","\"...\"","Three words!","Just three words!","Yet they erupted like thunder from a clear sky, carrying an indescribable fervor, resounding powerfully in all directions!","Witnessing this, Zhou Muchen, Lu Hong, and Gu Yebai felt goosebumps instantly erupt all over their bodies, a shiver like an electric current shooting straight to the crowns of their heads!","They had never seen such a display in their lives. This impact was far more shocking than any movie special effect!","In fact, a faint trace of fear towards Liu Yutong subtly arose in their hearts.","Originally, they had always looked down on Liu Yutong and her Ten Thousand Dragons Society from a superior perspective, not truly taking her or her power seriously.","Even after later acknowledging her as their big sister due to Li Xiaohui and her promise to help them make money, subconsciously, they still believed they had the ability to bring her and the Ten Thousand Dragons Society down at any time.","It wasn't until now that they realized how gravely mistaken they were.","Liu Yutong commanded such a powerful organization. Even if they had the ability to bring it down, they would undoubtedly face retaliation. Their own outcome probably wouldn't be good either.","Just look at the expressions of these thousand people. Their respect and loyalty towards Liu Yutong were clearly heartfelt, even reaching a point of fervor.","If something really happened, what wouldn't they be capable of?","Only now did they truly realize that for Liu Yutong, a woman, to ascend to this leadership position and make the Ten Thousand Dragons Society the most renowned organization in Pearl City, it wasn't merely because she knew how to make money, nor was it as simple as it appeared on the surface...","They had still vastly underestimated her.","Facing this mountain-crashing, tsunami-like greeting, Liu Yutong's face remained calm and unruffled. She simply raised her hand and made a simple downward gesture.","Instantly!","All sound ceased abruptly!","She didn't waste words, instead turning to look at Zhou Muchen and the other two. \"Let's go.\"","Just a few words, yet they made Zhou Muchen, Lu Hong, and Gu Yebai instinctively straighten their backs.","\"Yes, Sister Yutong!\"","Without even realizing it themselves, a note of respect and nervousness had entered their tone.","After Zhou Muchen and the other two got into the car they had driven over in,","Liu Yutong then walked towards the black Maybach.","The moment she pulled open the car door and got in, that black tide suddenly stirred.","Swish!","Dozens of people opened car doors in unison, then, like streams of black water branching off, they boarded their vehicles one after another.","Next, the engines of all vehicles roared to life almost simultaneously with a low, powerful growl. Red taillights lit up in sequence, like countless crimson eyes opening in the darkness as a dragon suddenly awoke, fierce and terrifying.","Then the motorcade began to move. The massive stream of vehicles, like a black torrent of steel, carried an unstoppable momentum as it drove onto the main road leading to the highway.","Along the way,","Zhou Muchen and the others, looking at the grand procession in the rearview mirror, couldn't help but feel a surge of heroic spirit.","You had to admit, it was seriously super cool!","During the gap while the motorcade was queuing to enter the highway, Gu Yebai called Shen Hao, who was in Danan City, wanting to tell them that the big sister was coming.","Of course, he didn't plan to mention the thousand black-clad young men following behind, intending to give them a surprise and thoroughly shock them.","But the call didn't connect.","Then he tried calling Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui, but still no one answered.","\"That's strange? Why aren't any of these three answering their phones?\"","\"Could it be that dog Shen Hao took them clubbing again?\"","He grumbled as he put down his phone, thinking he'd call Shen Hao and the others again once they reached Danan City.","Just as the motorcade was about to arrive in Danan City, Shen Hao finally called back.","But barely a few words into the call, Gu Yebai's face abruptly changed."]},{"number":481,"title":"Chapter 481: 481, Boasting","paragraphs":["Da Nan City.","A bustling night market street, thick with the aroma of street food.","Shen Hao was currently sitting on a plastic stool at a roadside barbecue stall with Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui, devouring skewers with gusto.","They had just come over from the private club.","During this period, they had pretty much finished all the preparatory work. The equipment was in place, the personnel were arranged, and all the necessary connections had been smoothed over.","Moving such a large sum of money overseas required a lot of procedures. If they hadn't made arrangements in advance, there could have been issues.","However, this wasn't particularly difficult for their Yunshan Society.","In fact, it would have been much harder and more troublesome for Liu Yutong to handle it herself, likely causing significant delays.","This was one of the reasons why Liu Yutong had been willing to let Zhou Muchen and the others in on the deal.","Having the right connections really sped things up.","As for the other reason, naturally, she could take a fifty percent cut from their investment profits as her own earnings.","This was no small amount; even by conservative estimates, it was around seven or eight billion.","Add to that the profits from the funds she had raised on her side, and she would become fabulously wealthy overnight!","Late at night is when cravings hit the hardest.","Being able to have some barbecue and beer would be pure bliss.","Shen Hao and the others had pretty much gone out for barbecue because they were craving it.","The three of them drank beer and ate skewers, and the conversation naturally turned to the stock market venture.","Shen Hao took a swig of beer and asked with a grin, \"Hey, ladies, what do you think? If this really works out, how much can we rake in this time? Will it be enough?\" He gestured with his hand.","Bai Shisui shook her head. \"I have no idea. I just hope we don't lose our principal.\"","Zhu Silin looked surprised. \"What? Shisui, you have so little faith?\"","Bai Shisui smiled faintly. \"It's mainly because I don't really understand this stuff. I saw you all investing, so I followed along. I trust you guys, that's all.\"","\"No matter how much we end up making, what I really want right now is to focus on my fashion design, win a major award someday, and become the best designer.\"","Zhu Silin: \"Alright, alright. But I've seen Sister Yutong's trading account. The return rate is absolutely terrifying. I've never seen anyone achieve returns that high. With her at the helm, plus all the thorough preparation we've done, personally overseeing every step, I feel like we could at least double our money?\"","Shen Hao: \"Double? Ladies, you're both way too conservative! If you ask me, even if it's just doubling, it should be in US dollars! Starting at two billion dollars!\"","\"Converted to Dragon Kingdom currency, that's over a hundred billion! We're really going to strike it rich this time!\"","\"Once we get that money, let's see who dares to call us good-for-nothing playboys anymore!\"","\"And I'm definitely going to make the old man hand over the Chairman's position to me. Only I, Shen Hao, am fit to be the Shen family heir!\"","Zhu Silin teased him deliberately: \"What if your dad refuses and insists on giving it to your younger brother instead?\"","Shen Hao snorted coldly and slammed his glass on the table. \"Then we split the family! Who's afraid of who!\"","\"........\"","The three of them had already had a bit to drink, and talking about money—a topic everyone loves—their voices unconsciously grew louder.","Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui were okay. As young women, their voices weren't naturally loud, and with their well-bred, aristocratic demeanor, they had good manners and rarely made a scene or disturbed others in public.","But Shen Hao was different. It seemed he had been bottling things up for a long time. The more he talked, the more excited he became, fully exposing the brashness of a rich young master.","Coupled with his constant talk of deals involving billions and tens of billions, his words grated on the ears of the ordinary patrons around them.","There's a limit to bragging!","\"Pfft!\"","At the next table, three young men dressed flashily with tattooed sleeves finally couldn't hold back and burst out laughing.","Especially the one with bleached hair and a cigarette dangling from his mouth, who tilted his head and said to his companions, \"Damn, hear that? Talking about making billions just like that? In US dollars? This bragging is next level, even Gates would have to offer him a cigarette! Hahaha...\"","\"No kidding! Projects involving tens or hundreds of billions of dollars just rolling off the tongue. Aren't you afraid of blowing a hole in the sky?\"","\"How much have you had to drink to get this delusional? Didn't even order a plate of peanuts to go with it?\"","The tall, skinny one among them even deliberately took out his phone and, in a voice loud enough for Shen Hao's group to hear, pretended to make a call: \"Hey! Brother Xiong! Quick, get a few hundred guys to the night market! I've got a show-off here whose mouth is so big he could blow an aircraft carrier over! Yeah! When you get here, chop off that bragging mouth of his!\"","The smile instantly froze on Shen Hao's face, his expression darkening visibly.","Damn it, these guys were saying he was bragging?","And wanted to chop his mouth off?","They had some nerve!","He slapped the table and stood up. \"You motherfuckers! Who the hell are you saying is bragging? Looking for a beating!?\"","Seeing this, Zhu Silin immediately reached out and tugged at Shen Hao's sleeve. \"Shen Hao, ignore them. They're just a bunch of drunk thugs. It's not worth it.\"","Hearing this, Shen Hao took a deep breath, forcibly suppressed his anger, and sat back down, intending to pay the bill and leave.","If it were any other time, if a few punks dared to mock him like this, he would have taught them a proper lesson!","Shen Hao thought he was letting them off the hook, but the three punks weren't ready to let it go.","Then they all stood up in unison, each picking up an empty beer bottle, and swaggered over.","The bleached-hair leader slammed his bottle onto their table with a clang and stared arrogantly at Shen Hao.","\"What's the matter? Can't handle people calling out your bullshit?\"","\"Got money to brag, but no money for a hangover cure? Look at your sorry ass, you look like you couldn't scrape together a billion in hell notes!\"","\"Tens of billions, US dollars! Pah!\"","After spitting in Shen Hao's direction, he turned his leering gaze to Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui, his eyes roaming over them brazenly.","Girls from backgrounds like Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui naturally had impeccable looks and grace.","\"Hey beauties, you better open your eyes. Don't get fooled by this pretty boy. These days, some guys love to brag and trick women.\"","\"Hanging out with trash like him, why not come have some fun with us brothers? We'll show you what real 'substance' is, hehe...\"","Shen Hao's rage could no longer be contained.","He slammed the table again as he stood up, his eyes terrifyingly cold.","\"I'm warning you, you'd better get the hell out of here right now! Otherwise, you'll face the consequences!\""]},{"number":482,"title":"Chapter 482: 482. Suffered a Great Loss","paragraphs":["\"Whoa there! Scared the hell out of me!\"","The blond-haired guy slammed his beer bottle on the table, his face full of contempt. \"Can't afford to mess with you? Who the hell do you think you are? Bragging like that, does your daddy know?\"","Shen Hao gritted his teeth, speaking each word deliberately. \"Listen up, you bastard. My name is Shen Hao! The young master of the Shen Group! Get lost now if you want to live! They're also people you can't afford to mess with!\"","He had thought revealing his identity would make them back down and leave, but to his surprise, it not only didn't work, but instead provoked even more frenzied laughter from the three.","\"Young Master Shen? Hahaha... He says he's Young Master Shen!\"","\"The young master of the Shen Group eating at a dumpy roadside stall like this? And with the daughters of big shots and rich girls? You've read too many damn novels!\"","\"Yeah, if you're Young Master Shen, then I'm your daddy! If these two chicks are really rich heiresses, then that's perfect for us brothers to have some fun with. Let's get a taste of what high-society girls are like!\"","\"Hahaha...\"","The leader, the blond guy, emboldened by alcohol, even slapped Shen Hao's face in an extremely insulting manner. \"Kid, trying to show off in front of me? Dressed in a monkey suit and think you're really somebody? Today, I'll teach you what rules are!\"","Shen Hao had never suffered such humiliation in his life. He violently swatted the blond guy's hand away and threw a punch. \"Fuck your mother! You're asking for it!\"","The conflict erupted instantly!","Caught off guard by Shen Hao's punch, the blond guy stumbled back several steps. He touched his face, which was starting to swell, and flew into a rage.","\"Beat this bastard to death!\"","Seeing that things had really turned physical, the other two thugs were stunned for a second, then reacted. Swinging their beer bottles, they charged at Shen Hao.","Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui tried to intervene but couldn't stop them, nearly getting hit in the head by a flying bottle instead.","\"Call the police!\"","They were definitely no match for these three thugs. They had never formally learned martial arts or fighting, and had never been in a fight since childhood.","Of course, they never really needed to learn that stuff. What normal person would dare lay a hand on them?","So in this situation, calling the police was their only option.","By now, the scene had descended into chaos.","A table was violently overturned, sending skewers, beer bottles, and soup splattering everywhere, leaving a complete mess.","Although Shen Hao had done some combat training, it was mainly for fitness, not practical application. In a real fight, he relied on instinct, using whatever was at hand.","Outnumbered, and facing thugs who were used to brawling, he was quickly beaten to the ground.","The thugs continued hitting him while hurling insults.","\"Damn it! Show off now! Think money makes you hot shit? Now you're lying on the ground like a dog!\"","\"Making billions, my ass! I'll send you to hell to spend it!\"","\"After we're done with you, we'll grab those two little bitches and show you what real men are!\"","\"........\"","But before they could make a move on Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui, they suddenly heard the sound of police sirens.","They had called the police.","Coupled with the fact that the cops on night patrol weren't far from this night market street, they soon appeared in sight.","The blond guy and his crew had to give up beating Shen Hao. They each spat viciously on him lying on the ground. \"Pah! What a piece of trash! Next time you brag, pick your spot! Let's go, brothers!\"","The three of them ran off, cursing and swearing.","A patrol car with flashing red and blue lights stopped by the roadside, and two cops got out.","They asked about the situation, checked Shen Hao and the others' injuries, took a report, and said they would review the nearby surveillance footage and try to apprehend the three thugs as soon as possible.","As Shen Hao's injuries weren't particularly severe and the perpetrators had fled, the cops finished their report, left contact information, and advised them to go get their injuries treated first. They promised to notify them immediately if there was any news.","After the cops left, the night market stall owner looked at the smashed tables and chairs, sighing heavily.","Zhu Silin took out a thick wad of cash from her wallet and stuffed it into the owner's hand, far exceeding the cost of the damages, as compensation.","The stall owner was stunned for a moment, then quickly thanked her.","Supported by Bai Shisui, Shen Hao limped towards their car, saying through gritted teeth, \"Let's go back first. I'll call Gu Yebai and the others later. We can't just let this go!\"","Just as he turned to get in the car, he suddenly noticed a black handbag under the table next to theirs—the one where the three thugs had been sitting.","Probably something they left behind.","Shen Hao immediately told Zhu Silin to take the bag. It might contain identification for the three men.","Even if it only had one person's info, it would make catching them easy.","No sooner had they left than the three thugs sneaked back to the scene, anxiously searching for something.","\"Damn it! Where's my bag!\"","Upon learning the bag had been taken by the two guys and the girl from earlier, the three thugs breathed a sigh of relief. As long as the cops didn't have it, there was still wiggle room.","Because the bag contained something very important they had just picked up, something they were supposed to deliver to their boss, Brother Pao, tomorrow.","Fortunately, they had also found out the color and model of the car the others were driving—a Land Rover.","The blond guy didn't dare delay. He immediately called his boss.","\"Yeah, yeah, Brother Pao, it was a Land Rover.\"","\"There were too many of them, like a dozen people. The three of us were no match at all. We got beaten up pretty bad.\"","\"Don't know their background. Sounded like they were from out of town. Yeah, really arrogant! Even said they'd make you eat shit, Brother Pao!\"","\".......\"","Hanging up the phone, the blond guy had cold sweat on his forehead. He had just told a lie.","He claimed that while eating, they had encountered an extremely arrogant group who beat them up and stole their bag.","They said this naturally to shift the blame. If Brother Pao found out they lost it themselves, he'd skin them alive.","Although they might still face punishment later for this, it would likely be less severe.","After all, they genuinely 'couldn't beat' the other side.","To make their story more convincing, the three of them even gave each other black eyes and smeared some ketchup on their foreheads.","Not long after.","At an intersection, they saw about six or seven vans and over twenty motorcycles appear before them.","Altogether, nearly a hundred people.","Then, a bald man got out of the first van. It was Brother Pao.","\"Where are they?!\"","The blond guy, holding his freshly 'injured' forehead, said somewhat guiltily, \"They... they got away!\"","Then he fell to his knees with a thud, crying dramatically.","\"Brother Pao, there were so many of them, and their car was fancy. We... we really couldn't stop them!\"","The other two immediately knelt down as well.","\"That's right! Brother Pao! We fought desperately, but we just couldn't beat them!\"","\"........\"","Brother Pao's face gradually darkened. He really wanted to teach these three guys a lesson, but the top priority right now was to get the bag back.","If the stuff fell into the hands of the cops, they'd be in real trouble.","Brother Pao kicked the blond-haired guy, cursing, \"Useless! Can't even keep hold of a bag! Did you see which way they went?!\"","\"I... I saw! They headed towards the southern suburbs! Oh, and they might go to the hospital, some of them were injured too.\" The blond guy grimaced as he scrambled to his feet and pointed the way.","\"Get in the cars!\"","Brother Pao waved his hand, his expression grim. \"Everyone, go find it! Even if we have to turn the southern suburbs upside down, find that Range Rover and that bag for me! Otherwise, you three are dead!\"","Instantly, over a hundred men swarmed back into the vans and onto their motorcycles. Engines roared to life as they sped off in the direction Shen Hao and the others had fled.","Meanwhile, Shen Hao's Range Rover had just pulled into the underground parking lot of the club.","Their club had a medical room, which is why he hadn't chosen to go to a hospital, planning instead to get a simple bandage there.","Right after parking, Shen Hao called Gu Yebai back.","After all, the greater Nan City area was Gu Yebai's turf; him handling it would be simpler and more direct.","On the other end of the line, Gu Yebai was first furious, then calmed down. He glanced at the long convoy of cars behind him and suddenly had an idea.","\"Do you want me to have them sent to jail the normal way, or do you want to personally teach those thugs a lesson yourself?\"","When he handled things, it usually ended one way: arrest, jail, and then have someone inside 'look after' them.","But that way, they wouldn't get to see it. Not satisfying enough, not cathartic enough.","Hearing this, Shen Hao replied without hesitation, \"I want to deal with them myself!\"","\"OK, Brother Chen and I will be there in about twenty minutes,\" Gu Yebai said.","Just after they hung up, a cell phone ringtone suddenly came from the black handbag they'd picked up.","Shen Hao directly unzipped it, pulled out the flip phone inside, and answered the call.","When he heard the familiar voice on the other end, he smiled.","Well, that saved them the trouble of having to go look for them."]},{"number":483,"title":"Chapter 483: 483. Meeting","paragraphs":["\"Friends in the Land Rover, hello. My men were out of line earlier, offending you all. Let me start by apologizing on their behalf.\"","\"Let me introduce myself. People in the circles give me face and call me Brother Pao. That bag you picked up contains some of my personal belongings. They're not really worth much money, but they hold some sentimental value for me personally. I was wondering if it would be convenient for you to do me a favor and return the bag?\"","\"Where are you now? I'll send someone over to pick it up. I promise they won't disturb you again. Also, I've prepared a generous gift as an apology.\"","\"........\"","On the other end of the phone, Brother Pao's tone was extremely polite. He had to be. If the other party discovered the contents of the bag, the trouble would be immense.","He had already taken a fall once before in Pearl City. The boss had spent a significant price to bail him and the crew he took there out.","If something went wrong again, he really didn't know how he'd explain it to the boss.","He'd probably be sold off like a piglet to some foreign country by the boss himself.","The boss was already upset about the Pearl City situation. The Ten Thousand Dragons Society had taken out their important partner, Zhao Tianxing. Hell, Zhao Tianxing was even shot dead by that terrifying young lady from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society in Pearl City.","That revenue stream was completely severed.","The boss even had to use a lot of connections and spend a lot of money just to barely clean up the mess and distance themselves from that whole affair.","But with one source of income gone, their earnings took a huge hit, forcing them to explore new avenues.","That's when they thought of a new money-making scheme: loan sharking.","Their main targets were university students, giving out high-interest loans, especially those so-called \"naked loans.\"","The bag those three with the dyed hair lost earlier contained a silver USB drive. It stored a lot of student information, including some videos—not just of girls, but guys too.","Besides being used as leverage to pressure students who couldn't repay into paying up, this information naturally had other uses too.","In short, if this thing fell into the hands of the police, the consequences would be unthinkable.","On his end of the call, Shen Hao let out a cold laugh.","If this Brother Pao hadn't mentioned the black bag, it might have been fine. But bringing it up only raised Shen Hao's suspicions.","He immediately had Zhu Silin search the bag again, and sure enough, she found a silver USB drive.","He took it, examined it, and became even more convinced it contained something utterly unspeakable.","\"Brother Pao, that's quite a distinctive memento you've got there? All saved on a drive?\"","\"Tell me, should I call a friend who knows computers over right now so we can both admire the good stuff you've been collecting?\"","He said this deliberately to test the waters.","\"Don't! Friend! Please don't!\"","\"Let's talk this through! Where are you? I'll come myself. Name your terms, whatever you want. You can ask for any amount of money. I just beg you to return that thing to me!\"","\"Alright, I can name any terms, right? Then have those three reckless underlings of yours come crawling over here on their own, kowtow and apologize. We'll talk about returning the stuff only when I've cooled off.\"","\"Deal! I promise I'll make them kowtow and apologize! Just give me an address...\"","\"Straight to the point! Let's make it...\"","They quickly agreed on a meeting location: further south, in that old factory district scheduled for demolition.","Due to urban planning, all those old factory areas in the south needed to be relocated. Most had already moved out, so the place was basically deserted now.","After hanging up, Shen Hao made another call, this time to Gu Yebai.","\"The old factory? They sure know how to pick a spot.\"","\"We've already entered the Greater Southern City area. We'll be there soon.\"","\"Good!\"","............","Southern suburbs, the old factory district awaiting demolition.","Shen Hao's Land Rover sat alone in the center of the factory grounds, its headlights on, parked on a potholed concrete clearing.","Shen Hao, a bandage wrapped around his forehead, stood in front of the vehicle. Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui were chatting casually beside him.","The three of them showed no sense of tension at all.","After all, they had already notified Gu Yebai. Given Gu Yebai's influence in Greater Southern City, it would be a joke if he couldn't handle a few small-time thugs.","To put it bluntly, Gu Yebai dealing with those punks would be as easy as an elephant stepping on ants.","They waited for about ten minutes.","\"Maybe they won't show?\"","\"They'll come. Unless they don't want that USB drive anymore.\"","\".......\"","Right then.","Several dilapidated vans and over twenty motorcycles roared out from different intersections, their headlights flashing chaotically, blinding to the eyes.","They quickly came to a stop directly in front of the Land Rover.","Doors slammed open. A crowd of thugs wielding steel pipes, machetes, and baseball bats jumped out one after another, a dark mass closing in around them.","Shen Hao shielded his nearly blinded eyes with one hand. Seeing the other side had brought so many people, his heart skipped a beat.","It seemed the USB drive in his possession was even more important than he had imagined.","Soon, Brother Pao, his bald head gleaming, emerged surrounded by his gang of thugs.","He was surprised to see only one man and two women on the other side.","The three thugs with dyed hair followed behind, pointing at Shen Hao and shouting, \"Brother Pao! It's him! It's this kid!\"","Brother Pao immediately backhanded the lead thug with a loud slap. \"You motherfucker! Didn't you say there were a lot of people on their side?!\"","\"Just wait till we get back. I'll deal with you then!\"","Even he wasn't stupid enough to not realize his men had lied to him now.","What 'a lot of people'? Where were they?","But now wasn't the time to dwell on that.","Brother Pao took a few steps forward, sizing up Shen Hao, then glanced at the two young women beside him. \"Kid, you've got some nerve, huh? Bringing two chicks to a meeting like this? Where's the stuff?!\"","Shen Hao didn't give him the slightest regard, replying impatiently, \"Who are you? Where are those three pieces of trash I asked for? Have them crawl out here and kowtow to me!\"","\"Fuck! Who the hell do you think you're talking to?!\" A thug nearby raised his steel pipe, ready to charge forward.","But Brother Pao raised a hand, stopping his underling.","Although he felt he had the upper hand today, he also noticed that this kid and the two pretty girls he brought showed not a hint of fear despite their overwhelming numbers. It felt too abnormal.","Having been in the underworld for so many years, Brother Pao knew very well how ordinary people would react to a scene like this, and it wasn't like this.","Maybe they really did have a backup plan.","\"Kid, which circle do you run in? Give me a name. Wouldn't want to offend someone from the same family by mistake.\"","Shen Hao grew even more impatient. \"You think you're worthy of asking for my name? Cut the crap. Get those people over here to kowtow!\"","The thug with dyed hair, still holding his face, stepped forward. \"Brother Pao, I know, I know. He told us before. He's the young master of the Shen Group.\"","Brother Pao narrowed his eyes, scrutinizing Shen Hao again.","Truth be told, just from this guy's attire, demeanor, and the car he drove, he really did seem like a rich young master.","Of course he knew about the Shen Group—a publicly listed company worth tens of billions, with a branch in Greater Southern City.","If what the punk said was true, then this guy really wasn't someone to be messed with lightly.","It was just... he simply couldn't wrap his head around it. How could a top-tier rich heir like that possibly get into a conflict with one of his own lackeys?","\"Are you really the eldest son of the Shen Corporation?\""]},{"number":484,"title":"Chapter 484: 484、The Raptor is Crossing the River","paragraphs":["Before Shen Hao could even speak.","Just then, the yellow-haired guy next to him, seemingly eager to show off in front of Pao Ge, quickly chimed in.","\"Pao Ge, he's definitely full of shit. He was just shooting the breeze with these two chicks at that barbecue stall earlier, talking about casually doing deals worth tens of billions, even hundreds of billions—and in US dollars! Even robbing banks isn't that profitable, right?!\"","\"And another thing, if he were really the young master of the Shen family, would he be discussing such huge business deals at some dumpy place while eating skewers and drinking beer? If he were really that awesome and could make money like that, even Bill Gates would probably be offering him a cigarette!\"","\"He's just a scammer and a poser looking for free meals! Hell, maybe even this car he's driving is rented to put on a show!\"","The yellow-haired guy's words instantly dispelled all of Pao Ge's doubts.","Right! A truly top-tier rich second-generation heir would be discussing multi-billion-dollar projects in private clubs or luxury hotels, not at a night market!","And to have it overheard by a few of his own low-level thugs?","That was a massive insult to the upper echelons!","Besides, even the Shen Group probably doesn't make tens of billions a year, let alone in US dollars.","This kid's composure must be an act!","Those two girls probably are too!","Thinking that he, a society boss, had almost been intimidated by them, a wave of shame washed over Pao Ge.","\"Fuck! Damn it! I almost really got fooled by a bullshitting loser like you!\"","\"Where's the stuff?! Hand it over to me! If you don't, don't blame me for being rude!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the thugs behind Pao Ge, wielding steel pipes and machetes, pressed forward.","\"You hear that, kid? Pao Ge is asking you a question!\"","\"If you don't want to die, hand over the stuff now, and have these two girls have a drink with us brothers. Maybe then we'll break fewer of your bones!\"","\"From now on, no one's allowed to bullshit around here. In Great South City, no one is allowed to be a bigger bullshitter than our Pao Ge!\"","\"???\"","\".........\"","Shen Hao remained unmoved. \"And what if I don't? You really dare to lay a hand on me?\"","Although he appeared calm on the surface, he was actually getting anxious inside.","After all, Gu Yebai still hadn't shown up with people, so he had no confidence!","Shen Hao's attitude completely enraged Pao Ge. This guy had no patience left either, and with a wave of his hand, he barked,","\"Damn it! You're refusing a face-saving offer!\"","\"Fuck him up for me! Chop his hands off first! Let's see if he hands over the stuff then!\"","The thugs at the front, hearing Pao Ge's order, immediately raised their weapons, ready to strike at Shen Hao and the others.","Seeing the thugs suddenly charge, Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui's faces also lost their composure; they were genuinely frightened by this gang.","They hadn't expected the other side to actually dare to start a fight.","Without a second thought, Shen Hao immediately shielded the two women. His adrenaline was also surging, and only one thought remained in his mind: Gu Yebai! Where the hell are you?!","At this critical moment.","A loud car horn suddenly blared from behind Pao Ge and his men.","Everyone's actions froze, and they all turned to look in unison.","On the road not far away, two incredibly thick, blindingly bright beams of light brutally tore through the darkness, illuminating the entire factory area as bright as day.","The light was so intense that all the thugs instinctively squinted and raised their hands to shield their eyes!","Immediately after, a massive black Cadillac Escalade Presidential limousine, resembling a moving fortress, charged forward at an almost savage speed!","Behind it, a second, a third, a fourth vehicle... a seemingly endless stream of cars!","There were sedans and luxury coaches as well.","\"SCREECH!\"","\"SCREECH!\"","The screeching sounds of brakes rang out one after another.","\"BANG!\"","\"BANG!\"","\"BANG!\"","\"...\"","Car doors kept opening, and countless young men in matching black suits filed out in an orderly stream.","Ten, fifty, one hundred, three hundred, five hundred, eight hundred...","The numbers kept growing, seeming to have no end!","In just a few dozen seconds, Pao Ge and the hundred or so thugs he brought were completely submerged, utterly surrounded by a seemingly boundless sea of black-clad figures.","A massive crowd, packed tightly, leaving no room to move!","The once-arrogant thugs of Great South City were now filled with nothing but terror; some were even trembling on their legs.","Although they were part of the underworld, they had never in their lives seen so many black-clad society men gathered in one place.","It was terrifying!","There had to be at least a thousand people by the look of it, right?","The expression on Pao Ge's face was incredibly vivid, etched with pure fear.","He had kicked a titanium alloy steel plate.","He now wished he could tear the yellow-haired guy to pieces!","If it weren't for that bastard repeatedly lying and tricking him, how could he have ended up in such a desperate situation?","He really wanted to mince that yellow-haired guy into pieces right now!","If it weren't for that dog betraying him, could he have been put in such a passive position?","Also, this scene, this feeling, gave him a strange sense of familiarity.","It felt eerily similar to the time he had taken a fall in Pearl City.","It wasn't until he clearly saw the familiar dragon emblem on the chests of those black-suited youths that his pupils contracted sharply.","No! Not just similar!","It's fucking them!","Just then, a tall figure stepped out first from the crowd.","When Pao Ge saw that face, his mind exploded with a buzz!","It's her! It's really her!","That woman from Pearl City who nearly gave him nightmares for months—Yu Xin!","Why is she here?","Shouldn't she be in Pearl City?","And why has she brought so many members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society to Great South City? What does she want?!","Yu Xin stopped not far from Pao Ge, looking him up and down with a faint, mocking smile.","\"Well, well, look who it is, making such a grand scene.\"","\"If it isn't Brother Pao? What's the matter, got tired of the prison food in Pearl City, came to Great South City for a change of taste?\"","She paused, as if suddenly remembering something, and quickly covered her mouth, saying apologetically,","\"Oh dear, look at my memory, I almost forgot this is Great South City, your turf.\"","\"Since it's your turf, how could we possibly expect you to welcome us?\"","At this point, she suddenly spread her arms, making a gesture almost identical to the one from last time.","\"It's for us to say...\"","\"Welcome home, Brother Pao!\" Over a thousand members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society shouted in unison.","The sound was like rolling thunder, crashing down on Pao Ge and his men with overwhelming force, utterly terrifying!","Pao Ge's legs gave way, and with a thud, he directly knelt down. \"Yu... Sister Yu... I... I didn't know they were your people... this... this is all a misunderstanding... a misunderstanding!\"","Although he had brought quite a few men, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had even more—ten times his number!","And he had experienced the combat prowess of these Ten Thousand Dragons Society men in black last time; he wouldn't dare to fight them now.","He finally understood why Shen Hao had been so confident, and why he had so 'coincidentally' taken his bag and lured him to such a remote place.","All of this, everything, was a setup by the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!","The scheming is way too fucking deep!","Pao Ge couldn't help but look up at the pitch-black sky and the overwhelming sea of black-clad figures before him.","He felt he had guessed why the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had suddenly brought so many people to Great South City.","It can be summed up in just six words—a dragon is crossing the river!"]},{"number":485,"title":"Chapter 485: 485, A Good Thing","paragraphs":["Just as Brother Pao was scared out of his wits, nearly wetting himself and begging for mercy incessantly, Shen Hao, standing by the Land Rover, was also stunned.","He watched with wide eyes as the massive, seemingly endless crowd of people appeared, his jaw dropping open.","\"Holy crap! Old Gu's entrance is a bit too extravagant, isn't it? Is this a movie shoot? How much did it cost to hire all these extras? Wait, no... this presence, it doesn't look staged at all.\"","He had imagined many ways Gu Yebai might make his entrance. The most likely scenario was him showing up with the police to haul everyone away.","He never expected Gu Yebai to give him such a huge surprise.","Originally, he had planned to demand compensation for emotional distress from Gu Yebai after this mess was settled.","But now, he felt the guy was truly a solid brother.","This brother was worth having!","When there's trouble, he really shows up, and brings an army with him!","Just as Shen Hao was still wondering why Gu Yebai hadn't appeared yet, the situation on the ground changed again.","He saw Yu Xin stop paying attention to the kneeling, pleading Brother Pao. Instead, she turned slightly, her gaze shifting to the car behind the Cadillac Escalade Presidential One. A hint of... respect? flickered in her eyes.","This subtle movement sent a shock through everyone present who was still capable of thought.","Yu Xin wasn't the leader of these men in black?","Was there an even bigger figure arriving?","The next second, the rear door of the Maybach was respectfully opened by one of the men in black.","The first thing to emerge was a foot clad in a delicate black flat leather shoe, followed by a slender figure bending down to step out of the car.","When the newcomer's appearance became clear, everyone, including Shen Hao, was stunned once more.","It was actually a girl who looked very young.","She was dressed in a black suit, her hair pulled up into a bun, revealing a smooth forehead and a face that, while still carrying a hint of youthful girlishness, was exceptionally delicate.","She looked to be, at most, eighteen or nineteen.","However, what was utterly incongruous with her age were her eyes.","Clear, yet possessing a calmness that transcended her years.","Wherever her gaze swept, even the men in black from the Wanlong Society unconsciously straightened their backs a little more.","Finally, amidst the respectful attitudes of countless men in black, she walked up to the group, her gaze settling on Shen Hao, who was still in a state of shock.","\"Holy crap! Sister Yutong?\"","\"This... all these are your people?\"","Although Shen Hao, like the others, knew something about the 'background' of this recently acknowledged 'big sister,' Liu Yutong.","For instance, that her Wanlong Society was an organization with ties to both legitimate and underworld circles.","On the surface, they did legitimate business, but in the shadows, they kept a group of exceptionally capable fighters.","He had just never seen it before. Today was truly an eye-opener.","It really felt like a movie had come to life.","Just then, a familiar voice came from behind Liu Yutong.","\"Haozi, what do you think? Is the rescue crew your buddy found impressive enough? Satisfied? Surprised? Shocked?\"","\"Hahaha...\"","Gu Yebai and Zhou Muchen, along with a few others, walked out grinning from among the crowd of men in black.","They stopped half a step behind Liu Yutong, greeted her first, then winked and made faces at Shen Hao.","Shen Hao looked at Gu Yebai's expression that screamed 'say thank you, daddy,' then at the big sister Liu Yutong with her commanding two-meter-eight aura standing before him. He finally snapped out of his immense shock, and a strange sense of exhilaration welled up inside him.","Today's spectacle had genuinely thrilled him!","He finally understood why so many people were drawn to the underworld life.","With this kind of presence, what man could resist it?","He even started thinking, maybe he should just join them. After all, he wasn't like Gu Yebai and the others; his family was in business...","Soon after, Zhu Silin and Bai Shisui also recovered from their earlier astonishment and walked up to Liu Yutong to greet her.","\"Sister Yutong.\"","\"Sister Yutong.\"","The shock in their hearts was no less than Shen Hao's.","So this is what real underworld figures are like, and it was all created by this big sister.","So cool! So impressive!","Liu Yutong also smiled and greeted them. After exchanging a few pleasantries, the group finally turned their attention to Brother Pao and his crew.","Brother Pao was also immensely shocked. He originally thought Yu Xin was already unbelievable, but he never expected the big boss behind her to be similarly, unbelievably young.","Shen Hao now walked back up to Brother Pao and the others. Seeing the group who had been so arrogant and threatening to chop off his hand just moments ago, now pale-faced and sweating bullets in terror, he let out a sinister chuckle.","\"Brother Pao, weren't you acting pretty tough just now?\"","\"Come on, show me that tough act again?\"","Brother Pao had lost every ounce of his earlier arrogance. His lips trembled as he spoke, \"Bro... brother... no, boss! It's a misunderstanding! A huge misunderstanding! I was blind! I deserve to die! I'm scum!\"","As he spoke, he actually raised his hand and slapped himself hard twice across the face.","Shen Hao touched the gauze on his forehead and sneered, \"Heh, now you know it's a misunderstanding? Where was this understanding earlier?\"","Then he looked at the three men, including Yellow Hair Man, who had attacked him before: \"Weren't you guys saying I was all talk earlier? Still think I'm talking big now?\"","Yellow Hair Man and the other two were terrified, kowtowing repeatedly. \"Boss, I was wrong! My mouth is trash! I deserve to die! Please be magnanimous, let me off like I'm nothing!\"","\"Call me grandpa!\"","\"Grandpa, we were wrong! We were really wrong!\"","\"...\"","After venting a bit of his anger, Shen Hao looked at Gu Yebai again.","His look meant, 'Today I might do something extreme, you need to cover for me.'","Gu Yebai nodded, saying with a grin, \"Haozi, you got hurt today, you call the shots! Whatever you want to do to get even, go for it. Sister Yutong is here backing you up, and I'll clean up the mess. Do whatever you want.\"","He said it lightly, but it revealed his immense confidence.","For instance, he had already notified the local authorities about the Wanlong Society bringing so many people.","Of course, this was also something Liu Yutong had told them to do in advance when she learned they were coming to support Shen Hao and the others.","After all, they were in a different city, and they had brought over a thousand men and gotten into a conflict with local thugs.","Not notifying them would have caused some minor trouble.","Once they were more familiar with the place later, it wouldn't be an issue.","Hearing Gu Yebai's words and looking at the dense crowd of men in black around him, Shen Hao nodded.","He glanced around, picked up a machete from the ground, then walked back holding it to stand before Yellow Hair Man and the others, a cruel smile spreading across his face.","Yellow Hair Man and his crew were scared out of their minds, begging for mercy frantically once more.","\"Boss! Grandpa! Have mercy!\"","\"........\"","Shen Hao seemed genuinely furious. If the Wanlong Society people hadn't arrived in time, he might have lost his arm today.","So he intended to take one of theirs.","Just as he was about to raise his hand, a man wearing gold-rimmed glasses spoke up to stop him.","\"Young Master Shen, wait a moment.\"","Before Shen Hao could react, the man had someone bring over two items.","One item resembled a chest protector, and there was also a metal baton, about the length of a palm, pitch-black and gleaming.","\"Young Master Shen, these are two special treasures from our Ten Thousand Dragons Society. The first is a custom-made chest protector. If you enjoy a sense of violence and want to vent your frustrations, you can use this. It guarantees a truly visceral, 'fist-to-flesh' experience, all without leaving behind any evidence.\"","\"As for this second item, upon contact with skin, it instantly produces intense vibrations and a sharp, stinging pain that seems to penetrate straight to the bone—guaranteed to leave a lasting impression. Afterwards, there might be some slight redness and swelling at most, not even enough to qualify as a minor injury. It fades within minutes.\"","\"With such excellent tools at your disposal, why resort to such bloody methods? If you were to invite a heap of trouble over it, it really wouldn't be worth it, don't you agree?\""]},{"number":486,"title":"Chapter 486: 486, Beyond Doubt","paragraphs":["Shen Hao's hand, holding the watermelon knife, froze in mid-air. He looked at the bespectacled man who had spoken, then glanced at the two items the man's subordinate handed over, completely stunned.","Since when did dealing with someone require such... sophistication?","But he was genuinely intrigued.","He had indeed been impulsive moments ago. If he had actually hacked someone, although confident he could handle the aftermath, it would inevitably leave a stain.","If people with ill intentions, like certain business rivals, found out, they would undoubtedly use it against him.","\"Ahem... You make a valid point.\"","\"Brother, you really think things through.\"","The bespectacled man smiled slightly, his tone still professional: \"You flatter me, Young Master Shen. We simply prefer more efficient and secure methods to resolve issues.\"","Shen Hao: \"I've learned something new. May I know how to address you?\"","The bespectacles man adjusted his glasses: \"Grand Jurisconsult, Zhao Tianyi!\"","For this trip to BS Province, many high-level members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had come.","Such as Yu Xin, Yun Cheng, Ma Da, and Grand Jurisconsult Zhao Tianyi.","Li Xiaohui, Yang Xin, and others stayed behind in Pearl City.","Shen Hao took the two \"treasures\" handed to him, first carefully feeling the chest protector.","It looked somewhat like a bulletproof vest, but the material was lighter and thinner, feeling very resilient to the touch.","\"This thing... can it really deliver that satisfying, meaty thud with every punch?\"","Zhao Tianyi: \"Young Master Shen, please trust our professionalism. This is made from a specially formulated polymer damping material composite with memory gel, featuring a unique non-Newtonian fluid structure internally. Simply put, the greater the force you strike with, the stronger the instantaneous feedback resistance. The sensation is solid and full, guaranteed to be ten times more satisfying than punching a sandbag!\"","\"Moreover, it causes pain without injury, undetectable even by a forensic examination.\"","\"Damn! That's incredible?\"","\"And this stick, what is it?\"","\"This device has a built-in micro high-frequency motor and a specially designed vibrating head. It can generate mechanical waves at a specific frequency exceeding 200 times per second, directly stimulating pain nerve endings. It bypasses most muscles and bones to achieve deep, piercing pain...\"","Shen Hao listened, stunned, feeling as if a new world had opened up to him.","He then picked up the chest protector and walked towards the guy with dyed yellow hair and his crew.","Ten minutes later.","Shen Hao was drenched in sweat, but his eyes shone with excitement as he looked at Zhao Tianyi again.","\"Does your Ten Thousand Dragons Society usually research stuff like this? This is way too professional!\"",".......","Southern City, outskirts.","Several cars passed through a night market street gradually coming to life and finally stopped in front of an extremely low-key yet vast, luxurious-looking building.","This was the private club opened by Gu Yebai and the others—Cloud Summit!","The massive convoy of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had already arrived and checked into several nearby hotels.","After all, traveling from Pearl City to Great Southern City in the middle of the night, coupled with the earlier incident, had left many exhausted.","So, after dealing with Brother Pao and his gang of thugs, the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members dispersed to rest at their pre-booked hotels.","Only Liu Yutong, accompanied by Yun Cheng, Shen Hao, and others, came to the Cloud Summit club.","Just after getting out of the car.","Two rows of hosts, men and women, already stood at the entrance. Seeing Liu Yutong, they bowed in unison.","\"Welcome, Miss Liu!\"","Liu Yutong gave a slight nod and walked into the club with Shen Hao, Gu Yebai, and the others.","The group passed through an extravagantly luxurious yet tasteful lobby, took an elevator that required specific authorization to operate, and went straight to the top floor.","The elevator doors opened, revealing a newly set-up operations center.","Several large screens adorned the walls, displaying real-time data from the U.S. capital markets.","Additionally, there were dozens of top-tier trading terminals. A few technicians sat there, chatting over coffee.","For the coming days, due to the time difference, they would have to live a nocturnal life.","This was just getting used to it in advance.","As soon as Liu Yutong and the others appeared, Chen Mo, previously referred to as \"Ghost Hand,\" came forward.","When he saw the remarkably young girl at the forefront of Shen Hao's group, he was also taken aback.","This was the legendary \"big sister\" with immense capabilities, the one Shen Hao and the others mentioned who would lead them to snipe the international markets?","You've got to be kidding?","She's way too young!","She looked like a college freshman, maybe not even graduated yet. Her face still held a hint of youthful innocence. Though her aura was extraordinary, her age was a far cry from the image of a financial titan he had imagined.","Could a young girl like this really achieve over 800% annual returns?","Chen Mo was deeply skeptical.","Having been immersed in the financial markets for over a decade, he had seen too many arrogant, overconfident second-generation heirs crash and burn with their family's money.","Was this another case of the same?","Had Young Master Gu, Young Master Shen, and the others been fooled by this seemingly harmless young girl?","This involved several billion in real capital, not child's play!","\"Young Master Shen, is this the Miss Liu you mentioned earlier?\"","Shen Hao, sharp as ever, immediately detected the odd note in Chen Mo's tone. Frowning, he was about to speak.","But Liu Yutong spoke first. Her voice wasn't loud, nor angry, but very calm, though a thread of ice ran through that calmness.","\"Did I not make it clear that the people I want are only responsible for executing my requirements?\"","Chen Mo's face paled. He realized how foolish his earlier doubt had been.","In front of the financier and decision-maker, especially in an operation of this scale, an executor's duty is to obey, not to question the decision-maker's capability. They don't even have that right.","\"I... I'm sorry, Miss Liu! That was out of line!\"","Chen Mo hurriedly bowed in apology: \"I didn't mean to question you at all, I... I was just surprised by your youth. Please forgive me...\"","Liu Yutong looked at Chen Mo with her clear yet profound eyes.","Then she said, word by word:","\"Here, surprise, doubt, or any form of hesitation is superfluous and not permitted.\"","\"You, and everyone else, only need to understand one thing: I give the orders, you carry them out. If you can do that, you stay. If you can't, or if there's a next time...\"","She didn't finish, but her words already made Chen Mo and the other listening technicians break out in a cold sweat.","None of them doubted that if Chen Mo showed the slightest hint of doubt again, he would be ejected from the room the next second, with no room for negotiation.","Honestly, it was the first time they had felt such a powerful aura and nearly suffocating pressure from a teenage girl.","\"Yes! Absolutely!\"","\"Miss Liu, please rest assured! From this moment on, I, Chen Mo, and my team will absolutely only execute, never question the reasons, and guarantee to implement every one of your instructions one hundred percent!\" Chen Mo vowed.","\"Good.\"","Liu Yutong walked towards the main control position: \"Begin reporting the preparation status and contingency plan details. I don't want to hear any words like 'maybe' or 'probably.' I want one hundred percent guarantees.\"","\"Yes, Miss Liu!\" Chen Mo immediately snapped to attention, simulating the operation while reporting his progress.","Shen Hao, Gu Yebai, and the others watched this scene, their awe for Liu Yutong deepening yet another level.","That aura of unquestionable authority and total control—she was a born queen!","At the same time, they became even more certain: following this boss lady was absolutely the right move to make money!"]},{"number":487,"title":"Chapter 487: 487, Too Crazy Leverage","paragraphs":["Chen Mo is truly professional, at least in the field of finance. He is much more professional than Liu Yutong.","This guy was originally a senior trader, and the fact that Gu Yebai and his group specifically invited him from Hong Kong is enough to prove his professional ability.","After all, with Gu Yebai's connections, they wouldn't just find a fool to handle such a large sum of money.","There is also an advantage to having a trader from Hong Kong. That is, compared to them, he is more familiar with the international market.","All the funds prepared by the Yunshan Club this time amount to about 4.7 billion yuan. According to Chen Mo's report, these funds have been converted into US dollars.","At the current exchange rate, it's about 692 million US dollars.","\"Ms. Liu, according to the preliminary arrangements, we currently have nine relatively independent capital channels.","The first is a channel for false trade settlement through three trading companies registered in the Virgin Islands and the Cayman Islands. The daily available funds are about 80 million US dollars.","The second is a channel for capital collection through two licensed gambling and entertainment venues in Macau. The daily available funds are about 50 million US dollars, but the capital fluctuations are relatively large.","The third capital channel is a channel for cross - border asset management plan penetration through two affiliated securities companies in Hong Kong. The daily available funds are about 120 million US dollars.","There are also four backup channels. For example, we can connect with specific overseas funds through the cryptocurrency channel, with about 30 million US dollars available per day. This channel has the highest concealment but also the highest cost.","Currently, all channels have completed identity isolation and taken evasive measures...\"","Chen Mo explained in great detail how he and his team mobilized this sum of money. Maybe because it was quite professional, except for Zhu Silin, Zhou Muchen, Shen Hao and others were completely confused, but they still felt it was amazing.","So it's so troublesome to get that 4.7 - billion - yuan fund out of the country and ensure its safe operation.","Liu Yutong could understand it. Because in order to pluck the wool from the United States this time, she deliberately made up for some relevant information.","Otherwise, if it were last year, she would probably have been confused as well.","Even in her previous life, she might have been completely ignorant. In her previous life, she hardly touched stocks and the like.","The reason why she can make money in the stock market this life is, to put it bluntly, because of some information she knew from her previous life.","For example, this year's famous financial crisis, almost everyone has heard of it, whether they are stockholders or not.","So all she needs to confirm is that the stock market will definitely crash this year and investment banks like Lehman will go bankrupt.","After listening to Chen Mo's report on the capital situation, Liu Yutong still shook her head.","\"It's not enough. There is still a risk of associated review for the nine channels. I think the total funds should be split into no less than 50 shares, and then be injected through these 9 main channels into more than 100 independent trading sub - accounts that we have pre - opened in at least 8 international banks such as Credit Suisse, Morgan, Deutsche Bank, Goldman Sachs, and UBS.","The initial capital amount and subsequent leverage use of each sub - account must strictly follow the allocation ratio I will give later to avoid triggering the internal risk - control alarm of the bank due to the large amount of funds in a single account.\"","\"50 shares? More than 100 sub - accounts? This...\"","Hearing this, Chen Mo's scalp went numb. The operational complexity and the requirement for team coordination would increase exponentially.","To be honest, he was quite confident in the security of the channels he was in charge of, but Ms. Liu still wasn't at ease.","Is she really that confident in herself?","Is she confident that she can pluck 800% of the profit from the United States?","But even with an 800% profit, it would only be about 37 billion yuan in profit in the end, equivalent to about 6.2 billion US dollars.","To be honest, 6.2 billion US dollars is indeed a lot, but it's not enough to attract the great attention of the other side.","After all, the daily trading volume in the US market is in the hundreds of billions of US dollars. A few billion US dollars won't make the US government pay attention.","Moreover, it's still hard to say whether they can really make that much profit.","Although he thought so, he didn't dare to have the slightest objection now. He immediately nodded and said, \"Yes, we will quickly formulate a detailed capital diversion plan to ensure that the funds are more dispersed and more concealed.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"The safety of the funds cannot be compromised. You must always keep this in mind.\"","Everyone: \"Yes!\"","Liu Yutong: \"Now that we've finished talking about the safety of the funds, next, I'll assign specific short - selling strategies to you. Please remember them clearly.\"","Chen Mo and others, even the members of the Yunshan Club who were watching on the side, involuntarily straightened their backs at this moment.","After preparing for so long, what they wanted to hear the most was this topic. They wanted to see how Big Sister Liu Yutong was going to short the market across the sea.","\"First, I'll clarify the core target, which is the Nasdaq 100 index futures. But we can't put all our eggs in one basket, even for the same index.\"","\"Over the next period of time, you'll need to follow a three - step plan. First, use about 70% of the funds, approximately 480 million US dollars, as margin. Then, in different sub - accounts of different brokerages, gradually establish short positions in the Nasdaq 100 index futures.","The leverage ratio should be as high as possible, aiming for between 30 and 50 times according to the requirements of each brokerage and the account balance. The goal is to have a total nominal short value of around 28 to 30 billion US dollars.\"","\"30 to 50 times leverage? Around 30 billion is just about right?\"","\"Hiss~~~~\"","After hearing the figures Liu Yutong mentioned, Zhou Muchen and other members of the Yunshan Club all gasped.","Using around 690 million US dollars to leverage nearly 30 billion US dollars, this is just too crazy!","They originally thought that their leader would at most use a leverage of about ten times, or even possibly just five times.","Even with a five - fold leverage, as long as the operation was good, they could still achieve the expected 800% return.","But now, it seems that they have far underestimated their leader's ambition.","Is she trying to skin the people across the ocean?","Although it's an exaggeration, if they really use around 30 billion US dollars in short - selling funds to drive down the market across the ocean, the profit would start at least in the tens of billions of US dollars.","Suddenly, everyone, including the team's chief trader, Chen Mo, felt that their vision had been too narrow.","It's really crazy.","If the market drops as Miss Liu expects, it'll be fine. But if it doesn't, with this leverage ratio, if the index rises by 2% or 3%, their nearly 700 million US dollars will be instantly wiped out, and billions of funds will vanish into thin air.","To be honest, even he, a trader with many years of investment experience, wouldn't dare to use such a high leverage from the start.","Moreover, they're planning to short - sell in that place across the ocean that is prone to sudden changes.","There have been rumors in the global market this year that the economic environment is not good, and some giant investment banks in the United States might be on the verge of collapse.","But are you really that confident that they'll go bankrupt?","What if they implement an interest - rate hike to spread the risk to other countries and regions? If you short - sell, you'll be in big trouble.","Especially for their overseas funds, there's a risk of being exploited by the other side and used to replenish their financial resources.","Liu Yutong didn't care about everyone's shock. After being reborn, this might be her only chance to achieve instant financial freedom, so naturally, she wouldn't let it slip away. She was determined to short - sell aggressively and reap huge profits!"]},{"number":488,"title":"Chapter 488: 488, All Arranged.","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong: \"Chen Mo, for the first step of leveraging to build positions, just follow my instructions, no problem, right?\"","Chen Mo replied, \"No problem. When the time comes, I'll use the ghost entry method, breaking large orders into a multitude of micro-orders. They'll be executed during the periods of highest liquidity, mixed in with other trades to avoid leaving any obvious short-selling traces.\"","\"Good!\"","Liu Yutong continued, \"Then, use 75% of the capital as the main force. Additionally, mobilize about 15% of the funds, roughly 100 million USD, to simultaneously short several of the highest-weighted and most fundamentally fragile tech component stocks in the Nasdaq 100 index, like Fruit and Goole...\"","\"The liquidity of these individual stocks is relatively worse compared to index futures, making them more susceptible to triggering panic through concentrated selling. They're perfect for indirectly suppressing the index in coordination with our main force. Keep the leverage for these positions controlled between 10 to 20 times.\"","\"As for the remaining 15% of the capital, use it to purchase out-of-the-money Nasdaq index put options with expiries of 1 to 2 months. This is the highest-risk portion, but also the one with the greatest potential return. The option positions need to be spread across different exchanges and brokers...\"","Liu Yutong paused here, emphasizing a key point.","\"I know you're accustomed to setting stop-loss lines, but this time, there's no need to deliberately set them. As long as the index doesn't suddenly skyrocket, we can accept even a 50% loss at the initial stage.","You must stay calm and not hastily cut losses and exit. If anyone gets scared by the potential losses, cuts their position, and causes us to miss the chance to make big money, don't blame me for being unforgiving!\"","As Chen Mo took rapid notes, he was utterly shocked inside.","This is really too crazy!","Even crazier than a gambler!","This is practically going all-in!","\"Finally, intelligence.\"","\"You need to form an independent monitoring team. This team has only one task: to monitor the credit default swap spreads, commercial paper rates, and any potential signals of liquidity drying up for institutions like Lehman, Bear, and Washington Mutual around the clock.","Especially over there across the ocean, every Friday afternoon is the time when such institutions are most prone to funding chain issues.","The moment any signs of collapse are detected in any one of them, immediately deploy the main force and increase the short positions at any cost!\"","Although Liu Yutong knew roughly when Lehman would implode and go bankrupt, information discrepancies could exist. So, for the sake of prudence, she had them form this monitoring team.","This way, combined with the information she possessed, there shouldn't be any problems.","Chen Mo responded, \"Yes! Miss Liu!\"","\"..........\"","As Liu Yutong continuously assigned related tasks and elaborated on her almost insane short-selling plan, expressions of astonishment appeared on everyone's faces.","Could a nineteen-year-old girl really have conceived this plan?","Regardless of the outcome, just listening to this plan, there were no flaws. It was extremely thorough, perfect, and one could also say \"bloodthirsty\"!","It felt like a predatory plan one would only hear in the core strategy meetings of a top-tier Wall Street hedge fund.","\"That's about everything. Chen Mo, arrange for everyone to perform their respective duties.\"","\"Yes! Miss Liu!\"","Chen Mo abruptly turned to face his team and ordered, \"All personnel, initiate according to Miss Liu's plan!\"","“Capital team, begin executing the fund distribution step by step!”","\"Trading team, log into all sub-accounts, check connections!\"","\"Algorithm team.......\"","\"Intelligence team.....\"","By the time Liu Yutong finished arranging all the plans and work, an hour and a half had passed, and it was almost 4 a.m.","This reminded her of a famous quote from a notable figure in her previous life: \"Have you ever seen Da Nan City at 4 a.m.?\"","Walking out of the operations center set up on the top floor of the club.","Liu Yutong directly said to Gu Yebai and the others, \"During this period, until the operation concludes, no one is allowed to use personal phones for any non-essential contact with the outside world. You must monitor this closely.\"","Gu Yebai and the others nodded: \"Yesterday, after everything was arranged, I already had their phones confiscated and stored.\"","After all, with a business involving such a large sum of money, who wouldn't be cautious.","If nothing else, if the plans Liu Yutong arranged tonight were leaked and something went wrong, the losses would be enormous.","This was also why they chose the Cloud Peak Club as the location. Besides facilitating supervision, it allowed these traders to live comfortably. After all, they would be isolated from the world during this period, and due to the time difference, they would basically have to work overnight, which was quite taxing.","Under these circumstances, they had to be provided with a good environment, right?","Here, there were top-tier guest rooms, 24-hour on-call Chinese and Western chefs, even a gym and a cinema, etc., ensuring these traders could get the best relaxation and rest under high-pressure work, avoiding operational errors caused by long-term staying up late.","Only after finishing these trivial matters did Liu Yutong feel a wave of fatigue hit her.","Continuous high-intensity thinking and strategizing, even though she was young, now just made her head feel heavy.","She then went to the guest room arranged for her by Zhou Muchen and the others, ready to have a good sleep.","As she reached the door, she instructed Yun Cheng: \"I'm going to rest. Pay more attention to the material collection matter tomorrow.\"","\"Yes, Young Miss.\" Yun Cheng nodded and then turned to leave.","...............","On a street near the Drum Tower in Da Nan City.","Over thirty thugs with green hair were lying haphazardly at the entrance of a long-closed arcade.","The most incredible part was that each of their foreheads had a vertical \"Heavenly Eye\" painted on it with greasepaint.","Only, at this moment, for most of them, only the Heavenly Eye on their foreheads was still open; their actual eyes were hazily closed.","From exhaustion!","The green-haired leader took out his knock-off phone for the Nth time to check the time, growing increasingly impatient.","\"Damn it, is that bastard Pao Ge coming or not? I've been waiting for almost five hours now!\"","\"Boss, do you think Pao Ge and his crew got scared? Don't dare to fight our Heavenly Eye Gang for this arcade turf?\"","\"You think that's possible?\"","The green-haired boss said irritably, \"All I can sense right now is that that grandson Pao Ge stood us up! And, how many times have I told you, we're the Heavenly Eye Gang, not some Green Forest Gang!\"","\"Yes, yes, Heavenly Eye Gang, Heavenly Eye Gang...\"","The green-haired leader was none other than Brother Heavenly Eye, Liu Hao. After returning from his studies in Mingzhu City, he immediately gave his little brothers a makeover.","All members traveled in green: not only was their hair green, but their clothes were also green, and they even all got a Heavenly Eye.","Of course, most were painted on, to save money.","After the uniform dress code was implemented, he originally thought he was about to step by step ascend to the peak of life.","Unexpectedly, he ended up provoking a fierce adversary.","That was Pao Ge.","Paoge was at the arcade playing video games with a few of his lackeys when he saw Liu Hao, one of the guys watching the place. Something about Liu Hao's style of dress seemed to trigger a bad memory for Paoge, and he just started beating Liu Hao up on the spot.","Naturally, Liu Hao wasn't about to let that slide. Using his advantage of having more men on hand at the time, he and his crew turned the tables and beat up Paoge and the few followers he'd brought with him.","Later, Paoge left a fierce threat, saying he'd bring his people that very night to settle the score.","Liu Hao treated it as a major threat, calling in all his brothers and preparing for a full-blown confrontation.","And then... they all went down.","From exhaustion, that is.","Because the other side never actually showed up.","Finally, just as Liu Hao was about to drop from tiredness, he got the news.","Paoge had brought over a hundred men, and all of them had been soundly beaten by someone else!"]},{"number":489,"title":"Chapter 489: 489. Unwittingly Owe a Favor","paragraphs":["Liu Hao had no idea how long he had been staring at his phone. His eyelids grew heavy, so he simply found a corner and dozed off like the other underlings.","He wasn't foolishly waiting here out of stubbornness; he genuinely couldn't leave.","This arcade was the only turf he had managed to secure since arriving in Da Nan City. If it got snatched away today, he would lose his very foothold.","So, no matter what, he had to wait it out.","If he could just hold on until dawn without Brother Pao showing up, he could claim to the outside world that the other guy had chickened out. He might even use this chance to recruit more men and expand his territory.","But if he lost his nerve and pulled out first, and Brother Pao really did come back with his crew later, not only would he lose the arcade, but if word got out that \"Heaven's Eye\" Liu Hao had fled the scene, his reputation on the streets would be utterly ruined.","He had worked hard to learn the essence of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society and had reformed his own Heaven's Eye Gang. He naturally didn't want to die before achieving anything.","Although he had heard this Brother Pao was quite powerful locally, he still had to gamble.","Time ticked by, and a faint hint of white appeared on the horizon.","Liu Hao, leaning against the arcade's rolling shutter door, was sleeping soundly, drool nearly dripping to the ground.","Just then, an underling rushed over, shouting excitedly, \"Boss! Boss! Huge news! Brother Pao came, but not really!\"","Liu Hao jolted awake, nearly wrenching his neck.","\"Ouch!\" he cried out in pain, rubbing his neck while snapping, \"Speak plainly!\"","The underling hurriedly explained, \"I just got the scoop. Brother Pao really did come out last night with over a hundred guys, saying he was gonna flatten our arcade. But guess what happened?\"","A group of green-haired underlings, now awake, gathered around, curious.","\"What happened? What exactly went down?\"","\"Spit it out! Stop with the suspense!\"","\"...\"","\"Hold on, I'm getting to it! Boss, Brother Pao and his crew first went to the southern suburbs. Right after they got there, they got wiped out in one go. Word is a mysterious big shot made the move. Brother Pao's hundred-plus men didn't even make a splash; they were just completely steamrolled. Now, Brother Pao himself is said to have been taken away by them. Whereabouts unknown. I figure they're gonna...\" As he spoke, the messenger made a slicing motion across his own throat.","The air suddenly went quiet.","Brother Pao... got whacked?","For real?","Liu Hao asked, half-believing, \"Are you sure?\"","The underling nodded. \"Pretty much sure. I have a friend who works as a server at one of Brother Pao's joints. He said Brother Pao never went back, and he's not in the hospital either. If he's not at his own turf or in the hospital, where else could he be, boss?\"","\"Gone to fetch scriptures?\"","\"Most likely.\"","\"Hiss~~~\"","\"Who the hell has that kind of backing, to act so ruthlessly?\"","They weren't inexperienced street punks; they knew how things worked on the streets.","Normally, if two sides had beef, even if a fight broke out, they'd keep some measure of control. The losers would admit defeat and go to the hospital themselves. Actually killing someone was rare.","After all, once you got blood on your hands, the whole nature of things changed. Unless you had truly sky-high connections, you'd eventually get taken down.","That's why most bosses usually focused on teaching a lesson and intimidation, never going for the kill.","But now, here was someone who acted so viciously, not only wiping out Brother Pao's whole crew but taking out Brother Pao himself too.","Actually, it was no wonder they thought that.","If Brother Pao wasn't dead, then where was he?","Missing?","Was there any real difference between missing and dead?","Not really.","Soon, one underling suddenly caught on, looking at Liu Hao with worship in his eyes.","\"Boss! You're a legend!!!\"","\"Did you have this planned all along?\"","Prompted by this shout, the others instantly had an 'epiphany'.","\"Holy shit! So it was you, boss! When did you arrange this?\"","\"I knew it! That bastard Brother Pao didn't dare show up because you had it all set up, boss!\"","\"Boss is mighty! Heaven's Eye Gang is mighty! You really made a powerful enemy vanish into thin air while chatting and laughing!\"","\"Boss, you kept us in the dark! You know such a powerful big shot and didn't tell us, had us all worried sick.\"","\"I always said our boss was no ordinary fish in a pond. Following the boss definitely leads to a bright future...\"","\"...\"","The underlings instantly erupted, heaping extravagant praise on Liu Hao.","They talked about his masterful strategies, his unfathomable depth, etc., almost claiming the painted \"heaven's eye\" on Liu Hao's forehead could shoot death rays.","Liu Hao himself was dumbfounded.","Over a hundred guys, gone just like that?","Maybe many people don't grasp what over a hundred guys means.","Put it this way: in many places, having twenty or thirty brothers willing to fight is enough to throw your weight around.","Being able to muster over a hundred guys? That's definitely being a local tyrant.","When Liu Hao heard Brother Pao had brought over a hundred men, his heart had sunk.","After all, he only had about twenty or thirty men himself.","Then, hearing this hundred-plus crew was easily wiped out turned into sheer shock!","What kind of person, what kind of power was this?","To casually wipe out over a hundred guys... how could such a big shot possibly be connected to him?","If he had that kind of ability, would he still be stuck watching over this little arcade?","Suddenly!","A figure flashed across his mind like lightning.","— Liu Yutong!","She was the only person he had ever truly witnessed, and was certain possessed the power to easily eliminate over a hundred men, in all his time on the streets.","\"Could the Ten Thousand Dragons Society have come to Da Nan City?\"","Maybe it was a sixth sense, but the more Liu Hao thought about it, the more it fit the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's style.","He asked the underling who had gone to gather intel again and, upon learning the other side indeed wore black clothes, he nearly collapsed on the spot.","\"My dear mother, it really is them.\"","\"What are they doing in Da Nan City? Could it be that their turf in Mingzhu City isn't enough for them anymore?\"","\"And that idiot Brother Pao, really didn't know his limits, daring to provoke that living King of Hell. She dealt with him in the blink of an eye.\"","Amidst the shock, he also felt a wave of relief.","\"What kind of dumb luck did I stumble into? Otherwise, the one getting dealt with would have been me...\"","Looking at the group of blood-boiling underlings before him, eager to follow him and conquer the underworld, Liu Hao felt panicked inside, but his face still wore an expression of being completely in control.","Since a meat pie had fallen from the sky, he naturally wouldn't miss this chance to ride the wave.","He then pretended to be nonchalant and waved his hand. \"Keep it low-key, low-key. Originally, I wanted to lead everyone in a fair fight with Brother Pao. Who knew he'd be so dishonorable, bringing so many extra men? I had no choice but to ask a friend for a little help. It's a small matter, not worth mentioning. Everyone disperse, go about your business.\"","The more humble he acted, the more the underlings felt their boss was unfathomably deep, praising him even more extravagantly.","\"See that? Boss's mindset is on another level!\"","\"This is what you call the demeanor of a true big shot!\"","\"Boss, from now on, in life I am a man of the Sky Eye Gang, in death I am a ghost of the Sky Eye Gang!\"","\"Following the boss, we're sure to feast. Taking over the whole of South City won't be a problem in the future.\"","\"..........\"","Liu Hao once again put on an air and nodded: \"Of course, following Sky Eye will lead to the good life, that goes without saying.\"","\"Alright, alright, that's enough. Everyone head back and rest, dismissed.\"","After his underlings had all left, yawning, Liu Hao watched the gradually brightening sky. The profound and inscrutable expression he had worn earlier faded from his face as he murmured to himself.","\"Madam, I truly owe you a huge favor this time. I, Liu Hao, will remember it.\""]},{"number":490,"title":"Chapter 490: 490, Let's Go","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong woke up to find it was already past noon.","Gu Yebai and the others, probably still buzzing from last night's excitement, had risen early and were now having a meal in the VIP restaurant of the clubhouse.","The moment Liu Yutong appeared, everyone stood up in unison.","\"Sister Yutong, you're awake!\"","Zhou Muchen was the first to step forward, eagerly pulling out a chair for her.","\"Have a seat, have a seat! What would you like to eat? Chinese, Western, or some pastries? We've got Michelin-starred chefs on call here, ready for anything.\"","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and said, \"I'd like some rice, with a few simple stir-fried dishes.\"","\"No problem.\"","Zhou Muchen immediately beckoned a waiter over and gave a few quiet instructions.","The waiter nodded in acknowledgment and hurried off towards the kitchen.","After sitting down, Liu Yutong noticed everyone was still looking at her, which made her a bit puzzled. \"Why is everyone staring at me? Is my makeup that bad today?\"","Everyone quickly shook their heads.","\"Not at all, Sister Yutong, you look absolutely stunning!\"","\"We were completely blown away by your plan last night. Even now, thinking back on it feels like a dream—30 billion US dollars! I never imagined in my lifetime I'd be part of a project this huge.\"","\"Sister Yutong, honestly, seeing your strategy last night, I finally understood what real vision means. All our little schemes before pale in comparison—it's like child's play next to yours.\"","Liu Yutong took the glass of room-temperature water offered by a waiter, took a sip, and said, \"A good plan still relies on execution. We can't slack off on any step that follows. You all need to coordinate well with Chen Mo and ensure information flows smoothly.\"","\"Understood!\" several voices chimed in together.","\"I'm leaving tonight. Yebai, you need to speed up collecting the supplies I asked for,\" Liu Yutong said, turning to Gu Yebai.","Gu Yebai was taken aback. \"Wait, Sister Yutong, at such a critical juncture, you, the one at the helm, are leaving?\"","The others also found this very hard to understand.","Could their company's wilderness team-building retreat really be more important than this multi-billion dollar deal?","\"Sister Yutong, this is the crucial period now. Every single move could affect the whole situation. If you're not here, what do we do if there's a sudden market shift?\"","\"That's right, Sister Yutong. With billions on the line, you're the backbone. Chen Mo may be the professional executing, but the final decisions have to come from you.\"","\"Sister Yutong, did we do something wrong? Tell us, and we'll fix it right away. You can't leave at this pivotal moment!\"","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"You've all done very well. This has nothing to do with you. It's something I absolutely must do.\"","Gu Yebai and the others still weren't ready to give up.","\"Sister Yutong, I understand you might have other arrangements, but can it wait a few days? Even just until the initial positions are established and things stabilize a bit? Or tell us specifically where you're going and what it's about. Maybe we can send someone to handle it for you?\"","\"Yeah, Sister Yutong, just tell us what's going on. The brothers and sisters of the Yunshan Society can lend a hand too. Or at least postpone your trip by a week, just one week! Please?\"","Liu Yutong sighed. \"I'm sorry, I can't delay it by a single day. I believe you all can hold the fort.\"","Gu Yebai made a pained face. \"But we don't trust ourselves! What if we mess up...\"","Liu Yutong cut him off. \"Then don't mess up. Execute according to plan and maintain communication.\"","With that, she took out another list and handed it to him. \"This is a supplementary list. Besides what I previously asked you to acquire, also get the items on this list and have them shipped over.\"","The list mainly included food and water, along with medical supplies like tourniquets, splints, antibiotics, and also a large quantity of flashlights and radios, among other things.","While these items could likely be sourced at her destination, once a disaster struck, there would inevitably be a massive shortage. So it was better to gather as much as possible here first.","In short, whatever Gu Yebai and the others could help ship over during this time would be helpful.","Gu Yebai took the list, looked down at it, and his frown deepened.","Zhou Muchen and Shen Hao couldn't help but lean over to look as well.","\"Sister Yutong, with all these compressed biscuits and antibiotics... what exactly are you going to do? This doesn't sound like team-building; it feels more like going to war overseas or doing earthquake relief!\"","\"And so many flashlights and radios? Your company's team-building is way too hardcore.\"","\"Sister Yutong, you're suddenly leaving and urgently need to gather such a large batch of what looks like emergency disaster relief supplies. Did you get some news we don't know about? Like a possible natural disaster somewhere?\"","\"If that's the case, tell us. The entire Yunshan Society will definitely assist with all our might. But if you say nothing and just have us prepare blindly, we really have no peace of mind.\"","\"That's right, Sister Yutong. We're all in the same boat now, working on a deal worth tens of billions. What couldn't we talk about? If you're really going to do something major, would we brothers hold you back? You being so secretive like this actually makes us anxious, worried we might not coordinate properly and mess up your plans.\"","They all looked at Liu Yutong with eager eyes, wanting to know what was really happening.","Truthfully, they had a vague premonition that something major was about to occur.","Otherwise, how could Liu Yutong possibly disregard a deal worth tens of billions of dollars?","Seeing their faces full of questions, Liu Yutong sighed inwardly again.","It wasn't that she didn't trust them. The main issue was that her rebirth was her biggest secret, one she simply couldn't reveal.","Furthermore, with current technology, predicting an earthquake in advance wasn't possible. If it were, she wouldn't need to be so secretive.","So even if she told them, who would believe her?","\"Stop guessing. Just collect the items on the list for me. I have my own arrangements.\"","Seeing they couldn't get anything out of her, everyone reluctantly gave up.","\"Then, Sister Yutong, you must stay in touch with us. If anything happens on our end, you can still come back in time.\"","\"Alright, I'll prepare several backup phones.\"","Seeing Liu Yutong's determination to leave, Gu Yebai and the others stopped trying to dissuade her.","After the meal, they immediately mobilized all their resources to frantically purchase and gather supplies according to the lists.","In just half a day, the required materials began converging from all directions.","By evening, a large convoy had assembled on the outskirts of the city.","Following the Wanlong Society's vehicles were seven or eight heavy trucks, fully loaded with emergency supplies.","Liu Yutong stood in front of the lead car, looking at this vast convoy that stretched almost as far as the eye could see. Her heart felt slightly more at ease.","Although the road ahead was uncertain, this was the strongest force she could muster in such a short time.","Once everything was ready, Liu Yutong only said two words: \"Let's go.\"","Then she bent down and got into the car."]},{"number":491,"title":"Chapter 491: 491. Is Charity a Sports Event","paragraphs":["\"Move out!\"","At Liu Yutong's command, the convoy, like a steel dragon, rumbled out of Danan City under the cover of night, heading towards BS Province.","The fleet traveled day and night, stopping only for essential refueling and brief rests, barely pausing for a moment.","Liu Yutong's heart remained on edge throughout the journey. She had hardly slept a wink, and the closer they got to their destination, the greater the pressure she felt.","She could only silently pray that in this lifetime, everything would be different.","After entering BS Province, the mountain roads noticeably increased, forcing the convoy to slow down.","In the early hours of the morning, as they neared Bei C, the supply trucks and the vehicle carrying Liu Yutong pulled into a large service area for a break and resupply.","Most of the other vehicles, including the bus transporting the Wanlong Hui members, having traveled considerably faster than the trucks, had already exited the highway to find places to rest.","Only three or four cars remained with the trucks to ensure no issues arose with the supplies on the road.","By now, after the continuous long-distance travel, everyone from the truck drivers to Liu Yutong and her companions was exhausted. They all got out at the service area to stretch their legs.","Some headed for the restrooms, others went to buy hot food.","Although they had brought plenty of provisions, the Chinese soul still yearns for something warm. Going too long without hot food always leaves one feeling like something is missing.","Even a simple, steaming cup of instant noodles could bring immense satisfaction.","Liu Yutong also got out and went to make herself a cup of noodles.","The service area hall in the predawn hours was quite deserted; apart from their group, there were hardly any other travelers.","Besides Liu Yutong, one other person from Yunshan Hui had come along.","Zhu Silin.","According to her, her father had been transferred to BS Province and even promoted a level; he was now the provincial chief administrator.","She had come on a whim, partly to visit her father along the way.","Yunshan Hui currently had seven members, each with substantial backgrounds.","Only Liu Yutong herself had no background to speak of.","Zhu Silin, holding her own cup of noodles, sat down opposite Liu Yutong. While waiting for the noodles to steep, she couldn't help but ask again:","\"Yutong-jie, we're almost in Bei C territory. Can't you tell me where exactly everyone is going for this 'training exercise'?\"","\"My father is here; maybe he can be of some help.\"","Liu Yutong could easily guess her thoughts—she was still curious about the real purpose of this trip, suspecting the previously mentioned training exercise was just a cover.","And in fact, it was indeed false.","However, during the journey, Liu Yutong had already devised a relatively perfect explanation to dispel their suspicions.","She put down her fork, wiped her mouth, and wore an expression that said 'I really can't do anything with you'. \"Silin, actually, this action of mine probably seems a bit childish to you and Zhou Muchen. But for me, it's something I must do.\"","\"Because you all have people to back you up. I don't.\"","\"You might not know, but there are many people outside who want to see my Wanlong Hui destroyed. I just want to run legitimate businesses, but there are always those who want to cause us trouble.\"","\"So, I need to build a 'golden shield' for myself, and for Wanlong Hui.\"","Zhu Silin: \"A golden shield?\"","Liu Yutong didn't spell it out too plainly: \"I plan to establish a charitable foundation later. This operation is a kind of trial run.\"","Zhu Silin finally understood, thinking to herself, \"No wonder the boss lady didn't explain clearly to them. So that's her plan.\"","Nowadays, many successful people engage in charity. Besides answering the ancient call of 'with prosperity comes the duty to benefit the world', charity offers many advantages.","For instance, it can secure policy support, win favor from leaders...","It's like adding a special, invisible protective talisman for oneself.","Thinking this, Zhu Silin suddenly felt ashamed.","She had never really thought about doing charity work herself, probably because, like the others in Yunshan Hui, she never had to worry about background or connections.","The boss lady was different. She was a true self-made woman, having built the Wanlong Hui group from the ground up. Naturally, she would become a target in many people's eyes, or rather, a coveted prize.","After all, wealth stirs men's hearts!","Hadn't their own Yunshan Hui initially had similar thoughts?","To prevent such things from happening again, the boss lady wanting to gain some sense of security through charity, to build that golden shield for herself and Wanlong Hui, was entirely reasonable.","The more she thought, the more ashamed Zhu Silin felt.","Although it was that Xue Chen who first suggested moving against Wanlong Hui, they had all tacitly agreed.","She now finally understood why the boss lady was unwilling to tell them the real reason. The root cause lay in their past actions, which had left a rift in the boss lady's heart.","Also, she guessed the boss lady's choice of BS Province for charity work wasn't random.","After all, BS Province was far from Wanlong Hui's home base. Coming all this way for charity seemed unnecessary.","She must have come here because of her, using action to convey to the other Yunshan Hui members a desire to completely dissolve the estrangement between them.","That's also why she didn't want to tell her, didn't want to tell the others.","Not only did the boss lady not hold a grudge against them for Yunshan Hui's past intentions, but she was also repaying their unkindness with kindness, going out of her way to deliver achievements for her, even for her father... This was simply...","Zhu Silin even felt her face grow hot, and she suddenly apologized to Liu Yutong.","\"Yutong-jie, I'm sorry!\"","She had to make it up to her.","Since she had come to a place under her father's jurisdiction to do charity, she couldn't remain indifferent.","This time, she must do everything in her power to help Yutong-jie make this a success. She needed to let her father know about Yutong-jie's goodwill, and more importantly, let the other Yunshan Hui members see that Yutong-jie truly regarded everyone as friends, as brothers and sisters.","From now on, everyone must sincerely acknowledge her as their boss lady.","After all, where else could you find such a good boss lady?","Hearing Zhu Silin's sudden apology, Liu Yutong was slightly taken aback. \"What are you apologizing to me for?\"","\"Nothing.\"","Zhu Silin didn't plan to tell Liu Yutong just yet that she would inform her father about her coming here for charity, as she wanted to give Liu Yutong a surprise.","\"Yutong-jie, can you tell me what you plan to do for this charity project?\"","\"I've seen people donate money, donate goods, but this is the first time I've seen someone bring all these emergency supplies. It feels a bit strange.\"","Liu Yutong pointed towards the endless mountains outside the window.","\"Look at BS Province, especially places like Bei C. High mountains and deep valleys. Many children in towns and villages here, in their drive to escape the mountains, only know to bury their heads in books. They've never even participated in a proper outdoor activity. How can that be right? So I thought, why not organize a sports meet?\"","Zhu Silin was stunned, completely failing to follow Liu Yutong's train of thought. \"Huh? A sports meet?\"","\"Yes!\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"I plan to organize a large-scale public welfare sports meet covering impoverished primary and middle schools in Bei C and several nearby cities. I've even thought of a name: the Rainbow Plan Aid-for-Education Sports Meet.\""]},{"number":492,"title":"Chapter 492: 492, The Real Purpose","paragraphs":["\"Just think, organizing an event for tens of thousands of children, shouldn't safety and security be the top priority?\"","\"So, we need to prepare a large amount of medical supplies, so that if the children get bumps, scrapes, or injuries, they can be treated promptly. Also, the mountain weather is unpredictable, and accommodation conditions are limited. Things like tents, emergency food, drinking water, and flashlights—don't they all need to be prepared thoroughly?\"","\"After all, the scale of this sports event is large, with many participants, so the demand for supplies naturally won't be small.\"","Zhu Silin listened, dumbfounded.","Hold on, isn't this charity work a bit too hardcore?","And this sports event sounds different from a traditional one too?","Zhu Silin was now almost certain that she and everyone else had guessed wrong.","Liu Yutong's plan wasn't to take the Wanlong Hui members on a training march at all, but to have the Wanlong Hui people lead the students in something like a wilderness summer camp activity.","Honestly, in all her life, this was the first time she'd seen charity done this way.","The most crucial point was, would the students even be willing?","Even if the students were willing, would the parents and teachers agree?","Would the local education department and local officials approve?","Zhu Silin guessed correctly. When some local officials heard that Wanlong Hui wanted to take all the teachers and students of some schools into the wilderness for training, they were completely baffled.","Take the officials of Bei C County, for example. Upon meeting the person in charge of Wanlong Hui's advance team, they were initially overjoyed and gave a warm welcome upon hearing it was for charity.","But when they heard this charity involved taking all the county's teachers and students for wilderness training and a hundred-kilometer cross-country trek, they all frowned.","\"This is just reckless...\"","Before they could finish.","Yu Xin held up a finger: \"For every school that participates, we'll make an additional donation of one million yuan. Ten schools mean ten million, with no upper limit...\"","The officials' expressions changed instantly: \"No problem! Absolutely no problem! Tomorrow... no, I'll have people notified to start preparations right now, we can begin the training immediately!\"","They couldn't help it, they were truly desperate from poverty!","The county's finances were already tight, and being located in a mountainous area, economic development was mediocre.","This money was far too important for them.","With over fifty primary and secondary schools combined in the county, that meant over fifty million yuan!","It's just a few days of outdoor training. The kids from the mountains can run anyway, and some exercise is good for them.","Besides, the costs and material support for the training aren't coming from their pockets; they just need to coordinate.","Not only that, Yu Xin then proposed organizing a city-wide marathon.","The students have their activities, but the adults shouldn't be idle either.","Pick a date, find an open section of road, and hold a marathon for all citizens.","\"For this marathon, for every person who participates, we'll donate an additional three hundred yuan.\"","The Bei C officials heard this and started calculating furiously in their minds: \"Our county's registered population is about 160,000. If we can mobilize everyone, that's a significant sum.\"","\"Do it! We must do it! Marathons are great, they improve people's physical fitness. I'll arrange for people to organize it right away, I guarantee we'll even mobilize the elderly who can walk from the nursing homes, hahaha...\"","Although the officials privately found the other party's demands utterly bizarre and unprecedented, the thought of that gleaming cash made them think: not just a hundred-kilometer trek and a nationwide marathon, even if they were asked to organize a county-wide bed-making competition, they could immediately have the notice sent to every neighborhood committee.","Poverty truly can cure all pickiness and hesitation.","Doing these two things well would bring in nearly a hundred million yuan in donations. This was a political achievement handed to them on a silver platter; only a fool would refuse.","Moreover, this money could genuinely solve urgent shortages in areas like education.","Almost simultaneously.","Not just in Bei C, similar situations occurred in several other places like Wen C.","At roughly the same time.","Besides Bei C, the same thing was happening in a few other places like Wen C.","A bunch of eccentric people from other provinces had arrived, wanting to hold some sort of sports event.","The reactions of the local officials in these areas were pretty much the same as those in Bei C.","For a hundred million yuan in donations, what's wrong with having everyone get some exercise?","This was 2008. A hundred million yuan was a very substantial figure for local finances, significant even more than a decade later.","Shortly after, at the provincial level, instructions were conveyed to the relevant officials of these nearly ten counties and cities, requiring them to actively cooperate with the mass fitness activities carried out by the public welfare enterprise Wanlong Hui.","After all, involving nearly a billion yuan in public welfare donations was enough to attract attention from higher-ups.","Especially since someone had quietly notified the provincial leadership as well.","...","Liu Yutong hadn't been settled in Bei C for long when she learned some news from Zhu Silin: her father was coming.","He was coming down to inspect because of the sports event.","Given that the scale of this event was unique nationwide, it was normal for high-ranking leaders to come inspect its progress.","Not to mention the promised over one billion yuan in charitable funds.","\"Your dad wants to see me, why didn't you tell me earlier?\" Liu Yutong shot Zhu Silin a look.","Zhu Silin grinned: \"Sister Yutong, you're here doing good deeds. It's only normal for my dad, as a leader here, to want to meet you.\"","\"Don't worry, my dad doesn't bite.\"","Liu Yutong was speechless: \"Alright then, thank you.\"","Zhu Silin: \"No need to be so polite.\"","On the afternoon of May 10th.","Liu Yutong met Zhu Silin's father, the chief executive of BS Province.","As this meeting was relatively private, the leader only brought one secretary and, upon meeting Liu Yutong, displayed no official airs or pretension, acting more like a gentle elder.","It was Liu Yutong who acted a bit reserved.","Of course, she was doing it on purpose.","\"Chairwoman Liu, no need to be reserved. Today is just a private chat.\"","\"Your move this time has caused quite a stir in our entire province. To be honest, I'm very curious, why did you choose BS Province, and choose to hold such a... particular sports event?\"","Truth be told, when he first heard about this event, he also found it quite bizarre.","Who does things like this?","Hearing the leader's question, Liu Yutong knew she couldn't use charity as a vague excuse anymore.","However, she had already prepared her explanation and spoke candidly: \"Uncle Zhu, since you ask, I'll be frank. Our charity work is sincere, but Wanlong Hui is, after all, a company that also needs to develop.\"","\"Wanlong Hui has businesses like chain supermarkets under its umbrella, and we've been seeking to expand outward. BS Province is a very important part of our strategic layout. It's rich in products, the people are honest and simple, and the market potential is huge. That's why we chose to start from here.\"","The leader pondered upon hearing this; this reason was clearly more in line with business logic than mere charity.","Although he had already guessed the general idea, he still asked: \"So, such a grand gesture is just to break into the BS Province market?\"","\"You could understand it that way.\"","Liu Yutong continued, \"But what we hope for is not simply to establish a presence here, but to take root. This large-scale public welfare event is meant to show the people and the government of BS Province the sincerity and social responsibility of the Wanlong Association. We hope to build good government-business relations and a solid public foundation.","In other words, when Wanlong Supermarkets open across BS Province in the future, we want everyone to think of us not as an outside business coming to snatch their market, but as a warm and responsible 'one of our own'!\"","She deliberately emphasized the words \"one of our own.\"","It was almost an explicit hint that her coming here was precisely because of her connection to Zhu Silin, that she was banking on that very relationship.","Hearing Liu Yutong state it so frankly, the official felt no displeasure. On the contrary, he admired her even more.","This young woman is truly remarkable!","Just her vision alone is something ordinary businesspeople lack, and both her manner of speaking and her actions greatly appealed to him.","He isn't afraid of people using connections to invest and make money here; the key is how you go about it.","If you are open and above board, as sincere and straightforward as Liu Yutong is, then he absolutely welcomes it with open arms and will offer strong support.","What truly disgusts him are those who employ underhanded tactics and crooked methods behind the scenes.","\"Well said!\"","The official nodded in approval. \"Chairperson Liu, despite your youth, you possess not only compassion but also foresight and courage. On behalf of the government, I warmly welcome enterprises like the Wanlong Association Group, which have both strength and sincerity, to invest and develop here. For businesses that operate with integrity, are willing to put down roots locally, and work for the benefit of the community, we will certainly provide our utmost support!\""]},{"number":493,"title":"Chapter 493: 493. The Training March Begins.","paragraphs":["Upon hearing this, Liu Yutong replied modestly, \"Governor Zhu, you flatter me. As an emerging enterprise, for Wanlonghui Group to receive your recognition is truly an honor. Please rest assured, we will keep our feet firmly on the ground and strive to create more job opportunities for BS Province, repaying the trust of you and the local people with concrete actions.\"","The leader's smile widened at her words, and he waved his hand. \"Ah, no need to call me 'leader' in private from now on. If you don't mind, just call me Uncle Zhu. Seeing young people like you with such vision and sense of responsibility truly warms my heart.\"","\"And my daughter, she's been a bit spoiled and willful since she was little. You'll have to bear with her.\"","Liu Yutong readily complied, promptly and sweetly changing her address. \"Uncle Zhu, Silin is a good friend of mine. I've always regarded her as my own sister.\"","The leader: \"Good, good, good. It's wonderful that you young people can support each other and make progress together. You'll have to guide Silin more in the future.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Don't worry, Uncle Zhu, I certainly will.\"","The leader looked at the poised and eloquent young woman before him, liking her more and more.","If his own daughter could possess even half of her grace and capability, he would be perfectly content.","\"Yutong, from now on, if you have any ideas or encounter any difficulties here, you can always talk to Silin, or have your secretary contact me directly. I have no doubt about your abilities, achieving such a scale with your enterprise at such a young age. From now on, consider BS Province your second home. Don't be a stranger.\"","These words essentially constituted a complete endorsement of Liu Yutong and conveyed a willingness to offer some personal support.","Liu Yutong understood perfectly; calling him \"Uncle Zhu\" was absolutely worth it.","This trip to BS Province had been worthwhile!","In fact, she originally hadn't planned to expand into the BS Province market, at least not in the short term, as the front line was a bit too distant.","But now, it seemed like a good opportunity after all.","With this connection, she could fully expand her company's operations here.","Of course, it wouldn't just be a supermarket expansion. She had long drafted plans for out-of-province expansion, generally based on shopping centers, aiming to create large-scale complexes to better achieve economies of scale.","The goal was simple, summarized by a slogan: Wherever a Wanlong Shopping Center is, that's the city's commercial hub.","Liu Yutong's conversation with the leader lasted about an hour before concluding.","This was followed by the formal meeting session.","After all, Liu Yutong's investment of over a billion yuan in public welfare in BS Province was certainly going to be televised.","However, Liu Yutong politely declined this formal media appearance, which surprised the leader, yet didn't entirely surprise him.","What surprised him was that someone would willingly pass up such a good opportunity for publicity.","What didn't surprise him was that his daughter had already told him Liu Yutong disliked the limelight and preferred to work diligently and pragmatically.","The leader respected this and admired her even more for it. Young yet not arrogant, practical and low-key—such qualities were exceptionally rare in today's restless society.","However, such a major public welfare project required someone to represent it publicly.","Thus, Yu Xin, as the representative of Wanlonghui Group, formally met with the leader, appearing on BS Province television in Liu Yutong's stead.","After the meeting concluded, Liu Yutong stood atop a hotel in North C, gazing out at the city about to face trauma.","In her previous life, the damage to North C had been so severe that the entire county town had to be rebuilt at a new location.","She had done all she could.","This was also the best method she could currently devise to get as many people as possible away from buildings and into relatively safe, open areas.","She just didn't know how many people would ultimately be saved.","At this moment in North C, whether on TV news, newspapers, radio, or roadside banner advertisements, the student wilderness training and public marathon activities were being promoted.","It was easier with the teachers and students from schools. As long as the higher-ups' notification was properly relayed, regardless of how much the school principals or teachers complained, they had to comply.","It was a mandatory task requiring cooperation.","Of course, this hundred-li training march wasn't for nothing.","As long as the task was completed, the previously unapproved funding applications would be granted by the higher-ups.","Many schools were short of funds now—for things like repairing classrooms, replacing desks and chairs—there were truly many areas needing money.","Some schools in remote areas even had long-overdue teacher salaries.","But now it was different. Securing that hundred million yuan in funding could alleviate a lot of pressure.","Almost immediately after the notice was issued, teachers and students from various schools set out one after another.","As for the marathon activity, organizing it was a bit more troublesome. Many people, especially the elderly, weren't very interested and were unwilling to participate.","However, the organizers came up with countermeasures.","They set up numerous stalls along the planned marathon route, providing not only water but also placing large quantities of eggs.","Just by showing up, you could get a free bag of eggs. If you could bring friends to cheer for the contestants, you could even get extra eggs.","If the eggs ran out, they'd hand out cash directly.","This instantly ignited enthusiasm even among the group least interested in marathons. They all got incredibly pumped up, rallying friends early in the morning, even dragging their lazy, sleeping children out of bed by the ear to go collect eggs and money together.","This further encouraged more people to leave the buildings.","A similar situation unfolded in the countryside, where people were specifically sent to villages, for instance, to distribute eggs in open spaces.","Villages, relatively speaking, had more left-behind elderly. Upon hearing about free eggs, they all rushed out of their homes in a clamor to get them.","No urging was needed at all.","After the large-scale activity began, the original thousand or so members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society were far from enough.","They even had to hire many people to help with the work.","Liu Yutong didn't choose to stay in North C. She, along with Yun Cheng and Zhu Silin, joined a nearly hundred-strong wilderness training team from a township elementary school.","Their destination was a martyrs' cemetery a hundred li away.","At the very beginning, the children, thinking it was a spring outing, were all in high spirits and very excited.","Liu Yutong and the other two changed into sportswear, put on volunteer armbands, and blended in among the teachers, directing the students toward their goal.","Following behind them was a box truck carrying supplies to ensure their food and accommodation.","The first half of the hike was fine, but problems started later on.","Many children were young, and even with walking and resting intermittently, after walking over ten kilometers, they began to fuss. Quite a few even plopped down on the ground, refusing to go any further.","Liu Yutong had no choice but to encourage the children like the other teachers, leading them in songs, telling stories about the martyrs, and doing her best to motivate them to keep going.","Perhaps because of her approachability and broader knowledge, many children really liked this pretty and gentle older sister, always clustering around her asking all sorts of questions.","The most frequent question was why the destination was a martyrs' cemetery.","\"Big sister, why do we have to walk so far to see the martyrs' graves?\"","\"Because heroes deserve us measuring the distance of our respect with our own steps. Also, look, how blue the sky is, how green the mountains are. Isn't exercising in nature much more fun than staying in the classroom?\"","\"Hmm, it's just my feet hurt a bit.\"","\"Just persevere a little longer. Once we're over this hill, we can rest.\"","\"Big sister, can you tell us some more stories?\"","\"Alright...\""]},{"number":494,"title":"Chapter 494: 494. The Earthquake Is Coming.","paragraphs":["\"You know, many of the martyrs were not much older than you when they sacrificed themselves. Some were even around your age.\"","\"Really? They joined the army that young?\"","\"Yes! In those war-torn years, many children your age resolutely marched to the battlefield to defend their homeland and protect their loved ones. They might not have had the chance to sit in bright classrooms and study peacefully like you do, before they had to shoulder rifles taller than themselves to fight the enemy...\"","\"...\"","\"They were so brave! If I lived in that era, I would want to be a hero too!\" said a sturdy little boy, clenching his fist.","Liu Yutong gently patted his head and said with a smile, \"Every era has its own heroes. You don't need to go to war now, but you can still be little heroes. For example, by working hard to leave these mountains and using the knowledge you gain to build your hometown. Or, like today, by persevering and completing this journey of over a hundred li. Just by persevering and succeeding, you are remarkable little heroes.\"","Just then, a quiet girl wearing glasses couldn't help but ask softly, \"Sister, is the path we're walking today the same as the one the martyrs walked back then?\"","\"Although the paths are different, the spirit is the same.\"","Liu Yutong looked towards the mountain path in the distance and continued, \"The path they walked was one of defending the homeland. The path we walk today is one of remembering history and passing on their spirit. Every step is a tribute to the heroes.\"","\"Sister, I understand! We must persevere to the end, just like the martyrs did!\"","\"Sister, I'm not tired anymore, let's keep going!\"","\"I'm not tired either, let's go!\"","\"...\"","The children chimed in one after another, standing up again and gritting their teeth as they marched forward.","Time passed bit by bit, and in the blink of an eye, it was the third day of the training march.","The entire team, both students and teachers, were utterly exhausted, as it was the first time any of them had walked such a long distance.","If it weren't for the constant encouragement from Liu Yutong, the others, and the school teachers, the students might not have been able to persevere.","Finally, on the morning of the 12th, the team arrived at the solemn and majestic martyrs' cemetery.","After a simple yet solemn memorial ceremony, everyone rested briefly before preparing for the return journey.","By noon, their returning team had set up camp in a wide, flat open area.","The children eagerly gathered firewood and helped start the fire to cook, creating a lively and bustling scene.","Watching these innocent and lovely children, the pressure in Liu Yutong's heart seemed to ease a little.","Their team had come so far; the situation with the other teams should be similar, right?","Thinking this, she picked up her phone and called a member of the Wanlong Hui in the other teams.","Although the mobile signal was poor, she managed to get a general idea of each team's situation.","All teams had basically moved far away from the epicenter area.","However, just as she hung up, the ground beneath her feet began to shake violently without warning!","The mountains trembled, trees swayed wildly!","The camp instantly descended into chaos, filled with cries of alarm.","\"Earthquake!\"","\"Ah!\"","\"Mom, I'm scared!\"","\"Teacher...\"","\"Don't panic! Everyone, come to the middle of the open area immediately, away from the hillsides and trees!\" Liu Yutong shouted, grabbing a megaphone at once.","Fortunately, the past few days of marching had made the students more disciplined.","Finally, guided by the teachers and Wanlong Hui volunteers, the students quickly gathered in the open area at the center of the camp.","\"Hold hands, squat down, protect your heads!\" Yun Cheng's powerful voice rang out among the crowd as he took charge of directing.","Zhu Silin also recovered from the initial panic and hurriedly comforted the children trembling beside her.","The earth continued to shake, and the distant, dull sound of rolling rocks was terrifying.","Fortunately, there was no real danger, and there were no casualties in their temporarily set-up camp.","Liu Yutong continued to give loud commands while holding a few terrified younger children in her arms.","Her own heart was beating very fast, and she also felt an indescribable sense of relief.","She had succeeded. At least these nearly one hundred vibrant lives before her, because of her seemingly absurd actions, had survived this great catastrophe.","The tremors lasted for several minutes before gradually subsiding.","The shaken children, looking at the chaotic scene around them and the huge boulders that had tumbled down the mountainside in the distance, couldn't hold back their tears.","\"Classmates, don't be afraid, we are safe now!\"","\"Look around you. Your teachers and older brothers and sisters are all here. We will definitely get back safely. Don't forget, you are all little heroes who conquered a hundred-li journey. Now you can conquer fear too!\"","Because of her time spent with the children day and night over the past few days, Liu Yutong had built deep trust in their hearts.","So as soon as she spoke, the children's emotions gradually stabilized.","Just then, Liu Yutong's satellite phone rang. It was Yu Xin.","Her voice sounded particularly tense.","\"Yutong, are you okay? There's been an earthquake.\"","\"I'm fine. What's the situation?\"","\"The news I've gotten so far is that most signals in areas like Bei C and Wen C are down. The situation in the urban areas is terrible; many buildings have collapsed.\"","\"This earthquake was so sudden, it scared me to death!\" Yu Xin on the other end of the line was also shaken.","\"As long as you and everyone else are safe, that's what matters.\"","\"I have a feeling this earthquake's magnitude won't be low. Distribute all the supplies we brought to those in need. Have everyone participate in the rescue efforts, but of course, only on the premise of ensuring their own safety.\"","\"Yes, Yutong!\"","\"...\"","Just as Liu Yutong hung up, Zhu Silin ran over to borrow the phone.","All regular signals were now down; only this satellite phone Liu Yutong had brought could get through.","Zhu Silin wanted to call her father to report she was safe and to ask about the situation.","The leader on the other end breathed a sigh of relief upon receiving his daughter's call, while also feeling a secret sense of relief. That girl Liu Yutong was so thoughtful, knowing there might be poor signal during field training and preparing a satellite phone in advance.","He had just returned to the provincial capital not long ago when the sudden tremors made him realize something was terribly wrong.","Soon, reports came in: a major earthquake had struck areas like Wen C and Bei C... the very places he had just returned from inspecting.","The earthquake magnitude was at least above 7, possibly even reaching 8.","An 8.0 magnitude earthquake—a devastating disaster in human history. The energy released is equivalent to thousands of small atomic bombs exploding simultaneously.","Historically, earthquakes of this scale have always resulted in horrifying casualty numbers.","The leader immediately set off for the site to direct the earthquake relief efforts.","To save time, he flew directly by helicopter.","Along the way, he received many reports, mostly bad news: many roads paralyzed, rescue operations difficult, severe building collapses, etc....","However, after his daughter's call, the good news started coming in more and more.","The unprecedented-scale sports meet and public marathon initiated by Liu Yutong and her Wanlong Hui Group had, by sheer coincidence, left the teachers, students, and a large number of citizens who were right in the epicenter area miraculously safe.","This meant countless lives that might otherwise have been buried under rubble had survived because of it.","The leader held the phone, listening to his daughter's voice speaking from after the disaster, Liu Yutong's young face appearing in his mind. A wave of gratitude welled up in his heart.","That girl, she really was his lucky star!","No! She should be the lucky star of BS Province!"]},{"number":495,"title":"Chapter 495: 495, Return.","paragraphs":["The news of the earthquake in BS Province quickly spread across the nation and even the world.","\"Major Earthquake Strikes BS Province, Magnitude as High as 8.0!\"","This shocking headline instantly dominated the front pages of all news outlets.","TV screens continuously broadcast images from the disaster zone: landslides, shattered roads, towns almost razed to the ground—a hellish scene that gripped the hearts of every viewer.","Survivors, faces covered in dust and still shaken, stood dazed on the rubble, staring at their unrecognizable surroundings. Rescue workers desperately called out in front of piles of debris. Beside collapsed school buildings, fragments of desks and chairs lay scattered...","These scenes pained viewers thousands of miles away, bringing countless citizens to tears.","Yet, amidst the sorrowful reports, miraculous sparks of hope were constantly being ignited.","\"Miracle! Tens of Thousands of Teachers and Students Survive Due to Outdoor Training Drill!\"","\"'Egg Marathon' Proves Its Worth! Citizens Avoid Disaster While Collecting Supplies, Astonishing Survival Rate!\"","\"An Entrepreneur's Responsibility: An 'Ill-Timed' Charity Sports Event Coincidentally Saves Tens of Thousands!\"","\"Hope\"!","\"........\"","Major media outlets vied to report in detail how a sports event and a public marathon organized by a certain enterprise had coincidentally helped large numbers of students and citizens escape the disaster.","Newspaper front pages published photos of children safe and sound in open areas, forming a stark contrast with the collapsed school buildings in the distance.","On TV news, survivors, with tears in their eyes, recounted how they had luckily escaped because they had gone to collect eggs or to participate in their children's outdoor training activities.","Strangely, however, all the reports referred only to \"a certain enterprise\" without mentioning its name in detail.","This was actually specifically requested by Liu Yutong, as she did not want to capitalize on the tragedy's attention.","Although many companies and individuals might use opportunities like donating to disaster areas to gain publicity, she did not want to, nor did she need to.","The current steady development of the Wanlong Hui was just fine. If it suddenly received too much attention, with too many eyes fixed on the Wanlong Hui Group, it might actually become a constraint for them.","Despite their low profile, many locals and rescue workers remembered those special volunteers dressed in black with dragon emblems on their chests.","After settling the teachers and students, Liu Yutong, Yun Cheng, and the others immediately returned to North C to participate in rescue efforts.","This continued until five days later.","The intensive rescue operations temporarily came to a stage, with the main life-saving phase largely concluded. The focus began shifting toward the resettlement of disaster victims and epidemic prevention.","The members of the Wanlong Hui, including Liu Yutong and Yun Cheng, had almost all reached their physical limits.","For five days, they had suffered severe sleep deprivation, working day and night on the rubble.","Everyone's face bore heavy exhaustion, their clothes stained with mud and dust. Many had even sustained injuries, but fortunately, no one was seriously hurt.","Although physically exhausted, everyone was in good spirits—perhaps this was the sense of fulfillment that came from saving lives.","As Liu Yutong gathered the Wanlong Hui members to prepare for withdrawal in batches, Zhu Silin hurried over, his expression serious. \"Sister Yutong, my father called. A very important leader wants to meet you at the temporary command center.\"","Liu Yutong was slightly taken aback.","Uncle Zhu was already a high-ranking leader himself. For him to personally relay the message and describe the other as \"very important\" hinted at an even higher level.","\"Right now?\" Liu Yutong glanced at her own appearance, which she hadn't had time to tend to for days.","Zhu Silin nodded, lowering his voice. \"Father specifically emphasized that the leader knows you've been working hard for days and just wants to have a brief word with you in person to express thanks. A car is already waiting outside.\"","Liu Yutong's mind raced.","At this moment, for such a high-ranking figure to want to see her was surely not merely to express gratitude.","It likely meant that her previous actions, and the capability and sense of responsibility displayed by the Wanlong Hui, had already caught the attention of the leadership.","Thinking this, she felt an inexplicable mix of excitement and nervousness.","After all, neither in her past life nor this one had she ever met a leader of this stature.","\"Alright, I'll go right away. Silin, help me tidy up a bit. Can't be too disrespectful.\"","\"Okay.\"",".............","The next day.","Liu Yutong took a flight back to Da Nan City.","Mingzhu City didn't have an airport, so the nearest airports besides the provincial capital were Da Nan City. She chose Da Nan City first because important matters awaited her there.","The others returned by car to Mingzhu City to rest.","During the return journey, she kept thinking about what the leader had said to her.","\"You are still young, with a long road ahead. You must remember one phrase: Great merchants strategize for the nation.\"","\"A true entrepreneur must have a vision that transcends immediate gains and losses in one place. Only by closely integrating one's own development with the needs of the country and the well-being of the people can one walk a longer, farther path...\"","\"'Great merchants strategize for the nation'... How well put,\" Liu Yutong murmured to herself.","The plane landed smoothly at Da Nan City airport.","After Liu Yutong, Zhu Silin, and Yun Cheng walked out of the arrival gate, the sight before them made them both laugh and cry.","Outside the VIP passage, the members of the Yunshan Society, led by Gu Yebai and Zhou Muchen, were all present, dressed in suits and looking spirited.","The most exaggerated part was that they had actually unfurled two bright red banners.","One read: Welcome Back, Heroes!","The other made Liu Yutong utterly speechless: Sister Yutong, you are electricity, you are light, you are the one and only myth!","Zhou Muchen was the first to rush forward, holding an exaggeratedly large bouquet of flowers almost big enough to hide his entire person, and presented it to her.","\"Sister Yutong, you're finally back! You know, we were scared to death when we saw the news! An 8.0 magnitude earthquake! And what do you do? You lead tens of thousands of teachers and students in a real-life escape act! Amazing!\"","\"Sister Yutong, I want to apprentice under you, I want to learn the secret art of foretelling the future. Have you been secretly cultivating some divination technique? Can you know the future?\"","Before Liu Yutong could explain, Zhu Silin slapped him on the back of the head.","\"Know your head! Sister Yutong just had good luck. Who can predict the future nowadays? That would make her a god!\"","\"But isn't Sister Yutong a god...\"","\"Exactly, Sister Yutong is a god among humans. The things Sister Yutong does, we couldn't think of or accomplish them in eight lifetimes.\"","To be honest, when the earthquake happened in Wen C, they, like everyone else, were deeply distressed. Some even cried watching the news.","They had even wanted to go help, but reason told them they might just get in the way, so they held back.","Especially after they later learned about what Liu Yutong and the others had done, they were genuinely impressed and fully accepted her as their big sister.","She had heart, loyalty, and a strong sense of responsibility.","Compared to Liu Yutong, they felt like they were nothing."]},{"number":496,"title":"Chapter 496: 496. On the Eve of the Financial Storm","paragraphs":["After everyone returned to the Cloud Summit Club, Zhou Muchen and the others held a very high-standard welcome banquet for Liu Yutong and her two companions.","They specially selected many precious ingredients and invited a top chef to prepare a sumptuous dinner.","Chen Mo, the stock trader, also attended the banquet. He too had dark circles under his eyes, clearly having slept poorly during this period.","God only knows how he managed to endure these past days—it involved funds close to five billion!","Although he had handled funds over a hundred million before, this was his first time managing nearly five billion. With leverage applied, it reached a terrifying scale of over thirty billion US dollars.","Of course, besides worry, there was more excitement.","If they could successfully profit from the turmoil across the ocean this time, he would become a myth in the investment circle.","Even though he had expert guidance behind him, it wouldn't stop him from becoming a legend in the investment world.","Therefore, he took this opportunity very seriously, not just because the commission was substantial.","What he hadn't expected was that ever since Liu Yutong went to BS province some time ago, it was almost as if she had gone off the grid.","Although he operated according to Liu Yutong's previous instructions, he had been on tenterhooks the whole time. Combined with the time difference and late nights, it resulted in those dark circles.","Now that Liu Yutong was back, he could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","Beyond that, he also felt admiration!","He and his team had learned about what Liu Yutong had done in BS province.","Like others, he couldn't help but suspect whether Liu Yutong had some kind of foresight, but it was just a suspicion, not something he dwelled on.","After all, they were all atheists and not inclined to believe in such mysterious and elusive things.","However, that didn't diminish his respect for Liu Yutong.","Capable, decisive, ambitious, compassionate... well... and a bit ruthless...","No wonder she was so successful, able to make so many young masters willingly acknowledge her as their leader.","There are no walls without chinks. He now knew that Liu Yutong actually commanded a society with a membership in the thousands.","When he first learned this news, he was truly almost shocked speechless.","No wonder he felt such immense pressure when he first met Liu Yutong—it all made sense now.","Seeing Chen Mo's haggard appearance, Liu Yutong couldn't help but smile. She raised her glass proactively and said, \"Chen Mo, you've worked hard these past days.\"","Chen Mo hurriedly picked up his wine glass, feeling somewhat flattered. \"Not hard at all, not hard at all. Compared to what you did in BS province, the pressure I faced is nothing.\"","\"Miss Liu, I actually have a question that's been on my mind for a long time.\"","Everyone at the table quieted down, looking at Chen Mo curiously.","\"Go ahead,\" Liu Yutong signaled for him to continue.","\"It's about the timing and target selection for this short-selling operation. Do you have some insider information?\" Chen Mo asked.","Liu Yutong shook her head, then uttered a meaningful sentence: \"What insider information? I merely wanted everyone to see the cracks that have long existed in that wall. As for the storm that later arose... that was Heaven, opening its eye!\"","Upon hearing this, everyone felt a jolt in their hearts.","They all seemed to understand the meaning behind her words.","Liu Yutong was telling them that she never gambled on luck. Instead, she waited for an event that was bound to happen and positioned herself on the winning side in advance.","What immense confidence this was!","Several seconds passed.","Only then did Chen Mo let out a long sigh of relief, downed the wine in his glass in one gulp, and shook his head with a wry smile. \"Miss Liu, I understand. I used to think I was a decent trader. Now I know what it means—there's always someone greater. Working with you, I've learned more than in the past ten-plus years combined.\"","His words came from the bottom of his heart.","Liu Yutong had not only given him a chance to create a legend but also reshaped his understanding of financial markets.","True masters never just analyze indices; they learn to discern trends and position themselves at the crest of the wave before the tide even arrives.","Liu Yutong offered no further explanation. She wouldn't tell everyone that she had just been talking nonsense.","She pretended to be profound precisely to make everyone, especially key executors like Chen Mo, build absolute confidence and trust in her.","This way, they could cooperate with her more effectively.","Liu Yutong stood up, raised her glass again, and looked at everyone.","\"Everyone, the cracks have always been there. It's just that most people choose to turn a blind eye or cling to hope.\"","\"What we must do is seize this opportunity well, to elevate our wealth to a level that will leave the world astonished!\"","\"Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!\"","...","Time passed bit by bit.","News reports about the earthquake gradually decreased, while financial news and reports appeared more frequently.","More and more people seemed to have caught the scent, noticing something unusual.","However, they still firmly believed that the party across the ocean would once again resort to their usual rogue tactics—cranking up the printing presses.","They would use the printed money, through so-called quantitative easing, to shift their own crisis onto the whole world, forcing all countries and investors holding US dollar assets to collectively pay for the mess they created.","In fact, this global financial crisis truly resembled a runaway wild horse, with destructive power and chain reactions far exceeding most people's imaginations.","It wasn't a simple liquidity crisis but a massive collapse of credit at the very core of the financial system.","Those complex derivatives that once represented financial innovation, such as mortgage-backed securities, collateralized debt obligations, etc., were now spreading rapidly across the world like a virus.","Liu Yutong had been staying in a guest room at the Cloud Summit Club recently, going up to the top floor almost every night during market hours to inquire about the situation.","Several months later.","Top-floor operations center.","On the huge electronic screens in the room, red and green candlestick charts flickered violently.","The traders inside were busy executing orders, each face etched with tension.","Because they knew the critical time point Liu Yutong had mentioned was approaching. They could even feel it themselves.","That night, Liu Yutong had just gone upstairs.","Chen Mo, the seasoned trader invited from Hong Kong, immediately approached upon seeing Liu Yutong and her group enter. He even skipped the pleasantries, his speech rapid as he reported the situation to her.","\"Miss Liu, you've returned just in time. The situation is changing drastically right now!\"","Chen Mo essentially ignored the Cloud Mountain Society members behind Liu Yutong—mainly because he couldn't spare the attention—and quickly led Liu Yutong to the main console. Pointing at several key curves and data on the screen, he said:","\"According to the indicators you previously instructed us to monitor closely, Lehman's credit default swap spread has skyrocketed uncontrollably over the past forty-eight hours, just breaking through 500 basis points. This means market expectations of its default have reached an extreme. More importantly, the commercial paper market is almost frozen; they can't obtain any liquidity through short-term financing!\"","Liu Yutong's gaze was fixed on the screen, her heart surging with waves.","All of this aligned perfectly with her memories from her past life.","\"What's the current time across the ocean? Any latest updates from the intelligence team?\"","\"It's currently Thursday, just past 3 PM, across the ocean time.\"","\"Based on information gathered by our intelligence team and market rumors, Lehman's internal situation is in complete chaos. They are making a final struggle, but the Federal Reserve and the Treasury seem to be preparing to abandon them. This aligns with your assessment.\"","\"Thursday afternoon.\"","Liu Yutong pondered this timing. According to the time across the ocean, tomorrow would be what they call Black Friday, wouldn't it?","It would also be the moment the dominoes begin to fall.","Thinking of this, she immediately issued instructions.","\"Order all traders to immediately check the margin for all short positions. Prepare to face the... seismic tsunami that may occur when the market opens on Friday!\""]},{"number":497,"title":"Chapter 497: 497, 3.5 Billion Profit Fluctuation","paragraphs":["The next day.","Black Friday across the sea. The opening bell was almost upon them.","This day felt infinitely drawn out for everyone present, each minute and second stretching on like a century.","Besides the traders, Gu Yebai and the others were all on site as well. They had brought their own laptops, connected to external networks, trying to find the news they were hoping to see.","Finally, it happened just as they had hoped.","Suddenly!","Zhou Muchen leaped up from his chair, pointing at his screen, shouting excitedly.","\"It's here! Sister Yutong! Look! It's out!\"","His excited shout immediately drew the attention of everyone nearby. They all rushed to his computer, staring at the content on the screen.","Although the news headlines were in English, most of them could understand, as several among them had studied abroad.","Once they confirmed their eyes weren't deceiving them, excitement surged through them one by one.","On the computer screen, one urgent financial news story after another instantly swept across the headlines of all major portals.","\"Breaking News: Lehman Brothers Fails to Find Buyer, Faces Likely Bankruptcy!\"","\"Wall Street Panics as Interbank Lending Rates Skyrocket!\"","\"Weekend Emergency Meetings Fail to Save Lehman, Century-Old Investment Bank on the Brink of Collapse?\"","\".........\"","Each headline was more shocking, more horrifying than the last!","This news was no longer mere speculation or warning; it was the bloody truth.","Anyone watching the markets across the sea could sense what scene would unfold once trading began.","But even if they realized it now, it was too late.","\"Hahaha!\" Someone suddenly burst into laughter.","\"Sister Yutong, you're a genius!\"","\"We're going to be rich!\"","\"........\"","The Yunshan Club had almost emptied its entire coffers, even borrowing significant sums, all to bet on this very moment.","It could be said their future fate was already inextricably tied to those massive short positions with leverage reaching dozens of times.","Success would mean creating a financial legend.","Failure would mean the 4.7 billion RMB they invested would vanish into thin air, and they would lose everything, including Liu Yutong.","During this period of waiting, not just Liu Yutong, not just Chen Mo, but everyone, including the traders, had slept poorly, all tense with anxiety.","Fortunately, they were finally about to welcome their own spring.","Liu Yutong stood before the main console, arms crossed, watching the large screen. Outwardly, she appeared calm and unruffled, but her blood was gradually beginning to boil as the moment approached.","This moment had finally arrived!","\"Everyone, final check on system connections, account status, contingency plans!\"","Chen Mo's voice echoed through the hall. Though he was also trying hard to maintain composure, the slight tremor in his voice betrayed him.","After issuing the operational instructions, he couldn't help but look towards Liu Yutong standing before the large screen, his heart filled with admiration.","This pillar of their group, her sense of smell was truly too sharp, her vision too keen!","Most crucially, she possessed a daring spirit ordinary people lacked!","Right then, someone shouted.","\"It's open!\"","On the large screen, the Nasdaq 100 Index Futures pre-market trading started, a sea of dismal green.","But it held for less than five minutes before the entire index plummeted like a kite with its string cut, falling in a straight line.","-1%, -3%,..... the numbers jumped wildly.","Red!","The color most beloved by the people of Long Country, bar none.","In the Long Country market, this color represents gains, but across the sea, it's just the opposite.","At this moment, all they saw was a blinding red!","No, this was no ordinary red anymore; this was the color of blood!","Suddenly!","Another major news pop-up appeared, as if a nuclear bomb had been dropped on the global capital markets.","\"Lehman Officially Announces Bankruptcy Filing!\"","After this news appeared, panic spread through the market like a plague.","It wasn't just Lehman. AIG, Merrill Lynch, Washington Mutual Bank..... the names of one financial giant after another appeared in the news.","-5%! -8%! -10%!!","With almost no meaningful resistance, the index fell like a free-falling object.","\"Nasdaq Index Plunges 12% in Single Day! Largest Single-Day Drop in History!\"","\"Dow Jones Plummets Over 500 Points!\"","\"Global Stock Markets Synchronize in Crash, Fear Index VIX Soars to Record High!\"","\"........\"","For many around the globe, there was no good news to be seen today, only bad news.","Investors across the sea were also in lament, as countless people's wealth was instantly wiped out in this financial storm, leaving only despair!","However, in the operations center atop the Cloud Peak Club, the atmosphere was completely different.","Time passed bit by bit.","On the large screen, the numbers representing their profits were wildly jumping and growing at a staggering, mind-boggling speed!","Chen Mo was the first to report the latest capital situation to Liu Yutong.","\"Miss Liu, our main capital's short positions on the Nasdaq 100 Index have a notional value exceeding 27.2 billion USD. Current floating profit... over 400%.\"","\"Some key shorted tech stocks have floating profits exceeding 600%!\"","\"Those out-of-the-money put options... some varieties have returns already exceeding.... percent...\"","\"........\"","Zhou Muchen and the other non-professionals didn't fully understand, asking somewhat confused,","\"What does this 'notional 27.2 billion USD' mean? How much have we actually made?\"","Chen Mo took a deep breath, suppressing the excitement in his heart, and explained, \"The notional value of 27.2 billion is not our principal, nor is it profit. You can understand it as us using margin to leverage a massive bet with a total value of 27.2 billion USD!\"","He went directly to a whiteboard, picked up a marker, and quickly wrote down several numbers.","\"Our initial total capital was 4.7 billion RMB, approximately 690 million USD. Currently, after several months of adjustments, our main capital has grown to about 920 million USD. Of that, the margin we invested for our main positions is roughly 500 million USD.\"","Using this 500 million USD as a deposit, through leverage of around 50 times, we control this fund worth approximately 250 billion USD!","\"Now that the market has crashed, we've won this big bet. 'Floating profit 400%' means our 500 million USD principal has already earned over 2 billion USD. And that's just the main capital portion. If we include the profits from the remaining 400+ million USD in put options and other channels... conservatively, our gains today should exceed 3.5 billion... well, USD!\"","\"Hiss!!!\"","Although everyone had braced themselves, when the number was actually announced from Chen Mo's lips, the entire operations center still echoed with a collective, sharp intake of breath.","\"This is insane, the world has gone mad! We... we've gone mad too!\""]},{"number":498,"title":"Chapter 498: 498, Crazy","paragraphs":["Dead silence!","Expressions of utter disbelief appeared on everyone's faces, each person looking as if they had been turned to stone.","3.5 billion?","And in US dollars?","Wasn't that over 20 billion RMB in profit?","In just one Black Friday, they had achieved the entirety of their initial target.","They looked at each other, one after another, their glances seeming to ask: Did we hear that right? Are we dreaming?","The next second.","BOOM!!!","Long-suppressed emotions erupted completely!","\"Ah!!!\"","Zhou Muchen was the first to leap up. He didn't just stand on his chair—he vaulted onto a nearby desk, waving his arms wildly, venting his inner excitement.","He couldn't help it; the sheer amount was too much of a shock.","It wasn't that he'd never seen money before, but he had certainly never witnessed such a terrifying speed of making it.","\"Three point five billion, in US dollars! Holy shit! Holy fucking shit! Tell me I didn't mishear! Yebai, Lu Hong, pinch me, quick, pinch me!\"","\"Pinch you my ass, my own hands have gone weak.\"","\"We're rich! We're really rich! Sister Yutong! You're too damn awesome!\"","\"Hahaha... I knew it, I knew following Sister Yutong was the right move!\"","\"Long live Sister Yutong!!\"","\"...............\"","\"Pop!\"","Someone brought out champagne, aimed it at the ceiling, and opened it, celebrating madly as foam sprayed everywhere.","A smile finally appeared on Liu Yutong's face, though inwardly she was also deeply astonished.","Her original plan had been to make off with roughly 20 billion RMB before pulling back, but she never expected to hit the target this quickly.","Only by truly living in this unique era could one deeply understand that saying from a famous figure in her past life: as long as you catch the wind, even a pig can fly.","She was now successfully standing right in that wind—a gale-force wind!","After everyone's emotions had settled somewhat, Liu Yutong gently tapped the table. The entire operations center quickly quieted down. All eyes focused on her, filled with fervor, waiting for her to speak.","\"The storm across the ocean has only just begun. Lehman's bankruptcy is not the end, but the start. More 'Lehmans' will surface, and market panic will persist for quite some time.\"","\"This means our gains are far from limited to what we see before us.\"","She looked directly at Chen Mo: \"Increase our position. Plow all the profits back in!\"","Hearing this, everyone's hearts skipped a beat.","Some of them actually felt it would be better to quit while they were ahead. After all, continuing meant greater risks; why not secure the profits first?","Before they could voice this thought,","Liu Yutong spoke again: \"I once heard a fish seller say something—the greater the storm, the more valuable the fish!\"","Upon hearing this, Gu Yebai and the others forcibly swallowed the words that had reached their lips, even mentally cursing themselves for being so timid.","\"Big Sis is right, the greater the storm, the more valuable the fish!\"","\"If we don't skin those across the ocean, it'd be a disservice to all the capital we've thrown in!\"","\"Let's keep fucking going!\"","\"........\"","\"Chen Mo,\" Liu Yutong called his name directly.","\"Miss Liu, your instructions!\" Chen Mo immediately stepped forward, his attitude one of utmost respect.","He was completely convinced now.","He had never done anything this crazy in his life, nor achieved such staggering returns.","Now, working under Liu Yutong, he was hitting numbers he'd never dared dream of before.","With this track record alone, he would become a legend in the investment world.","Liu Yutong proceeded to arrange the next phase of work.","\"Chen Mo, my stance remains the same: fund safety first. Our current scale is somewhat large. The profits generated today, and all subsequent profits, are to continue being dispersed. Utilize the 300 sub-accounts we've set up over the past few months for cross-operation. The capital amount and transaction frequency for each account must be strictly controlled below the thresholds that would trigger high-level risk control alarms at the major banks.\"","\"After that, continue adding leverage. Your methods must be even more discreet. Don't concentrate on just a few brokers. Inject our new margin deposits into the various international brokers we cooperate with. Once that's done, continue establishing short positions on the NASDAQ index and the key financial stocks I'll list later. The total leverage can be increased to 60x depending on the situation. If they dare to lend it, we dare to borrow it, but the prerequisite is ensuring the numbers in any single account don't attract undue attention.\"","\"Finally, and most importantly, now that we have generated massive profits, we can establish a circuit breaker. You will personally set a dynamic warning line later. If the market experiences extreme, unforeseen reverse volatility causing a total capital drawdown of 10%, immediately initiate the automatic liquidation procedure without waiting for instructions. Protect our core profits.\"","\".........\"","\"Yes, Miss Liu!\" Chen Mo immediately began directing the team according to her orders.","A group of traders, already sporting dark circles and even having lost some hair, shook off their fatigue and threw themselves back into the new battle.","After arranging the work,","Liu Yutong then said quietly to Gu Yebai and the others,","\"Sister Yutong, don't worry, leave it to us.\"","Gu Yebai called Zhou Muchen and a few others, and they hurriedly rushed out.","Not long after,","They somehow managed to get their hands on 100 million in cash, and in the middle of the night no less.","Their methods were truly astonishing.","Although Liu Yutong didn't ask, she could roughly guess they had probably 'borrowed' it from some unlucky targets.","This wasn't like the later cashless era; many big shots liked to keep large amounts of cash in their home safes.","Using their respective connections, Young Masters Gu Yebai and the others contacted local wealthy individuals with resources to borrow money on short notice. Obliged to give face due to their status, these individuals ultimately managed to scrape together the amount.","When 100 million in cash appeared in the operations center on the top floor of the club, the traders' breathing grew ragged.","They had handled sums far larger than 100 million, but those were just numbers. Seeing 100 million in physical cash was a completely different experience.","The impact was simply indescribable.","Liu Yutong only said one thing: \"This money is all yours!\"","Her words instantly ignited everyone's emotions to the peak.","\"Thank you, Miss Liu!\"","\"Thank you, Miss Liu!\"","\"Let's do this! Let's go all out!\"","\"..........\"","The traders felt all their exhaustion swept away, replaced by boiling blood.","This bonus far exceeded the salaries they were originally supposed to receive.","Originally, Zhou Muchen had offered Chen Mo and his team 80 million, as their initial contract wasn't for a percentage of the profits.","Even without a profit share, Chen Mo and the others felt what they were being offered was already more than generous.","In just a few months, 80 million. Apart from Chen Mo, everyone could take home at least a million each. It would be hard to find a salary this high at any financial firm.","Of course, if it were based on a percentage, even ten times that amount wouldn't be a problem. It's just a pity that Chen Mo had been shortsighted back then and chose a fixed sum.","His expectation at the time was to generate a few hundred million in profit from tens of billions in capital, which he already considered an excellent return.","Under those circumstances, for him and the team he assembled to take 80 million was already an extraordinarily high figure.","Looking back now, he realized just how mistaken he had been.","Naturally, even if someone offered him the standard industry percentage now, he wouldn't dare take it—because it would be too much.","The main reason was the backgrounds of these young people, each more intimidating than the last. Liu Yutong, in particular, had underworld connections. He was afraid that taking too much money might mean he wouldn't live to spend it.","Although he didn't think Liu Yutong was that kind of person... but what if?","A few more days passed.","The markets were closed over the weekend. Overseas, intervention measures were announced, including plans to print more money. While this had some effect, the panic persisted and even seemed to be growing.","It would likely take some more time for things to gradually settle down.","During this period, as their profits continued to swell, Chen Mo and the team operated with increasing caution.","Following the previous plan, they began to systematically harvest the profits, securing the gains and moving the funds to safety.","Finally, when the total profit was calculated, everyone who saw the number was struck dumb.","Countless zeros......."]},{"number":499,"title":"Chapter 499: 499 and 129 Billion","paragraphs":["A few more days passed, and all profits were successfully harvested, with all positions successfully closed out.","Everyone gathered in the operations center, nervously awaiting the final earnings report.","Chen Mo and the others were equally tense. For months, they had been operating under immense pressure, and now the moment of reckoning had finally arrived.","Chen Mo stood on the stage, facing the expectant gazes of the crowd below, and gently adjusted the microphone.","Finally, he looked at Liu Yutong, whom he already regarded as a deity, and then announced the final outcome of this campaign to everyone present.","\"Ms. Liu, esteemed bosses, our cross-ocean short-selling operation has now been concluded. All positions were closed out strictly according to the predetermined strategy, in batches and with discretion!\"","\"Now, I will report the final settlement results!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the room fell completely silent.","Immediately after, the large screen behind Chen Mo lit up with the first slide of a presentation.","\"Our initial invested capital totaled 4.7 billion RMB, which, at the exchange rate at the time of entry, was approximately 692 million US dollars.\"","\"Over the past few months, utilizing leverage of up to nearly 60x, the total notional size of the short positions we built and maintained peaked at 40.9 billion US dollars!\"","\"In this financial storm that swept the globe, our three-pronged portfolio—core short positions, individual stock shorts, and the most profitable out-of-the-money options—achieved a triple leap in returns!\"","\"After deducting all cross-border channel costs, commissions, funding interest, risk reserves, and so on, the final confirmed net cash safely returned under our control is...\"","What followed was a bit of mischievous fun. At this point, he deliberately paused.","As expected, everyone grew even more impatient, urging him to spit it out.","Finally, after a five-second pause, he announced the staggering figure.","\"12.1 billion US dollars!\"","\"Whoa!\"","\"Holy shit! Holy shit!!!\"","Despite everyone's best efforts to restrain themselves, many couldn't help but curse in astonishment.","However, this was just the beginning!","Zhou Muchen directly pulled out a calculator and started punching numbers frantically.","\"12.1 billion US dollars, at the current exchange rate, that's... that's over 80 billion RMB!\"","They put in 4.7 billion and got back over 80 billion!","A net profit exceeding 70 billion!","This number was almost enough to knock everyone out cold.","But it wasn't over yet.","Chen Mo raised his hand, waiting for everyone to quiet down before continuing, \"Everyone, please settle down. This is not all!\"","\"There's more?\" The crowd was stunned.","Chen Mo nodded. \"Following Ms. Liu's instructions, when the market was at its most panicked and prices had plummeted, we utilized over 3.5 billion dollars in floating profits to aggressively acquire deeply discounted equity and convertible bonds in several technology companies, including Fruit Company and the lithography giant ASML. The current conservative valuation of these long-term strategic assets reaches 6.6 billion US dollars!\"","\"Therefore, the total gain from our operation is 12.1 billion in cash, plus 6.6 billion in strategic assets, totaling 18.7 billion US dollars!\"","\"Converted to Longguo currency, that is—\"","A number appeared on the large screen behind him, a number that made everyone's heads spin.","129,000,000,000.00!","Approximately 129 billion RMB!","The total rate of return reached a terrifying 2700%.","When this number came out, people started counting like elementary school kids, pointing at the screen: \"Ones, tens, hundreds, thousands, ten-thousands... damn, so many zeros, my eyes are blurry!\"","Several people miscounted multiple times.","Once they confirmed the number was correct, everyone could no longer contain themselves, howling with mad excitement.","\"Twenty-seven times!!\"","\"One hundred and twenty-nine billion!!\"","\"Incredible!!! Incredible!!!\"","\"Long live Sister Yutong!!!!\"","Pandemonium! Everyone went wild!","Champagne sprayed everywhere, confetti rained down continuously!","Even the traders were frantically hugging, jumping, roaring...","This feeling transcended mere joy; everyone felt they had participated in and witnessed a mortal's glorious ascension to godhood!","Liu Yutong also wore a slight smile, clapping gently, celebrating along with everyone.","All eyes looking at her were as if gazing upon a deity.","With this battle, she not only laid a solid financial foundation for the Wanlong Society but also elevated herself to a true pedestal!","Entering with 4.7 billion RMB, triumphantly returning with a staggering 129 billion!","129 billion!","Many small countries in the world don't have that much money. It could truly be described as wealth rivaling a nation.","Liu Yutong then took a glass of champagne handed to her by someone nearby and raised it gently.","No words were needed. That simple action instantly raised the frenzy in the room to a whole new level.","\"Sister Yutong, from now on, I, Zhou Muchen, will follow your lead!\"","\"Me too!\"","\"And me!\"","\"Same here!\"","\".......\"","The members of the Yunshan Society hurriedly expressed their allegiance one after another.","129 billion. If Wanlong Society's share of just over half was subtracted, that left about 64 billion.","Then, from that 64 billion, after deducting the principal, half was to be given to Liu Yutong, as agreed beforehand.","The final amount they could distribute was over 34 billion, which came to about 5.6 billion for each person.","Originally, they would have been satisfied with 1 billion each. Now, it was more than five times that amount.","Earning over 5 billion per person in just a few months—this was even more lucrative than robbing banks!","Of course, they would need to pay taxes to bring that much money back to their home country, roughly 25%.","However, due to relevant tax relief policies—after all, this money, even when repatriated through tax havens like the Cayman Islands, had already had some taxes paid—the overall tax already paid was about 10%. The numbers they were seeing now were post that payment.","The tax already paid could be credited upon returning the funds, so they would likely only need to pay an additional 15% or so.","But they wouldn't actually bring all the money back. Some would be kept in foreign corporate accounts for future use, with only a portion withdrawn.","Most importantly, they wanted to gauge Liu Yutong's attitude.","That's right, they wanted a permanent seat on this train.","Investing in a person is better than investing in a project. They wanted this capital to continue under Liu Yutong's management; it would only grow larger in the future.","This single campaign had built an exceptionally strong trust in Liu Yutong.","They were even somewhat worried that Liu Yutong might not want to play with them anymore, since she was now wealthier than all of them combined.","Out of the 129 billion, Liu Yutong herself accounted for about 95 billion.","Aside from the 6.6 billion USD in equity that hadn't been liquidated—this was specifically requested by Liu Yutong; she controlled these shares through her separately held offshore company registered in the Caymans, intending to hold them long-term—she still had roughly 49 to 50 billion in cash.","What was the publicly listed net worth of Longguo's richest person this year?","A certain home appliance tycoon, Huang Yu—the richest person Liu Yutong had received at the university last year—had a net worth of only about 43 billion so far this year.","Quite a drop from last year.","It was mainly due to the impact of the financial crisis. Last year, someone's net worth had once soared to over 130 billion, but unfortunately, it was slashed down after a very short period.","Many people saw their net worth plummet significantly, which allowed Huang Yu to reclaim the top spot as the richest person.","Even so, his net worth of over 40 billion is still staggering. However, an even more formidable woman has now appeared.","At 19 years old, not counting her equity stakes and industries, the funds she controls alone amount to nearly 50 billion.","Just thinking about it is terrifying!","Of course, on paper, her net worth is only a few billion, which comes from the valuation brought by the Wanlong Hui Group. This is because the money extracted from across the ocean is an open secret among them; no one actively publicizes it.","Being too high-profile is not a good thing.","They are also afraid that if more powerful figures learn about Liu Yutong's prowess, they would rush to offer her money, leaving no share for them.","So, without Liu Yutong having to give specific instructions, they naturally wouldn't reveal her role behind the scenes.","This incident also reveals the inaccuracies in those external rich lists. Generally, such publications can only account for publicly visible wealth, such as stock values, industries, and so on.","Those who truly hold vast amounts of cash are not included in the statistics.","Therefore, on the surface, Liu Yutong's net worth is still far from that of the country's richest person.","In reality, the capital she controls has already surpassed that of the top richest.","Facing the expectant looks from the members of Yunshan Hui, Liu Yutong smiled faintly. Without giving a direct answer, she raised her glass once more.","\"Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!\" everyone echoed, lifting their glasses in unison."]},{"number":500,"title":"Chapter 500: 500. The Youngest Centibillionaire Helm in History","paragraphs":["After the toast, everyone's attention once again focused on Liu Yutong, all eagerly awaiting her statement.","It seemed that unless she made her position clear, they wouldn't be entirely satisfied.","The initiative now lay completely in Liu Yutong's hands.","After all, the results they had achieved this time were truly staggering. If the outside world learned of this legendary figure in the investment world named Liu Yutong, people wanting to give her money would probably form a line stretching from Danan City all the way to Pearl City.","These solid, tangible achievements were her confidence.","Of course, everyone understood in their hearts that achieving such a terrifying rate of return was because Liu Yutong had explained to them many times before—they had simply been standing in the right place at the right time.","If it weren't for the financial crisis, in ordinary times, how could anyone achieve such high returns in such a short period?","An opportunity like this would likely be hard to come by a second time.","Yet, even so, they were still willing to follow her.","After all, even without the financial crisis, the returns she achieved last year were astonishing enough.","They themselves could never have done it, no matter what.","Liu Yutong set down her glass, her gaze sweeping over the group of fervent Yunshan Club members before her.","It was about time.","\"Since you are all willing to continue trusting me, then we need to establish a new platform, one that can make a name for itself globally.\"","Zhou Muchen, catching her drift immediately, excitedly picked up the thread, asking, \"Sister Yutong, do you mean we should establish our own fund? No, I mean, build our own capital empire?\"","Liu Yutong nodded: \"Exactly. Money sitting in an account is just a string of numbers. Only by spending it can we create more wealth and leverage more industries. I propose that we jointly establish a new capital firm under the name of the Yunshan Club—Yunshan Capital.\"","\"I agree!\" Lu Hong was the first to raise his hand in approval.","\"This money was earned under Sister Yutong's guidance anyway. How to use it is entirely up to her!\"","The others immediately voiced their agreement without the slightest hesitation.","Handing the funds over to her for continued management was far wiser than making blind investments themselves.","\"Absolutely! With Sister Yutong at the helm, we have nothing to worry about!\"","\"Let's call it Yunshan Capital then.\"","\"......\"","Seeing that no one had any objections, Liu Yutong continued, \"The initial capital for Yunshan Capital will be allocated from our profits this time. Everyone present here will be a founding partner. I myself will contribute 10 billion from my cash proceeds.\"","\"As for the rest of you, the amount is not mandatory; it's entirely voluntary. You can inject a portion, or all, of your proceeds from this venture into Yunshan Capital in exchange for corresponding equity shares.","The funds will be managed and operated by me collectively. In the future, our investment areas will not be limited to the secondary market but will also include equity investments and mergers & acquisitions in the primary market, especially in future tech industries, and so on.\"","Her words essentially told everyone that she wouldn't rely solely on stock and futures trading to make money anymore. Instead, she would truly dive into the real economy and the tech sector.","Everyone was fine with that. As long as they could continue following her, they would do whatever she said.","They wouldn't utter a single word of dissent.","\"I'm in! Out of my 5.6 billion, aside from the part used to repay debts and a few billion kept for spending money, the remaining roughly 5 billion will all go into Yunshan Capital!\"","\"I'll match with 5 billion!\"","\"4 billion from me!\"","\"I'll put in 3.8 billion!\"","\"......\"","Soon, just from the commitments of the Yunshan Club members, plus Liu Yutong's 10 billion, the startup capital pool for Yunshan Capital easily surpassed 35 billion.","Of course, the portion of these funds that needed to be repatriated would require tax filing based on the situation, so the actual amount received would be a little over 30 billion.","This money would also be split into two parts: roughly 24 billion would be reserved domestically for Yunshan Capital, after taxes.","Another 5 billion or so would remain overseas, managed by a newly established overseas branch of Yunshan Capital.","Similarly, the overseas branch of Liu Yutong's Wanlong Capital controlled equity worth $6.6 billion over there, plus 10 billion RMB in cash, reserved for investing in some overseas and Hong Kong projects.","For example, the stock of Tencent listed in Hong Kong was worth holding long-term.","Of course, it was possible that Tencent might not reach the heights of its previous incarnation in this life.","Because she was the biggest variable!","However, losses were probably impossible; Pony Ma still had some skills.","The remaining nearly 30 billion funds, after taxes, would leave about 25 billion, which Liu Yutong would transfer back to China in batches.","Over 5 billion of that would be returned to the Wanlong Group, principal plus interest. The remaining approximately 20 billion would be injected into Wanlong Capital and Pearl Capital, both under her control.","Thus, the number of capital platforms actually controlled by Liu Yutong reached three.","The newly created Wanlong Capital still belonged to the Wanlong Group, but she was in charge of managing it.","The other two capital firms were completely unrelated to the Wanlong Group, connected only to Liu Yutong personally.","In short, the total amount of capital under Liu Yutong's control at this moment had already broken through one hundred billion.","From this moment on, she truly became the youngest legend in domestic history to control a hundred billion in capital at the mere age of nineteen.","With the basics settled.","Zhou Muchen and the others were visibly even happier. They even felt they could just lie back and do nothing, and their future wealth would grow continuously.","Yet, amidst this jubilant atmosphere, one person's expression was slightly forlorn.","That was Chen Mo.","Chen Mo looked at this group of young elites with prominent backgrounds and freshly skyrocketed net worth, a hint of envy faintly showing in his eyes.","How great for them!","They could continue investing with Miss Liu.","He was different. He wasn't qualified to sit at their table, and might not even get a chance to be involved.","Because the temporary trading team he led had successfully completed its mission. According to the contract, it was about to be disbanded on the spot.","He personally had also received a massive bonus of two hundred million.","That figure was already enough for him to achieve financial freedom. Moreover, with the stellar track record of being the lead trader for this operation, achieving sky-defying returns with his team, he could easily have countless people clamoring to give him money, leaping to become a hot new star in the investment world.","But only he himself knew clearly that all this glory was because of that nineteen-year-old girl surrounded at the center.","Without her, he, Chen Mo, might still become an excellent fund manager, but it was unlikely he would ever create a myth like this again.","Unless.........","Chen Mo took a deep breath and approached Liu Yutong.","\"Miss Liu.\" His voice carried a trace of nervousness.","Liu Yutong looked up, smiling at him as if she had long anticipated his approach.","\"Chen Mo, you've all worked hard this time. The bonuses will be paid as agreed within five working days.\"","\"Thank you, Miss Liu. We are already extremely grateful.\"","At this point, Chen Mo unconsciously clenched his hands tightly and couldn't help but ask, \"Miss Liu, is our team going to be disbanded afterward?\"","He was asking a question he already knew the answer to, but he couldn't help wanting to ask it.","\"With the mission complete, naturally, everyone returns to their own homes.\"","Liu Yutong's tone betrayed little emotion as she asked, \"Do you have something in mind?\"","Hearing this, Chen Mo finally mustered his courage and said, \"Miss Liu, I know that with my status and this limited capital, I have no right to sit as an equal partner with Young Master Gu and Young Master Zhou in Yunshan Capital.\"","\"However, I still wish to follow you.\"","\"Not merely as a hired hand. I beg you to give me a chance, to allow me to invest everything I've gained from this operation, plus all my past savings—totaling approximately 270 million—into Yunshan Capital. I don't seek the title of partner or voting rights. I only ask for the qualification to follow you!\"","Liu Yutong looked at him quietly, not answering immediately.","She appreciated Chen Mo's professional skill and execution ability, and she admired even more the boldness and foresight he was showing now.","A top-tier trader wasn't hard to find, but a subordinate with vision, who understood when to advance and when to retreat, who could obey unconditionally, and who was willing to stake everything to align himself with her—that was truly rare.","A few seconds of silence felt like centuries to Chen Mo.","Finally.","The corner of Liu Yutong's lips curved slightly into a smile as she elegantly extended a hand.","\"Welcome to Yunshan Capital!\""]}]);
